{"format":"srcd","version":1,"generator":"闪星卡（StarCard）· TOEFL 托福 48 List（标黄例句）","exportedAt":"2026-11-18T12:35:35.775Z","parameters":{"algorithm":"FSRS-5","algorithmVersion":"5","requestRetention":0.9,"maximumInterval":36500,"weights":[0.40255,1.18385,3.173,15.69105,7.1949,0.5345,1.4604,0.0046,1.54575,0.1192,1.01925,1.9395,0.11,0.29605,2.2698,0.2315,2.9898,0.51655,0.6621],"newCardsPerDay":20,"reviewCardsPerDay":200,"learningSteps":[1,10],"relearningSteps":[10],"graduatingInterval":1,"easyInterval":4,"leechThreshold":8,"leechAction":"tag","buryRelated":true,"newOrder":"mix","reviewOrder":"due"},"decks":[{"id":"toefl-list-1","name":"TOEFL 托福 › List 1","description":"托福核心词 · List 1（72 词 · 释义 + 词根词缀 + 助记 + 标黄例句）","createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["toefl","imported"],"options":{"newPerDay":null,"reviewsPerDay":null,"learningSteps":null,"relearningSteps":null,"graduatingInterval":null,"easyInterval":null,"leechThreshold":null,"leechAction":"","buryRelated":null,"maxInterval":null,"requestRetention":null,"newOrder":"","reviewOrder":""},"cards":[{"noteId":"toefl_l1_0","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"chaotic","back":"释义\na. 混乱的，杂乱无章的，毫无秩序的\n词根词缀\nchaos 混乱（希腊神话'混沌'）+ -tic 形容词 → 混乱的\n助记\nchaos n.混乱；同 disorderly, turbulent；反 orderly\n例句\nThe airport was ==chaotic== during the storm. 暴风雨期间机场一片混乱。","fields":{"Front":"chaotic","Back":"释义\na. 混乱的，杂乱无章的，毫无秩序的\n词根词缀\nchaos 混乱（希腊神话'混沌'）+ -tic 形容词 → 混乱的\n助记\nchaos n.混乱；同 disorderly, turbulent；反 orderly\n例句\nThe airport was ==chaotic== during the storm. 暴风雨期间机场一片混乱。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_1","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"colonization","back":"释义\nn. 殖民，殖民地化；（动植物）定居、移植\n词根词缀\ncolony 殖民地 + -ize 使…化 + -ation 名词 → 殖民化\n助记\ncolony n.殖民地；colonize v.殖民；colonist n.殖民者\n例句\nThe ==colonization== of the Americas began in the 15th century. 对美洲的殖民始于15世纪。","fields":{"Front":"colonization","Back":"释义\nn. 殖民，殖民地化；（动植物）定居、移植\n词根词缀\ncolony 殖民地 + -ize 使…化 + -ation 名词 → 殖民化\n助记\ncolony n.殖民地；colonize v.殖民；colonist n.殖民者\n例句\nThe ==colonization== of the Americas began in the 15th century. 对美洲的殖民始于15世纪。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_2","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"conform","back":"释义\nv. 遵守，遵从（规则、习俗）；符合，相一致\n词根词缀\ncon- 共同、完全 + form 形状 → 做成同一形状 → 遵从、符合\n助记\nconformity n.遵从；nonconformist n.不循规蹈矩者；搭配 conform to\n例句\nAll products must ==conform== to safety standards. 所有产品必须符合安全标准。","fields":{"Front":"conform","Back":"释义\nv. 遵守，遵从（规则、习俗）；符合，相一致\n词根词缀\ncon- 共同、完全 + form 形状 → 做成同一形状 → 遵从、符合\n助记\nconformity n.遵从；nonconformist n.不循规蹈矩者；搭配 conform to\n例句\nAll products must ==conform== to safety standards. 所有产品必须符合安全标准。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_3","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"cultivate","back":"释义\nv. 耕作，种植；培养，培育（兴趣、能力、人才）\n词根词缀\ncult 耕作、培养 + -ivate 动词后缀 → 耕种；引申为精心培养\n助记\ncultivation n.培养；culture n.文化（本义也是'培育'）；agriculture n.农业\n例句\nThe program helps ==cultivate== young talent in science. 该项目帮助培养年轻的科学人才。","fields":{"Front":"cultivate","Back":"释义\nv. 耕作，种植；培养，培育（兴趣、能力、人才）\n词根词缀\ncult 耕作、培养 + -ivate 动词后缀 → 耕种；引申为精心培养\n助记\ncultivation n.培养；culture n.文化（本义也是'培育'）；agriculture n.农业\n例句\nThe program helps ==cultivate== young talent in science. 该项目帮助培养年轻的科学人才。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_4","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"disproportionate","back":"释义\na. 不成比例的，不相称的，过多/过少的\n词根词缀\ndis- 否定 + proportion 比例 + -ate → 不成比例的\n助记\nproportion n.比例；反 proportionate, proportional；搭配 disproportionate to\n例句\nA ==disproportionate== amount of money was spent on ads. 花在广告上的钱多得不成比例。","fields":{"Front":"disproportionate","Back":"释义\na. 不成比例的，不相称的，过多/过少的\n词根词缀\ndis- 否定 + proportion 比例 + -ate → 不成比例的\n助记\nproportion n.比例；反 proportionate, proportional；搭配 disproportionate to\n例句\nA ==disproportionate== amount of money was spent on ads. 花在广告上的钱多得不成比例。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_5","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"embrace","back":"释义\nv./n. 拥抱；欣然接受，采纳（观点、变化）；包含\n词根词缀\nem- 进入 + brace 双臂、支撑 → 进入双臂 → 拥抱；引申为接纳\n助记\nbrace n.支架 v.绷紧；embrace change 拥抱变化；同 adopt\n例句\nWe should ==embrace== new technology. 我们应该拥抱/接纳新技术。","fields":{"Front":"embrace","Back":"释义\nv./n. 拥抱；欣然接受，采纳（观点、变化）；包含\n词根词缀\nem- 进入 + brace 双臂、支撑 → 进入双臂 → 拥抱；引申为接纳\n助记\nbrace n.支架 v.绷紧；embrace change 拥抱变化；同 adopt\n例句\nWe should ==embrace== new technology. 我们应该拥抱/接纳新技术。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_6","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"grievous","back":"释义\na. 极其严重的；令人悲痛的，难以承受的\n词根词缀\ngriev (=grief) 悲伤 + -ous 形容词 → 带来悲痛的 → 严重的\n助记\ngrief n.悲痛；grieve v.使悲伤；grievous bodily harm 严重人身伤害\n例句\nHe suffered ==grievous== injuries in the crash. 他在撞车中受了重伤。","fields":{"Front":"grievous","Back":"释义\na. 极其严重的；令人悲痛的，难以承受的\n词根词缀\ngriev (=grief) 悲伤 + -ous 形容词 → 带来悲痛的 → 严重的\n助记\ngrief n.悲痛；grieve v.使悲伤；grievous bodily harm 严重人身伤害\n例句\nHe suffered ==grievous== injuries in the crash. 他在撞车中受了重伤。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_7","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"husk","back":"释义\nn./v. n.（谷物、种子的）外壳，皮；v. 去壳，去皮\n词根词缀\n本义为干燥的外皮，拟'干枯外壳'之意\n助记\nhusk 指谷物外壳；shell 指硬壳；peel 指水果皮\n例句\nShe removed the ==husk== from the corn. 她剥去玉米的外皮。","fields":{"Front":"husk","Back":"释义\nn./v. n.（谷物、种子的）外壳，皮；v. 去壳，去皮\n词根词缀\n本义为干燥的外皮，拟'干枯外壳'之意\n助记\nhusk 指谷物外壳；shell 指硬壳；peel 指水果皮\n例句\nShe removed the ==husk== from the corn. 她剥去玉米的外皮。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_8","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"inclination","back":"释义\nn. 倾向，意愿；倾斜（度）\n词根词缀\nincline 的名词形式：clin 倾斜 + -ation 名词\n助记\n搭配 have an inclination for/toward；同 tendency, preference\n例句\nShe has an ==inclination== toward music. 她有音乐方面的天赋/倾向。","fields":{"Front":"inclination","Back":"释义\nn. 倾向，意愿；倾斜（度）\n词根词缀\nincline 的名词形式：clin 倾斜 + -ation 名词\n助记\n搭配 have an inclination for/toward；同 tendency, preference\n例句\nShe has an ==inclination== toward music. 她有音乐方面的天赋/倾向。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_9","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"incline","back":"释义\nv./n. v.（使）倾斜；倾向于，有意；n. 斜坡，斜面\n词根词缀\nin- 向、朝 + clin 弯曲、倾斜 + -e → 向…倾斜 → 倾向\n助记\ninclination n.倾向；decline v.下降、拒绝；recline v.斜倚\n例句\nI ==incline== to the view that he is right. 我倾向于认为他是对的。","fields":{"Front":"incline","Back":"释义\nv./n. v.（使）倾斜；倾向于，有意；n. 斜坡，斜面\n词根词缀\nin- 向、朝 + clin 弯曲、倾斜 + -e → 向…倾斜 → 倾向\n助记\ninclination n.倾向；decline v.下降、拒绝；recline v.斜倚\n例句\nI ==incline== to the view that he is right. 我倾向于认为他是对的。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_10","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"nosy","back":"释义\na. 爱管闲事的，爱打听的，八卦的\n词根词缀\nnose 鼻子 + -y → 总把鼻子凑过去 → 爱打听的\n助记\n也写作 nosey；同 intrusive, curious（curious 中性，nosy 贬义）\n例句\nMy ==nosy== neighbor keeps asking about my job. 我那爱管闲事的邻居总打听我的工作。","fields":{"Front":"nosy","Back":"释义\na. 爱管闲事的，爱打听的，八卦的\n词根词缀\nnose 鼻子 + -y → 总把鼻子凑过去 → 爱打听的\n助记\n也写作 nosey；同 intrusive, curious（curious 中性，nosy 贬义）\n例句\nMy ==nosy== neighbor keeps asking about my job. 我那爱管闲事的邻居总打听我的工作。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_11","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"obliterate","back":"释义\nv. 摧毁，消灭；涂去，抹去（痕迹、记忆）\n词根词缀\nob- 对着、完全 + liter 字母、文字 + -ate → 把字全涂掉 → 抹去、毁灭\n助记\nliterate a.识字的；literature n.文学；同 erase, destroy\n例句\nThe bombing nearly ==obliterated== the town. 轰炸几乎将小镇夷为平地。","fields":{"Front":"obliterate","Back":"释义\nv. 摧毁，消灭；涂去，抹去（痕迹、记忆）\n词根词缀\nob- 对着、完全 + liter 字母、文字 + -ate → 把字全涂掉 → 抹去、毁灭\n助记\nliterate a.识字的；literature n.文学；同 erase, destroy\n例句\nThe bombing nearly ==obliterated== the town. 轰炸几乎将小镇夷为平地。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_12","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"pluralism","back":"释义\nn. 多元性，多元主义；多元化（社会、文化）\n词根词缀\nplur 多（plus 的词根）+ -al + -ism 主义 → 多元主义\n助记\nplural a.复数的、多元的；plurality n.多数；反 uniformity\n例句\nReligious ==pluralism== is a feature of modern society. 宗教多元是现代社会的特征。","fields":{"Front":"pluralism","Back":"释义\nn. 多元性，多元主义；多元化（社会、文化）\n词根词缀\nplur 多（plus 的词根）+ -al + -ism 主义 → 多元主义\n助记\nplural a.复数的、多元的；plurality n.多数；反 uniformity\n例句\nReligious ==pluralism== is a feature of modern society. 宗教多元是现代社会的特征。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_13","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"renaissance","back":"释义\nn. 复兴，再生；[the R-] 文艺复兴（时期）\n词根词缀\nre- 重新 + naiss (=nasci) 出生 + -ance 名词 → 重新出生 → 复兴\n助记\n同源 nascent a.新生的；native a.本地的；renaissance 强调'再度繁荣'\n例句\nThe city enjoyed an economic ==renaissance== in the 1990s. 这座城市在20世纪90年代经历了经济复兴。","fields":{"Front":"renaissance","Back":"释义\nn. 复兴，再生；[the R-] 文艺复兴（时期）\n词根词缀\nre- 重新 + naiss (=nasci) 出生 + -ance 名词 → 重新出生 → 复兴\n助记\n同源 nascent a.新生的；native a.本地的；renaissance 强调'再度繁荣'\n例句\nThe city enjoyed an economic ==renaissance== in the 1990s. 这座城市在20世纪90年代经历了经济复兴。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_14","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"renown","back":"释义\nn. 名望，声誉，名气\n词根词缀\nre- 反复 + nown (=nomin/name) 名字 → 名字被反复提起 → 名望\n助记\nrenowned a.著名的（搭配 renowned for）；同 fame, repute\n例句\nShe is a scientist of international ==renown== . 她是一位享有国际声誉的科学家。","fields":{"Front":"renown","Back":"释义\nn. 名望，声誉，名气\n词根词缀\nre- 反复 + nown (=nomin/name) 名字 → 名字被反复提起 → 名望\n助记\nrenowned a.著名的（搭配 renowned for）；同 fame, repute\n例句\nShe is a scientist of international ==renown== . 她是一位享有国际声誉的科学家。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_15","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"saucy","back":"释义\na. 粗鲁的，无礼的；俏皮的，调皮的；（食物）带酱汁的\n词根词缀\nsauce 酱汁 + -y → 沾酱的；引申为'嘴贫、俏皮'\n助记\nsauce n.酱汁；saucer n.茶碟；saucy 含轻微'没规矩'的意味\n例句\nHe gave her a ==saucy== grin. 他冲她调皮地一笑。","fields":{"Front":"saucy","Back":"释义\na. 粗鲁的，无礼的；俏皮的，调皮的；（食物）带酱汁的\n词根词缀\nsauce 酱汁 + -y → 沾酱的；引申为'嘴贫、俏皮'\n助记\nsauce n.酱汁；saucer n.茶碟；saucy 含轻微'没规矩'的意味\n例句\nHe gave her a ==saucy== grin. 他冲她调皮地一笑。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_16","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"scroll","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 滚动（屏幕、页面）；n. 卷轴；滚动条\n词根词缀\n原指卷起来的卷轴（roll），现指屏幕上下滚动\n助记\nscroll bar 滚动条；scroll through 浏览、刷（手机）\n例句\n==Scroll== down to see the answer. 向下滚动查看答案。","fields":{"Front":"scroll","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 滚动（屏幕、页面）；n. 卷轴；滚动条\n词根词缀\n原指卷起来的卷轴（roll），现指屏幕上下滚动\n助记\nscroll bar 滚动条；scroll through 浏览、刷（手机）\n例句\n==Scroll== down to see the answer. 向下滚动查看答案。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_17","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"stumble","back":"释义\nv./n. 绊脚，绊倒；蹒跚；结巴地说；偶然发现\n词根词缀\n拟声/动作感：脚步不稳；固定搭配 stumble across/on 偶然发现\n助记\nstumble over a word 结巴；stumbling block n.绊脚石\n例句\nI ==stumbled== across an old photo in the drawer. 我在抽屉里偶然发现一张旧照片。","fields":{"Front":"stumble","Back":"释义\nv./n. 绊脚，绊倒；蹒跚；结巴地说；偶然发现\n词根词缀\n拟声/动作感：脚步不稳；固定搭配 stumble across/on 偶然发现\n助记\nstumble over a word 结巴；stumbling block n.绊脚石\n例句\nI ==stumbled== across an old photo in the drawer. 我在抽屉里偶然发现一张旧照片。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_18","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"substitute","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 代替者，替代品；v. 代替，替换\n词根词缀\nsub- 在下面、接替 + stit 站立 + -e → 站在下面顶替 → 替代\n助记\nsubstitution n.替换；institute v.建立；constitute v.构成；同 replace\n例句\nYou can ==substitute== honey for sugar in this recipe. 这个食谱里你可以用蜂蜜代替糖。","fields":{"Front":"substitute","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 代替者，替代品；v. 代替，替换\n词根词缀\nsub- 在下面、接替 + stit 站立 + -e → 站在下面顶替 → 替代\n助记\nsubstitution n.替换；institute v.建立；constitute v.构成；同 replace\n例句\nYou can ==substitute== honey for sugar in this recipe. 这个食谱里你可以用蜂蜜代替糖。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_19","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"underscore","back":"释义\nv. 在…下划线；强调，使突出\n词根词缀\nunder- 在下面 + score 划线、得分 → 在下面划线 → 强调\n助记\n同 emphasize, highlight；score n.分数 v.划线\n例句\nThese figures ==underscore== the need for reform. 这些数字凸显了改革的必要性。","fields":{"Front":"underscore","Back":"释义\nv. 在…下划线；强调，使突出\n词根词缀\nunder- 在下面 + score 划线、得分 → 在下面划线 → 强调\n助记\n同 emphasize, highlight；score n.分数 v.划线\n例句\nThese figures ==underscore== the need for reform. 这些数字凸显了改革的必要性。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_20","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"vagrant","back":"释义\nn./a. n. 流浪者，无业游民；a. 流浪的，漂泊的\n词根词缀\nvag 漫游、流浪 + -rant 人 → 到处漫游的人 → 流浪者\n助记\n同源 vague a.模糊的（思绪游荡）；vagrancy n.流浪；同 wanderer, tramp\n例句\nThe ==vagrant== slept on a park bench. 那个流浪者睡在公园长椅上。","fields":{"Front":"vagrant","Back":"释义\nn./a. n. 流浪者，无业游民；a. 流浪的，漂泊的\n词根词缀\nvag 漫游、流浪 + -rant 人 → 到处漫游的人 → 流浪者\n助记\n同源 vague a.模糊的（思绪游荡）；vagrancy n.流浪；同 wanderer, tramp\n例句\nThe ==vagrant== slept on a park bench. 那个流浪者睡在公园长椅上。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_21","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"withhold","back":"释义\nv. 拒绝给予，扣留；隐瞒（信息）；抑制\n词根词缀\nwith- 向后、对抗 + hold 握住 → 向后拉住不给 → 扣留\n助记\n不规则 with-held；withhold payment 拒付；同 retain, hold back\n例句\nThe company ==withheld== information from the public. 公司向公众隐瞒了信息。","fields":{"Front":"withhold","Back":"释义\nv. 拒绝给予，扣留；隐瞒（信息）；抑制\n词根词缀\nwith- 向后、对抗 + hold 握住 → 向后拉住不给 → 扣留\n助记\n不规则 with-held；withhold payment 拒付；同 retain, hold back\n例句\nThe company ==withheld== information from the public. 公司向公众隐瞒了信息。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"di