ad) 朝向 + tain (=ten) 握住、触及 → 伸手够到 → 达到\n助记\nattainment n.成就、达到；同 achieve, reach；obtain 获得（物品）\n例句\nShe ==attained== the highest score in the class. 她取得了全班最高分。","fields":{"Front":"attain","Back":"释义\nv. 达到，获得（目标、水平、年龄）\n词根词缀\nat- (=ad) 朝向 + tain (=ten) 握住、触及 → 伸手够到 → 达到\n助记\nattainment n.成就、达到；同 achieve, reach；obtain 获得（物品）\n例句\nShe ==attained== the highest score in the class. 她取得了全班最高分。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_25","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"constitute","back":"释义\nv. 组成，构成；被算作，相当于；设立\n词根词缀\ncon- 一起 + stit 站立 + -e → 站到一起 → 组成\n助记\nconstitution n.宪法、构成；constituent n.成分、选民；同 compose, make up\n例句\nWomen ==constitute== half of the workforce. 女性占劳动力的一半。","fields":{"Front":"constitute","Back":"释义\nv. 组成，构成；被算作，相当于；设立\n词根词缀\ncon- 一起 + stit 站立 + -e → 站到一起 → 组成\n助记\nconstitution n.宪法、构成；constituent n.成分、选民；同 compose, make up\n例句\nWomen ==constitute== half of the workforce. 女性占劳动力的一半。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_26","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"exposition","back":"释义\nn. 阐述，讲解；展览会，博览会\n词根词缀\nex- 向外 + pos 放置 + -ition → 摆出来给人看 → 阐述；展览\n助记\nexpose v.暴露、揭露；expo n.博览会；同 exhibition, explanation\n例句\nThe book gives a clear ==exposition== of the theory. 这本书清晰地阐述了该理论。","fields":{"Front":"exposition","Back":"释义\nn. 阐述，讲解；展览会，博览会\n词根词缀\nex- 向外 + pos 放置 + -ition → 摆出来给人看 → 阐述；展览\n助记\nexpose v.暴露、揭露；expo n.博览会；同 exhibition, explanation\n例句\nThe book gives a clear ==exposition== of the theory. 这本书清晰地阐述了该理论。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_27","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"forum","back":"释义\nn. 论坛，讨论会；（古罗马）广场\n词根词缀\n拉丁语'公共集会地、市场'，现指讨论平台\n助记\n复数 forums/fora；同 discussion platform\n例句\nThe website provides a ==forum== for debate. 该网站提供辩论论坛。","fields":{"Front":"forum","Back":"释义\nn. 论坛，讨论会；（古罗马）广场\n词根词缀\n拉丁语'公共集会地、市场'，现指讨论平台\n助记\n复数 forums/fora；同 discussion platform\n例句\nThe website provides a ==forum== for debate. 该网站提供辩论论坛。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_28","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"intrepid","back":"释义\na. 勇敢的，无畏的，刚毅的\n词根词缀\nin- 不 + trepid 惊恐的 → 不惊恐的 → 无畏的\n助记\ntrepidation n.惊恐；同 fearless, bold, courageous；反 timid, cowardly\n例句\nThe ==intrepid== explorer crossed the desert alone. 这位无畏的探险家独自穿越沙漠。","fields":{"Front":"intrepid","Back":"释义\na. 勇敢的，无畏的，刚毅的\n词根词缀\nin- 不 + trepid 惊恐的 → 不惊恐的 → 无畏的\n助记\ntrepidation n.惊恐；同 fearless, bold, courageous；反 timid, cowardly\n例句\nThe ==intrepid== explorer crossed the desert alone. 这位无畏的探险家独自穿越沙漠。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","sche