意与 meditate（冥想）区分\n例句\nThe UN tried to ==mediate== between the two sides. 联合国试图在双方之间斡旋。","fields":{"Front":"mediate","Back":"释义\nv. 调解，斡旋；促成（协议）\n词根词缀\nmedi 中间 + -ate 动词 → 站在中间 → 调解\n助记\nmediation n.调解；mediator n.调解人；注意与 meditate（冥想）区分\n例句\nThe UN tried to ==mediate== between the two sides. 联合国试图在双方之间斡旋。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_32","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"meditate","back":"释义\nv. 冥想，打坐；沉思，仔细考虑\n词根词缀\nmedit 思考、衡量 + -ate → 深入思考 → 冥想\n助记\nmeditation n.冥想；meditative a.沉思的；同 contemplate, ponder\n例句\nShe ==meditates== for twenty minutes every morning. 她每天早上冥想二十分钟。","fields":{"Front":"meditate","Back":"释义\nv. 冥想，打坐；沉思，仔细考虑\n词根词缀\nmedit 思考、衡量 + -ate → 深入思考 → 冥想\n助记\nmeditation n.冥想；meditative a.沉思的；同 contemplate, ponder\n例句\nShe ==meditates== for twenty minutes every morning. 她每天早上冥想二十分钟。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_33","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"nominee","back":"释义\nn. 被提名者，候选人；被任命者\n词根词缀\nnomin 名字 + -ee 被…的人 → 被报上名字的人 → 被提名者\n助记\nnominate v.提名；nomination n.提名；-ee 表承受者：employee, trainee\n例句\nShe is the party's presidential ==nominee== . 她是该党的总统候选人。","fields":{"Front":"nominee","Back":"释义\nn. 被提名者，候选人；被任命者\n词根词缀\nnomin 名字 + -ee 被…的人 → 被报上名字的人 → 被提名者\n助记\nnominate v.提名；nomination n.提名；-ee 表承受者：employee, trainee\n例句\nShe is the party's presidential ==nominee== . 她是该党的总统候选人。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_34","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"participant","back":"释义\nn. 参加者，参与者\n词根词缀\npart 部分 + cip (=cap) 拿取 + -ant 人 → 承担一部分的人 → 参与者\n助记\nparticipate v.参加（participate in）；participation n.参与\n例句\nAll ==participants== received a certificate. 所有参与者都获得了证书。","fields":{"Front":"participant","Back":"释义\nn. 参加者，参与者\n词根词缀\npart 部分 + cip (=cap) 拿取 + -ant 人 → 承担一部分的人 → 参与者\n助记\nparticipate v.参加（participate in）；participation n.参与\n例句\nAll ==participants== received a certificate. 所有参与者都获得了证书。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_35","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"rancorous","back":"释义\na. 充满怨恨的，怀恨的，尖刻的\n词根词缀\nrancor 怨恨（ranc 变质、发臭，原指腐臭的黄油）+ -ous → 怨恨的\n助记\nrancor n.怨恨；rancid a.（油脂）变质的；同 resentful, bitter\n例句\nThey had a long, ==rancorous== dispute. 他们进行了一场漫长而充满怨恨的争执。","fields":{"Front":"rancorous","Back":"释义\na. 充满怨恨的，怀恨的，尖刻的\n词根词缀\nrancor 怨恨（ranc 变质、发臭，原指腐臭的黄油）+ -ous → 怨恨的\n助记\nrancor n.怨恨；rancid a.（油脂）变质的；同 resentful, bitter\n例句\nThey had a long, ==rancorous== dispute. 他们进行了一场漫长而充满怨恨的争执。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_36","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"revere","back":"释义\nv. 尊敬，崇敬，敬畏\n词根词缀\nre- 反复 + vere (=vereri) 敬畏 → 心怀敬畏 → 崇敬\n助记\nreverence n.崇敬；reverend a.可敬的；同 venerate, respect；反 scorn\n例句\nThe old teacher was ==revered== by everyone. 这位老教师受到所有人的敬重。","fields":{"Front":"revere","Back":"释义\nv. 尊敬，崇敬，敬畏\n词根词缀\nre- 反复 + vere (=vereri) 敬畏 → 心怀敬畏 → 崇敬\n助记\nreverence n.崇敬；reverend a.可敬的；同 venerate, respect；反 scorn\n例句\nThe old teacher was ==revered== by everyone. 这位老教师受到所有人的敬重。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_37","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"secrete","back":"释义\nv. 分泌；隐藏，藏匿\n词根词缀\nse- 分开、离开 + cret 放置 + -e → 分开放出 → 分泌；另义'藏起来'\n助记\nsecretion n.分泌物；secret a.秘密的；注意两义：分泌 / 藏匿\n例句\nGlands in the mouth ==secrete== saliva. 口腔中的腺体分泌唾液。","fields":{"Front":"secrete","Back":"释义\nv. 分泌；隐藏，藏匿\n词根词缀\nse- 分开、离开 + cret 放置 + -e → 分开放出 → 分泌；另义'藏起来'\n助记\nsecretion n.分泌物；secret a.秘密的；注意两义：分泌 / 藏匿\n例句\nGlands in the mouth ==secrete== saliva. 口腔中的腺体分泌唾液。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_38","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"sensitive","back":"释义\na. 敏感的，灵敏的；体贴的；（问题）棘手的\n词根词缀\nsens 感觉 + -itive 易于…的 → 容易有感觉的 → 敏感的\n助记\nsense n.感觉；sensible a.明智的；sensory a.感官的；搭配 sensitive to\n例句\nHe is very ==sensitive== to criticism. 他对批评非常敏感。","fields":{"Front":"sensitive","Back":"释义\na. 敏感的，灵敏的；体贴的；（问题）棘手的\n词根词缀\nsens 感觉 + -itive 易于…的 → 容易有感觉的 → 敏感的\n助记\nsense n.感觉；sensible a.明智的；sensory a.感官的；搭配 sensitive to\n例句\nHe is very ==sensitive== to criticism. 他对批评非常敏感。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_39","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"solicit","back":"释义\nv. 请求，恳求（给予）；招揽（生意）；征求（意见）\n词根词缀\nsol- 完全 + icit (=cit) 唤起、引动 → 急切唤起 → 请求、招揽\n助记\nsolicitor n.事务律师；solicitation n.招揽；同 request, seek\n例句\nWe are ==soliciting== feedback from customers. 我们正在征求顾客的反馈。","fields":{"Front":"solicit","Back":"释义\nv. 请求，恳求（给予）；招揽（生意）；征求（意见）\n词根词缀\nsol- 完全 + icit (=cit) 唤起、引动 → 急切唤起 → 请求、招揽\n助记\nsolicitor n.事务律师；solicitation n.招揽；同 request, seek\n例句\nWe are ==soliciting== feedback from customers. 我们正在征求顾客的反馈。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_40","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"strain","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 压力，重负；拉伤；品种；v. 拉伤；尽力；过滤\n词根词缀\nstrain 拉紧、束缚（与 strict/string 同源'绑紧'）\n助记\nstrained a.紧张的；同 stress, tension；eye strain 视疲劳\n例句\nThe long hours put a great ==strain== on her. 长时间工作给她造成巨大压力。","fields":{"Front":"strain","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 压力，重负；拉伤；品种；v. 拉伤；尽力；过滤\n词根词缀\nstrain 拉紧、束缚（与 strict/string 同源'绑紧'）\n助记\nstrained a.紧张的；同 stress, tension；eye strain 视疲劳\n例句\nThe long hours put a great ==strain== on her. 长时间工作给她造成巨大压力。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_41","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"stylized","back":"释义\na. 风格化的，程式化的，非写实的\n词根词缀\nstyle 风格 + -ize + -ed → 按固定风格处理的 → 程式化的\n助记\nstyle n.风格；stylize v.使风格化；stylized art 风格化艺术\n例句\nThe film uses highly ==stylized== visuals. 影片采用高度风格化的画面。","fields":{"Front":"stylized","Back":"释义\na. 风格化的，程式化的，非写实的\n词根词缀\nstyle 风格 + -ize + -ed → 按固定风格处理的 → 程式化的\n助记\nstyle n.风格；stylize v.使风格化；stylized art 风格化艺术\n例句\nThe film uses highly ==stylized== visuals. 影片采用高度风格化的画面。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_42","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"subculture","back":"释义\nn. 亚文化，次文化（某群体特有的文化）\n词根词缀\nsub- 次级的 + culture 文化 → 大文化下的次级文化\n助记\nsub- 表示'下、次'：submarine, subdivide；反 mainstream culture\n例句\nPunk was a youth ==subculture== in the 1970s. 朋克是20世纪70年代的一种青年亚文化。","fields":{"Front":"subculture","Back":"释义\nn. 亚文化，次文化（某群体特有的文化）\n词根词缀\nsub- 次级的 + culture 文化 → 大文化下的次级文化\n助记\nsub- 表示'下、次'：submarine, subdivide；反 mainstream culture\n例句\nPunk was a youth ==subculture== in the 1970s. 朋克是20世纪70年代的一种青年亚文化。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_43","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"unravel","back":"释义\nv. 解开（线团）；弄清，揭示（谜团）；瓦解\n词根词缀\nun- 相反 + ravel 缠绕、纠缠 → 使不再缠绕 → 解开、厘清\n助记\nravel 与 unravel 都可表'解开'；unravel a mystery 解开谜团\n例句\nDetectives finally ==unraveled== the mystery. 侦探们最终揭开了谜团。","fields":{"Front":"unravel","Back":"释义\nv. 解开（线团）；弄清，揭示（谜团）；瓦解\n词根词缀\nun- 相反 + ravel 缠绕、纠缠 → 使不再缠绕 → 解开、厘清\n助记\nravel 与 unravel 都可表'解开'；unravel a mystery 解开谜团\n例句\nDetectives finally ==unraveled== the mystery. 侦探们最终揭开了谜团。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_44","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"unsubstantiated","back":"释义\na. 未经证实的，没有事实根据的\n词根词缀\nun- 否定 + substantiate 证实（substant 实体、事实）+ -ed → 无实据的\n助记\nsubstance n.实质；substantial a.大量的；substantiate v.证实；反 verified\n例句\nThe report was based on ==unsubstantiated== rumors. 该报道基于未经证实的传言。","fields":{"Front":"unsubstantiated","Back":"释义\na. 未经证实的，没有事实根据的\n词根词缀\nun- 否定 + substantiate 证实（substant 实体、事实）+ -ed → 无实据的\n助记\nsubstance n.实质；substantial a.大量的；substantiate v.证实；反 verified\n例句\nThe report was based on ==unsubstantiated== rumors. 该报道基于未经证实的传言。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_45","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"varied","back":"释义\na. 各种各样的，不同的；多变的\n词根词缀\nvary 的过去分词作形容词：多样的\n助记\nvarious 强调'多个不同的'；varied 强调'富于变化的'\n例句\nThe menu offers a ==varied== selection of dishes. 菜单提供种类丰富的菜肴。","fields":{"Front":"varied","Back":"释义\na. 各种各样的，不同的；多变的\n词根词缀\nvary 的过去分词作形容词：多样的\n助记\nvarious 强调'多个不同的'；varied 强调'富于变化的'\n例句\nThe menu offers a ==varied== selection of dishes. 菜单提供种类丰富的菜肴。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_46","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"vary","back":"释义\nv. 变化，有不同；改变，使多样化\n词根词缀\nvar 变化、多样 + -y 动词 → 变化\n助记\nvaried a.各种各样的；various a.不同的；variety n.多样性；variable a.可变的\n例句\nPrices ==vary== from store to store. 各家商店价格不同。","fields":{"Front":"vary","Back":"释义\nv. 变化，有不同；改变，使多样化\n词根词缀\nvar 变化、多样 + -y 动词 → 变化\n助记\nvaried a.各种各样的；various a.不同的；variety n.多样性；variable a.可变的\n例句\nPrices ==vary== from store to store. 各家商店价格不同。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_47","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"accent","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 口音，腔调；重音；着重点；v. 强调\n词根词缀\nac- (=ad) + cent (=cant) 歌唱、声音 → 说话的声调 → 口音\n助记\naccentuate v.强调、突出；同 emphasize；注意重音在名词义\n例句\nShe speaks English with a French ==accent== . 她说英语带法国口音。","fields":{"Front":"accent","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 口音，腔调；重音；着重点；v. 强调\n词根词缀\nac- (=ad) + cent (=cant) 歌唱、声音 → 说话的声调 → 口音\n助记\naccentuate v.强调、突出；同 emphasize；注意重音在名词义\n例句\nShe speaks English with a French ==accent== . 她说英语带法国口音。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_48","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"bedrock","back":"释义\nn. 基岩，底层；基础，根本原则\n词根词缀\nbed 床、底层 + rock 岩石 → 最底下的岩石 → 坚实基础\n助记\nthe bedrock of …的根本；同 foundation, cornerstone\n例句\nHonesty is the ==bedrock== of a good relationship. 诚实是良好关系的基石。","fields":{"Front":"bedrock","Back":"释义\nn. 基岩，底层；基础，根本原则\n词根词缀\nbed 床、底层 + rock 岩石 → 最底下的岩石 → 坚实基础\n助记\nthe bedrock of …的根本；同 foundation, cornerstone\n例句\nHonesty is the ==bedrock== of a good relationship. 诚实是良好关系的基石。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_49","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"constrain","back":"释义\nv. 强迫，限制，约束，束缚\n词根词缀\ncon- 一起 + strain 拉紧 → 紧紧拉住 → 约束\n助记\nconstraint n.约束；restrain v.抑制；constrained a.拘谨的；同 restrict, limit\n例句\nResearch is ==constrained== by lack of funds. 研究因资金不足而受限。","fields":{"Front":"constrain","Back":"释义\nv. 强迫，限制，约束，束缚\n词根词缀\ncon- 一起 + strain 拉紧 → 紧紧拉住 → 约束\n助记\nconstraint n.约束；restrain v.抑制；constrained a.拘谨的；同 restrict, limit\n例句\nResearch is ==constrained== by lack of funds. 研究因资金不足而受限。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_50","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"due","back":"释义\na./n. 到期的；应得的；预期的；适当的；n. 应得物\n词根词缀\ndu 欠、应给 + -e → 应给予的 → 到期的\n助记\ndue to 由于；give sb. their due 公道评价；dues n.会费\n例句\nThe report is ==due== on Friday. 报告周五到期/须在周五交。","fields":{"Front":"due","Back":"释义\na./n. 到期的；应得的；预期的；适当的；n. 应得物\n词根词缀\ndu 欠、应给 + -e → 应给予的 → 到期的\n助记\ndue to 由于；give sb. their due 公道评价；dues n.会费\n例句\nThe report is ==due== on Friday. 报告周五到期/须在周五交。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_51","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"electron","back":"释义\nn. 电子\n词根词缀\nelectr 电（源自希腊语'琥珀'，摩擦生电）+ -on 粒子后缀 → 电子\n助记\nelectronic a.电子的；electricity n.电；proton 质子；neutron 中子\n例句\nAn ==electron== carries a negative charge. 电子带负电荷。","fields":{"Front":"electron","Back":"释义\nn. 电子\n词根词缀\nelectr 电（源自希腊语'琥珀'，摩擦生电）+ -on 粒子后缀 → 电子\n助记\nelectronic a.电子的；electricity n.电；proton 质子；neutron 中子\n例句\nAn ==electron== carries a negative charge. 电子带负电荷。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_52","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"engage","back":"释义\nv. 从事，参与；吸引（注意）；雇用；订婚；交战\n词根词缀\nen- 使 + gage 保证、抵押 → 立下保证 → 投入、参与\n助记\nengagement n.订婚、参与；engaging a.迷人的；搭配 engage in；be engaged to sb 与…订婚\n例句\nShe is ==engaged== in medical research. 她从事医学研究。","fields":{"Front":"engage","Back":"释义\nv. 从事，参与；吸引（注意）；雇用；订婚；交战\n词根词缀\nen- 使 + gage 保证、抵押 → 立下保证 → 投入、参与\n助记\nengagement n.订婚、参与；engaging a.迷人的；搭配 engage in；be engaged to sb 与…订婚\n例句\nShe is ==engaged== in medical research. 她从事医学研究。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_53","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"engulf","back":"释义\nv. 吞没，吞噬，包围（火焰、洪水、情感）\n词根词缀\nen- 使进入 + gulf 海湾、深渊 → 卷入深渊 → 吞没\n助记\ngulf n.海湾、鸿沟；同 swallow up, overwhelm\n例句\nFlames quickly ==engulfed== the building. 火焰很快吞噬了整栋建筑。","fields":{"Front":"engulf","Back":"释义\nv. 吞没，吞噬，包围（火焰、洪水、情感）\n词根词缀\nen- 使进入 + gulf 海湾、深渊 → 卷入深渊 → 吞没\n助记\ngulf n.海湾、鸿沟；同 swallow up, overwhelm\n例句\nFlames quickly ==engulfed== the building. 火焰很快吞噬了整栋建筑。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_54","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"facilitate","back":"释义\nv. 使便利，促进，使更容易\n词根词缀\nfacil (=facile) 容易的 + -itate 动词 → 使变得容易 → 促进\n助记\nfacility n.设施、便利；facile a.轻易的、肤浅的；同 ease, promote\n例句\nTechnology can ==facilitate== communication. 技术能促进交流。","fields":{"Front":"facilitate","Back":"释义\nv. 使便利，促进，使更容易\n词根词缀\nfacil (=facile) 容易的 + -itate 动词 → 使变得容易 → 促进\n助记\nfacility n.设施、便利；facile a.轻易的、肤浅的；同 ease, promote\n例句\nTechnology can ==facilitate== communication. 技术能促进交流。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_55","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"feeble","back":"释义\na. 虚弱的，无力的；无效的，站不住脚的\n词根词缀\nfeeb (=fleb) 哭泣、衰弱 + -le → 无力的\n助记\nfeeble-minded a.意志薄弱的；同 weak, frail；feeble excuse 站不住脚的借口\n例句\nHe made a ==feeble== attempt to argue. 他做了一次无力的争辩。","fields":{"Front":"feeble","Back":"释义\na. 虚弱的，无力的；无效的，站不住脚的\n词根词缀\nfeeb (=fleb) 哭泣、衰弱 + -le → 无力的\n助记\nfeeble-minded a.意志薄弱的；同 weak, frail；feeble excuse 站不住脚的借口\n例句\nHe made a ==feeble== attempt to argue. 他做了一次无力的争辩。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_56","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"identification","back":"释义\nn. 识别，确认；身份证明；认同\n词根词缀\nidentify 的名词：ident- 相同 + -ification\n助记\n缩写 ID；identification number 识别号、编号\n例句\nThe police asked for ==identification== . 警察要求出示身份证件。","fields":{"Front":"identification","Back":"释义\nn. 识别，确认；身份证明；认同\n词根词缀\nidentify 的名词：ident- 相同 + -ification\n助记\n缩写 ID；identification number 识别号、编号\n例句\nThe police asked for ==identification== . 警察要求出示身份证件。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_57","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"identify","back":"释义\nv. 认出，识别；确认；认同，把…视为相同\n词根词缀\nident- 相同 + -ify 使 → 使（与某身份）相同 → 识别、认同\n助记\nidentify with 认同、产生共鸣；identification n.识别、身份证明\n例句\nCan you ==identify== the man in the photo? 你能认出照片里的男人吗？","fields":{"Front":"identify","Back":"释义\nv. 认出，识别；确认；认同，把…视为相同\n词根词缀\nident- 相同 + -ify 使 → 使（与某身份）相同 → 识别、认同\n助记\nidentify with 认同、产生共鸣；identification n.识别、身份证明\n例句\nCan you ==identify== the man in the photo? 你能认出照片里的男人吗？","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_58","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"identity","back":"释义\nn. 身份；本身，同一性；一致性\n词根词缀\nident- 相同 + -ity 名词 → 与…相同（证明'我是我'）→ 身份\n助记\nidentify v.识别、认同；identical a.完全相同的；ID 身份证；identity card\n例句\nPlease show proof of ==identity== . 请出示身份证明。","fields":{"Front":"identity","Back":"释义\nn. 身份；本身，同一性；一致性\n词根词缀\nident- 相同 + -ity 名词 → 与…相同（证明'我是我'）→ 身份\n助记\nidentify v.识别、认同；identical a.完全相同的；ID 身份证；identity card\n例句\nPlease show proof of ==identity== . 请出示身份证明。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_59","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"influx","back":"释义\nn. 涌入，大量流入（人、资金、事物）\n词根词缀\nin- 进入 + flux 流动 → 流入 → 大量涌入\n助记\nflux n.流动、变迁；influence n.影响（流入）；反 exodus, outflow\n例句\nThe city saw an ==influx== of tourists in summer. 夏天这座城市游客大量涌入。","fields":{"Front":"influx","Back":"释义\nn. 涌入，大量流入（人、资金、事物）\n词根词缀\nin- 进入 + flux 流动 → 流入 → 大量涌入\n助记\nflux n.流动、变迁；influence n.影响（流入）；反 exodus, outflow\n例句\nThe city saw an ==influx== of tourists in summer. 夏天这座城市游客大量涌入。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_60","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"innocent","back":"释义\na./n. a. 清白的，无辜的；天真的；无害的；n. 无辜者\n词根词缀\nin- 不 + noc 伤害、过错 + -ent → 未做伤害之事 → 无辜的\n助记\ninnocence n.无辜；noc 表伤害：nocuous 有害的；反 guilty；innocent of 无罪\n例句\nThe court found him ==innocent== of the crime. 法庭判他无罪。","fields":{"Front":"innocent","Back":"释义\na./n. a. 清白的，无辜的；天真的；无害的；n. 无辜者\n词根词缀\nin- 不 + noc 伤害、过错 + -ent → 未做伤害之事 → 无辜的\n助记\ninnocence n.无辜；noc 表伤害：nocuous 有害的；反 guilty；innocent of 无罪\n例句\nThe court found him ==innocent== of the crime. 法庭判他无罪。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_61","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"kernel","back":"释义\nn. （坚果、谷物的）仁，核；核心，要点\n词根词缀\nkern 谷粒、核 + -el 小 → 小核 → 核心\n助记\na kernel of truth 一丝真相；同 core, essence；注意与 colonel（上校）同音\n例句\nThere is a ==kernel== of truth in his story. 他的话里有一点真实的成分。","fields":{"Front":"kernel","Back":"释义\nn. （坚果、谷物的）仁，核；核心，要点\n词根词缀\nkern 谷粒、核 + -el 小 → 小核 → 核心\n助记\na kernel of truth 一丝真相；同 core, essence；注意与 colonel（上校）同音\n例句\nThere is a ==kernel== of truth in his story. 他的话里有一点真实的成分。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_62","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"nourish","back":"释义\nv. 滋养，给…营养；培育，怀有（希望）\n词根词缀\nnour (=nutri) 喂养、营养 + -ish 动词 → 滋养\n助记\nnourishment n.食物、营养；nutrition n.营养；nurture v.培育；nourish a hope 怀有希望\n例句\nGood soil ==nourishes== the crops. 肥沃的土壤滋养庄稼。","fields":{"Front":"nourish","Back":"释义\nv. 滋养，给…营养；培育，怀有（希望）\n词根词缀\nnour (=nutri) 喂养、营养 + -ish 动词 → 滋养\n助记\nnourishment n.食物、营养；nutrition n.营养；nurture v.培育；nourish a hope 怀有希望\n例句\nGood soil ==nourishes== the crops. 肥沃的土壤滋养庄稼。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_63","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"patriarch","back":"释义\nn. 家长，族长，德高望重的老年男性\n词根词缀\npatri 父亲 + arch 统治、首领 → 父系统治者 → 族长\n助记\npatriarchy n.父权制；matriarch n.女家长；arch 表'首领'：monarch\n例句\nGrandfather was the ==patriarch== of the family. 祖父是这个家族的大家长。","fields":{"Front":"patriarch","Back":"释义\nn. 家长，族长，德高望重的老年男性\n词根词缀\npatri 父亲 + arch 统治、首领 → 父系统治者 → 族长\n助记\npatriarchy n.父权制；matriarch n.女家长；arch 表'首领'：monarch\n例句\nGrandfather was the ==patriarch== of the family. 祖父是这个家族的大家长。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_64","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"progressive","back":"释义\na./n. a. 进步的，先进的；逐步的；n. 进步人士\n词根词缀\nprogress 进步（pro- 向前 + gress 走）+ -ive → 向前走的 → 进步的\n助记\nprogress n./v.进步；progression n.进程；反 conservative, regressive\n例句\nThe disease causes ==progressive== loss of memory. 这种病导致记忆逐步衰退。","fields":{"Front":"progressive","Back":"释义\na./n. a. 进步的，先进的；逐步的；n. 进步人士\n词根词缀\nprogress 进步（pro- 向前 + gress 走）+ -ive → 向前走的 → 进步的\n助记\nprogress n./v.进步；progression n.进程；反 conservative, regressive\n例句\nThe disease causes ==progressive== loss of memory. 这种病导致记忆逐步衰退。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_65","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"receptacle","back":"释义\nn. 容器，收纳处；插座\n词根词缀\nre- 反复 + cept (=cap) 接收 + -acle 物 → 用来接收的东西 → 容器\n助记\nreceive v.接收；reception n.接待；receptive a.乐于接受的；同 container\n例句\nPlease put waste in the proper ==receptacle== . 请把垃圾放入合适的容器。","fields":{"Front":"receptacle","Back":"释义\nn. 容器，收纳处；插座\n词根词缀\nre- 反复 + cept (=cap) 接收 + -acle 物 → 用来接收的东西 → 容器\n助记\nreceive v.接收；reception n.接待；receptive a.乐于接受的；同 container\n例句\nPlease put waste in the proper ==receptacle== . 请把垃圾放入合适的容器。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_66","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"secure","back":"释义\na./v. a. 安全的，稳固的；无忧的；v. 获得；使安全，保护\n词根词缀\nse- 离开 + cur 忧虑 → 无忧无虑 → 安全；动词义'弄到、确保'\n助记\nsecurity n.安全；insecure a.不安全的；同 obtain, protect\n例句\nHe managed to ==secure== two tickets. 他设法弄到了两张票。","fields":{"Front":"secure","Back":"释义\na./v. a. 安全的，稳固的；无忧的；v. 获得；使安全，保护\n词根词缀\nse- 离开 + cur 忧虑 → 无忧无虑 → 安全；动词义'弄到、确保'\n助记\nsecurity n.安全；insecure a.不安全的；同 obtain, protect\n例句\nHe managed to ==secure== two tickets. 他设法弄到了两张票。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_67","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"seep","back":"释义\nv. （液体、气体）渗漏，渗透；（思想）渐渐扩散\n词根词缀\n拟声，模拟液体缓慢渗出\n助记\nseepage n.渗漏；同 ooze, leak；seep into 逐渐进入\n例句\nRainwater began to ==seep== through the roof. 雨水开始从屋顶渗进来。","fields":{"Front":"seep","Back":"释义\nv. （液体、气体）渗漏，渗透；（思想）渐渐扩散\n词根词缀\n拟声，模拟液体缓慢渗出\n助记\nseepage n.渗漏；同 ooze, leak；seep into 逐渐进入\n例句\nRainwater began to ==seep== through the roof. 雨水开始从屋顶渗进来。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_68","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"segment","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 部分，片段，瓣；v. 分割，划分\n词根词缀\nseg- (=sec) 切割 + -ment 物 → 切下来的一块 → 片段\n助记\nsection n.部分；segment 橙子的一瓣；segmentation n.分割；同 portion\n例句\nThe market is divided into several ==segments== . 市场被划分为几个部分。","fields":{"Front":"segment","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 部分，片段，瓣；v. 分割，划分\n词根词缀\nseg- (=sec) 切割 + -ment 物 → 切下来的一块 → 片段\n助记\nsection n.部分；segment 橙子的一瓣；segmentation n.分割；同 portion\n例句\nThe market is divided into several ==segments== . 市场被划分为几个部分。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_69","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"tolerate","back":"释义\nv. 容忍，忍受；容许；耐受（药物、环境）\n词根词缀\ntoler 忍受 + -ate 动词 → 忍受\n助记\ntolerance n.宽容、耐受力；tolerant a.宽容的；同 endure, put up with\n例句\nI will not ==tolerate== such rude behavior. 我不会容忍如此无礼的行为。","fields":{"Front":"tolerate","Back":"释义\nv. 容忍，忍受；容许；耐受（药物、环境）\n词根词缀\ntoler 忍受 + -ate 动词 → 忍受\n助记\ntolerance n.宽容、耐受力；tolerant a.宽容的；同 endure, put up with\n例句\nI will not ==tolerate== such rude behavior. 我不会容忍如此无礼的行为。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_70","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"unprecedented","back":"释义\na. 史无前例的，空前的，前所未有的\n词根词缀\nun- 无 + precedent 先例（pre- 前 + ced 走）+ -ed → 无先例的\n助记\nprecede v.先于；precedent n.先例；同 unparalleled；反 usual\n例句\nThe country faced ==unprecedented== challenges. 国家面临前所未有的挑战。","fields":{"Front":"unprecedented","Back":"释义\na. 史无前例的，空前的，前所未有的\n词根词缀\nun- 无 + precedent 先例（pre- 前 + ced 走）+ -ed → 无先例的\n助记\nprecede v.先于；precedent n.先例；同 unparalleled；反 usual\n例句\nThe country faced ==unprecedented== challenges. 国家面临前所未有的挑战。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l1_71","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"verbal","back":"释义\na. 口头的；言语的，文字的；动词的\n词根词缀\nverb 词语、动词 + -al → 与言语有关的 → 口头的\n助记\nverb n.动词；verbalize v.用言语表达；nonverbal a.非语言的；oral 口头的\n例句\nThey reached a ==verbal== agreement. 他们达成了口头协议。","fields":{"Front":"verbal","Back":"释义\na. 口头的；言语的，文字的；动词的\n词根词缀\nverb 词语、动词 + -al → 与言语有关的 → 口头的\n助记\nverb n.动词；verbalize v.用言语表达；nonverbal a.非语言的；oral 口头的\n例句\nThey reached a ==verbal== agreement. 他们达成了口头协议。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 1 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]}]},{"id":"toefl-list-2","name":"TOEFL 托福 › List 2","description":"托福核心词 · List 2（68 词 · 释义 + 词根词缀 + 助记 + 标黄例句）","createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["toefl","imported"],"options":{"newPerDay":null,"reviewsPerDay":null,"learningSteps":null,"relearningSteps":null,"graduatingInterval":null,"easyInterval":null,"leechThreshold":null,"leechAction":"","buryRelated":null,"maxInterval":null,"requestRetention":null,"newOrder":"","reviewOrder":""},"cards":[{"noteId":"toefl_l2_0","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"arrest","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 逮捕，拘捕；阻止，抑制；n. 逮捕\n词根词缀\nar- (=ad) + rest 停留、阻止 → 使停住 → 逮捕；引申'阻止发展'\n助记\nunder arrest 被捕；cardiac arrest 心脏骤停；同 stop, detain\n例句\nThe new drug may ==arrest== the disease's progress. 这种新药或许能阻止病情发展。","fields":{"Front":"arrest","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 逮捕，拘捕；阻止，抑制；n. 逮捕\n词根词缀\nar- (=ad) + rest 停留、阻止 → 使停住 → 逮捕；引申'阻止发展'\n助记\nunder arrest 被捕；cardiac arrest 心脏骤停；同 stop, detain\n例句\nThe new drug may ==arrest== the disease's progress. 这种新药或许能阻止病情发展。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_1","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"associate","back":"释义\nv./n./a. v. 联系，联想；交往；n. 同事，伙伴；a. 副的\n词根词缀\nas- (=ad) + soci 同伴、联合（social）+ -ate → 结为同伴\n助记\nassociation n.协会、联想；associate professor 副教授；搭配 associate with\n例句\nPeople often ==associate== red with danger. 人们常把红色与危险联系起来。","fields":{"Front":"associate","Back":"释义\nv./n./a. v. 联系，联想；交往；n. 同事，伙伴；a. 副的\n词根词缀\nas- (=ad) + soci 同伴、联合（social）+ -ate → 结为同伴\n助记\nassociation n.协会、联想；associate professor 副教授；搭配 associate with\n例句\nPeople often ==associate== red with danger. 人们常把红色与危险联系起来。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_2","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"certitude","back":"释义\nn. 确定，确信，毫无疑问\n词根词缀\ncert 确定（certain）+ -itude 状态 → 确定无疑的状态\n助记\ncertain a.确定的；certify v.证明；同 certainty, assurance；反 doubt\n例句\nHe spoke with complete ==certitude== . 他说话时语气十分笃定。","fields":{"Front":"certitude","Back":"释义\nn. 确定，确信，毫无疑问\n词根词缀\ncert 确定（certain）+ -itude 状态 → 确定无疑的状态\n助记\ncertain a.确定的；certify v.证明；同 certainty, assurance；反 doubt\n例句\nHe spoke with complete ==certitude== . 他说话时语气十分笃定。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_3","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"constitution","back":"释义\nn. 宪法；体质，体格；构成，组成\n词根词缀\ncon- 一起 + stit 站立 + -ution → 共同确立之物 → 宪法；身体'根基'→体质\n助记\nconstitute v.构成；constitutional a.宪法的、体质的；a strong constitution 强健体魄\n例句\nThe right to vote is protected by the ==constitution== . 选举权受宪法保护。","fields":{"Front":"constitution","Back":"释义\nn. 宪法；体质，体格；构成，组成\n词根词缀\ncon- 一起 + stit 站立 + -ution → 共同确立之物 → 宪法；身体'根基'→体质\n助记\nconstitute v.构成；constitutional a.宪法的、体质的；a strong constitution 强健体魄\n例句\nThe right to vote is protected by the ==constitution== . 选举权受宪法保护。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_4","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"critic","back":"释义\nn. 批评者，挑剔者；评论家，评论员\n词根词缀\ncrit 判断、评判（crisis 决断关头）+ -ic 人 → 做评判的人 → 评论家\n助记\ncritical a.批评的、关键的；criticism n.批评；criticize v.批评\n例句\nThe film was praised by most ==critics== . 这部电影受到大多数评论家好评。","fields":{"Front":"critic","Back":"释义\nn. 批评者，挑剔者；评论家，评论员\n词根词缀\ncrit 判断、评判（crisis 决断关头）+ -ic 人 → 做评判的人 → 评论家\n助记\ncritical a.批评的、关键的；criticism n.批评；criticize v.批评\n例句\nThe film was praised by most ==critics== . 这部电影受到大多数评论家好评。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_5","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"cynical","back":"释义\na. 愤世嫉俗的，冷嘲热讽的，不信善意的\n词根词缀\ncynic 犬儒学派（昔兰尼的愤世者）+ -al → 怀疑一切动机的\n助记\ncynic n.愤世嫉俗者；cynicism n.犬儒主义；同 skeptical, distrustful\n例句\nDon't be so ==cynical== about people's kindness. 别对他人的善意这么冷嘲热讽。","fields":{"Front":"cynical","Back":"释义\na. 愤世嫉俗的，冷嘲热讽的，不信善意的\n词根词缀\ncynic 犬儒学派（昔兰尼的愤世者）+ -al → 怀疑一切动机的\n助记\ncynic n.愤世嫉俗者；cynicism n.犬儒主义；同 skeptical, distrustful\n例句\nDon't be so ==cynical== about people's kindness. 别对他人的善意这么冷嘲热讽。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_6","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"database","back":"释义\nn. 数据库，资料库\n词根词缀\ndata 数据（datum 复数）+ base 基础、库 → 数据库\n助记\ndata n.数据；databank n.数据库；data entry 数据录入\n例句\nAll records are stored in a central ==database== . 所有记录都存在中央数据库里。","fields":{"Front":"database","Back":"释义\nn. 数据库，资料库\n词根词缀\ndata 数据（datum 复数）+ base 基础、库 → 数据库\n助记\ndata n.数据；databank n.数据库；data entry 数据录入\n例句\nAll records are stored in a central ==database== . 所有记录都存在中央数据库里。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_7","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"dehydrate","back":"释义\nv. 脱水，使失水；（食物）干燥保存\n词根词缀\nde- 去除 + hydr 水 + -ate → 去掉水分 → 脱水\n助记\nhydr 水：hydrant 消防栓；dehydration n.脱水；反 hydrate 补水\n例句\nHot weather can ==dehydrate== you quickly. 炎热天气会让你很快脱水。","fields":{"Front":"dehydrate","Back":"释义\nv. 脱水，使失水；（食物）干燥保存\n词根词缀\nde- 去除 + hydr 水 + -ate → 去掉水分 → 脱水\n助记\nhydr 水：hydrant 消防栓；dehydration n.脱水；反 hydrate 补水\n例句\nHot weather can ==dehydrate== you quickly. 炎热天气会让你很快脱水。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_8","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"dramatize","back":"释义\nv. 改编成剧本/戏剧；夸张渲染，小题大做\n词根词缀\ndrama 戏剧 + -tize 使 → 使戏剧化\n助记\ndrama n.戏剧；dramatic a.戏剧性的；dramatization n.改编；同 exaggerate\n例句\nThe novel was later ==dramatized== for television. 这部小说后来被改编成电视剧。","fields":{"Front":"dramatize","Back":"释义\nv. 改编成剧本/戏剧；夸张渲染，小题大做\n词根词缀\ndrama 戏剧 + -tize 使 → 使戏剧化\n助记\ndrama n.戏剧；dramatic a.戏剧性的；dramatization n.改编；同 exaggerate\n例句\nThe novel was later ==dramatized== for television. 这部小说后来被改编成电视剧。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_9","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"engrave","back":"释义\nv. 雕刻，刻上；使铭记，深深印在\n词根词缀\nen- 使 + grave 雕刻、刻刀（同 grave 墓穴'挖掘'）→ 刻入\n助记\nengraving n.版画、雕刻；engrave in memory 铭记；同 carve, inscribe\n例句\nHis name was ==engraved== on the trophy. 他的名字刻在奖杯上。","fields":{"Front":"engrave","Back":"释义\nv. 雕刻，刻上；使铭记，深深印在\n词根词缀\nen- 使 + grave 雕刻、刻刀（同 grave 墓穴'挖掘'）→ 刻入\n助记\nengraving n.版画、雕刻；engrave in memory 铭记；同 carve, inscribe\n例句\nHis name was ==engraved== on the trophy. 他的名字刻在奖杯上。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_10","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"homage","back":"释义\nn. 敬意，致敬；致敬之作\n词根词缀\nhom (=homin) 人、臣服（homage 原指向领主效忠）→ 致敬\n助记\npay homage to 向…致敬；同 tribute, respect\n例句\nThe film pays ==homage== to old westerns. 这部影片向老西部片致敬。","fields":{"Front":"homage","Back":"释义\nn. 敬意，致敬；致敬之作\n词根词缀\nhom (=homin) 人、臣服（homage 原指向领主效忠）→ 致敬\n助记\npay homage to 向…致敬；同 tribute, respect\n例句\nThe film pays ==homage== to old westerns. 这部影片向老西部片致敬。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_11","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"hustle","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 匆忙奔忙，努力打拼；推搡；兜售；n. 忙碌，干劲\n词根词缀\n拟声/动作感：快速推挤；现代口语指'拼搏、搞钱'\n助记\nhustler n.很拼的人、骗子；hustle and bustle 熙熙攘攘；同 bustle, rush\n例句\nWe ==hustled== through the crowd to catch the train. 我们挤过人群赶火车。","fields":{"Front":"hustle","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 匆忙奔忙，努力打拼；推搡；兜售；n. 忙碌，干劲\n词根词缀\n拟声/动作感：快速推挤；现代口语指'拼搏、搞钱'\n助记\nhustler n.很拼的人、骗子；hustle and bustle 熙熙攘攘；同 bustle, rush\n例句\nWe ==hustled== through the crowd to catch the train. 我们挤过人群赶火车。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_12","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"infatuate","back":"释义\nv. 使迷恋，使痴迷；使冲昏头脑\n词根词缀\nin- 使进入 + fatu 愚蠢的（fatuous）+ -ate → 使人犯傻 → 迷恋\n助记\ninfatuation n.痴迷（短暂盲目）；fatuous a.愚蠢的；区别 love（深沉）\n例句\nHe was ==infatuated== with the new girl. 他对新来的女孩一片痴迷。","fields":{"Front":"infatuate","Back":"释义\nv. 使迷恋，使痴迷；使冲昏头脑\n词根词缀\nin- 使进入 + fatu 愚蠢的（fatuous）+ -ate → 使人犯傻 → 迷恋\n助记\ninfatuation n.痴迷（短暂盲目）；fatuous a.愚蠢的；区别 love（深沉）\n例句\nHe was ==infatuated== with the new girl. 他对新来的女孩一片痴迷。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_13","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"instinctual","back":"释义\na. 本能的，天性的，直觉的\n词根词缀\ninstinct 本能（in- 向内 + stinct 刺、激发 → 天生的驱动）+ -ual\n助记\ninstinct n.本能；instinctive a.本能的；同 innate, inborn\n例句\nBirds have an ==instinctual== urge to migrate. 鸟类有迁徙的本能冲动。","fields":{"Front":"instinctual","Back":"释义\na. 本能的，天性的，直觉的\n词根词缀\ninstinct 本能（in- 向内 + stinct 刺、激发 → 天生的驱动）+ -ual\n助记\ninstinct n.本能；instinctive a.本能的；同 innate, inborn\n例句\nBirds have an ==instinctual== urge to migrate. 鸟类有迁徙的本能冲动。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_14","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"interior","back":"释义\nn./a. n. 内部，里面；内陆；a. 内部的，室内的\n词根词缀\ninter- (=intra) 在…之间、内部 + -ior 比较级后缀 → 更靠里的 → 内部\n助记\n反 exterior 外部；interior design 室内设计；internal a.内部的\n例句\nThe ==interior== of the house was cool and quiet. 房子内部凉爽安静。","fields":{"Front":"interior","Back":"释义\nn./a. n. 内部，里面；内陆；a. 内部的，室内的\n词根词缀\ninter- (=intra) 在…之间、内部 + -ior 比较级后缀 → 更靠里的 → 内部\n助记\n反 exterior 外部；interior design 室内设计；internal a.内部的\n例句\nThe ==interior== of the house was cool and quiet. 房子内部凉爽安静。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_15","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"nominal","back":"释义\na. 名义上的，有名无实的；（费用）微不足道的\n词根词缀\nnomin 名字 + -al → 只在名字上存在的 → 名义上的\n助记\nnominate v.提名；nominal fee 象征性收费；同 token, so-called\n例句\nHe is the ==nominal== head, but she runs the company. 他是名义上的负责人，实际由她经营。","fields":{"Front":"nominal","Back":"释义\na. 名义上的，有名无实的；（费用）微不足道的\n词根词缀\nnomin 名字 + -al → 只在名字上存在的 → 名义上的\n助记\nnominate v.提名；nominal fee 象征性收费；同 token, so-called\n例句\nHe is the ==nominal== head, but she runs the company. 他是名义上的负责人，实际由她经营。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_16","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"orthodox","back":"释义\na. 正统的，传统的，公认的；保守的\n词根词缀\northo 正、直 + dox 观点、信仰 → 正确的信仰 → 正统的\n助记\northo- 正：orthodontics 正畸；反 unorthodox, heterodox；同 conventional\n例句\nHe holds fairly ==orthodox== views on education. 他在教育上持相当正统的观点。","fields":{"Front":"orthodox","Back":"释义\na. 正统的，传统的，公认的；保守的\n词根词缀\northo 正、直 + dox 观点、信仰 → 正确的信仰 → 正统的\n助记\northo- 正：orthodontics 正畸；反 unorthodox, heterodox；同 conventional\n例句\nHe holds fairly ==orthodox== views on education. 他在教育上持相当正统的观点。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_17","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"preliterate","back":"释义\na. 文字出现以前的，尚无文字的（社会）\n词根词缀\npre- 在…之前 + liter 文字 + -ate → 有文字之前的\n助记\nliterate a.识字的；illiterate a.文盲的；prehistory 史前\n例句\nThe myth was passed down in a ==preliterate== society. 这则神话在无文字社会中口耳相传。","fields":{"Front":"preliterate","Back":"释义\na. 文字出现以前的，尚无文字的（社会）\n词根词缀\npre- 在…之前 + liter 文字 + -ate → 有文字之前的\n助记\nliterate a.识字的；illiterate a.文盲的；prehistory 史前\n例句\nThe myth was passed down in a ==preliterate== society. 这则神话在无文字社会中口耳相传。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_18","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"prohibit","back":"释义\nv. 禁止，不准；阻止，妨碍\n词根词缀\npro- 在前 + hibit 拿住、握住 → 事先拿住不让做 → 禁止\n助记\nprohibition n.禁令；exhibit v.展览；同 forbid, ban；反 permit\n例句\nSmoking is strictly ==prohibited== here. 此处严禁吸烟。","fields":{"Front":"prohibit","Back":"释义\nv. 禁止，不准；阻止，妨碍\n词根词缀\npro- 在前 + hibit 拿住、握住 → 事先拿住不让做 → 禁止\n助记\nprohibition n.禁令；exhibit v.展览；同 forbid, ban；反 permit\n例句\nSmoking is strictly ==prohibited== here. 此处严禁吸烟。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_19","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"sinuous","back":"释义\na. 蜿蜒的，迂回的，弯曲起伏的\n词根词缀\nsinu 弯曲、褶皱（sinus 弯曲）+ -ous → 多弯的 → 蜿蜒\n助记\nsinus n.窦、弯曲；同 winding, curving, serpentine\n例句\nA ==sinuous== path wound through the hills. 一条蜿蜒小路在山间盘旋。","fields":{"Front":"sinuous","Back":"释义\na. 蜿蜒的，迂回的，弯曲起伏的\n词根词缀\nsinu 弯曲、褶皱（sinus 弯曲）+ -ous → 多弯的 → 蜿蜒\n助记\nsinus n.窦、弯曲；同 winding, curving, serpentine\n例句\nA ==sinuous== path wound through the hills. 一条蜿蜒小路在山间盘旋。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_20","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"spare","back":"释义\na./v./n. a. 备用的；多余的，空闲的；v. 抽出（时间）；饶恕；n. 备件\n词根词缀\n本义'节制、省下'，引申为备用、富余\n助记\nspare time 空闲；spare no effort 不遗余力；spare tire 备胎；to spare 有余\n例句\nCould you ==spare== me a few minutes? 你能为我抽出几分钟吗？","fields":{"Front":"spare","Back":"释义\na./v./n. a. 备用的；多余的，空闲的；v. 抽出（时间）；饶恕；n. 备件\n词根词缀\n本义'节制、省下'，引申为备用、富余\n助记\nspare time 空闲；spare no effort 不遗余力；spare tire 备胎；to spare 有余\n例句\nCould you ==spare== me a few minutes? 你能为我抽出几分钟吗？","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_21","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"sprinkle","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 撒，洒（粉末、水滴）；n. 少量，稀落\n词根词缀\n拟声，模拟细粒洒落；spr- 与'喷洒'有关（spray, spread）\n助记\nsprinkler n.洒水器、喷淋；a sprinkle of 一点点；同 scatter\n例句\nShe ==sprinkled== sugar over the strawberries. 她在草莓上撒了糖。","fields":{"Front":"sprinkle","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 撒，洒（粉末、水滴）；n. 少量，稀落\n词根词缀\n拟声，模拟细粒洒落；spr- 与'喷洒'有关（spray, spread）\n助记\nsprinkler n.洒水器、喷淋；a sprinkle of 一点点；同 scatter\n例句\nShe ==sprinkled== sugar over the strawberries. 她在草莓上撒了糖。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_22","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"uncanny","back":"释义\na. 异常的，离奇的，不可思议的（强到令人不安）\n词根词缀\nun- 不 + canny 精明的、可知的 → 无法以常理知晓 → 离奇的\n助记\nuncanny valley 恐怖谷；同 eerie, strange；强调'准得反常'\n例句\nShe bears an ==uncanny== resemblance to her grandmother. 她和祖母长得惊人地相似。","fields":{"Front":"uncanny","Back":"释义\na. 异常的，离奇的，不可思议的（强到令人不安）\n词根词缀\nun- 不 + canny 精明的、可知的 → 无法以常理知晓 → 离奇的\n助记\nuncanny valley 恐怖谷；同 eerie, strange；强调'准得反常'\n例句\nShe bears an ==uncanny== resemblance to her grandmother. 她和祖母长得惊人地相似。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_23","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"canyon","back":"释义\nn. 峡谷（常指深而陡、有河流的）\n词根词缀\n西班牙语 cañón'管子、深谷'\n助记\nthe Grand Canyon 大峡谷；同 gorge, ravine；canyon 通常更大更深\n例句\nThe river carved a deep ==canyon== over millions of years. 河流历经数百万年切出深谷。","fields":{"Front":"canyon","Back":"释义\nn. 峡谷（常指深而陡、有河流的）\n词根词缀\n西班牙语 cañón'管子、深谷'\n助记\nthe Grand Canyon 大峡谷；同 gorge, ravine；canyon 通常更大更深\n例句\nThe river carved a deep ==canyon== over millions of years. 河流历经数百万年切出深谷。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_24","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"column","back":"释义\nn. 圆柱，柱；（报刊）专栏；（数字、人）列，纵队\n词根词缀\ncolumn (=columna) 柱子、顶部突出物\n助记\ncolumnist n.专栏作家；spinal column 脊柱；row 横排，column 纵列\n例句\nA ==column== of soldiers marched down the road. 一列士兵沿路行进。","fields":{"Front":"column","Back":"释义\nn. 圆柱，柱；（报刊）专栏；（数字、人）列，纵队\n词根词缀\ncolumn (=columna) 柱子、顶部突出物\n助记\ncolumnist n.专栏作家；spinal column 脊柱；row 横排，column 纵列\n例句\nA ==column== of soldiers marched down the road. 一列士兵沿路行进。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_25","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"controversy","back":"释义\nn. 争论，论战，争议\n词根词缀\ncontro- 相反、对抗 + vers 转 + -y → 观点反转相争 → 争议\n助记\ncontroversial a.有争议的；controvert v.反驳；同 dispute, argument\n例句\nThe decision caused much ==controversy== . 这一决定引发很大争议。","fields":{"Front":"controversy","Back":"释义\nn. 争论，论战，争议\n词根词缀\ncontro- 相反、对抗 + vers 转 + -y → 观点反转相争 → 争议\n助记\ncontroversial a.有争议的；controvert v.反驳；同 dispute, argument\n例句\nThe decision caused much ==controversy== . 这一决定引发很大争议。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_26","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"hay","back":"释义\nn. （做饲料用的）干草\n词根词缀\n古英语'割下晒干的草'；固定 make hay 晒草\n助记\nhaystack n.干草堆；make hay while the sun shines 趁热打铁；区别 grass 青草\n例句\nThe cows were fed on fresh ==hay== . 牛喂的是新鲜干草。","fields":{"Front":"hay","Back":"释义\nn. （做饲料用的）干草\n词根词缀\n古英语'割下晒干的草'；固定 make hay 晒草\n助记\nhaystack n.干草堆；make hay while the sun shines 趁热打铁；区别 grass 青草\n例句\nThe cows were fed on fresh ==hay== . 牛喂的是新鲜干草。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_27","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"homestead","back":"释义\nn. 家园，宅地；（政府授予开垦的）农庄\n词根词缀\nhome 家 + stead 地方、所在地 → 家所在的地 → 宅地\n助记\nhomesteader n.自耕农；stead n.位置；instead 顶替；同 farmstead\n例句\nThe family built a cabin on their ==homestead== . 这家人在自家宅地上盖了小木屋。","fields":{"Front":"homestead","Back":"释义\nn. 家园，宅地；（政府授予开垦的）农庄\n词根词缀\nhome 家 + stead 地方、所在地 → 家所在的地 → 宅地\n助记\nhomesteader n.自耕农；stead n.位置；instead 顶替；同 farmstead\n例句\nThe family built a cabin on their ==homestead== . 这家人在自家宅地上盖了小木屋。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_28","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"lead","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 带领；导致；领先；通向；n. 领先；榜样；线索；铅\n词根词缀\n动词读 /liːd/；名词'铅'读 /led/（同形异音）\n助记\nlead to 导致；take the lead 带头；leading a.领先的；leadership n.领导力\n例句\nA poor diet can ==lead== to health problems. 不良饮食会导致健康问题。","fields":{"Front":"lead","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 带领；导致；领先；通向；n. 领先；榜样；线索；铅\n词根词缀\n动词读 /liːd/；名词'铅'读 /led/（同形异音）\n助记\nlead to 导致；take the lead 带头；leading a.领先的；leadership n.领导力\n例句\nA poor diet can ==lead== to health problems. 不良饮食会导致健康问题。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_29","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"level","back":"释义\na./n./v. a. 平的，水平的；n. 水平，级别，层次；v. 使平坦；瞄准；推倒\n词根词缀\n本义天平的'水平'（与 balance 相关）\n助记\nsea level 海平面；level off 趋稳；level with sb 对…说实话；同 flat, even\n例句\nThe two teams are at the same ==level== . 两队处于同一水平。","fields":{"Front":"level","Back":"释义\na./n./v. a. 平的，水平的；n. 水平，级别，层次；v. 使平坦；瞄准；推倒\n词根词缀\n本义天平的'水平'（与 balance 相关）\n助记\nsea level 海平面；level off 趋稳；level with sb 对…说实话；同 flat, even\n例句\nThe two teams are at the same ==level== . 两队处于同一水平。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_30","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"microbe","back":"释义\nn. 微生物，（尤指致病的）细菌\n词根词缀\nmicro- 微小 + be (=bios) 生命 → 微小的生命 → 微生物\n助记\nmicro- 小：microscope 显微镜；microbial a.微生物的；同 microorganism\n例句\nThe disease is caused by a tiny water-borne ==microbe== . 这种病由一种水中的微小细菌引起。","fields":{"Front":"microbe","Back":"释义\nn. 微生物，（尤指致病的）细菌\n词根词缀\nmicro- 微小 + be (=bios) 生命 → 微小的生命 → 微生物\n助记\nmicro- 小：microscope 显微镜；microbial a.微生物的；同 microorganism\n例句\nThe disease is caused by a tiny water-borne ==microbe== . 这种病由一种水中的微小细菌引起。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_31","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"oppose","back":"释义\nv. 反对，反抗，与…对抗\n词根词缀\nop- (=ob) 对着 + pos 放置 + -e → 摆在对面 → 对抗\n助记\nopposite a.相对的；opposition n.反对；as opposed to 而不是；同 resist\n例句\nMany residents ==oppose== the new airport. 许多居民反对新建机场。","fields":{"Front":"oppose","Back":"释义\nv. 反对，反抗，与…对抗\n词根词缀\nop- (=ob) 对着 + pos 放置 + -e → 摆在对面 → 对抗\n助记\nopposite a.相对的；opposition n.反对；as opposed to 而不是；同 resist\n例句\nMany residents ==oppose== the new airport. 许多居民反对新建机场。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_32","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"proclaim","back":"释义\nv. 宣告，公布，声明；清楚显示\n词根词缀\npro- 向前、公开 + claim 呼喊 → 当众喊出 → 宣告\n助记\nclaim v.声称；exclaim v.惊呼；proclamation n.公告；同 declare, announce\n例句\nThe country ==proclaimed== its independence in 1947. 该国于1947年宣告独立。","fields":{"Front":"proclaim","Back":"释义\nv. 宣告，公布，声明；清楚显示\n词根词缀\npro- 向前、公开 + claim 呼喊 → 当众喊出 → 宣告\n助记\nclaim v.声称；exclaim v.惊呼；proclamation n.公告；同 declare, announce\n例句\nThe country ==proclaimed== its independence in 1947. 该国于1947年宣告独立。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_33","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"profession","back":"释义\nn. （需要专门训练的）职业，专业；行业；声明\n词根词缀\npro- 公开 + fess 说、承认 + -ion → 公开声明从事的行当 → 专业\n助记\nprofessional a.专业的；professor n.教授；同 occupation, career\n例句\nTeaching is a demanding ==profession== . 教书是一项要求很高的职业。","fields":{"Front":"profession","Back":"释义\nn. （需要专门训练的）职业，专业；行业；声明\n词根词缀\npro- 公开 + fess 说、承认 + -ion → 公开声明从事的行当 → 专业\n助记\nprofessional a.专业的；professor n.教授；同 occupation, career\n例句\nTeaching is a demanding ==profession== . 教书是一项要求很高的职业。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_34","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"rustproof","back":"释义\na. 防锈的，不锈的\n词根词缀\nrust 锈 + -proof 防…的 → 防止生锈的\n助记\n-proof 防…：waterproof 防水；fireproof 防火；proof n.证据\n例句\nThe knife is made of ==rustproof== steel. 这把刀用防锈钢制成。","fields":{"Front":"rustproof","Back":"释义\na. 防锈的，不锈的\n词根词缀\nrust 锈 + -proof 防…的 → 防止生锈的\n助记\n-proof 防…：waterproof 防水；fireproof 防火；proof n.证据\n例句\nThe knife is made of ==rustproof== steel. 这把刀用防锈钢制成。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_35","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"sunlit","back":"释义\na. 阳光照耀的，被阳光照亮的\n词根词缀\nsun 太阳 + lit（light 的过去分词）被照亮的 → 洒满阳光的\n助记\nmoonlit a.月光下的；lit a.点亮的；sunlight n.阳光\n例句\nThey had breakfast in a ==sunlit== kitchen. 他们在洒满阳光的厨房里吃早餐。","fields":{"Front":"sunlit","Back":"释义\na. 阳光照耀的，被阳光照亮的\n词根词缀\nsun 太阳 + lit（light 的过去分词）被照亮的 → 洒满阳光的\n助记\nmoonlit a.月光下的；lit a.点亮的；sunlight n.阳光\n例句\nThey had breakfast in a ==sunlit== kitchen. 他们在洒满阳光的厨房里吃早餐。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_36","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"toxic","back":"释义\na. 有毒的，有害的；令人中毒的\n词根词缀\ntox 毒（原指弓箭涂毒）+ -ic → 有毒的\n助记\ntoxin n.毒素；intoxicate v.使中毒、使醉；detox n.排毒；同 poisonous\n例句\nThe factory dumped ==toxic== waste into the river. 工厂把有毒废物倒进河里。","fields":{"Front":"toxic","Back":"释义\na. 有毒的，有害的；令人中毒的\n词根词缀\ntox 毒（原指弓箭涂毒）+ -ic → 有毒的\n助记\ntoxin n.毒素；intoxicate v.使中毒、使醉；detox n.排毒；同 poisonous\n例句\nThe factory dumped ==toxic== waste into the river. 工厂把有毒废物倒进河里。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_37","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"advocate","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 拥护，提倡，主张；n. 拥护者，辩护者，律师\n词根词缀\nad- 朝向 + voc 声音、呼唤 + -ate → 为…发声 → 提倡\n助记\nvocal a.发声的；advocacy n.拥护；同 support, champion；反 oppose\n例句\nMany doctors ==advocate== regular exercise. 许多医生提倡规律运动。","fields":{"Front":"advocate","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 拥护，提倡，主张；n. 拥护者，辩护者，律师\n词根词缀\nad- 朝向 + voc 声音、呼唤 + -ate → 为…发声 → 提倡\n助记\nvocal a.发声的；advocacy n.拥护；同 support, champion；反 oppose\n例句\nMany doctors ==advocate== regular exercise. 许多医生提倡规律运动。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_38","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"credential","back":"释义\nn. 资格证明，证书；资历，凭据\n词根词缀\ncred 相信、信任 + -ential → 用以取信之物 → 资质证明\n助记\ncredit n.信用；credible a.可信的；credentials 常用复数；同 certificate\n例句\nCandidates must present their academic ==credentials== . 候选人须出示学历证明。","fields":{"Front":"credential","Back":"释义\nn. 资格证明，证书；资历，凭据\n词根词缀\ncred 相信、信任 + -ential → 用以取信之物 → 资质证明\n助记\ncredit n.信用；credible a.可信的；credentials 常用复数；同 certificate\n例句\nCandidates must present their academic ==credentials== . 候选人须出示学历证明。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_39","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"crush","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 压碎，碾碎；镇压，击败；使窘迫；n. 拥挤；迷恋对象\n词根词缀\n拟声，模拟挤压破碎（与 crash 相近）\n助记\nhave a crush on sb 迷恋某人；crushing a.压倒性的；同 smash, squeeze\n例句\nThe machine ==crushes== rocks into powder. 机器把岩石碾成粉末。","fields":{"Front":"crush","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 压碎，碾碎；镇压，击败；使窘迫；n. 拥挤；迷恋对象\n词根词缀\n拟声，模拟挤压破碎（与 crash 相近）\n助记\nhave a crush on sb 迷恋某人；crushing a.压倒性的；同 smash, squeeze\n例句\nThe machine ==crushes== rocks into powder. 机器把岩石碾成粉末。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_40","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"dilate","back":"释义\nv. 扩大，膨胀，扩张（瞳孔、血管、孔道）\n词根词缀\ndi- (=dis) 分开、敞开 + late (=latus) 宽 → 使变宽 → 扩张\n助记\ndilation n.扩张；dilated pupils 放大的瞳孔；同 expand, widen；反 constrict\n例句\nThe doctor put drops in to ==dilate== my pupils. 医生滴药水放大我的瞳孔。","fields":{"Front":"dilate","Back":"释义\nv. 扩大，膨胀，扩张（瞳孔、血管、孔道）\n词根词缀\ndi- (=dis) 分开、敞开 + late (=latus) 宽 → 使变宽 → 扩张\n助记\ndilation n.扩张；dilated pupils 放大的瞳孔；同 expand, widen；反 constrict\n例句\nThe doctor put drops in to ==dilate== my pupils. 医生滴药水放大我的瞳孔。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_41","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"ethical","back":"释义\na. 道德的，伦理的；合乎职业道德的\n词根词缀\nethic 伦理（eth 品格、习俗）+ -al → 合乎道德的\n助记\nethics n.伦理学；ethic n.道德准则；同 moral；unethical a.不道德的\n例句\nIs it ==ethical== to test on animals? 用动物做实验合乎伦理吗？","fields":{"Front":"ethical","Back":"释义\na. 道德的，伦理的；合乎职业道德的\n词根词缀\nethic 伦理（eth 品格、习俗）+ -al → 合乎道德的\n助记\nethics n.伦理学；ethic n.道德准则；同 moral；unethical a.不道德的\n例句\nIs it ==ethical== to test on animals? 用动物做实验合乎伦理吗？","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_42","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"flagellum","back":"释义\nn. 鞭毛（微生物的游动尾）；鞭子\n词根词缀\nflagell 小鞭子（flagrum 鞭）+ -um 名词 → 鞭状尾\n助记\nflagellate v.鞭打；flagella 复数；whip n.鞭子\n例句\nA bacterium swims using a whip-like ==flagellum== . 细菌靠鞭状的鞭毛游动。","fields":{"Front":"flagellum","Back":"释义\nn. 鞭毛（微生物的游动尾）；鞭子\n词根词缀\nflagell 小鞭子（flagrum 鞭）+ -um 名词 → 鞭状尾\n助记\nflagellate v.鞭打；flagella 复数；whip n.鞭子\n例句\nA bacterium swims using a whip-like ==flagellum== . 细菌靠鞭状的鞭毛游动。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_43","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"hemp","back":"释义\nn. 大麻（纤维），麻类植物；麻绳\n词根词缀\n古英语'麻'，指其坚韧纤维\n助记\nhempen a.麻制的；jute n.黄麻；hemp 可指工业大麻纤维\n例句\nThe rope was made from natural ==hemp== . 这根绳子由天然麻纤维制成。","fields":{"Front":"hemp","Back":"释义\nn. 大麻（纤维），麻类植物；麻绳\n词根词缀\n古英语'麻'，指其坚韧纤维\n助记\nhempen a.麻制的；jute n.黄麻；hemp 可指工业大麻纤维\n例句\nThe rope was made from natural ==hemp== . 这根绳子由天然麻纤维制成。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_44","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"homing","back":"释义\na. 有归家/归巢能力的；归航的，制导的\n词根词缀\nhome 家 + -ing → 朝家方向的 → 归巢的\n助记\nhoming pigeon 信鸽；home in on 朝…逼近、锁定；homing device 归航装置\n例句\nPigeons have a remarkable ==homing== instinct. 鸽子有非凡的归巢本能。","fields":{"Front":"homing","Back":"释义\na. 有归家/归巢能力的；归航的，制导的\n词根词缀\nhome 家 + -ing → 朝家方向的 → 归巢的\n助记\nhoming pigeon 信鸽；home in on 朝…逼近、锁定；homing device 归航装置\n例句\nPigeons have a remarkable ==homing== instinct. 鸽子有非凡的归巢本能。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_45","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"igneous","back":"释义\na. 火成的，火成岩的；（似）火的\n词根词缀\nign 火（ignite 点燃）+ -eous → 由火形成的 → 火成的\n助记\nignite v.点燃；igneous rock 火成岩；sedimentary 沉积岩；metamorphic 变质岩\n例句\nGranite is a common ==igneous== rock. 花岗岩是常见的火成岩。","fields":{"Front":"igneous","Back":"释义\na. 火成的，火成岩的；（似）火的\n词根词缀\nign 火（ignite 点燃）+ -eous → 由火形成的 → 火成的\n助记\nignite v.点燃；igneous rock 火成岩；sedimentary 沉积岩；metamorphic 变质岩\n例句\nGranite is a common ==igneous== rock. 花岗岩是常见的火成岩。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_46","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"infancy","back":"释义\nn. 婴儿期；初期，萌芽阶段\n词根词缀\ninfant 婴儿（in- 不 + fant (=fan) 说话 → 不会说话者）+ -cy\n助记\ninfant n.婴儿；infantile a.婴儿期的、幼稚的；in its infancy 在初期\n例句\nThe technology was still in its ==infancy== . 这项技术当时仍处于萌芽期。","fields":{"Front":"infancy","Back":"释义\nn. 婴儿期；初期，萌芽阶段\n词根词缀\ninfant 婴儿（in- 不 + fant (=fan) 说话 → 不会说话者）+ -cy\n助记\ninfant n.婴儿；infantile a.婴儿期的、幼稚的；in its infancy 在初期\n例句\nThe technology was still in its ==infancy== . 这项技术当时仍处于萌芽期。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_47","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"inflammation","back":"释义\nn. 炎症，发炎（红、肿、热、痛）；点火，激动\n词根词缀\nin- 向内 + flam 火焰 + -mation → 内部'着火'般红肿 → 炎症\n助记\ninflame v.使发炎、激怒；flame n.火焰；inflammatory a.发炎的、煽动性的\n例句\nThe cream reduces ==inflammation== of the skin. 这种药膏减轻皮肤炎症。","fields":{"Front":"inflammation","Back":"释义\nn. 炎症，发炎（红、肿、热、痛）；点火，激动\n词根词缀\nin- 向内 + flam 火焰 + -mation → 内部'着火'般红肿 → 炎症\n助记\ninflame v.使发炎、激怒；flame n.火焰；inflammatory a.发炎的、煽动性的\n例句\nThe cream reduces ==inflammation== of the skin. 这种药膏减轻皮肤炎症。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_48","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"ingredient","back":"释义\nn. 成分，（烹饪）原料；要素，因素\n词根词缀\nin- 进入 + gred (=grad) 迈步 + -ient → 进入其中之物 → 成分\n助记\ngrad 步：progress；同 component, element；key ingredient 关键要素\n例句\nFresh ==ingredients== make the dish taste better. 新鲜原料让菜更美味。","fields":{"Front":"ingredient","Back":"释义\nn. 成分，（烹饪）原料；要素，因素\n词根词缀\nin- 进入 + gred (=grad) 迈步 + -ient → 进入其中之物 → 成分\n助记\ngrad 步：progress；同 component, element；key ingredient 关键要素\n例句\nFresh ==ingredients== make the dish taste better. 新鲜原料让菜更美味。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_49","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"intricate","back":"释义\na. 复杂精细的，错综复杂的，难理清的\n词根词缀\nin- 向内 + tric 障碍、纠缠（trick 诡计）+ -ate → 内部纠缠的 → 精细复杂\n助记\nextricate v.使摆脱；intricacy n.错综复杂；同 complex, complicated；反 simple\n例句\nThe carpet has an ==intricate== pattern. 这块地毯图案繁复精细。","fields":{"Front":"intricate","Back":"释义\na. 复杂精细的，错综复杂的，难理清的\n词根词缀\nin- 向内 + tric 障碍、纠缠（trick 诡计）+ -ate → 内部纠缠的 → 精细复杂\n助记\nextricate v.使摆脱；intricacy n.错综复杂；同 complex, complicated；反 simple\n例句\nThe carpet has an ==intricate== pattern. 这块地毯图案繁复精细。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_50","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"inverse","back":"释义\na./n. 相反的，反向的，倒转的；n. 反面，倒数\n词根词缀\nin- 反过来 + vers 转 + -e → 反转的\n助记\ninvert v.颠倒；inverse proportion 反比；同 reverse, opposite\n例句\nThere is an ==inverse== relationship between price and demand. 价格与需求成反比。","fields":{"Front":"inverse","Back":"释义\na./n. 相反的，反向的，倒转的；n. 反面，倒数\n词根词缀\nin- 反过来 + vers 转 + -e → 反转的\n助记\ninvert v.颠倒；inverse proportion 反比；同 reverse, opposite\n例句\nThere is an ==inverse== relationship between price and demand. 价格与需求成反比。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_51","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"lush","back":"释义\na. 茂盛的，葱翠的；繁茂的；豪华舒适的\n词根词缀\n拟'柔软多汁、鲜绿'之感；形容草木丰美\n助记\n同 verdant, flourishing；lush 也可形容奢华；反 barren, arid\n例句\nThe valley is covered in ==lush== green forest. 山谷覆盖着葱翠的森林。","fields":{"Front":"lush","Back":"释义\na. 茂盛的，葱翠的；繁茂的；豪华舒适的\n词根词缀\n拟'柔软多汁、鲜绿'之感；形容草木丰美\n助记\n同 verdant, flourishing；lush 也可形容奢华；反 barren, arid\n例句\nThe valley is covered in ==lush== green forest. 山谷覆盖着葱翠的森林。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_52","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"microscopic","back":"释义\na. 显微镜的；极小的，微观的\n词根词缀\nmicroscope 显微镜（micro- 微 + scope 观察）+ -ic\n助记\nmicroscope n.显微镜；microscopy n.显微术；同 tiny, minute；反 macroscopic\n例句\nThe rock contains ==microscopic== fossils. 这块岩石里有微小的化石。","fields":{"Front":"microscopic","Back":"释义\na. 显微镜的；极小的，微观的\n词根词缀\nmicroscope 显微镜（micro- 微 + scope 观察）+ -ic\n助记\nmicroscope n.显微镜；microscopy n.显微术；同 tiny, minute；反 macroscopic\n例句\nThe rock contains ==microscopic== fossils. 这块岩石里有微小的化石。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_53","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"mighty","back":"释义\na./ad. a. 强大的，强有力的，巨大的；ad. 非常\n词根词缀\nmight 力量、威力 + -y → 有力量的 → 强大的\n助记\nmight n.力量；mightily ad.强有力地；同 powerful, strong；反 weak\n例句\nThe ==mighty== river flowed to the sea. 浩荡的江河流向大海。","fields":{"Front":"mighty","Back":"释义\na./ad. a. 强大的，强有力的，巨大的；ad. 非常\n词根词缀\nmight 力量、威力 + -y → 有力量的 → 强大的\n助记\nmight n.力量；mightily ad.强有力地；同 powerful, strong；反 weak\n例句\nThe ==mighty== river flowed to the sea. 浩荡的江河流向大海。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_54","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"motivate","back":"释义\nv. 激励，激发；成为…的动机，促使\n词根词缀\nmotive 动机（mot 移动、驱动）+ -ate → 驱动行动 → 激励\n助记\nmotive n.动机；motivation n.动力；motion n.运动；同 inspire, drive\n例句\nGood teachers know how to ==motivate== their students. 好老师懂得如何激励学生。","fields":{"Front":"motivate","Back":"释义\nv. 激励，激发；成为…的动机，促使\n词根词缀\nmotive 动机（mot 移动、驱动）+ -ate → 驱动行动 → 激励\n助记\nmotive n.动机；motivation n.动力；motion n.运动；同 inspire, drive\n例句\nGood teachers know how to ==motivate== their students. 好老师懂得如何激励学生。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_55","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"pervasive","back":"释义\na. 普遍的，弥漫的，遍布的，渗透的\n词根词缀\nper- 贯穿 + vas (=vad) 走 + -ive → 走通各处的 → 遍布的\n助记\npervade v.弥漫；invasion n.入侵；同 widespread, prevalent\n例句\nSmartphones have become ==pervasive== in daily life. 智能手机已渗透日常生活。","fields":{"Front":"pervasive","Back":"释义\na. 普遍的，弥漫的，遍布的，渗透的\n词根词缀\nper- 贯穿 + vas (=vad) 走 + -ive → 走通各处的 → 遍布的\n助记\npervade v.弥漫；invasion n.入侵；同 widespread, prevalent\n例句\nSmartphones have become ==pervasive== in daily life. 智能手机已渗透日常生活。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_56","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"portraiture","back":"释义\nn. 肖像画（技法）；人像摄影；肖像描绘\n词根词缀\nportrait 肖像（por- 向前 + trait 描画、拉线条）+ -ure\n助记\nportray v.描绘、扮演；portrait n.肖像；trait n.特征\n例句\nShe specializes in photographic ==portraiture== . 她专攻人像摄影。","fields":{"Front":"portraiture","Back":"释义\nn. 肖像画（技法）；人像摄影；肖像描绘\n词根词缀\nportrait 肖像（por- 向前 + trait 描画、拉线条）+ -ure\n助记\nportray v.描绘、扮演；portrait n.肖像；trait n.特征\n例句\nShe specializes in photographic ==portraiture== . 她专攻人像摄影。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_57","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"salient","back":"释义\na. 显著的，突出的，最重要的\n词根词缀\nsal- (=salire) 跳跃、跃起 + -ient → 跳出来的 → 显眼的\n助记\n同源 salmon（逆流'跳跃'的鱼）；同 prominent, notable；反 insignificant\n例句\nPlease summarize the ==salient== points of the report. 请总结报告的要点。","fields":{"Front":"salient","Back":"释义\na. 显著的，突出的，最重要的\n词根词缀\nsal- (=salire) 跳跃、跃起 + -ient → 跳出来的 → 显眼的\n助记\n同源 salmon（逆流'跳跃'的鱼）；同 prominent, notable；反 insignificant\n例句\nPlease summarize the ==salient== points of the report. 请总结报告的要点。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_58","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"shield","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 盾牌；防护物，挡板；v. 保护，遮挡\n词根词缀\n古英语'盾牌'；动词为遮挡、庇护\n助记\nwindshield n.挡风玻璃；同 protect, shelter；shield from 使免受\n例句\nShe raised her hand to ==shield== her eyes from the sun. 她抬手遮挡阳光保护眼睛。","fields":{"Front":"shield","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 盾牌；防护物，挡板；v. 保护，遮挡\n词根词缀\n古英语'盾牌'；动词为遮挡、庇护\n助记\nwindshield n.挡风玻璃；同 protect, shelter；shield from 使免受\n例句\nShe raised her hand to ==shield== her eyes from the sun. 她抬手遮挡阳光保护眼睛。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_59","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"shrivel","back":"释义\nv. 枯萎，干枯，皱缩；（使）束手无策\n词根词缀\n拟'收缩起皱'的动作；与 shrink 音近义通\n助记\nshrivel up 干瘪；同 wither, wrinkle, shrink；反 expand, plump\n例句\nThe leaves ==shriveled== in the hot sun. 叶子在烈日下干枯皱缩。","fields":{"Front":"shrivel","Back":"释义\nv. 枯萎，干枯，皱缩；（使）束手无策\n词根词缀\n拟'收缩起皱'的动作；与 shrink 音近义通\n助记\nshrivel up 干瘪；同 wither, wrinkle, shrink；反 expand, plump\n例句\nThe leaves ==shriveled== in the hot sun. 叶子在烈日下干枯皱缩。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_60","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"syrup","back":"释义\nn. 糖浆，糖汁；（水果煮出的）浓汁\n词根词缀\n阿拉伯语 sharāb'饮料'（同 sherbet）；浓稠甜液\n助记\nsyrupy a.糖浆般的、过于缠绵的；cough syrup 止咳糖浆\n例句\nShe poured maple ==syrup== over the pancakes. 她把枫糖浆浇在煎饼上。","fields":{"Front":"syrup","Back":"释义\nn. 糖浆，糖汁；（水果煮出的）浓汁\n词根词缀\n阿拉伯语 sharāb'饮料'（同 sherbet）；浓稠甜液\n助记\nsyrupy a.糖浆般的、过于缠绵的；cough syrup 止咳糖浆\n例句\nShe poured maple ==syrup== over the pancakes. 她把枫糖浆浇在煎饼上。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_61","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"terminal","back":"释义\na./n. a. 末端的，终点的；晚期的；n. 航站楼；终端；终点站\n词根词缀\ntermin 界限、终点（term 期限）+ -al → 到终点的\n助记\nterminate v.终止；terminus n.终点；terminal illness 绝症；同 end, final\n例句\nYour flight departs from ==terminal== three. 你的航班从3号航站楼起飞。","fields":{"Front":"terminal","Back":"释义\na./n. a. 末端的，终点的；晚期的；n. 航站楼；终端；终点站\n词根词缀\ntermin 界限、终点（term 期限）+ -al → 到终点的\n助记\nterminate v.终止；terminus n.终点；terminal illness 绝症；同 end, final\n例句\nYour flight departs from ==terminal== three. 你的航班从3号航站楼起飞。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_62","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"tournament","back":"释义\nn. 锦标赛，联赛；（中世纪）骑士比武大会\n词根词缀\n古法语'骑士比武、回转较量'（tourn 转动）\n助记\n同 championship, contest；tourney n.比武；tour n.巡回\n例句\nShe won the national tennis ==tournament== . 她赢得了全国网球锦标赛。","fields":{"Front":"tournament","Back":"释义\nn. 锦标赛，联赛；（中世纪）骑士比武大会\n词根词缀\n古法语'骑士比武、回转较量'（tourn 转动）\n助记\n同 championship, contest；tourney n.比武；tour n.巡回\n例句\nShe won the national tennis ==tournament== . 她赢得了全国网球锦标赛。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_63","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"towering","back":"释义\na. 高耸的，高大的；杰出的；强烈的（愤怒）\n词根词缀\ntower 塔 + -ing → 像塔一样高的 → 高耸的\n助记\ntower n.塔 v.屹立；a towering figure 杰出人物；towering rage 暴怒\n例句\nThey gazed up at the ==towering== redwoods. 他们仰望高耸的红杉。","fields":{"Front":"towering","Back":"释义\na. 高耸的，高大的；杰出的；强烈的（愤怒）\n词根词缀\ntower 塔 + -ing → 像塔一样高的 → 高耸的\n助记\ntower n.塔 v.屹立；a towering figure 杰出人物；towering rage 暴怒\n例句\nThey gazed up at the ==towering== redwoods. 他们仰望高耸的红杉。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_64","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"trend","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 趋势，倾向；时尚，潮流；v. 趋向；走红\n词根词缀\n古英语'旋转、延伸方向'（与 trend 同源'转向'）\n助记\ntrendy a.时髦的；set a trend 引领潮流；同 tendency, fashion\n例句\nThere is a growing ==trend== toward online learning. 在线学习呈日益增长的趋势。","fields":{"Front":"trend","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 趋势，倾向；时尚，潮流；v. 趋向；走红\n词根词缀\n古英语'旋转、延伸方向'（与 trend 同源'转向'）\n助记\ntrendy a.时髦的；set a trend 引领潮流；同 tendency, fashion\n例句\nThere is a growing ==trend== toward online learning. 在线学习呈日益增长的趋势。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_65","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"verse","back":"释义\nn. 诗，诗句，韵文；（《圣经》）节\n词根词缀\nvers 转、排列（原指诗行的换行）+ -e → 分行的文字 → 诗句\n助记\nversus 缩写 vs；versify v.作诗；prose n.散文（与 verse 相对）\n例句\nShe recited a short ==verse== from memory. 她凭记忆背诵了一小节诗。","fields":{"Front":"verse","Back":"释义\nn. 诗，诗句，韵文；（《圣经》）节\n词根词缀\nvers 转、排列（原指诗行的换行）+ -e → 分行的文字 → 诗句\n助记\nversus 缩写 vs；versify v.作诗；prose n.散文（与 verse 相对）\n例句\nShe recited a short ==verse== from memory. 她凭记忆背诵了一小节诗。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_66","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"versus","back":"释义\nprep. 对，对抗；与…相对，与…相比\n词根词缀\nvers 转向 + -us → 转向对方 → 对抗；常缩写为 v. 或 vs.\n助记\n缩写 vs；同 against；用于比赛、诉讼、对比\n例句\nIt's the home team ==versus== the champions tonight. 今晚是主队对阵冠军队。","fields":{"Front":"versus","Back":"释义\nprep. 对，对抗；与…相对，与…相比\n词根词缀\nvers 转向 + -us → 转向对方 → 对抗；常缩写为 v. 或 vs.\n助记\n缩写 vs；同 against；用于比赛、诉讼、对比\n例句\nIt's the home team ==versus== the champions tonight. 今晚是主队对阵冠军队。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l2_67","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"weed","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 杂草，野草；v. 除草；清除，淘汰\n词根词缀\n古英语'野草'；固定 weed out 淘汰、清除\n助记\nweedy a.多杂草的、瘦弱的；weed out 剔除；同 remove, eliminate\n例句\nHe spent the morning ==weeding== the garden. 他一上午都在花园除草。","fields":{"Front":"weed","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 杂草，野草；v. 除草；清除，淘汰\n词根词缀\n古英语'野草'；固定 weed out 淘汰、清除\n助记\nweedy a.多杂草的、瘦弱的；weed out 剔除；同 remove, eliminate\n例句\nHe spent the morning ==weeding== the garden. 他一上午都在花园除草。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 2 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]}]},{"id":"toefl-list-3","name":"TOEFL 托福 › List 3","description":"托福核心词 · List 3（59 词 · 释义 + 词根词缀 + 助记 + 标黄例句）","createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["toefl","imported"],"options":{"newPerDay":null,"reviewsPerDay":null,"learningSteps":null,"relearningSteps":null,"graduatingInterval":null,"easyInterval":null,"leechThreshold":null,"leechAction":"","buryRelated":null,"maxInterval":null,"requestRetention":null,"newOrder":"","reviewOrder":""},"cards":[{"noteId":"toefl_l3_0","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"check","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 检查，核对；阻止，抑制；托运；n. 检查；支票；账单\n词根词缀\n本义'将军（象棋）、阻止'，引申核查\n助记\ncheck in 登记；check out 退房、结账；hold/keep in check 控制；blank check 空白支票\n例句\nPlease ==check== your answers before handing in. 交卷前请核对答案。","fields":{"Front":"check","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 检查，核对；阻止，抑制；托运；n. 检查；支票；账单\n词根词缀\n本义'将军（象棋）、阻止'，引申核查\n助记\ncheck in 登记；check out 退房、结账；hold/keep in check 控制；blank check 空白支票\n例句\nPlease ==check== your answers before handing in. 交卷前请核对答案。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_1","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"compliment","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 赞美（话），恭维；致意；v. 赞美，恭维\n词根词缀\ncom- 加强 + pli (=ply) 填满、满足 → 使对方满足的话 → 恭维\n助记\n注意区别 complement 补充；complimentary a.赞美的、免费赠送的；同 praise\n例句\nShe received many ==compliments== on her dress. 她的裙子博得许多赞美。","fields":{"Front":"compliment","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 赞美（话），恭维；致意；v. 赞美，恭维\n词根词缀\ncom- 加强 + pli (=ply) 填满、满足 → 使对方满足的话 → 恭维\n助记\n注意区别 complement 补充；complimentary a.赞美的、免费赠送的；同 praise\n例句\nShe received many ==compliments== on her dress. 她的裙子博得许多赞美。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_2","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"connote","back":"释义\nv. 暗示，意味着，含有…的言外之意\n词根词缀\ncon- 一起 + not 标记、意味 + -e → 附带的意味 → 隐含\n助记\ndenote v.表示字面义；connotation n.隐含意义；connotative a.含蓄的\n例句\nThe word 'home' ==connotes== warmth and safety. '家'这个词暗含温暖与安全。","fields":{"Front":"connote","Back":"释义\nv. 暗示，意味着，含有…的言外之意\n词根词缀\ncon- 一起 + not 标记、意味 + -e → 附带的意味 → 隐含\n助记\ndenote v.表示字面义；connotation n.隐含意义；connotative a.含蓄的\n例句\nThe word 'home' ==connotes== warmth and safety. '家'这个词暗含温暖与安全。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_3","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"disquiet","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 不安，忧虑，焦虑；v. 使不安\n词根词缀\ndis- 否定 + quiet 安宁 → 失去安宁 → 不安\n助记\n同 unease, anxiety；disquieting a.令人不安的；反 calm, reassure\n例句\nThere is growing ==disquiet== over the new law. 对新法律的不安日益增长。","fields":{"Front":"disquiet","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 不安，忧虑，焦虑；v. 使不安\n词根词缀\ndis- 否定 + quiet 安宁 → 失去安宁 → 不安\n助记\n同 unease, anxiety；disquieting a.令人不安的；反 calm, reassure\n例句\nThere is growing ==disquiet== over the new law. 对新法律的不安日益增长。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_4","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"dwarf","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 矮子，侏儒；矮小生物；v. 使显得矮小，使相形见绌\n词根词缀\n古神话中的'矮人族'（善采矿）；动词义'高过、盖过'\n助记\ndwarf 复数 dwarfs/dwarves；dwarfed by 被…比下去；同 overshadow\n例句\nThe new skyscraper ==dwarfs== all surrounding buildings. 新摩天大楼让周围建筑相形见绌。","fields":{"Front":"dwarf","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 矮子，侏儒；矮小生物；v. 使显得矮小，使相形见绌\n词根词缀\n古神话中的'矮人族'（善采矿）；动词义'高过、盖过'\n助记\ndwarf 复数 dwarfs/dwarves；dwarfed by 被…比下去；同 overshadow\n例句\nThe new skyscraper ==dwarfs== all surrounding buildings. 新摩天大楼让周围建筑相形见绌。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_5","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"fauna","back":"释义\nn. （某地区、时代的）动物群，动物区系\n词根词缀\n罗马神话 Fauna 农牧女神（对应 faun 农牧神）→ 动物总称\n助记\n与 flora（植物群）相对；flora and fauna 动植物\n例句\nThe island's ==fauna== includes many rare birds. 该岛的动物群包括许多珍稀鸟类。","fields":{"Front":"fauna","Back":"释义\nn. （某地区、时代的）动物群，动物区系\n词根词缀\n罗马神话 Fauna 农牧女神（对应 faun 农牧神）→ 动物总称\n助记\n与 flora（植物群）相对；flora and fauna 动植物\n例句\nThe island's ==fauna== includes many rare birds. 该岛的动物群包括许多珍稀鸟类。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_6","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"intrigue","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 激起…的好奇心/兴趣；密谋；n. 阴谋，密谋\n词根词缀\nin- 在内 + trigue (=tric) 障碍、诡计 → 设诡计；引申'勾人好奇'\n助记\nintriguing a.有趣的、迷人的；同 fascinate；political intrigue 政治阴谋\n例句\nThe strange letter ==intrigued== the detective. 这封奇怪的信勾起侦探的兴趣。","fields":{"Front":"intrigue","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 激起…的好奇心/兴趣；密谋；n. 阴谋，密谋\n词根词缀\nin- 在内 + trigue (=tric) 障碍、诡计 → 设诡计；引申'勾人好奇'\n助记\nintriguing a.有趣的、迷人的；同 fascinate；political intrigue 政治阴谋\n例句\nThe strange letter ==intrigued== the detective. 这封奇怪的信勾起侦探的兴趣。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_7","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"mortality","back":"释义\nn. 死亡（率）；必死性，致命性\n词根词缀\nmort 死亡 + -al + -ity → 不免一死；死亡数\n助记\nmortal a.终有一死的、致命的；immortal a.不朽的；mortality rate 死亡率\n例句\nInfant ==mortality== has fallen sharply. 婴儿死亡率已大幅下降。","fields":{"Front":"mortality","Back":"释义\nn. 死亡（率）；必死性，致命性\n词根词缀\nmort 死亡 + -al + -ity → 不免一死；死亡数\n助记\nmortal a.终有一死的、致命的；immortal a.不朽的；mortality rate 死亡率\n例句\nInfant ==mortality== has fallen sharply. 婴儿死亡率已大幅下降。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_8","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"muggy","back":"释义\na. （天气、空气）闷热潮湿的，闷得难受的\n词根词缀\nmug 闷热 + -y ；指湿热无风\n助记\n同 humid, sticky, sultry；mugginess n.闷热；区别 dry heat 干热\n例句\nIt was a hot, ==muggy== afternoon in July. 那是七月一个闷热潮湿的下午。","fields":{"Front":"muggy","Back":"释义\na. （天气、空气）闷热潮湿的，闷得难受的\n词根词缀\nmug 闷热 + -y ；指湿热无风\n助记\n同 humid, sticky, sultry；mugginess n.闷热；区别 dry heat 干热\n例句\nIt was a hot, ==muggy== afternoon in July. 那是七月一个闷热潮湿的下午。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_9","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"outrage","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 暴行，骇人之事；义愤；v. 激怒，使震惊\n词根词缀\nout- 超出 + rage 狂暴 → 超出常理的暴行；义愤\n助记\noutrageous a.骇人的、离谱的；同 indignation, scandal；enrage v.激怒\n例句\nThe price increase caused public ==outrage== . 涨价激起公愤。","fields":{"Front":"outrage","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 暴行，骇人之事；义愤；v. 激怒，使震惊\n词根词缀\nout- 超出 + rage 狂暴 → 超出常理的暴行；义愤\n助记\noutrageous a.骇人的、离谱的；同 indignation, scandal；enrage v.激怒\n例句\nThe price increase caused public ==outrage== . 涨价激起公愤。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_10","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"persistent","back":"释义\na. 坚持不懈的，执着的；持续的，反复出现的\n词根词缀\nper- 贯穿 + sist 站立 + -ent → 一直站着不放弃 → 坚持的\n助记\npersist v.坚持、持续；persistence n.毅力；persevere v.坚持不懈；同 constant\n例句\nA ==persistent== cough may last for weeks. 持续的咳嗽可能拖上数周。","fields":{"Front":"persistent","Back":"释义\na. 坚持不懈的，执着的；持续的，反复出现的\n词根词缀\nper- 贯穿 + sist 站立 + -ent → 一直站着不放弃 → 坚持的\n助记\npersist v.坚持、持续；persistence n.毅力；persevere v.坚持不懈；同 constant\n例句\nA ==persistent== cough may last for weeks. 持续的咳嗽可能拖上数周。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_11","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"pest","back":"释义\nn. 害虫，有害动物；讨厌的人/事物\n词根词缀\npest 瘟疫、祸害（同 pestilence）→ 有害之物\n助记\npesticide n.杀虫剂；pester v.纠缠；同 nuisance；pest control 虫害防治\n例句\nAphids are a common garden ==pest== . 蚜虫是常见的园圃害虫。","fields":{"Front":"pest","Back":"释义\nn. 害虫，有害动物；讨厌的人/事物\n词根词缀\npest 瘟疫、祸害（同 pestilence）→ 有害之物\n助记\npesticide n.杀虫剂；pester v.纠缠；同 nuisance；pest control 虫害防治\n例句\nAphids are a common garden ==pest== . 蚜虫是常见的园圃害虫。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_12","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"predecessor","back":"释义\nn. 前任，前辈；（被取代的）原有事物\n词根词缀\npre- 在前 + decess (=deed/cede) 离开、退下 + -or 人 → 先前退位的人\n助记\n同源 deceased a.已故的；反 successor 继任者；同 forerunner\n例句\nHer ==predecessor== retired last year. 她的前任去年退休了。","fields":{"Front":"predecessor","Back":"释义\nn. 前任，前辈；（被取代的）原有事物\n词根词缀\npre- 在前 + decess (=deed/cede) 离开、退下 + -or 人 → 先前退位的人\n助记\n同源 deceased a.已故的；反 successor 继任者；同 forerunner\n例句\nHer ==predecessor== retired last year. 她的前任去年退休了。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_13","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"rationality","back":"释义\nn. 理性，合理性；推理能力\n词根词缀\nrat (=reason) 理性、计算 + -ional + -ity → 理性\n助记\nrational a.理性的；rationale n.理论依据；反 irrationality；同 reason, logic\n例句\nDecisions should be based on ==rationality== , not emotion. 决策应基于理性而非情绪。","fields":{"Front":"rationality","Back":"释义\nn. 理性，合理性；推理能力\n词根词缀\nrat (=reason) 理性、计算 + -ional + -ity → 理性\n助记\nrational a.理性的；rationale n.理论依据；反 irrationality；同 reason, logic\n例句\nDecisions should be based on ==rationality== , not emotion. 决策应基于理性而非情绪。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_14","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"repute","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 名声，名誉；v. 认为，称为（常用被动）\n词根词缀\nre- 反复 + put 计算、考虑 → 被人反复评说 → 名声\n助记\nreputation n.名声；reputable a.声誉好的；be reputed to be 被认为是\n例句\nHe is a doctor of high ==repute== . 他是一位声誉很高的医生。","fields":{"Front":"repute","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 名声，名誉；v. 认为，称为（常用被动）\n词根词缀\nre- 反复 + put 计算、考虑 → 被人反复评说 → 名声\n助记\nreputation n.名声；reputable a.声誉好的；be reputed to be 被认为是\n例句\nHe is a doctor of high ==repute== . 他是一位声誉很高的医生。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_15","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"scrub","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 用力擦洗，搓净；取消；n. 矮树丛，灌木丛\n词根词缀\n拟'搓擦'动作；名词指低矮灌丛\n助记\nscrub brush 硬毛刷；scrub a mission 取消任务；scrubland n.灌木地；同 scour\n例句\nShe ==scrubbed== the floor until it was clean. 她把地板刷洗干净。","fields":{"Front":"scrub","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 用力擦洗，搓净；取消；n. 矮树丛，灌木丛\n词根词缀\n拟'搓擦'动作；名词指低矮灌丛\n助记\nscrub brush 硬毛刷；scrub a mission 取消任务；scrubland n.灌木地；同 scour\n例句\nShe ==scrubbed== the floor until it was clean. 她把地板刷洗干净。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_16","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"secede","back":"释义\nv. 退出，脱离（联邦、组织）\n词根词缀\nse- 分开 + cede 走、退让 → 分道而行 → 脱离\n助记\nsecession n.脱离；cede v.割让；反 join, unite；同 withdraw\n例句\nThe southern states tried to ==secede== from the union. 南方各州曾试图脱离联邦。","fields":{"Front":"secede","Back":"释义\nv. 退出，脱离（联邦、组织）\n词根词缀\nse- 分开 + cede 走、退让 → 分道而行 → 脱离\n助记\nsecession n.脱离；cede v.割让；反 join, unite；同 withdraw\n例句\nThe southern states tried to ==secede== from the union. 南方各州曾试图脱离联邦。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_17","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"stain","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 沾污，染色；n. 污点，污渍；着色剂\n词根词缀\n古英语'变色、留下印记'\n助记\nstainless a.不锈的、无污点的；stained glass 彩色玻璃；同 spot, discolor\n例句\nCoffee ==stained== the white tablecloth. 咖啡弄脏了白桌布。","fields":{"Front":"stain","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 沾污，染色；n. 污点，污渍；着色剂\n词根词缀\n古英语'变色、留下印记'\n助记\nstainless a.不锈的、无污点的；stained glass 彩色玻璃；同 spot, discolor\n例句\nCoffee ==stained== the white tablecloth. 咖啡弄脏了白桌布。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_18","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"stubborn","back":"释义\na. 顽固的，倔强的；难去除/难处理的\n词根词缀\nstub 树桩 + -born → 像树桩一样不动摇（贬义固执）\n助记\nstubbornness n.固执；stubborn stain 顽固污渍；同 obstinate；反 compliant\n例句\nHe is too ==stubborn== to admit his mistake. 他太固执，不肯认错。","fields":{"Front":"stubborn","Back":"释义\na. 顽固的，倔强的；难去除/难处理的\n词根词缀\nstub 树桩 + -born → 像树桩一样不动摇（贬义固执）\n助记\nstubbornness n.固执；stubborn stain 顽固污渍；同 obstinate；反 compliant\n例句\nHe is too ==stubborn== to admit his mistake. 他太固执，不肯认错。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_19","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"sympathetic","back":"释义\na. 同情的，有同情心的；赞同的，支持的；共鸣的\n词根词缀\nsym- 共同 + path 感受 + -etic → 与他人同感 → 同情的\n助记\nsympathy n.同情；sympathize v.同情；搭配 sympathetic to/toward；反 unsympathetic\n例句\nHe was very ==sympathetic== when I failed the exam. 我考试失利时他很体谅我。","fields":{"Front":"sympathetic","Back":"释义\na. 同情的，有同情心的；赞同的，支持的；共鸣的\n词根词缀\nsym- 共同 + path 感受 + -etic → 与他人同感 → 同情的\n助记\nsympathy n.同情；sympathize v.同情；搭配 sympathetic to/toward；反 unsympathetic\n例句\nHe was very ==sympathetic== when I failed the exam. 我考试失利时他很体谅我。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_20","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"tout","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 兜售（票）；极力吹捧，标榜；n. 黄牛，兜售者\n词根词缀\n古英语'窥视、招揽'；现代指高调宣传\n助记\nticket tout 票贩子；同 promote, peddle, boast；含'吹嘘'意味\n例句\nThe company ==touts== its product as the best. 该公司标榜自家产品最好。","fields":{"Front":"tout","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 兜售（票）；极力吹捧，标榜；n. 黄牛，兜售者\n词根词缀\n古英语'窥视、招揽'；现代指高调宣传\n助记\nticket tout 票贩子；同 promote, peddle, boast；含'吹嘘'意味\n例句\nThe company ==touts== its product as the best. 该公司标榜自家产品最好。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_21","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"adorn","back":"释义\nv. 装饰，装点；佩戴\n词根词缀\nad- + orn 装饰、装备（ornament）→ 加以装饰\n助记\nornament n.装饰品；ornate a.华丽的；adornment n.装饰；同 decorate\n例句\nFresh flowers ==adorned== the dinner table. 鲜花装点着餐桌。","fields":{"Front":"adorn","Back":"释义\nv. 装饰，装点；佩戴\n词根词缀\nad- + orn 装饰、装备（ornament）→ 加以装饰\n助记\nornament n.装饰品；ornate a.华丽的；adornment n.装饰；同 decorate\n例句\nFresh flowers ==adorned== the dinner table. 鲜花装点着餐桌。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_22","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"amenable","back":"释义\na. 顺从的，愿意接受建议的；对…负责的\n词根词缀\namen 引导、驱策（同 amenable 原'可被带到…前'）+ -able → 可引导的\n助记\n搭配 amenable to；同 compliant, open, agreeable；反 stubborn, resistant\n例句\nShe is ==amenable== to new ideas. 她乐于接受新想法。","fields":{"Front":"amenable","Back":"释义\na. 顺从的，愿意接受建议的；对…负责的\n词根词缀\namen 引导、驱策（同 amenable 原'可被带到…前'）+ -able → 可引导的\n助记\n搭配 amenable to；同 compliant, open, agreeable；反 stubborn, resistant\n例句\nShe is ==amenable== to new ideas. 她乐于接受新想法。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_23","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"barrel","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 木桶；一桶之量；枪管，炮管；v. 飞奔，高速行驶\n词根词缀\n拉丁/法语 barril 木桶；动词为'冲、飞'\n助记\na barrel of fun 很有趣；over a barrel 受制于人；barrel down the road 沿路飞驰\n例句\nWine is aged in oak ==barrels== . 葡萄酒在橡木桶中陈酿。","fields":{"Front":"barrel","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 木桶；一桶之量；枪管，炮管；v. 飞奔，高速行驶\n词根词缀\n拉丁/法语 barril 木桶；动词为'冲、飞'\n助记\na barrel of fun 很有趣；over a barrel 受制于人；barrel down the road 沿路飞驰\n例句\nWine is aged in oak ==barrels== . 葡萄酒在橡木桶中陈酿。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_24","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"bode","back":"释义\nv. 预示，预兆（吉凶，尤用于 bode well/ill）\n词根词缀\n古英语'预言、宣布'（与 bid 同源）\n助记\nbode well/ill for 对…是好/坏兆头；同 foretell, portend, foreshadow\n例句\nThe dark clouds ==bode== ill for our picnic. 乌云预示我们的野餐不妙。","fields":{"Front":"bode","Back":"释义\nv. 预示，预兆（吉凶，尤用于 bode well/ill）\n词根词缀\n古英语'预言、宣布'（与 bid 同源）\n助记\nbode well/ill for 对…是好/坏兆头；同 foretell, portend, foreshadow\n例句\nThe dark clouds ==bode== ill for our picnic. 乌云预示我们的野餐不妙。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_25","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"console","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 安慰，抚慰；n. 控制台，机柜；（游戏）主机\n词根词缀\ncon- 一起 + sole (=solari) 安慰 → 给予安慰\n助记\nconsolation n.安慰；consolation prize 安慰奖；solace n.安慰；同 comfort\n例句\nNothing could ==console== her after the loss. 失去之后什么也安慰不了她。","fields":{"Front":"console","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 安慰，抚慰；n. 控制台，机柜；（游戏）主机\n词根词缀\ncon- 一起 + sole (=solari) 安慰 → 给予安慰\n助记\nconsolation n.安慰；consolation prize 安慰奖；solace n.安慰；同 comfort\n例句\nNothing could ==console== her after the loss. 失去之后什么也安慰不了她。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_26","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"entitle","back":"释义\nv. 给…权利（或资格）；给…命名，授予称号\n词根词缀\nen- 赋予 + title 头衔、标题 → 赋予头衔/权利\n助记\nentitlement n.权利、津贴；be entitled to 有权享有；同 qualify, authorize\n例句\nThis ticket ==entitles== you to a free meal. 这张票让你有权免费用一餐。","fields":{"Front":"entitle","Back":"释义\nv. 给…权利（或资格）；给…命名，授予称号\n词根词缀\nen- 赋予 + title 头衔、标题 → 赋予头衔/权利\n助记\nentitlement n.权利、津贴；be entitled to 有权享有；同 qualify, authorize\n例句\nThis ticket ==entitles== you to a free meal. 这张票让你有权免费用一餐。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_27","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"folkway","back":"释义\nn. 社会习俗，民风，传统习惯\n词根词缀\nfolk 民间的 + way 方式 → 民间通行的做法 → 习俗\n助记\nfolk n.人们 a.民间的；folklore n.民俗；同 custom, tradition\n例句\nSharing meals is an ancient ==folkway== of the village. 共餐是这个村子古老的习俗。","fields":{"Front":"folkway","Back":"释义\nn. 社会习俗，民风，传统习惯\n词根词缀\nfolk 民间的 + way 方式 → 民间通行的做法 → 习俗\n助记\nfolk n.人们 a.民间的；folklore n.民俗；同 custom, tradition\n例句\nSharing meals is an ancient ==folkway== of the village. 共餐是这个村子古老的习俗。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_28","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"insulin","back":"释义\nn. 胰岛素\n词根词缀\ninsula 岛屿 + -in 素 → 由胰腺'胰岛'分泌的激素 → 胰岛素\n助记\ninsulate v.隔离、绝缘；peninsula n.半岛；-in 表物质：protein\n例句\nDiabetics may need daily ==insulin== injections. 糖尿病患者可能需要每日注射胰岛素。","fields":{"Front":"insulin","Back":"释义\nn. 胰岛素\n词根词缀\ninsula 岛屿 + -in 素 → 由胰腺'胰岛'分泌的激素 → 胰岛素\n助记\ninsulate v.隔离、绝缘；peninsula n.半岛；-in 表物质：protein\n例句\nDiabetics may need daily ==insulin== injections. 糖尿病患者可能需要每日注射胰岛素。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_29","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"lyric","back":"释义\na./n. a. 抒情的；吟唱的；n.（常复数）歌词；抒情诗\n词根词缀\nlyr 竖琴（lyre）+ -ic → 配竖琴吟唱的 → 抒情的\n助记\nlyre n.里拉琴；lyrical a.抒情的；lyricist n.词作者；lyrics 歌词\n例句\nThe ==lyrics== of the song are easy to remember. 这首歌的歌词很好记。","fields":{"Front":"lyric","Back":"释义\na./n. a. 抒情的；吟唱的；n.（常复数）歌词；抒情诗\n词根词缀\nlyr 竖琴（lyre）+ -ic → 配竖琴吟唱的 → 抒情的\n助记\nlyre n.里拉琴；lyrical a.抒情的；lyricist n.词作者；lyrics 歌词\n例句\nThe ==lyrics== of the song are easy to remember. 这首歌的歌词很好记。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_30","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"mercy","back":"释义\nn. 仁慈，怜悯，宽恕；恩惠，幸运\n词根词缀\n古法语'报酬、恩惠'；指对弱者的宽恕\n助记\nmerciful a.仁慈的；merciless a.无情的；at the mercy of 任凭…摆布；同 pity\n例句\nThey showed no ==mercy== to their enemies. 他们对敌人毫不留情。","fields":{"Front":"mercy","Back":"释义\nn. 仁慈，怜悯，宽恕；恩惠，幸运\n词根词缀\n古法语'报酬、恩惠'；指对弱者的宽恕\n助记\nmerciful a.仁慈的；merciless a.无情的；at the mercy of 任凭…摆布；同 pity\n例句\nThey showed no ==mercy== to their enemies. 他们对敌人毫不留情。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_31","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"minority","back":"释义\nn. 少数；少数民族，少数群体；未成年\n词根词缀\nminor 较小的 + -ity → 较少的部分 → 少数\n助记\nminor a.较小的 n.辅修；反 majority；ethnic minority 少数民族\n例句\nOnly a small ==minority== of students disagreed. 只有少数学生不同意。","fields":{"Front":"minority","Back":"释义\nn. 少数；少数民族，少数群体；未成年\n词根词缀\nminor 较小的 + -ity → 较少的部分 → 少数\n助记\nminor a.较小的 n.辅修；反 majority；ethnic minority 少数民族\n例句\nOnly a small ==minority== of students disagreed. 只有少数学生不同意。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_32","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"nude","back":"释义\na./n. a. 裸体的，光秃的；n. 裸体（画、人像）\n词根词缀\n拉丁语'赤裸'；同 naked 但更正式、艺术化\n助记\nnudity n.裸体；naked a.赤裸的（也指无遮蔽）；bare a.光秃的\n例句\nThe artist painted a ==nude== figure in soft light. 艺术家在柔光中画了一幅裸体人像。","fields":{"Front":"nude","Back":"释义\na./n. a. 裸体的，光秃的；n. 裸体（画、人像）\n词根词缀\n拉丁语'赤裸'；同 naked 但更正式、艺术化\n助记\nnudity n.裸体；naked a.赤裸的（也指无遮蔽）；bare a.光秃的\n例句\nThe artist painted a ==nude== figure in soft light. 艺术家在柔光中画了一幅裸体人像。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_33","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"overrun","back":"释义\nv. 泛滥，蔓延，横行；超过（时间、预算）；蹂躏\n词根词缀\nover- 过度、越过 + run 跑 → 跑过界 → 泛滥、超出\n助记\noverrun the budget 超预算；同 invade, overflow, exceed\n例句\nThe garden was ==overrun== with weeds. 花园里杂草丛生。","fields":{"Front":"overrun","Back":"释义\nv. 泛滥，蔓延，横行；超过（时间、预算）；蹂躏\n词根词缀\nover- 过度、越过 + run 跑 → 跑过界 → 泛滥、超出\n助记\noverrun the budget 超预算；同 invade, overflow, exceed\n例句\nThe garden was ==overrun== with weeds. 花园里杂草丛生。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_34","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"pertinent","back":"释义\na. 相关的，切题的，中肯的\n词根词缀\nper- 贯穿 + tain(=ten) 握住 → 直切要点的 → 中肯的\n助记\nimpertinent a.无礼的、离题的；同 relevant, applicable；反 irrelevant\n例句\nPlease keep your questions ==pertinent== to the topic. 请让问题紧扣主题。","fields":{"Front":"pertinent","Back":"释义\na. 相关的，切题的，中肯的\n词根词缀\nper- 贯穿 + tain(=ten) 握住 → 直切要点的 → 中肯的\n助记\nimpertinent a.无礼的、离题的；同 relevant, applicable；反 irrelevant\n例句\nPlease keep your questions ==pertinent== to the topic. 请让问题紧扣主题。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_35","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"rebellious","back":"释义\na. 反叛的，叛逆的，造反的；难管束的\n词根词缀\nrebel 反叛（re- 对抗 + bel 战争）+ -lious → 反抗的\n助记\nrebellion n.叛乱；rebel n.反叛者；同 defiant, mutinous；反 obedient\n例句\nHe went through a ==rebellious== phase as a teenager. 他十几岁时经历过叛逆期。","fields":{"Front":"rebellious","Back":"释义\na. 反叛的，叛逆的，造反的；难管束的\n词根词缀\nrebel 反叛（re- 对抗 + bel 战争）+ -lious → 反抗的\n助记\nrebellion n.叛乱；rebel n.反叛者；同 defiant, mutinous；反 obedient\n例句\nHe went through a ==rebellious== phase as a teenager. 他十几岁时经历过叛逆期。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_36","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"redundant","back":"释义\na. 多余的，冗余的，累赘的；（人员）被裁员的\n词根词缀\nred- (=re) 反复 + und 波浪、涌起 + -ant → 多到涌出 → 冗余\n助记\nredundancy n.冗余、裁员；同 superfluous, unnecessary；反 essential\n例句\nThe last paragraph is ==redundant== ; delete it. 最后一段多余，删掉。","fields":{"Front":"redundant","Back":"释义\na. 多余的，冗余的，累赘的；（人员）被裁员的\n词根词缀\nred- (=re) 反复 + und 波浪、涌起 + -ant → 多到涌出 → 冗余\n助记\nredundancy n.冗余、裁员；同 superfluous, unnecessary；反 essential\n例句\nThe last paragraph is ==redundant== ; delete it. 最后一段多余，删掉。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_37","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"revive","back":"释义\nv. 复苏，苏醒；恢复，复兴；重演\n词根词缀\nre- 重新 + viv 生命、活 + -e → 重新活过来 → 复苏\n助记\nrevival n.复兴；survive v.幸存；vivid a.生动的；同 restore, awaken\n例句\nA cup of coffee helped ==revive== him. 一杯咖啡让他恢复了精神。","fields":{"Front":"revive","Back":"释义\nv. 复苏，苏醒；恢复，复兴；重演\n词根词缀\nre- 重新 + viv 生命、活 + -e → 重新活过来 → 复苏\n助记\nrevival n.复兴；survive v.幸存；vivid a.生动的；同 restore, awaken\n例句\nA cup of coffee helped ==revive== him. 一杯咖啡让他恢复了精神。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_38","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"turmoil","back":"释义\nn. 混乱，骚动，动荡，骚乱\n词根词缀\n可能源自 turn 翻滚 + oil 沸腾感；指剧烈动荡\n助记\nin turmoil 陷入混乱；同 chaos, upheaval, disorder；反 peace, calm\n例句\nThe country was in political ==turmoil== . 国家处于政治动荡中。","fields":{"Front":"turmoil","Back":"释义\nn. 混乱，骚动，动荡，骚乱\n词根词缀\n可能源自 turn 翻滚 + oil 沸腾感；指剧烈动荡\n助记\nin turmoil 陷入混乱；同 chaos, upheaval, disorder；反 peace, calm\n例句\nThe country was in political ==turmoil== . 国家处于政治动荡中。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_39","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"absenteeism","back":"释义\nn. （经常性的）旷课，旷工，缺席\n词根词缀\nabsent 缺席的（ab- 离开 + sent 在场）+ -ee 人 + -ism 现象 → 缺席现象\n助记\nabsent a.缺席的；absentee n.缺席者；absence n.缺席；同 truancy\n例句\nThe school is trying to reduce student ==absenteeism== . 学校正设法降低学生旷课率。","fields":{"Front":"absenteeism","Back":"释义\nn. （经常性的）旷课，旷工，缺席\n词根词缀\nabsent 缺席的（ab- 离开 + sent 在场）+ -ee 人 + -ism 现象 → 缺席现象\n助记\nabsent a.缺席的；absentee n.缺席者；absence n.缺席；同 truancy\n例句\nThe school is trying to reduce student ==absenteeism== . 学校正设法降低学生旷课率。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_40","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"assimilation","back":"释义\nn. 同化；消化吸收；（语音）同化\n词根词缀\nas- + simil 相同 + -ation → 使变得相同 → 同化\n助记\nassimilate v.同化、吸收；similar a.相似的；simulate v.模拟；同 absorption\n例句\nThe ==assimilation== of immigrants takes generations. 移民的同化需要几代人。","fields":{"Front":"assimilation","Back":"释义\nn. 同化；消化吸收；（语音）同化\n词根词缀\nas- + simil 相同 + -ation → 使变得相同 → 同化\n助记\nassimilate v.同化、吸收；similar a.相似的；simulate v.模拟；同 absorption\n例句\nThe ==assimilation== of immigrants takes generations. 移民的同化需要几代人。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_41","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"bacon","back":"释义\nn. 咸猪肉，培根，熏肉\n词根词缀\n古法语/日耳曼语'腌猪背肉'\n助记\nbring home the bacon 养家糊口、成功；save one's bacon 使免于受损\n例句\nWe had eggs and crispy ==bacon== for breakfast. 我们早餐吃了鸡蛋和脆培根。","fields":{"Front":"bacon","Back":"释义\nn. 咸猪肉，培根，熏肉\n词根词缀\n古法语/日耳曼语'腌猪背肉'\n助记\nbring home the bacon 养家糊口、成功；save one's bacon 使免于受损\n例句\nWe had eggs and crispy ==bacon== for breakfast. 我们早餐吃了鸡蛋和脆培根。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_42","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"consistent","back":"释义\na. 一致的，前后相符的；始终如一的；连续的\n词根词缀\ncon- 一起 + sist 站立 + -ent → 始终站在一处 → 一贯的\n助记\nconsist v.组成、在于；consistency n.一致性；搭配 consistent with；反 inconsistent\n例句\nHer statements are not ==consistent== with the facts. 她的陈述与事实不符。","fields":{"Front":"consistent","Back":"释义\na. 一致的，前后相符的；始终如一的；连续的\n词根词缀\ncon- 一起 + sist 站立 + -ent → 始终站在一处 → 一贯的\n助记\nconsist v.组成、在于；consistency n.一致性；搭配 consistent with；反 inconsistent\n例句\nHer statements are not ==consistent== with the facts. 她的陈述与事实不符。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_43","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"convention","back":"释义\nn. 大会，集会；惯例，习俗；公约，协定\n词根词缀\ncon- 一起 + vent 来 + -ion → 众人来到一起 → 大会；共同做法→惯例\n助记\nconventional a.传统的、常规的；convene v.召集；同 custom, assembly, treaty\n例句\nBy ==convention== , everyone stood for the anthem. 按照惯例，奏国歌时全体起立。","fields":{"Front":"convention","Back":"释义\nn. 大会，集会；惯例，习俗；公约，协定\n词根词缀\ncon- 一起 + vent 来 + -ion → 众人来到一起 → 大会；共同做法→惯例\n助记\nconventional a.传统的、常规的；convene v.召集；同 custom, assembly, treaty\n例句\nBy ==convention== , everyone stood for the anthem. 按照惯例，奏国歌时全体起立。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_44","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"detest","back":"释义\nv. 憎恶，痛恨，极其讨厌\n词根词缀\nde- 向下、轻蔑 + test 见证、作证 → 诅咒般地作证 → 痛恨\n助记\ndetestable a.可憎的；testify v.作证；contest v.争辩；同 hate, loathe, abhor\n例句\nI ==detest== having to wait in long lines. 我极其讨厌排长队。","fields":{"Front":"detest","Back":"释义\nv. 憎恶，痛恨，极其讨厌\n词根词缀\nde- 向下、轻蔑 + test 见证、作证 → 诅咒般地作证 → 痛恨\n助记\ndetestable a.可憎的；testify v.作证；contest v.争辩；同 hate, loathe, abhor\n例句\nI ==detest== having to wait in long lines. 我极其讨厌排长队。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_45","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"diagonal","back":"释义\na./n. a. 对角线的，斜的；n. 对角线，斜线\n词根词缀\ndia- 穿过、对角 + gon 角、膝 + -al → 穿过两角的 → 对角线\n助记\ndiagram n.图解；diagonally ad.斜对地；同 slanting, oblique；反 horizontal\n例句\nDraw a ==diagonal== line across the square. 穿过正方形画一条对角线。","fields":{"Front":"diagonal","Back":"释义\na./n. a. 对角线的，斜的；n. 对角线，斜线\n词根词缀\ndia- 穿过、对角 + gon 角、膝 + -al → 穿过两角的 → 对角线\n助记\ndiagram n.图解；diagonally ad.斜对地；同 slanting, oblique；反 horizontal\n例句\nDraw a ==diagonal== line across the square. 穿过正方形画一条对角线。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_46","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"digression","back":"释义\nn. 离题，题外话，偏离主题\n词根词缀\ndi- (=dis) 离开 + gress 走 + -ion → 走开、偏离 → 离题\n助记\ndigress v.离题；progress n.进步；同 deviation, aside；反 focus\n例句\nAfter a long ==digression== , he returned to the main point. 扯了一大段后他回到正题。","fields":{"Front":"digression","Back":"释义\nn. 离题，题外话，偏离主题\n词根词缀\ndi- (=dis) 离开 + gress 走 + -ion → 走开、偏离 → 离题\n助记\ndigress v.离题；progress n.进步；同 deviation, aside；反 focus\n例句\nAfter a long ==digression== , he returned to the main point. 扯了一大段后他回到正题。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_47","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"hide","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 隐藏，躲藏；隐瞒；n. 兽皮，皮革\n词根词缀\n动词'藏'；名词指动物厚皮（同源 hide 皮革）\n助记\nhide-and-seek 捉迷藏；tan a hide 鞣制兽皮；hidden a.隐藏的；同 conceal\n例句\nThe rabbit ==hid== in the tall grass. 兔子躲在高草丛里。","fields":{"Front":"hide","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 隐藏，躲藏；隐瞒；n. 兽皮，皮革\n词根词缀\n动词'藏'；名词指动物厚皮（同源 hide 皮革）\n助记\nhide-and-seek 捉迷藏；tan a hide 鞣制兽皮；hidden a.隐藏的；同 conceal\n例句\nThe rabbit ==hid== in the tall grass. 兔子躲在高草丛里。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_48","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"internship","back":"释义\nn. 实习（期），实习生职位\n词根词缀\ninternal 内部的 → intern 实习生（在机构'内部'干活）+ -ship 职位/时期\n助记\nintern n.实习生 v.实习；internship 可数；-ship 表身份：membership\n例句\nShe got a summer ==internship== at a law firm. 她在一家律师事务所得到暑期实习。","fields":{"Front":"internship","Back":"释义\nn. 实习（期），实习生职位\n词根词缀\ninternal 内部的 → intern 实习生（在机构'内部'干活）+ -ship 职位/时期\n助记\nintern n.实习生 v.实习；internship 可数；-ship 表身份：membership\n例句\nShe got a summer ==internship== at a law firm. 她在一家律师事务所得到暑期实习。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_49","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"kennel","back":"释义\nn. 狗窝，犬舍；养狗场\n词根词缀\nken (=can) 犬 + -nel 处所 → 狗的住处\n助记\ncanine a.犬的；kennels n.养狗场；区别 kennel 与 kernel（核）\n例句\nThe dog slept in a wooden ==kennel== outside. 狗睡在屋外的木狗窝里。","fields":{"Front":"kennel","Back":"释义\nn. 狗窝，犬舍；养狗场\n词根词缀\nken (=can) 犬 + -nel 处所 → 狗的住处\n助记\ncanine a.犬的；kennels n.养狗场；区别 kennel 与 kernel（核）\n例句\nThe dog slept in a wooden ==kennel== outside. 狗睡在屋外的木狗窝里。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_50","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"polish","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 擦亮，磨光；润色，完善；n. 鞋油；光泽；优雅\n词根词缀\npol 光滑、磨光 + -ish 动词 → 使光滑\n助记\nPolish（大写）指波兰的；polish off 迅速完成；nail polish 指甲油；同 shine, refine\n例句\nHe ==polished== his shoes until they shone. 他把鞋擦得锃亮。","fields":{"Front":"polish","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 擦亮，磨光；润色，完善；n. 鞋油；光泽；优雅\n词根词缀\npol 光滑、磨光 + -ish 动词 → 使光滑\n助记\nPolish（大写）指波兰的；polish off 迅速完成；nail polish 指甲油；同 shine, refine\n例句\nHe ==polished== his shoes until they shone. 他把鞋擦得锃亮。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_51","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"principal","back":"释义\na./n. a. 主要的，首要的；n. 校长；本金；主角\n词根词缀\nprin- (prim) 首要 + cip 拿取 + -al → 拿第一位的 → 主要的\n助记\n原则是 principle（名词）；principal 可作'校长/本金'；同 main, chief\n例句\nThe ==principal== reason for failure was lack of money. 失败的主要原因是缺钱。","fields":{"Front":"principal","Back":"释义\na./n. a. 主要的，首要的；n. 校长；本金；主角\n词根词缀\nprin- (prim) 首要 + cip 拿取 + -al → 拿第一位的 → 主要的\n助记\n原则是 principle（名词）；principal 可作'校长/本金'；同 main, chief\n例句\nThe ==principal== reason for failure was lack of money. 失败的主要原因是缺钱。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_52","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"quotation","back":"释义\nn. 引文，引语，语录；报价，行情\n词根词缀\nquote 引用（quot 多少、编号）+ -ation → 引用的话\n助记\nquote v.引用；quotation mark 引号；price quotation 报价；同 citation\n例句\nHe began his speech with a ==quotation== from Lincoln. 他以林肯的一句引语开场。","fields":{"Front":"quotation","Back":"释义\nn. 引文，引语，语录；报价，行情\n词根词缀\nquote 引用（quot 多少、编号）+ -ation → 引用的话\n助记\nquote v.引用；quotation mark 引号；price quotation 报价；同 citation\n例句\nHe began his speech with a ==quotation== from Lincoln. 他以林肯的一句引语开场。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_53","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"renew","back":"释义\nv. 更新，更换；续借，续签；恢复，重新开始\n词根词缀\nre- 重新 + new 新 → 使重新变新\n助记\nrenewal n.更新、续签；renewable a.可续期的、可再生的；renewable energy 可再生能源\n例句\nI need to ==renew== my library books online. 我需要在网上续借图书馆的书。","fields":{"Front":"renew","Back":"释义\nv. 更新，更换；续借，续签；恢复，重新开始\n词根词缀\nre- 重新 + new 新 → 使重新变新\n助记\nrenewal n.更新、续签；renewable a.可续期的、可再生的；renewable energy 可再生能源\n例句\nI need to ==renew== my library books online. 我需要在网上续借图书馆的书。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_54","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"silversmith","back":"释义\nn. 银匠，银器匠\n词根词缀\nsilver 银 + smith 工匠（同 blacksmith 铁匠）→ 银匠\n助记\nsmith n.工匠；goldsmith n.金匠；wordsmith n.语言大师\n例句\nThe ==silversmith== crafted an ornate teapot. 银匠打造了一把华丽的茶壶。","fields":{"Front":"silversmith","Back":"释义\nn. 银匠，银器匠\n词根词缀\nsilver 银 + smith 工匠（同 blacksmith 铁匠）→ 银匠\n助记\nsmith n.工匠；goldsmith n.金匠；wordsmith n.语言大师\n例句\nThe ==silversmith== crafted an ornate teapot. 银匠打造了一把华丽的茶壶。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_55","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"stake","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 桩，标桩；赌注；利害关系；v. 打赌；以…打赌；立桩\n词根词缀\n古英语'尖桩'；引申为押下的赌注\n助记\nat stake 处于危险中、利害攸关；stake a claim 主张权利；同 bet, risk\n例句\nShe has a big ==stake== in the company's future. 她与公司的未来利害攸关。","fields":{"Front":"stake","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 桩，标桩；赌注；利害关系；v. 打赌；以…打赌；立桩\n词根词缀\n古英语'尖桩'；引申为押下的赌注\n助记\nat stake 处于危险中、利害攸关；stake a claim 主张权利；同 bet, risk\n例句\nShe has a big ==stake== in the company's future. 她与公司的未来利害攸关。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_56","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"starch","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 淀粉；（浆布的）浆；v. 给…上浆\n词根词缀\n古英语'僵硬、强固'；淀粉使布料挺括\n助记\nstarchy a.含淀粉的、刻板的；starch a collar 浆衣领；carbohydrate n.碳水化合物\n例句\nRice and potatoes are rich in ==starch== . 米饭和土豆富含淀粉。","fields":{"Front":"starch","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 淀粉；（浆布的）浆；v. 给…上浆\n词根词缀\n古英语'僵硬、强固'；淀粉使布料挺括\n助记\nstarchy a.含淀粉的、刻板的；starch a collar 浆衣领；carbohydrate n.碳水化合物\n例句\nRice and potatoes are rich in ==starch== . 米饭和土豆富含淀粉。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_57","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"sting","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 刺，蛰，叮；（使）刺痛；n. 刺，蛰针；剧痛\n词根词缀\n古英语'刺、扎'；拟尖锐痛感\n助记\nstinger n.蛰针；stingy a.吝啬的；a sting of guilt 一阵内疚；同 prick, bite\n例句\nA bee ==stung== me on the arm. 一只蜜蜂蛰了我的胳膊。","fields":{"Front":"sting","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 刺，蛰，叮；（使）刺痛；n. 刺，蛰针；剧痛\n词根词缀\n古英语'刺、扎'；拟尖锐痛感\n助记\nstinger n.蛰针；stingy a.吝啬的；a sting of guilt 一阵内疚；同 prick, bite\n例句\nA bee ==stung== me on the arm. 一只蜜蜂蛰了我的胳膊。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l3_58","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"utensil","back":"释义\nn. 器具，用具（尤指厨房用具）\n词根词缀\nut- (=useful) 使用 + ensil 工具 → 用来使用之物 → 器具\n助记\nkitchen utensils 厨具；同 implement, tool, appliance\n例句\nWooden cooking ==utensils== hung on the wall. 木制厨具挂在墙上。","fields":{"Front":"utensil","Back":"释义\nn. 器具，用具（尤指厨房用具）\n词根词缀\nut- (=useful) 使用 + ensil 工具 → 用来使用之物 → 器具\n助记\nkitchen utensils 厨具；同 implement, tool, appliance\n例句\nWooden cooking ==utensils== hung on the wall. 木制厨具挂在墙上。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 3 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]}]},{"id":"toefl-list-4","name":"TOEFL 托福 › List 4","description":"托福核心词 · List 4（73 词 · 释义 + 词根词缀 + 助记 + 标黄例句）","createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["toefl","imported"],"options":{"newPerDay":null,"reviewsPerDay":null,"learningSteps":null,"relearningSteps":null,"graduatingInterval":null,"easyInterval":null,"leechThreshold":null,"leechAction":"","buryRelated":null,"maxInterval":null,"requestRetention":null,"newOrder":"","reviewOrder":""},"cards":[{"noteId":"toefl_l4_0","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"abysmal","back":"释义\na. 极糟的，坏透的；深不可测的\n词根词缀\nabyss 深渊（a- 无 + byss 底）+ -al → 像深渊一样 → 糟透\n助记\nabyss n.深渊；abysmally ad.极差地；同 dreadful, terrible；反 excellent\n例句\nThe team's performance was absolutely ==abysmal== . 该队的表现简直糟透了。","fields":{"Front":"abysmal","Back":"释义\na. 极糟的，坏透的；深不可测的\n词根词缀\nabyss 深渊（a- 无 + byss 底）+ -al → 像深渊一样 → 糟透\n助记\nabyss n.深渊；abysmally ad.极差地；同 dreadful, terrible；反 excellent\n例句\nThe team's performance was absolutely ==abysmal== . 该队的表现简直糟透了。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_1","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"assent","back":"释义\nn./v. n./v. 同意，赞成，应允\n词根词缀\nas- (=ad) 朝向 + sent 感觉、赞同 → 表示赞同\n助记\n注意区别 ascent 上升；by common assent 一致同意；同 agreement, consent；反 dissent\n例句\nThe board gave its ==assent== to the proposal. 董事会同意了这项提案。","fields":{"Front":"assent","Back":"释义\nn./v. n./v. 同意，赞成，应允\n词根词缀\nas- (=ad) 朝向 + sent 感觉、赞同 → 表示赞同\n助记\n注意区别 ascent 上升；by common assent 一致同意；同 agreement, consent；反 dissent\n例句\nThe board gave its ==assent== to the proposal. 董事会同意了这项提案。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_2","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"beaver","back":"释义\nn. 海狸，河狸；勤奋的人\n词根词缀\n古英语'海狸'；习语 eager beaver 做事极卖力的人\n助记\nbeaver away 埋头苦干；eager beaver 积极肯干的人；beaver 象征勤劳\n例句\nThe ==beaver== built a dam across the stream. 海狸在小溪上筑了坝。","fields":{"Front":"beaver","Back":"释义\nn. 海狸，河狸；勤奋的人\n词根词缀\n古英语'海狸'；习语 eager beaver 做事极卖力的人\n助记\nbeaver away 埋头苦干；eager beaver 积极肯干的人；beaver 象征勤劳\n例句\nThe ==beaver== built a dam across the stream. 海狸在小溪上筑了坝。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_3","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"bizarre","back":"释义\na. 古怪的，奇异的，怪诞的，异乎寻常的\n词根词缀\n法语/巴斯克语'有胡子的、怪异的'；指离奇古怪\n助记\nbizarrely ad.怪诞地；同 strange, odd, weird；反 normal, ordinary\n例句\nShe wore a rather ==bizarre== hat to the party. 她戴了顶相当古怪的帽子赴宴。","fields":{"Front":"bizarre","Back":"释义\na. 古怪的，奇异的，怪诞的，异乎寻常的\n词根词缀\n法语/巴斯克语'有胡子的、怪异的'；指离奇古怪\n助记\nbizarrely ad.怪诞地；同 strange, odd, weird；反 normal, ordinary\n例句\nShe wore a rather ==bizarre== hat to the party. 她戴了顶相当古怪的帽子赴宴。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_4","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"blend","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 混合，融合，调和；n. 混合物，融合\n词根词缀\n古英语'混合'（与 blind 同源'搅混'）\n助记\nblender n.搅拌机；blended a.混合的；同 mix, merge, combine\n例句\nThe old house ==blends== Chinese and Western styles. 这栋老宅融合了中西风格。","fields":{"Front":"blend","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 混合，融合，调和；n. 混合物，融合\n词根词缀\n古英语'混合'（与 blind 同源'搅混'）\n助记\nblender n.搅拌机；blended a.混合的；同 mix, merge, combine\n例句\nThe old house ==blends== Chinese and Western styles. 这栋老宅融合了中西风格。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_5","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"conceit","back":"释义\nn. 自负，自大，骄傲；别出心裁的比喻/构想\n词根词缀\nconceive 的名词：con- 完全 + ceit (=cap) 抓取（自视过高）\n助记\nconceive v.构想；conceited a.自负的；同 vanity, egotism；反 humility\n例句\nHis ==conceit== made him unpopular with colleagues. 他的自负让他在同事中不受欢迎。","fields":{"Front":"conceit","Back":"释义\nn. 自负，自大，骄傲；别出心裁的比喻/构想\n词根词缀\nconceive 的名词：con- 完全 + ceit (=cap) 抓取（自视过高）\n助记\nconceive v.构想；conceited a.自负的；同 vanity, egotism；反 humility\n例句\nHis ==conceit== made him unpopular with colleagues. 他的自负让他在同事中不受欢迎。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_6","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"crude","back":"释义\na. 天然的，未加工的；粗糙的，简陋的；粗鲁的\n词根词缀\n拉丁语'生的、粗糙的'（与 cruel 相关）\n助记\ncrude oil 原油；crudely ad.粗糙地；同 raw, unrefined；反 refined\n例句\nThe country depends heavily on ==crude== oil. 该国严重依赖原油。","fields":{"Front":"crude","Back":"释义\na. 天然的，未加工的；粗糙的，简陋的；粗鲁的\n词根词缀\n拉丁语'生的、粗糙的'（与 cruel 相关）\n助记\ncrude oil 原油；crudely ad.粗糙地；同 raw, unrefined；反 refined\n例句\nThe country depends heavily on ==crude== oil. 该国严重依赖原油。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_7","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"elasticity","back":"释义\nn. 弹性，弹力；灵活性，伸缩性\n词根词缀\nelastic 有弹性的（elast 驱动、弹）+ -icity 性质\n助记\nelastic a.有弹性的；inelastic a.无弹性的；同 flexibility, springiness\n例句\nRubber is valued for its high ==elasticity== . 橡胶因高弹性而受重视。","fields":{"Front":"elasticity","Back":"释义\nn. 弹性，弹力；灵活性，伸缩性\n词根词缀\nelastic 有弹性的（elast 驱动、弹）+ -icity 性质\n助记\nelastic a.有弹性的；inelastic a.无弹性的；同 flexibility, springiness\n例句\nRubber is valued for its high ==elasticity== . 橡胶因高弹性而受重视。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_8","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"expertise","back":"释义\nn. 专门知识（或技能），专长，专业能力\n词根词缀\nexpert 专家 + -ise 性质/状态 → 专家级的本领\n助记\nexpert a.内行的；expertly ad.熟练地；同 know-how, skill；反 inexperience\n例句\nHis ==expertise== in computer security is widely respected. 他在计算机安全方面的专业能力广受敬重。","fields":{"Front":"expertise","Back":"释义\nn. 专门知识（或技能），专长，专业能力\n词根词缀\nexpert 专家 + -ise 性质/状态 → 专家级的本领\n助记\nexpert a.内行的；expertly ad.熟练地；同 know-how, skill；反 inexperience\n例句\nHis ==expertise== in computer security is widely respected. 他在计算机安全方面的专业能力广受敬重。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_9","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"fungus","back":"释义\nn. 真菌，霉菌；菌类（蘑菇、霉等）\n词根词缀\n拉丁语/希腊语'海绵、菌类'；复数 fungi / funguses\n助记\nfungal a.真菌的；fungicide n.杀真菌剂；区别 bacteria 细菌\n例句\nA soft green ==fungus== grew on the damp log. 潮湿木头上长出一层绿色真菌。","fields":{"Front":"fungus","Back":"释义\nn. 真菌，霉菌；菌类（蘑菇、霉等）\n词根词缀\n拉丁语/希腊语'海绵、菌类'；复数 fungi / funguses\n助记\nfungal a.真菌的；fungicide n.杀真菌剂；区别 bacteria 细菌\n例句\nA soft green ==fungus== grew on the damp log. 潮湿木头上长出一层绿色真菌。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_10","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"gibe","back":"释义\nv./n. 嘲笑，奚落，讥讽；也写作 jibe\n词根词缀\n可能拟'嘲弄'之声；固定 gibe at 讥笑\n助记\n也作 jibe；同 jeer, mock, taunt；gibe at 嘲笑\n例句\nHis classmates made ==gibes== about his old coat. 同学们拿他的旧外套取笑。","fields":{"Front":"gibe","Back":"释义\nv./n. 嘲笑，奚落，讥讽；也写作 jibe\n词根词缀\n可能拟'嘲弄'之声；固定 gibe at 讥笑\n助记\n也作 jibe；同 jeer, mock, taunt；gibe at 嘲笑\n例句\nHis classmates made ==gibes== about his old coat. 同学们拿他的旧外套取笑。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_11","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"husbandry","back":"释义\nn. 农牧业，耕作；（资源的）节俭管理\n词根词缀\nhusband 古义'管家、节俭持家' + -ry → 农耕与精打细算\n助记\nhusband n.丈夫（古义'管家'）；crop husbandry 作物栽培；同 farming, thrift\n例句\nThey studied animal ==husbandry== at agricultural college. 他们在农学院学习畜牧管理。","fields":{"Front":"husbandry","Back":"释义\nn. 农牧业，耕作；（资源的）节俭管理\n词根词缀\nhusband 古义'管家、节俭持家' + -ry → 农耕与精打细算\n助记\nhusband n.丈夫（古义'管家'）；crop husbandry 作物栽培；同 farming, thrift\n例句\nThey studied animal ==husbandry== at agricultural college. 他们在农学院学习畜牧管理。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_12","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"incur","back":"释义\nv. 招致，遭受（损失、债务、愤怒）\n词根词缀\nin- 进入 + cur 跑 → 撞上、惹上 → 招致\n助记\nincur costs 产生成本；occur v.发生；recur v.复发；同 bring upon oneself\n例句\nHe ==incurred== huge debts buying the business. 他买下这家店背上了巨额债务。","fields":{"Front":"incur","Back":"释义\nv. 招致，遭受（损失、债务、愤怒）\n词根词缀\nin- 进入 + cur 跑 → 撞上、惹上 → 招致\n助记\nincur costs 产生成本；occur v.发生；recur v.复发；同 bring upon oneself\n例句\nHe ==incurred== huge debts buying the business. 他买下这家店背上了巨额债务。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_13","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"interim","back":"释义\na./n. a. 暂时的，过渡的，临时的；n. 间歇，过渡期\n词根词缀\n拉丁语'在此期间'（inter 在…之间）\n助记\nin the interim 在此期间；interim report 中期报告；同 temporary, provisional\n例句\nAn ==interim== manager will run the office until June. 在六月之前将由一位临时经理主管。","fields":{"Front":"interim","Back":"释义\na./n. a. 暂时的，过渡的，临时的；n. 间歇，过渡期\n词根词缀\n拉丁语'在此期间'（inter 在…之间）\n助记\nin the interim 在此期间；interim report 中期报告；同 temporary, provisional\n例句\nAn ==interim== manager will run the office until June. 在六月之前将由一位临时经理主管。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_14","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"laudable","back":"释义\na. 值得称赞的，可嘉的\n词根词缀\nlaud 赞美 + -able 可…的 → 值得赞美的\n助记\nlaud v.赞美；laudatory a.赞扬的；同 praiseworthy, commendable\n例句\nHer efforts to help the poor are highly ==laudable== . 她帮助穷人的努力十分可嘉。","fields":{"Front":"laudable","Back":"释义\na. 值得称赞的，可嘉的\n词根词缀\nlaud 赞美 + -able 可…的 → 值得赞美的\n助记\nlaud v.赞美；laudatory a.赞扬的；同 praiseworthy, commendable\n例句\nHer efforts to help the poor are highly ==laudable== . 她帮助穷人的努力十分可嘉。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_15","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"lunge","back":"释义\nn./v. 猛冲，前刺，扑（突然向前）\n词根词缀\n古法语'延长、前伸'；指突然前扑\n助记\nlunge forward 猛地向前；同 thrust, dive, pounce；反 retreat\n例句\nThe dog ==lunged== at the stranger. 狗朝陌生人猛扑过去。","fields":{"Front":"lunge","Back":"释义\nn./v. 猛冲，前刺，扑（突然向前）\n词根词缀\n古法语'延长、前伸'；指突然前扑\n助记\nlunge forward 猛地向前；同 thrust, dive, pounce；反 retreat\n例句\nThe dog ==lunged== at the stranger. 狗朝陌生人猛扑过去。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_16","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"mingle","back":"释义\nv. 混合，交融；交往，应酬\n词根词缀\n古英语'混合'（与 among 相关）；指人或物相混\n助记\nmingle with 与…交往；同 mix, blend, socialize；反 separate\n例句\nThe smell of coffee ==mingled== with fresh bread. 咖啡香与新鲜面包味交融。","fields":{"Front":"mingle","Back":"释义\nv. 混合，交融；交往，应酬\n词根词缀\n古英语'混合'（与 among 相关）；指人或物相混\n助记\nmingle with 与…交往；同 mix, blend, socialize；反 separate\n例句\nThe smell of coffee ==mingled== with fresh bread. 咖啡香与新鲜面包味交融。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_17","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"pretext","back":"释义\nn. 借口，托词，幌子\n词根词缀\npre- 事先 + text 编织、文本 → 事先编好的说法 → 借口\n助记\ntextile n.纺织品；under the pretext of 以…为借口；同 excuse, pretense\n例句\nHe left early on the ==pretext== of having a headache. 他借口头疼提前离开。","fields":{"Front":"pretext","Back":"释义\nn. 借口，托词，幌子\n词根词缀\npre- 事先 + text 编织、文本 → 事先编好的说法 → 借口\n助记\ntextile n.纺织品；under the pretext of 以…为借口；同 excuse, pretense\n例句\nHe left early on the ==pretext== of having a headache. 他借口头疼提前离开。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_18","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"replica","back":"释义\nn. 复制品，摹本，仿样（尤指精确复制）\n词根词缀\nre- 再 + plic 折叠、复制 + -a → 再做出一份 → 复制品\n助记\nreplicate v.复制；duplicate a.复制的；同 copy, reproduction；反 original\n例句\nThe museum sold small ==replicas== of the statue. 博物馆出售该雕像的小型复制品。","fields":{"Front":"replica","Back":"释义\nn. 复制品，摹本，仿样（尤指精确复制）\n词根词缀\nre- 再 + plic 折叠、复制 + -a → 再做出一份 → 复制品\n助记\nreplicate v.复制；duplicate a.复制的；同 copy, reproduction；反 original\n例句\nThe museum sold small ==replicas== of the statue. 博物馆出售该雕像的小型复制品。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_19","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"scorn","back":"释义\nn./v. 轻蔑，鄙视，不屑（做某事）\n词根词缀\n古法语'嘲笑、羞辱'；指极度轻蔑\n助记\nscornful a.轻蔑的；scornfully ad.鄙视地；同 contempt, disdain；反 respect\n例句\nHe ==scorned== all offers of help. 他对一切帮助都嗤之以鼻。","fields":{"Front":"scorn","Back":"释义\nn./v. 轻蔑，鄙视，不屑（做某事）\n词根词缀\n古法语'嘲笑、羞辱'；指极度轻蔑\n助记\nscornful a.轻蔑的；scornfully ad.鄙视地；同 contempt, disdain；反 respect\n例句\nHe ==scorned== all offers of help. 他对一切帮助都嗤之以鼻。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_20","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"siege","back":"释义\nn. 围攻，围困，围城；长期围困\n词根词缀\n古法语'就座、包围'（军队驻扎围困）\n助记\nlay siege to 围攻；siege mentality 受困心态；同 blockade, encirclement\n例句\nThe city was under ==siege== for three months. 这座城市被围困了三个月。","fields":{"Front":"siege","Back":"释义\nn. 围攻，围困，围城；长期围困\n词根词缀\n古法语'就座、包围'（军队驻扎围困）\n助记\nlay siege to 围攻；siege mentality 受困心态；同 blockade, encirclement\n例句\nThe city was under ==siege== for three months. 这座城市被围困了三个月。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_21","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"speckle","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 小斑点，小点；v. 点缀，使布满斑点\n词根词缀\nspeck 小点 + -le 反复 → 布满小点\n助记\nspeck n.斑点；speckled a.有斑点的；同 spot, fleck, dot\n例句\nThe egg had a pale blue shell with dark ==speckles== . 这枚蛋淡蓝壳上有深色斑点。","fields":{"Front":"speckle","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 小斑点，小点；v. 点缀，使布满斑点\n词根词缀\nspeck 小点 + -le 反复 → 布满小点\n助记\nspeck n.斑点；speckled a.有斑点的；同 spot, fleck, dot\n例句\nThe egg had a pale blue shell with dark ==speckles== . 这枚蛋淡蓝壳上有深色斑点。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_22","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"stout","back":"释义\na./n. a. 结实的，粗壮的；勇敢的；（酒）浓烈的；n. 烈性黑啤酒\n词根词缀\n古法语'傲慢、强壮'；指矮壮结实\n助记\nstout-hearted a.勇敢的；同 sturdy, robust, stocky；反 frail, slender\n例句\nHe carried a ==stout== wooden walking stick. 他拄着一根结实的木手杖。","fields":{"Front":"stout","Back":"释义\na./n. a. 结实的，粗壮的；勇敢的；（酒）浓烈的；n. 烈性黑啤酒\n词根词缀\n古法语'傲慢、强壮'；指矮壮结实\n助记\nstout-hearted a.勇敢的；同 sturdy, robust, stocky；反 frail, slender\n例句\nHe carried a ==stout== wooden walking stick. 他拄着一根结实的木手杖。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_23","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"tranquil","back":"释义\na. 宁静的，平静的，安宁的\n词根词缀\ntrans- 跨越 + quil(=quiet) 安静 → 全然安静的\n助记\ntranquility n.宁静；tranquilize v.使平静；同 calm, peaceful；反 agitated\n例句\nThey spent a ==tranquil== evening by the lake. 他们在湖边度过宁静的夜晚。","fields":{"Front":"tranquil","Back":"释义\na. 宁静的，平静的，安宁的\n词根词缀\ntrans- 跨越 + quil(=quiet) 安静 → 全然安静的\n助记\ntranquility n.宁静；tranquilize v.使平静；同 calm, peaceful；反 agitated\n例句\nThey spent a ==tranquil== evening by the lake. 他们在湖边度过宁静的夜晚。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_24","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"alchemist","back":"释义\nn. 炼金术士（中世纪试图点石成金者）\n词根词缀\nalchemy 炼金术（al- + chem 化学）+ -ist 人\n助记\nalchemy n.炼金术；chemistry n.化学；alchemistic a.炼金术的\n例句\nThe ==alchemist== tried to turn lead into gold. 炼金术士试图把铅变成黄金。","fields":{"Front":"alchemist","Back":"释义\nn. 炼金术士（中世纪试图点石成金者）\n词根词缀\nalchemy 炼金术（al- + chem 化学）+ -ist 人\n助记\nalchemy n.炼金术；chemistry n.化学；alchemistic a.炼金术的\n例句\nThe ==alchemist== tried to turn lead into gold. 炼金术士试图把铅变成黄金。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_25","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"budget","back":"释义\nn./a./v. n. 预算；经费；a. 廉价的，经济的；v. 编预算，安排开支\n词根词缀\n古法语'小皮袋、钱袋'；引申为预算\n助记\non a budget 手头不宽裕；budget cuts 预算削减；budget hotel 经济型酒店\n例句\nThe project is over ==budget== . 该项目超出预算。","fields":{"Front":"budget","Back":"释义\nn./a./v. n. 预算；经费；a. 廉价的，经济的；v. 编预算，安排开支\n词根词缀\n古法语'小皮袋、钱袋'；引申为预算\n助记\non a budget 手头不宽裕；budget cuts 预算削减；budget hotel 经济型酒店\n例句\nThe project is over ==budget== . 该项目超出预算。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_26","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"clipper","back":"释义\nn. 剪刀，理发剪，指甲剪；（旧时）快速帆船\n词根词缀\nclip 剪、夹住 + -er 物 → 用来剪的工具\n助记\nclip v.剪、夹住；clippers 常用复数；nail clippers 指甲刀；hair clip 发夹\n例句\nThe barber picked up his ==clippers== . 理发师拿起了推剪。","fields":{"Front":"clipper","Back":"释义\nn. 剪刀，理发剪，指甲剪；（旧时）快速帆船\n词根词缀\nclip 剪、夹住 + -er 物 → 用来剪的工具\n助记\nclip v.剪、夹住；clippers 常用复数；nail clippers 指甲刀；hair clip 发夹\n例句\nThe barber picked up his ==clippers== . 理发师拿起了推剪。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_27","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"confer","back":"释义\nv. 商谈，商议；授予，赋予（头衔、荣誉）\n词根词缀\ncon- 一起 + fer 拿、带 → 把意见带到一起→商议；把荣誉带给某人→授予\n助记\nconference n.会议；confer with 与…商议；同 consult, grant\n例句\nThe president will ==confer== an honorary degree on her. 校长将授予她荣誉学位。","fields":{"Front":"confer","Back":"释义\nv. 商谈，商议；授予，赋予（头衔、荣誉）\n词根词缀\ncon- 一起 + fer 拿、带 → 把意见带到一起→商议；把荣誉带给某人→授予\n助记\nconference n.会议；confer with 与…商议；同 consult, grant\n例句\nThe president will ==confer== an honorary degree on her. 校长将授予她荣誉学位。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_28","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"diffusion","back":"释义\nn. 扩散，传播，弥漫；（文化）传播\n词根词缀\ndif- (=dis) 散开 + fus 倾倒、流 + -ion → 向四处流散 → 扩散\n助记\ndiffuse v.扩散 a.弥散的；fusion n.融合；同 spread, dispersal\n例句\nThe ==diffusion== of knowledge was sped up by the internet. 互联网加速了知识传播。","fields":{"Front":"diffusion","Back":"释义\nn. 扩散，传播，弥漫；（文化）传播\n词根词缀\ndif- (=dis) 散开 + fus 倾倒、流 + -ion → 向四处流散 → 扩散\n助记\ndiffuse v.扩散 a.弥散的；fusion n.融合；同 spread, dispersal\n例句\nThe ==diffusion== of knowledge was sped up by the internet. 互联网加速了知识传播。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_29","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"dominate","back":"释义\nv. 支配，统治，控制；在…中占主导/俯视\n词根词缀\ndomin 主人、统治（domain）+ -ate → 像主人一样掌控\n助记\ndominant a.占优势的；dominion n.统治；同 control, rule；反 submit\n例句\nOne large company ==dominates== the software market. 一家大公司主导着软件市场。","fields":{"Front":"dominate","Back":"释义\nv. 支配，统治，控制；在…中占主导/俯视\n词根词缀\ndomin 主人、统治（domain）+ -ate → 像主人一样掌控\n助记\ndominant a.占优势的；dominion n.统治；同 control, rule；反 submit\n例句\nOne large company ==dominates== the software market. 一家大公司主导着软件市场。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_30","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"equivalent","back":"释义\na./n. a. 等价的，相当的，等同的；n. 等价物，对应词\n词根词缀\nequi- 相等 + val 价值 + -ent → 价值相等的\n助记\nequivalence n.等价；value n.价值；同 equal, corresponding；反 different\n例句\nOne dollar is roughly ==equivalent== to seven yuan. 一美元约合七元人民币。","fields":{"Front":"equivalent","Back":"释义\na./n. a. 等价的，相当的，等同的；n. 等价物，对应词\n词根词缀\nequi- 相等 + val 价值 + -ent → 价值相等的\n助记\nequivalence n.等价；value n.价值；同 equal, corresponding；反 different\n例句\nOne dollar is roughly ==equivalent== to seven yuan. 一美元约合七元人民币。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_31","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"fray","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 磨损，磨破（布边）；紧张；n. 吵闹，打斗，竞争\n词根词缀\n拉丁语'摩擦'（fricare）；指织物边缘磨散\n助记\nfrayed temper 急躁的情绪；join the fray 加入争斗；同 wear, chafe；tempers fray 火气上升\n例句\nThe cuffs of his old shirt were ==frayed== . 他旧衬衫的袖口磨毛了。","fields":{"Front":"fray","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 磨损，磨破（布边）；紧张；n. 吵闹，打斗，竞争\n词根词缀\n拉丁语'摩擦'（fricare）；指织物边缘磨散\n助记\nfrayed temper 急躁的情绪；join the fray 加入争斗；同 wear, chafe；tempers fray 火气上升\n例句\nThe cuffs of his old shirt were ==frayed== . 他旧衬衫的袖口磨毛了。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_32","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"incessantly","back":"释义\nad. 不停地，持续不断地，连续地\n词根词缀\nin- 不 + cess 停止（cess 退让）+ -ant + -ly → 不停歇地\n助记\ncease v.停止；incessant a.不停的；同 constantly, continually；反 occasionally\n例句\nIt rained ==incessantly== for three days. 雨连续下了三天。","fields":{"Front":"incessantly","Back":"释义\nad. 不停地，持续不断地，连续地\n词根词缀\nin- 不 + cess 停止（cess 退让）+ -ant + -ly → 不停歇地\n助记\ncease v.停止；incessant a.不停的；同 constantly, continually；反 occasionally\n例句\nIt rained ==incessantly== for three days. 雨连续下了三天。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_33","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"intelligence","back":"释义\nn. 智力，智慧，理解力；情报，谍报\n词根词缀\nintel- 在…之间 + lig 选择、采集 → 在其间辨别选择 → 智力；采集的消息→情报\n助记\nintelligent a.聪明的；intellect n.智力；intelligible a.可理解的；IQ 智商\n例句\nA dog has far more ==intelligence== than most people think. 狗比多数人以为的聪明得多。","fields":{"Front":"intelligence","Back":"释义\nn. 智力，智慧，理解力；情报，谍报\n词根词缀\nintel- 在…之间 + lig 选择、采集 → 在其间辨别选择 → 智力；采集的消息→情报\n助记\nintelligent a.聪明的；intellect n.智力；intelligible a.可理解的；IQ 智商\n例句\nA dog has far more ==intelligence== than most people think. 狗比多数人以为的聪明得多。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_34","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"listless","back":"释义\na. 无精打采的，倦怠的，懒洋洋的，提不起劲的\n词根词缀\nlist 古义'渴望、兴致' + -less 无 → 毫无兴致的\n助记\nlistlessness n.无精打采；同 lethargic, sluggish；反 energetic, lively\n例句\nThe hot weather made the children tired and ==listless== . 炎热天气让孩子们疲惫倦怠。","fields":{"Front":"listless","Back":"释义\na. 无精打采的，倦怠的，懒洋洋的，提不起劲的\n词根词缀\nlist 古义'渴望、兴致' + -less 无 → 毫无兴致的\n助记\nlistlessness n.无精打采；同 lethargic, sluggish；反 energetic, lively\n例句\nThe hot weather made the children tired and ==listless== . 炎热天气让孩子们疲惫倦怠。","Extra":"","So