is a major air ==pollutant== . 汽车尾气是主要空气污染物。","fields":{"Front":"pollutant","Back":"释义\nn. 污染物，污染物质\n词根词缀\npollute 污染（pol- 弄脏）+ -ant 物 → 造成污染之物\n助记\npollute v.污染；pollution n.污染；同 contaminant；polluted a.受污染的\n例句\nCar exhaust is a major air ==pollutant== . 汽车尾气是主要空气污染物。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_40","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"precede","back":"释义\nv. 在…之前，先于，领先；在前面说\n词根词缀\npre- 在前 + cede 走 → 走在前面 → 先于\n助记\nprecedent n.先例；preceding a.在前的；同 go before；反 follow, succeed\n例句\nA short speech ==preceded== the dinner. 晚宴前有一段简短致辞。","fields":{"Front":"precede","Back":"释义\nv. 在…之前，先于，领先；在前面说\n词根词缀\npre- 在前 + cede 走 → 走在前面 → 先于\n助记\nprecedent n.先例；preceding a.在前的；同 go before；反 follow, succeed\n例句\nA short speech ==preceded== the dinner. 晚宴前有一段简短致辞。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_41","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"prolific","back":"释义\na. 多产的，丰富的，作品很多的；大量繁殖的\n词根词缀\npro- 向前、大量 + lif (=offspring) 后代 + -ic → 大量产出后代/作品\n助记\nproliferate v.激增；同 productive, fertile；反 barren, unproductive\n例句\nShe was a remarkably ==prolific== writer. 她是一位极其多产的作家。","fields":{"Front":"prolific","Back":"释义\na. 多产的，丰富的，作品很多的；大量繁殖的\n词根词缀\npro- 向前、大量 + lif (=offspring) 后代 + -ic → 大量产出后代/作品\n助记\nproliferate v.激增；同 productive, fertile；反 barren, unproductive\n例句\nShe was a remarkably ==prolific== writer. 她是一位极其多产的作家。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_42","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"recharge","back":"释义\nv. 再充电，再充值；休整恢复精力\n词根词缀\nre- 再 + charge 充电、装载 → 重新充上\n助记\nrechargeable a.可充电的；charge v.充电；recharge one's batteries 休整；同 refresh\n例句\nA short nap helped her ==recharge== her batteries. 小睡片刻帮她恢复了精力。","fields":{"Front":"recharge","Back":"释义\nv. 再充电，再充值；休整恢复精力\n词根词缀\nre- 再 + charge 充电、装载 → 重新充上\n助记\nrechargeable a.可充电的；charge v.充电；recharge one's batteries 休整；同 refresh\n例句\nA short nap helped her ==recharge== her batteries. 小睡片刻帮她恢复了精力。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_43","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"sardonic","back":"释义\na. 讥讽的，冷嘲的，挖苦的\n词根词缀\n源自希腊/拉丁'撒丁岛的'（一种让人面部扭曲似笑的毒草）→ 讥笑\n助记\nsardonically ad.讥讽地；同 sarcastic, mocking, cynical\n例句\nHe gave a ==sardonic== smile and turned away. 他露出一丝冷笑，转身离开。","fields":{"Front":"sardonic","Back":"释义\na. 讥讽的，冷嘲的，挖苦的\n词根词缀\n源自希腊/拉丁'撒丁岛的'（一种让人面部扭曲似笑的毒草）→ 讥笑\n助记\nsardonically ad.讥讽地；同 sarcastic, mocking, cynical\n例句\nHe gave a ==sardonic== smile and turned away. 他露出一丝冷笑，转身离开。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview"