stretch of road 一段路；同 extend\n例句\nShe woke and ==stretched== her arms. 她醒来伸了个懒腰。","fields":{"Front":"stretch","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 伸展，舒展；延伸，拉长；n. 伸展；一片（地区/时间）\n词根词缀\n古英语'张开、延伸'；与 string（拉紧）同源\n助记\nstretch out 伸出、延长；at a stretch 一口气；a stretch of road 一段路；同 extend\n例句\nShe woke and ==stretched== her arms. 她醒来伸了个懒腰。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_47","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"ultimatum","back":"释义\nn. 最后通牒，最终要求\n词根词缀\nultim 最远、最终（ultimate）+ -atum → 最后的条件\n助记\nultimate a.最终的；ultimately ad.最终；issue an ultimatum 发出最后通牒\n例句\nShe gave him an ==ultimatum== : find a job or leave. 她给他下了最后通牒：找工作，要么走人。","fields":{"Front":"ultimatum","Back":"释义\nn. 最后通牒，最终要求\n词根词缀\nultim 最远、最终（ultimate）+ -atum → 最后的条件\n助记\nultimate a.最终的；ultimately ad.最终；issue an ultimatum 发出最后通牒\n例句\nShe gave him an ==ultimatum== : find a job or leave. 她给他下了最后通牒：找工作，要么走人。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_48","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"untamed","back":"释义\na. 未驯服的，野性的，未受控制的\n词根词缀\nun- 未 + tame 驯服 + -ed → 未被驯服的\n助记\ntame a.驯服的；同 wild, feral；反 tame, domesticated\n例句\nThey hiked into the wild, ==untamed== mountains. 他们徒步进入野性未驯的群山。","fields":{"Front":"untamed","Back":"释义\na. 未驯服的，野性的，未受控制的\n词根词缀\nun- 未 + tame 驯服 + -ed → 未被驯服的\n助记\ntame a.驯服的；同 wild, feral；反 tame, domesticated\n例句\nThey hiked into the wild, ==untamed== mountains. 他们徒步进入野性未驯的群山。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_49","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"appreciate","back":"释义\nv. 欣赏，赏识；感激；理解；升值，增值\n词根词缀\nap- + preci 价值、定价 + -ate → 看出…的价值 → 欣赏、感激\n助记\nappreciation n.欣赏、感激、增值；precious a.珍贵的；反 depreciate 贬值\n例句\nI really ==appreciate== your help. 我非常感激你的帮助。","fields":{"Front":"appreciate","Back":"释义\nv. 欣赏，赏识；感激；理解；升值，增值\n词根词缀\nap- + preci 价值、定价 + -ate → 看出…的价值 → 欣赏、感激\n助记\nappreciation n.欣赏、感激、增值；precious a.珍贵的；反 depreciate 贬值\n例句\nI really ==appreciate== your help. 我非常感激你的帮助。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_50","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"corrosive","back":"释义\na./n. 腐蚀性的；（言语）刻薄伤人的；腐蚀剂\n词根词缀\ncorrode 腐蚀（cor- 完全 + rod 啃咬）+ -sive → 逐渐啃蚀的\n助记\ncorrode v.腐蚀；corrosion n.侵蚀；rodent n.啮齿动物（啃咬）；同 caustic\n例句\nThe acid has a strong ==corrosive== effect on metal. 这种酸对金属有强烈腐蚀作用。","fields":{"Front":"corrosive","Back":"释义\na./n. 腐蚀性的；（言语）刻薄伤人的；腐蚀剂\n词根词缀\ncorrode 腐蚀（cor- 完全 + rod 啃咬）+ -sive → 逐渐啃蚀的\n助记\ncorrode v.腐蚀；corrosion n.侵蚀；rodent n.啮齿动物（啃咬）；同 caustic\n例句\nThe acid has a strong ==corrosive== effect on metal. 这种酸对金属有强烈腐蚀作用。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_51","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"debatable","back":"释义\na. 有争议的，可争论的，未定的，值得商榷的\n词根词缀\ndebate 辩论（de- + bat 打、论战）+ -able 可…的\n助记\ndebate v./n.辩论；battle n.战斗；同 arguable, disputable；反 certain, settled\n例句\nWhether the plan will work is highly ==debatable== . 计划是否可行很值得商榷。","fields":{"Front":"debatable","Back":"释义\na. 有争议的，可争论的，未定的，值得商榷的\n词根词缀\ndebate 辩论（de- + bat 打、论战）+ -able 可…的\n助记\ndebate v./n.辩论；battle n.战斗；同 arguable, disputable；反 certain, settled\n例句\nWhether the plan will work is highly ==debatable== . 计划是否可行很值得商榷。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_52","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"dim","back":"释义\na./v. a. 昏暗的，暗淡的；模糊的，迟钝的；v.（使）变暗\n词根词缀\n古英语'昏暗'；与 damp 相关\n助记\ndimly ad.昏暗地；take a dim view of 对…不乐观；同 dark, faint；反 bright\n例句\nThe room was lit by a single ==dim== lamp. 房间只点着一盏昏暗的灯。","fields":{"Front":"dim","Back":"释义\na./v. a. 昏暗的，暗淡的；模糊的，迟钝的；v.（使）变暗\n词根词缀\n古英语'昏暗'；与 damp 相关\n助记\ndimly ad.昏暗地；take a dim view of 对…不乐观；同 dark, faint；反 bright\n例句\nThe room was lit by a single ==dim== lamp. 房间只点着一盏昏暗的灯。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_53","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"durable","back":"释义\na. 耐用的，持久的，耐久的\n词根词缀\ndur- 持续、坚硬（durable 原'持久'）+ -able → 能持久的\n助记\nduration n.持续时间；endure v.持久；durability n.耐用性；同 lasting, sturdy\n例句\nThese shoes are made of tough, ==durable== leather. 这双鞋用结实耐穿的皮革制成。","fields":{"Front":"durable","Back":"释义\na. 耐用的，持久的，耐久的\n词根词缀\ndur- 持续、坚硬（durable 原'持久'）+ -able → 能持久的\n助记\nduration n.持续时间；endure v.持久；durability n.耐用性；同 lasting, sturdy\n例句\nThese shoes are made of tough, ==durable== leather. 这双鞋用结实耐穿的皮革制成。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_54","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"eclipse","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 日食，月食；（声誉）黯然失色；v. 使黯然失色，盖过\n词根词缀\n希腊语'放弃、遮蔽'（光被遮住）\n助记\nsolar/lunar eclipse 日/月食；an eclipse of 对…的遮蔽；同 overshadow, surpass\n例句\nHer success ==eclipsed== that of her brother. 她的成功让哥哥相形失色。","fields":{"Front":"eclipse","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 日食，月食；（声誉）黯然失色；v. 使黯然失色，盖过\n词根词缀\n希腊语'放弃、遮蔽'（光被遮住）\n助记\nsolar/lunar eclipse 日/月食；an eclipse of 对…的遮蔽；同 overshadow, surpass\n例句\nHer success ==eclipsed== that of her brother. 她的成功让哥哥相形失色。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_55","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"equitable","back":"释义\na. 公平的，公正的，合理的\n词根词缀\nequity 公平（equi 相等）+ -table → 公平对待的\n助记\nequity n.公平、资产净值；同 fair, just, impartial；反 unfair, biased\n例句\nThey reached an ==equitable== division of the money. 他们公平地分了那笔钱。","fields":{"Front":"equitable","Back":"释义\na. 公平的，公正的，合理的\n词根词缀\nequity 公平（equi 相等）+ -table → 公平对待的\n助记\nequity n.公平、资产净值；同 fair, just, impartial；反 unfair, biased\n例句\nThey reached an ==equitable== division of the money. 他们公平地分了那笔钱。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_56","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"foul","back":"释义\na./v./n. a. 肮脏的，恶臭的；恶劣的；犯规的；v. 弄脏；缠住；n. 犯规\n词根词缀\n古英语'污秽、肮脏'\n助记\nfoul play 恶行、谋杀；foul-mouthed a.说脏话的；foul weather 坏天气；同 dirty；反 clean\n例句\nThere was a ==foul== smell from the drain. 下水道里冒出恶臭。","fields":{"Front":"foul","Back":"释义\na./v./n. a. 肮脏的，恶臭的；恶劣的；犯规的；v. 弄脏；缠住；n. 犯规\n词根词缀\n古英语'污秽、肮脏'\n助记\nfoul play 恶行、谋杀；foul-mouthed a.说脏话的；foul weather 坏天气；同 dirty；反 clean\n例句\nThere was a ==foul== smell from the drain. 下水道里冒出恶臭。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_57","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"glare","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 怒目而视；发出刺眼强光；n. 刺眼的光；怒视\n词根词缀\n中古英语'闪光、瞪眼'；与 glass/glow 相关\n助记\nglaring a.刺眼的、明显的；glare at 怒视；区别 stare（凝视中性）\n例句\nThe sun ==glared== off the snow. 阳光在雪地上刺眼地反射。","fields":{"Front":"glare","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 怒目而视；发出刺眼强光；n. 刺眼的光；怒视\n词根词缀\n中古英语'闪光、瞪眼'；与 glass/glow 相关\n助记\nglaring a.刺眼的、明显的；glare at 怒视；区别 stare（凝视中性）\n例句\nThe sun ==glared== off the snow. 阳光在雪地上刺眼地反射。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_58","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"groom","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 梳洗，打理（毛发、外表）；训练，培养；n. 新郎；马夫\n词根词缀\n古英语'男孩、马夫'；动词为打理、培养\n助记\ngroomed a.打扮整洁的；well-groomed a.仪表整洁的；bride and groom 新娘新郎\n例句\nShe carefully ==groomed== the horse. 她仔细给马梳理毛发。","fields":{"Front":"groom","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 梳洗，打理（毛发、外表）；训练，培养；n. 新郎；马夫\n词根词缀\n古英语'男孩、马夫'；动词为打理、培养\n助记\ngroomed a.打扮整洁的；well-groomed a.仪表整洁的；bride and groom 新娘新郎\n例句\nShe carefully ==groomed== the horse. 她仔细给马梳理毛发。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_59","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"ideology","back":"释义\nn. 意识形态，思想体系，观念形态\n词根词缀\nidea 观念、思想 + -logy 学说 → 观念的体系\n助记\nidea n.思想；ideological a.意识形态的；ideologue n.理论家\n例句\nThe two parties hold very different political ==ideologies== . 两党持有截然不同的政治意识形态。","fields":{"Front":"ideology","Back":"释义\nn. 意识形态，思想体系，观念形态\n词根词缀\nidea 观念、思想 + -logy 学说 → 观念的体系\n助记\nidea n.思想；ideological a.意识形态的；ideologue n.理论家\n例句\nThe two parties hold very different political ==ideologies== . 两党持有截然不同的政治意识形态。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_60","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"incentive","back":"释义\nn. 激励，刺激，奖励，诱因\n词根词缀\nin- 进入 + cent 唱歌、唤起 + -ive → 唤起行动之物 → 激励\n助记\nincentivize v.激励；同 motivation, stimulus；反 disincentive\n例句\nTax cuts provide an ==incentive== to work harder. 减税提供了更努力工作的动力。","fields":{"Front":"incentive","Back":"释义\nn. 激励，刺激，奖励，诱因\n词根词缀\nin- 进入 + cent 唱歌、唤起 + -ive → 唤起行动之物 → 激励\n助记\nincentivize v.激励；同 motivation, stimulus；反 disincentive\n例句\nTax cuts provide an ==incentive== to work harder. 减税提供了更努力工作的动力。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_61","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"jot","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 草草记下，匆匆写下；n. 一点点，少量\n词根词缀\n希腊语 iota'一丁点'（字母 i）；动词为速记\n助记\njot down 匆匆记下；not a jot 一点也不；同 note down, scribble\n例句\nLet me ==jot== down your phone number. 让我快速记下你的电话号码。","fields":{"Front":"jot","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 草草记下，匆匆写下；n. 一点点，少量\n词根词缀\n希腊语 iota'一丁点'（字母 i）；动词为速记\n助记\njot down 匆匆记下；not a jot 一点也不；同 note down, scribble\n例句\nLet me ==jot== down your phone number. 让我快速记下你的电话号码。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_62","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"marsh","back":"释义\nn. 沼泽，湿地，草沼\n词根词缀\n古英语'沼泽'（与 marine 海相关）\n助记\nmarshy a.沼泽般的；salt marsh 盐沼；同 swamp, wetland；swamp 可长树\n例句\nThey crossed the wet ==marsh== at low tide. 退潮时他们穿过湿沼泽。","fields":{"Front":"marsh","Back":"释义\nn. 沼泽，湿地，草沼\n词根词缀\n古英语'沼泽'（与 marine 海相关）\n助记\nmarshy a.沼泽般的；salt marsh 盐沼；同 swamp, wetland；swamp 可长树\n例句\nThey crossed the wet ==marsh== at low tide. 退潮时他们穿过湿沼泽。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_63","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"neuron","back":"释义\nn. 神经元，神经细胞\n词根词缀\n希腊语'神经、筋'（neuro）+ -on 单元 → 神经细胞\n助记\nneural a.神经的；neurology n.神经学；neurotic a.神经质的\n例句\nThe brain contains billions of ==neurons== . 大脑含有数十亿神经元。","fields":{"Front":"neuron","Back":"释义\nn. 神经元，神经细胞\n词根词缀\n希腊语'神经、筋'（neuro）+ -on 单元 → 神经细胞\n助记\nneural a.神经的；neurology n.神经学；neurotic a.神经质的\n例句\nThe brain contains billions of ==neurons== . 大脑含有数十亿神经元。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_64","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"oyster","back":"释义\nn. 牡蛎，蚝\n词根词缀\n希腊/拉丁语'硬壳动物'；习语 the world is your oyster 世界尽在掌握\n助记\npearl oyster 珍珠贝；clam n.蛤蜊；shellfish n.贝类\n例句\nShe ordered fresh ==oysters== with lemon. 她点了配柠檬的新鲜牡蛎。","fields":{"Front":"oyster","Back":"释义\nn. 牡蛎，蚝\n词根词缀\n希腊/拉丁语'硬壳动物'；习语 the world is your oyster 世界尽在掌握\n助记\npearl oyster 珍珠贝；clam n.蛤蜊；shellfish n.贝类\n例句\nShe ordered fresh ==oysters== with lemon. 她点了配柠檬的新鲜牡蛎。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_65","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"picky","back":"释义\na. 挑剔的，难讨好的，挑挑拣拣的\n词根词缀\npick 挑选 + -y → 挑个没完的\n助记\npick v.挑选；picky 口语；同 fussy, choosy, selective；picky about 对…挑剔\n例句\nHe is a very ==picky== eater. 他吃饭很挑食。","fields":{"Front":"picky","Back":"释义\na. 挑剔的，难讨好的，挑挑拣拣的\n词根词缀\npick 挑选 + -y → 挑个没完的\n助记\npick v.挑选；picky 口语；同 fussy, choosy, selective；picky about 对…挑剔\n例句\nHe is a very ==picky== eater. 他吃饭很挑食。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_66","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"prudent","back":"释义\na. 谨慎的，慎重的，精明的，深谋远虑的\n词根词缀\n拉丁语'有远见'（provident 同根，pro- 前 + vid 看）\n助记\nprudence n.谨慎；imprudent a.轻率的；同 cautious, sensible, wise；反 reckless\n例句\nIt would be ==prudent== to save some money. 存点钱是明智谨慎之举。","fields":{"Front":"prudent","Back":"释义\na. 谨慎的，慎重的，精明的，深谋远虑的\n词根词缀\n拉丁语'有远见'（provident 同根，pro- 前 + vid 看）\n助记\nprudence n.谨慎；imprudent a.轻率的；同 cautious, sensible, wise；反 reckless\n例句\nIt would be ==prudent== to save some money. 存点钱是明智谨慎之举。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_67","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"puncture","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 刺穿，戳破；使泄气；n. 小孔，（轮胎）漏气\n词根词缀\npunct 点、刺（punctual 准点）+ -ure → 刺出小孔\n助记\npunctual a.准时的；punctuation n.标点；同 pierce, perforate\n例句\nA sharp nail ==punctured== the bicycle tire. 一颗尖钉扎破了自行车胎。","fields":{"Front":"puncture","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 刺穿，戳破；使泄气；n. 小孔，（轮胎）漏气\n词根词缀\npunct 点、刺（punctual 准点）+ -ure → 刺出小孔\n助记\npunctual a.准时的；punctuation n.标点；同 pierce, perforate\n例句\nA sharp nail ==punctured== the bicycle tire. 一颗尖钉扎破了自行车胎。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_68","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"quantify","back":"释义\nv. 量化，确定…的数量，用数量表示\n词根词缀\nquant 多少、数量（quantity）+ -ify 使 → 使可计量\n助记\nquantity n.数量；quantitative a.定量的；quantifiable a.可量化的；同 measure\n例句\nIt is hard to ==quantify== the value of good health. 健康的价值难以量化。","fields":{"Front":"quantify","Back":"释义\nv. 量化，确定…的数量，用数量表示\n词根词缀\nquant 多少、数量（quantity）+ -ify 使 → 使可计量\n助记\nquantity n.数量；quantitative a.定量的；quantifiable a.可量化的；同 measure\n例句\nIt is hard to ==quantify== the value of good health. 健康的价值难以量化。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_69","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"ratify","back":"释义\nv. 正式批准，认可，签署（条约、协议）使之生效\n词根词缀\nrat 确定、理性 + -ify 使 → 正式确认\n助记\nratification n.批准；rate n.比率；同 approve, confirm, endorse；反 reject\n例句\nBoth nations agreed to ==ratify== the treaty. 两国同意批准该条约。","fields":{"Front":"ratify","Back":"释义\nv. 正式批准，认可，签署（条约、协议）使之生效\n词根词缀\nrat 确定、理性 + -ify 使 → 正式确认\n助记\nratification n.批准；rate n.比率；同 approve, confirm, endorse；反 reject\n例句\nBoth nations agreed to ==ratify== the treaty. 两国同意批准该条约。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_70","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"raven","back":"释义\nn./a./v. n. 渡鸦；a. 乌黑发亮的；v. 狼吞虎咽；贪婪掠夺\n词根词缀\n古英语'掠夺（者）'；渡鸦性贪食\n助记\nraven-haired a.乌黑头发的；ravenous a.饿极了的；crow 乌鸦（较小）\n例句\nA large black ==raven== sat on the fence. 一只大渡鸦栖在栅栏上。","fields":{"Front":"raven","Back":"释义\nn./a./v. n. 渡鸦；a. 乌黑发亮的；v. 狼吞虎咽；贪婪掠夺\n词根词缀\n古英语'掠夺（者）'；渡鸦性贪食\n助记\nraven-haired a.乌黑头发的；ravenous a.饿极了的；crow 乌鸦（较小）\n例句\nA large black ==raven== sat on the fence. 一只大渡鸦栖在栅栏上。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_71","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"spur","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 马刺；刺激，鞭策；山嘴；v. 刺激，鞭策，促进\n词根词缀\n古英语 spora'踢马刺'（与 spurn 踢相关）\n助记\non the spur of the moment 一时冲动；win one's spurs 成名；同 stimulate, urge\n例句\nLower interest rates may ==spur== economic growth. 降息或能刺激经济增长。","fields":{"Front":"spur","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 马刺；刺激，鞭策；山嘴；v. 刺激，鞭策，促进\n词根词缀\n古英语 spora'踢马刺'（与 spurn 踢相关）\n助记\non the spur of the moment 一时冲动；win one's spurs 成名；同 stimulate, urge\n例句\nLower interest rates may ==spur== economic growth. 降息或能刺激经济增长。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l4_72","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"vice","back":"释义\nn. 恶习，恶行，缺点；邪恶；（台）虎钳\n词根词缀\n拉丁语'缺陷、恶行'；与 vicious（邪恶的）同源\n助记\nvicious a.恶毒的；vice versa 反之亦然；virtue n.美德（vice 的反面）\n例句\nSmoking is his only real ==vice== . 抽烟是他唯一真正的恶习。","fields":{"Front":"vice","Back":"释义\nn. 恶习，恶行，缺点；邪恶；（台）虎钳\n词根词缀\n拉丁语'缺陷、恶行'；与 vicious（邪恶的）同源\n助记\nvicious a.恶毒的；vice versa 反之亦然；virtue n.美德（vice 的反面）\n例句\nSmoking is his only real ==vice== . 抽烟是他唯一真正的恶习。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 4 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]}]},{"id":"toefl-list-5","name":"TOEFL 托福 › List 5","description":"托福核心词 · List 5（74 词 · 释义 + 词根词缀 + 助记 + 标黄例句）","createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["toefl","imported"],"options":{"newPerDay":null,"reviewsPerDay":null,"learningSteps":null,"relearningSteps":null,"graduatingInterval":null,"easyInterval":null,"leechThreshold":null,"leechAction":"","buryRelated":null,"maxInterval":null,"requestRetention":null,"newOrder":"","reviewOrder":""},"cards":[{"noteId":"toefl_l5_0","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"adventitious","back":"释义\na. 偶然的，外来的，非先天的，偶发的\n词根词缀\nadvent 到来（ad- + vent 来）+ -itious → 偶然来到的、外加的\n助记\nadvent n.到来、降临；adventure n.冒险；同 accidental, incidental；反 inherent\n例句\nThe discovery was largely ==adventitious== . 这一发现很大程度上出于偶然。","fields":{"Front":"adventitious","Back":"释义\na. 偶然的，外来的，非先天的，偶发的\n词根词缀\nadvent 到来（ad- + vent 来）+ -itious → 偶然来到的、外加的\n助记\nadvent n.到来、降临；adventure n.冒险；同 accidental, incidental；反 inherent\n例句\nThe discovery was largely ==adventitious== . 这一发现很大程度上出于偶然。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_1","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"bestow","back":"释义\nv. 授予，赠予，给予（荣誉、礼物）\n词根词缀\nbe- 加以 + stow 放置、收藏 → 把…放到某人身上 → 授予\n助记\nstow v.放置；bestowal n.赠予；bestow on/upon 授予；同 grant, confer, present\n例句\nThe king ==bestowed== a title on the brave knight. 国王授予勇敢的骑士爵位。","fields":{"Front":"bestow","Back":"释义\nv. 授予，赠予，给予（荣誉、礼物）\n词根词缀\nbe- 加以 + stow 放置、收藏 → 把…放到某人身上 → 授予\n助记\nstow v.放置；bestowal n.赠予；bestow on/upon 授予；同 grant, confer, present\n例句\nThe king ==bestowed== a title on the brave knight. 国王授予勇敢的骑士爵位。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_2","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"casualty","back":"释义\nn. 伤亡人员，遇难者；事故，受害者\n词根词缀\ncasual 偶然的（cas 落下、降临）+ -ty → 偶然降临的不幸 → 伤亡\n助记\ncasual a.偶然的、随便的；casualty 常用复数；同 victim, loss\n例句\nThe earthquake caused heavy ==casualties== . 地震造成重大伤亡。","fields":{"Front":"casualty","Back":"释义\nn. 伤亡人员，遇难者；事故，受害者\n词根词缀\ncasual 偶然的（cas 落下、降临）+ -ty → 偶然降临的不幸 → 伤亡\n助记\ncasual a.偶然的、随便的；casualty 常用复数；同 victim, loss\n例句\nThe earthquake caused heavy ==casualties== . 地震造成重大伤亡。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_3","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"conquer","back":"释义\nv. 征服，攻克；克服，战胜（恐惧、困难）\n词根词缀\ncon- 完全 + quer 寻求、获取（query）→ 全力取得 → 征服\n助记\nconquest n.征服；conqueror n.征服者；同 defeat, overcome；反 surrender\n例句\nHe finally ==conquered== his fear of flying. 他终于克服了对飞行的恐惧。","fields":{"Front":"conquer","Back":"释义\nv. 征服，攻克；克服，战胜（恐惧、困难）\n词根词缀\ncon- 完全 + quer 寻求、获取（query）→ 全力取得 → 征服\n助记\nconquest n.征服；conqueror n.征服者；同 defeat, overcome；反 surrender\n例句\nHe finally ==conquered== his fear of flying. 他终于克服了对飞行的恐惧。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_4","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"deposit","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 存放，储蓄；使沉积；n. 存款，押金，沉积物\n词根词缀\nde- 向下 + posit 放置 → 放下、存起来\n助记\nposition n.位置；positive a.肯定的；deposition n.沉积、证词；同 store, place\n例句\nShe ==deposited== half her salary in the bank. 她把一半工资存入银行。","fields":{"Front":"deposit","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 存放，储蓄；使沉积；n. 存款，押金，沉积物\n词根词缀\nde- 向下 + posit 放置 → 放下、存起来\n助记\nposition n.位置；positive a.肯定的；deposition n.沉积、证词；同 store, place\n例句\nShe ==deposited== half her salary in the bank. 她把一半工资存入银行。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_5","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"diverge","back":"释义\nv. 分叉，分歧，偏离，相异\n词根词缀\ndi- 分开 + verge 倾斜、转向 → 分向不同方向\n助记\ndivergent a.分歧的；converge v.汇合；divergence n.分歧；同 separate, deviate\n例句\nThe two roads ==diverge== at the bridge. 两条路在桥边分叉。","fields":{"Front":"diverge","Back":"释义\nv. 分叉，分歧，偏离，相异\n词根词缀\ndi- 分开 + verge 倾斜、转向 → 分向不同方向\n助记\ndivergent a.分歧的；converge v.汇合；divergence n.分歧；同 separate, deviate\n例句\nThe two roads ==diverge== at the bridge. 两条路在桥边分叉。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_6","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"embellish","back":"释义\nv. 美化，装饰；润色，添枝加叶\n词根词缀\nem- 使 + bell 美（belle 美女）+ -ish → 使变美\n助记\nembellishment n.装饰、润色；belle n.美女；ornament n.装饰；同 decorate, adorn\n例句\nHe tends to ==embellish== his stories. 他总爱给自己的故事添油加醋。","fields":{"Front":"embellish","Back":"释义\nv. 美化，装饰；润色，添枝加叶\n词根词缀\nem- 使 + bell 美（belle 美女）+ -ish → 使变美\n助记\nembellishment n.装饰、润色；belle n.美女；ornament n.装饰；同 decorate, adorn\n例句\nHe tends to ==embellish== his stories. 他总爱给自己的故事添油加醋。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_7","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"envelop","back":"释义\nv. 包围，笼罩，遮盖，裹住\n词根词缀\nen- 使进入 + velop 包裹（develop 反义'展开'）→ 包起来\n助记\nenvelope n.信封（名词，重音前）；envelop 动词重音后；develop v.发展；同 surround, enclose\n例句\nThick fog soon ==enveloped== the village. 浓雾很快笼罩了村庄。","fields":{"Front":"envelop","Back":"释义\nv. 包围，笼罩，遮盖，裹住\n词根词缀\nen- 使进入 + velop 包裹（develop 反义'展开'）→ 包起来\n助记\nenvelope n.信封（名词，重音前）；envelop 动词重音后；develop v.发展；同 surround, enclose\n例句\nThick fog soon ==enveloped== the village. 浓雾很快笼罩了村庄。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_8","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"incidental","back":"释义\na./n. a. 附带的，偶然的，次要的；n. 杂费，附带事件\n词根词缀\nincident 事件（in- + cid 落下）+ -al → 顺带发生的\n助记\nincident n.事件；incidentally ad.顺便说；同 accompanying, secondary；反 essential\n例句\nThe guide covers the main costs, not ==incidental== expenses. 指南涵盖主要费用，不含杂项开支。","fields":{"Front":"incidental","Back":"释义\na./n. a. 附带的，偶然的，次要的；n. 杂费，附带事件\n词根词缀\nincident 事件（in- + cid 落下）+ -al → 顺带发生的\n助记\nincident n.事件；incidentally ad.顺便说；同 accompanying, secondary；反 essential\n例句\nThe guide covers the main costs, not ==incidental== expenses. 指南涵盖主要费用，不含杂项开支。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_9","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"infuriate","back":"释义\nv. 使大怒，激怒，使狂怒\n词根词缀\nin- 进入 + furi 愤怒（fury）+ -ate → 使进入狂怒\n助记\nfury n.狂怒；furious a.暴怒的；同 enrage, incense；反 calm, delight\n例句\nHis constant lateness ==infuriated== the manager. 他一再迟到，激怒了经理。","fields":{"Front":"infuriate","Back":"释义\nv. 使大怒，激怒，使狂怒\n词根词缀\nin- 进入 + furi 愤怒（fury）+ -ate → 使进入狂怒\n助记\nfury n.狂怒；furious a.暴怒的；同 enrage, incense；反 calm, delight\n例句\nHis constant lateness ==infuriated== the manager. 他一再迟到，激怒了经理。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_10","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"lay","back":"释义\nv./a. v. 放置，铺设；下（蛋）；a. 世俗的，外行的\n词根词缀\n古英语'放置'；lie（躺）的及物对应，注意 laid-laid\n助记\nlay off 解雇；lay out 布置；layman n.外行；layer n.层；lie/lay 易混\n例句\nWorkers are ==laying== new pipes under the road. 工人正在路下铺设新管道。","fields":{"Front":"lay","Back":"释义\nv./a. v. 放置，铺设；下（蛋）；a. 世俗的，外行的\n词根词缀\n古英语'放置'；lie（躺）的及物对应，注意 laid-laid\n助记\nlay off 解雇；lay out 布置；layman n.外行；layer n.层；lie/lay 易混\n例句\nWorkers are ==laying== new pipes under the road. 工人正在路下铺设新管道。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_11","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"occupy","back":"释义\nv. 占用，占领，占据；使忙碌，使从事\n词根词缀\noc- 加强 + cupy 抓取（capture）→ 抓住、占住\n助记\noccupation n.职业、占领；occupant n.占用者；be occupied with 忙于\n例句\nReading ==occupies== most of her free time. 阅读占据她大部分空闲。","fields":{"Front":"occupy","Back":"释义\nv. 占用，占领，占据；使忙碌，使从事\n词根词缀\noc- 加强 + cupy 抓取（capture）→ 抓住、占住\n助记\noccupation n.职业、占领；occupant n.占用者；be occupied with 忙于\n例句\nReading ==occupies== most of her free time. 阅读占据她大部分空闲。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_12","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"posit","back":"释义\nv. 假定，设想，假设；安置，安放\n词根词缀\n拉丁语'放置'（posit 放）→ 摆出一个前提 → 假定\n助记\nposition n.位置；positive a.确定的；postulate v.假定；同 assume, suppose\n例句\nThe theory ==posits== that humans evolved in Africa. 该理论假定人类起源于非洲。","fields":{"Front":"posit","Back":"释义\nv. 假定，设想，假设；安置，安放\n词根词缀\n拉丁语'放置'（posit 放）→ 摆出一个前提 → 假定\n助记\nposition n.位置；positive a.确定的；postulate v.假定；同 assume, suppose\n例句\nThe theory ==posits== that humans evolved in Africa. 该理论假定人类起源于非洲。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_13","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"proactive","back":"释义\na. 主动的，先发制人的，积极行动的\n词根词缀\npro- 在前 + active 行动的 → 提前行动的\n助记\nactive a.积极的；react v.反应（被动）；proactivity n.主动性；反 passive, reactive\n例句\nWe need a more ==proactive== approach to safety. 我们对安全需采取更主动的做法。","fields":{"Front":"proactive","Back":"释义\na. 主动的，先发制人的，积极行动的\n词根词缀\npro- 在前 + active 行动的 → 提前行动的\n助记\nactive a.积极的；react v.反应（被动）；proactivity n.主动性；反 passive, reactive\n例句\nWe need a more ==proactive== approach to safety. 我们对安全需采取更主动的做法。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_14","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"psychology","back":"释义\nn. 心理学；心理，心理特点，心机\n词根词缀\npsycho 心灵、精神 + -logy 学科 → 研究心灵的学问\n助记\npsychological a.心理的；psychologist n.心理学家；psychic a.精神的\n例句\nShe is studying child ==psychology== . 她在学习儿童心理学。","fields":{"Front":"psychology","Back":"释义\nn. 心理学；心理，心理特点，心机\n词根词缀\npsycho 心灵、精神 + -logy 学科 → 研究心灵的学问\n助记\npsychological a.心理的；psychologist n.心理学家；psychic a.精神的\n例句\nShe is studying child ==psychology== . 她在学习儿童心理学。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_15","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"repress","back":"释义\nv. 抑制，压抑（情感）；镇压，压制\n词根词缀\nre- 回 + press 压 → 压回去 → 压抑、镇压\n助记\npress v.压；repression n.压抑；suppress v.压制；oppress v.压迫；同 restrain\n例句\nShe tried to ==repress== a smile. 她强忍住笑。","fields":{"Front":"repress","Back":"释义\nv. 抑制，压抑（情感）；镇压，压制\n词根词缀\nre- 回 + press 压 → 压回去 → 压抑、镇压\n助记\npress v.压；repression n.压抑；suppress v.压制；oppress v.压迫；同 restrain\n例句\nShe tried to ==repress== a smile. 她强忍住笑。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_16","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"spear","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 矛，长枪，鱼叉；v. 用矛刺，叉住\n词根词缀\n古英语'矛'；动词为刺、叉\n助记\nspearhead n.矛头、先锋 v.带头；spearmint n.留兰香；同 lance, pierce\n例句\nThe fisherman ==speared== a fish in shallow water. 渔夫在浅水中叉到一条鱼。","fields":{"Front":"spear","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 矛，长枪，鱼叉；v. 用矛刺，叉住\n词根词缀\n古英语'矛'；动词为刺、叉\n助记\nspearhead n.矛头、先锋 v.带头；spearmint n.留兰香；同 lance, pierce\n例句\nThe fisherman ==speared== a fish in shallow water. 渔夫在浅水中叉到一条鱼。","Extra":"","Sourc