,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_19","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"thrust","back":"释义\nv./n. v./n. 猛推，刺，戳；推力，要旨\n词根词缀\n古诺斯语'猛推、挤'；过去式同形 thrust\n助记\nthrust upon 强加于；main thrust 主旨；同 push, shove, stab；反 pull\n例句\nHe ==thrust== the letter into his pocket. 他把信猛地塞进口袋。","fields":{"Front":"thrust","Back":"释义\nv./n. v./n. 猛推，刺，戳；推力，要旨\n词根词缀\n古诺斯语'猛推、挤'；过去式同形 thrust\n助记\nthrust upon 强加于；main thrust 主旨；同 push, shove, stab；反 pull\n例句\nHe ==thrust== the letter into his pocket. 他把信猛地塞进口袋。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_20","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"balk","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 犹豫，畏缩，拒绝；阻止；n. 障碍，阻碍\n词根词缀\n古英语'梁、障碍'；动词为受阻而退缩\n助记\nbalk at 对…犹豫；同 hesitate, recoil, hinder；balky a.倔强的\n例句\nThe horse ==balked== at the high fence. 马在高栅栏前退缩了。","fields":{"Front":"balk","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 犹豫，畏缩，拒绝；阻止；n. 障碍，阻碍\n词根词缀\n古英语'梁、障碍'；动词为受阻而退缩\n助记\nbalk at 对…犹豫；同 hesitate, recoil, hinder；balky a.倔强的\n例句\nThe horse ==balked== at the high fence. 马在高栅栏前退缩了。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_21","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"consolidate","back":"释义\nv. 巩固，加强；合并，联合\n词根词缀\ncon- 一起 + solid 坚固 + -ate → 使成一体且坚固\n助记\nsolid a.坚固的；consolidation n.巩固、合并；solidarity n.团结；同 merge, strengthen\n例句\nThe company ==consolidated== its market position. 公司巩固了市场地位。","fields":{"Front":"consolidate","Back":"释义\nv. 巩固，加强；合并，联合\n词根词缀\ncon- 一起 + solid 坚固 + -ate → 使成一体且坚固\n助记\nsolid a.坚固的；consolidation n.巩固、合并；solidarity n.团结；同 merge, strengthen\n例句\nThe company ==consolidated== its market position. 公司巩固了市场地位。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_22","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"contamination","back":"释义\nn. 污染，玷污；污染物，杂质\n词根词缀\ncontaminate 污染（con- 一起 + tamin 接触）+ -ion → 接触弄脏\n助记\ncontaminate v.污染；contaminant n.污染物；同 pollution, impurity；反 purity\n例句\nTests found ==contamination== in the drinking water. 检测发现饮用水受到污染。","fields":{"Front":"contamination","Back":"释义\nn. 污染，玷污；污染物，杂质\n词根词缀\ncontaminate 污染（con- 一起 + tamin 接触）+ -ion → 接触弄脏\n助记\ncontaminate v.污染；contaminant n.污染物；同 pollution, impurity；反 purity\n例句\nTests found ==contamination== in the drinking water. 检测发现饮用水受到污染。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_23","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"cooperative","back":"释义\na./n. a. 合作的，协作的，配合的；n. 合作社\n词根词缀\ncooperate 合作（co- 共同 + oper 工作）+ -ive → 愿意一起干的\n助记\noperate v.操作；cooperation n.合作；co-op n.合作社；同 collaborative；反 uncooperative\n例句\nThe students were quiet and ==cooperative== . 学生们安静又配合。","fields":{"Front":"cooperative","Back":"释义\na./n. a. 合作的，协作的，配合的；n. 合作社\n词根词缀\ncooperate 合作（co- 共同 + oper 工作）+ -ive → 愿意一起干的\n助记\noperate v.操作；cooperation n.合作；co-op n.合作社；同 collaborative；反 uncooperative\n例句\nThe students were quiet and ==cooperative== . 学生们安静又配合。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_24","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"corrosion","back":"释义\nn. 腐蚀，侵蚀；衰败，逐渐损害\n词根词缀\ncorrode 腐蚀（cor- + rod 啃）+ -sion → 逐渐被啃蚀\n助记\ncorrode v.腐蚀；corrosive a.腐蚀性的；erosion n.侵蚀（水土）；同 rust, decay\n例句\nRust and ==corrosion== weakened the old bridge. 锈蚀削弱了旧桥。","fields":{"Front":"corrosion","Back":"释义\nn. 腐蚀，侵蚀；衰败，逐渐损害\n词根词缀\ncorrode 腐蚀（cor- + rod 啃）+ -sion → 逐渐被啃蚀\n助记\ncorrode v.腐蚀；corrosive a.腐蚀性的；erosion n.侵蚀（水土）；同 rust, decay\n例句\nRust and ==corrosion== weakened the old bridge. 锈蚀削弱了旧桥。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_25","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"cranial","back":"释义\na. 头颅的，头盖的，颅的\n词根词缀\ncrani 头颅（cranium 头盖骨）+ -al → 颅骨的\n助记\ncranium n.头盖骨；craniology n.颅骨学；skull n.头骨（日常词）\n例句\nThe doctor examined the ==cranial== nerves. 医生检查了颅神经。","fields":{"Front":"cranial","Back":"释义\na. 头颅的，头盖的，颅的\n词根词缀\ncrani 头颅（cranium 头盖骨）+ -al → 颅骨的\n助记\ncranium n.头盖骨；craniology n.颅骨学；skull n.头骨（日常词）\n例句\nThe doctor examined the ==cranial== nerves. 医生检查了颅神经。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.0