28","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"irritate","back":"释义\nv. 激怒，使烦躁；刺激（皮肤、器官）\n词根词缀\nirrit 激怒 + -ate → 使恼怒\n助记\nirritable a.易怒的；irritation n.恼怒；同 annoy, aggravate, provoke\n例句\nLoud music ==irritates== me when I'm reading. 我看书时吵闹的音乐让我烦躁。","fields":{"Front":"irritate","Back":"释义\nv. 激怒，使烦躁；刺激（皮肤、器官）\n词根词缀\nirrit 激怒 + -ate → 使恼怒\n助记\nirritable a.易怒的；irritation n.恼怒；同 annoy, aggravate, provoke\n例句\nLoud music ==irritates== me when I'm reading. 我看书时吵闹的音乐让我烦躁。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_29","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"laser","back":"释义\nn. 激光，激光器\n词根词缀\n首字母缩写 Light Amplification by Stimulated Emission of Radiation\n助记\nlaser beam 激光束；laser printer 激光打印机；lase v.发出激光\n例句\nThe doctor used a ==laser== to repair the eye. 医生用激光治疗眼睛。","fields":{"Front":"laser","Back":"释义\nn. 激光，激光器\n词根词缀\n首字母缩写 Light Amplification by Stimulated Emission of Radiation\n助记\nlaser beam 激光束；laser printer 激光打印机；lase v.发出激光\n例句\nThe doctor used a ==laser== to repair the eye. 医生用激光治疗眼睛。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_30","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"lineage","back":"释义\nn. 血统，世系，家族，门第\n词根词缀\nline 线、系 + -age → 一脉相承的世系\n助记\nline n.线、系；linear a.线性的；同 ancestry, descent, pedigree\n例句\nHe could trace his ==lineage== back to a king. 他能把家世追溯到一位国王。","fields":{"Front":"lineage","Back":"释义\nn. 血统，世系，家族，门第\n词根词缀\nline 线、系 + -age → 一脉相承的世系\n助记\nline n.线、系；linear a.线性的；同 ancestry, descent, pedigree\n例句\nHe could trace his ==lineage== back to a king. 他能把家世追溯到一位国王。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_31","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"mental","back":"释义\na. 精神的，心理的；智力的，脑力的\n词根词缀\nment 心智、思考（mind）+ -al → 心理的\n助记\nmention v.提及；mentality n.心态；comment v.评论；同 intellectual, psychological；反 physical\n例句\nChess is a form of ==mental== exercise. 国际象棋是一种脑力锻炼。","fields":{"Front":"mental","Back":"释义\na. 精神的，心理的；智力的，脑力的\n词根词缀\nment 心智、思考（mind）+ -al → 心理的\n助记\nmention v.提及；mentality n.心态；comment v.评论；同 intellectual, psychological；反 physical\n例句\nChess is a form of ==mental== exercise. 国际象棋是一种脑力锻炼。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_32","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"pave","back":"释义\nv. 铺（路、地面），铺设；为…做准备\n词根词缀\n古法语'铺路石'；固定 pave the way for 为…铺平道路\n助记\npavement n.人行道；paving n.铺路材料；pave the way for 为…创造条件\n例句\nThe path is ==paved== with smooth stones. 小路用光滑石块铺成。","fields":{"Front":"pave","Back":"释义\nv. 铺（路、地面），铺设；为…做准备\n词根词缀\n古法语'铺路石'；固定 pave the way for 为…铺平道路\n助记\npavement n.人行道；paving n.铺路材料；pave the way for 为…创造条件\n例句\nThe path is ==paved== with smooth stones. 小路用光滑石块铺成。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_33","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"plump","back":"释义\na./v. a. 丰满的，圆胖的，饱满的；v. 扑通放下；坚决支持\n词根词缀\n中古荷兰语'钝、臃肿'；指圆润饱满\n助记\nplump up 使鼓起、拍松（枕头）；plump for 坚决选择；同 chubby, rounded；反 slim\n例句\nThe baby had soft, ==plump== cheeks. 婴儿有着柔软圆胖的脸颊。","fields":{"Front":"plump","Back":"释义\na./v. a. 丰满的，圆胖的，饱满的；v. 扑通放下；坚决支持\n词根词缀\n中古荷兰语'钝、臃肿'；指圆润饱满\n助记\nplump up 使鼓起、拍松（枕头）；plump for 坚决选择；同 chubby, rounded；反 slim\n例句\nThe baby had soft, ==plump== cheeks. 婴儿有着柔软圆胖的脸颊。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_34","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"pretentious","back":"释义\na. 自命不凡的，炫耀的，做作的，卖弄的\n词根词缀\npretense 假装、自诩（pre- 前 + tend 伸展、标榜）+ -ious\n助记\npretend v.假装；pretense n.虚伪；pretension n.自命；同 showy, affected；反 modest\n例句\nI found the film dull and ==pretentious== . 我觉得这部电影沉闷又做作。","fields":{"Front":"pretentious","Back":"释义\na. 自命不凡的，炫耀的，做作的，卖弄的\n词根词缀\npretense 假装、自诩（pre- 前 + tend 伸展、标榜）+ -ious\n助记\npretend v.假装；pretense n.虚伪；pretension n.自命；同 showy, affected；反 modest\n例句\nI found the film dull and ==pretentious== . 我觉得这部电影沉闷又做作。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_35","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"readily","back":"释义\nad. 容易地，乐意地，迅速地，爽快地\n词根词缀\nready 准备好的 + -ly → 已准备好地、不迟疑地\n助记\nready a.准备好的；readiness n.准备就绪；同 easily, willingly, promptly\n例句\nVegetables are ==readily== available here. 这里很容易买到蔬菜。","fields":{"Front":"readily","Back":"释义\nad. 容易地，乐意地，迅速地，爽快地\n词根词缀\nready 准备好的 + -ly → 已准备好地、不迟疑地\n助记\nready a.准备好的；readiness n.准备就绪；同 easily, willingly, promptly\n例句\nVegetables are ==readily== available here. 这里很容易买到蔬菜。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_36","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"resolute","back":"释义\na. 坚决的，果断的，坚定的\n词根词缀\nre- 加强 + solut 松开、决断（resolve）→ 下定决心的\n助记\nresolve v.决心；resolution n.决心；irresolute a.优柔寡断的；同 determined, firm\n例句\nShe remained ==resolute== in the face of danger. 面对危险她依然坚定。","fields":{"Front":"resolute","Back":"释义\na. 坚决的，果断的，坚定的\n词根词缀\nre- 加强 + solut 松开、决断（resolve）→ 下定决心的\n助记\nresolve v.决心；resolution n.决心；irresolute a.优柔寡断的；同 determined, firm\n例句\nShe remained ==resolute== in the face of danger. 面对危险她依然坚定。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_37","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"shrink","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 收缩，缩小；退缩，畏缩；n. 收缩；（俚）心理医生\n词根词缀\n古英语'皱缩'；shrank/shrunk；与 shrug 相关\n助记\nshrinkage n.缩水；shrink from 回避；shrinking a.畏缩的；同 contract, dwindle；反 expand\n例句\nWool sweaters often ==shrink== in hot water. 羊毛衫在热水里常缩水。","fields":{"Front":"shrink","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 收缩，缩小；退缩，畏缩；n. 收缩；（俚）心理医生\n词根词缀\n古英语'皱缩'；shrank/shrunk；与 shrug 相关\n助记\nshrinkage n.缩水；shrink from 回避；shrinking a.畏缩的；同 contract, dwindle；反 expand\n例句\nWool sweaters often ==shrink== in hot water. 羊毛衫在热水里常缩水。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_38","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"barter","back":"释义\nv./n. 以物易物，易货贸易，物物交换\n词根词缀\n古法语 barater'交换、讨价'；指不用货币的交换\n助记\nbarter economy 易货经济；同 trade, exchange, swap\n例句\nThey ==bartered== grain for tools. 他们用谷物换取工具。","fields":{"Front":"barter","Back":"释义\nv./n. 以物易物，易货贸易，物物交换\n词根词缀\n古法语 barater'交换、讨价'；指不用货币的交换\n助记\nbarter economy 易货经济；同 trade, exchange, swap\n例句\nThey ==bartered== grain for tools. 他们用谷物换取工具。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_39","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"bulk","back":"释义\nn./a. n. 体积，大块，大量；大部分；a. 大批的，散装的\n词根词缀\n古诺斯语'货舱、堆'；the bulk of 大部分\n助记\nbulky a.庞大笨重的；in bulk 大量、散装；bulk buying 批量购买；同 mass, majority\n例句\nThe ==bulk== of the work is now complete. 大部分工作现已完成。","fields":{"Front":"bulk","Back":"释义\nn./a. n. 体积，大块，大量；大部分；a. 大批的，散装的\n词根词缀\n古诺斯语'货舱、堆'；the bulk of 大部分\n助记\nbulky a.庞大笨重的；in bulk 大量、散装；bulk buying 批量购买；同 mass, majority\n例句\nThe ==bulk== of the work is now complete. 大部分工作现已完成。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"