e":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_42","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"cue","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 提示，暗示，信号；（台球）球杆；v. 给…提示\n词根词缀\n源自拉丁语 quando'何时'（戏剧尾字母 Q 提示上场）\n助记\non cue 恰在此时；take one's cue from 学…的样；cue card 提词卡；同 signal, hint\n例句\nHer smile was my ==cue== to begin. 她一笑就是我开始的信号。","fields":{"Front":"cue","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 提示，暗示，信号；（台球）球杆；v. 给…提示\n词根词缀\n源自拉丁语 quando'何时'（戏剧尾字母 Q 提示上场）\n助记\non cue 恰在此时；take one's cue from 学…的样；cue card 提词卡；同 signal, hint\n例句\nHer smile was my ==cue== to begin. 她一笑就是我开始的信号。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_43","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"detergent","back":"释义\nn./a. n. 洗涤剂，清洁剂；a. 净化的，去污的\n词根词缀\nde- 离开 + terg 擦拭 + -ent → 擦掉污垢之物\n助记\ndeter v.阻止；laundry detergent 洗衣液；同 cleanser, soap\n例句\nAdd a little ==detergent== to the warm water. 往温水里加一点洗涤剂。","fields":{"Front":"detergent","Back":"释义\nn./a. n. 洗涤剂，清洁剂；a. 净化的，去污的\n词根词缀\nde- 离开 + terg 擦拭 + -ent → 擦掉污垢之物\n助记\ndeter v.阻止；laundry detergent 洗衣液；同 cleanser, soap\n例句\nAdd a little ==detergent== to the warm water. 往温水里加一点洗涤剂。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_44","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"encounter","back":"释义\nv./n. 遭遇，遇到（困难、危险）；邂逅，偶然相遇\n词根词缀\nen- 使 + counter 对面、相对 → 面对面碰上\n助记\ncounter a.相反的；encounter group 交心小组；同 meet, confront, come across\n例句\nShe ==encountered== an old friend at the station. 她在车站偶遇一位老友。","fields":{"Front":"encounter","Back":"释义\nv./n. 遭遇，遇到（困难、危险）；邂逅，偶然相遇\n词根词缀\nen- 使 + counter 对面、相对 → 面对面碰上\n助记\ncounter a.相反的；encounter group 交心小组；同 meet, confront, come across\n例句\nShe ==encountered== an old friend at the station. 她在车站偶遇一位老友。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_45","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"evolve","back":"释义\nv. 进化，演变，逐步发展\n词根词缀\ne- 向外 + volv 滚动、卷 → 逐渐展开、演变\n助记\nevolution n.进化；involve v.卷入；revolve v.旋转；同 develop, progress\n例句\nBirds ==evolved== from reptiles. 鸟类由爬行动物进化而来。","fields":{"Front":"evolve","Back":"释义\nv. 进化，演变，逐步发展\n词根词缀\ne- 向外 + volv 滚动、卷 → 逐渐展开、演变\n助记\nevolution n.进化；involve v.卷入；revolve v.旋转；同 develop, progress\n例句\nBirds ==evolved== from reptiles. 鸟类由爬行动物进化而来。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_46","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"flake","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 小薄片，碎片；v. 剥落，成片状落下；（雪）飘落\n词根词缀\n古英语/古诺斯语'薄片'；flake out 睡着、累倒\n助记\nsnowflake n.雪花；flaky a.薄片的、古怪的；cornflakes n.玉米片；同 chip, peel\n例句\n==Flakes== of old paint fell from the wall. 旧漆片从墙上剥落。","fields":{"Front":"flake","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 小薄片，碎片；v. 剥落，成片状落下；（雪）飘落\n词根词缀\n古英语/古诺斯语'薄片'；flake out 睡着、累倒\n助记\nsnowflake n.雪花；flaky a.薄片的、古怪的；cornflakes n.玉米片；同 chip, peel\n例句\n==Flakes== of old paint fell from the wall. 旧漆片从墙上剥落。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_47","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"imprint","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 盖印，压印；铭刻，使铭记；n. 印记，深刻印象\n词根词缀\nim- 进入 + print 印、压 → 印在心里\n助记\nprint v.印刷；imprinting n.印随（动物行为）；同 stamp, impress, mark\n例句\nThe scene was deeply ==imprinted== on her memory. 那一幕深深印在她记忆中。","fields":{"Front":"imprint","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 盖印，压印；铭刻，使铭记；n. 印记，深刻印象\n词根词缀\nim- 进入 + print 印、压 → 印在心里\n助记\nprint v.印刷；imprinting n.印随（动物行为）；同 stamp, impress, mark\n例句\nThe scene was deeply ==imprinted== on her memory. 那一幕深深印在她记忆中。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_48","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"inscribe","back":"释义\nv. 题写，刻写，雕刻；铭记，登记\n词根词缀\nin- 进入 + scrib 写 → 写/刻进去\n助记\nscript n.手稿；inscription n.铭文；describe v.描述；同 engrave, carve\n例句\nHis name was ==inscribed== on the trophy. 他的名字刻在奖杯上。","fields":{"Front":"inscribe","Back":"释义\nv. 题写，刻写，雕刻；铭记，登记\n词根词缀\nin- 进入 + scrib 写 → 写/刻进去\n助记\nscript n.手稿；inscription n.铭文；describe v.描述；同 engrave, carve\n例句\nHis name was ==inscribed== on the trophy. 他的名字刻在奖杯上。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_49","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"jeopardize","back":"释义\nv. 危及，危害，使处于危险，损害\n词根词缀\njeopardy 危险（jeo 游戏 + pard 平分）+ -ize → 使陷入险境\n助记\njeopardy n.危险；in jeopardy 处于危险；同 endanger, risk, imperil；反 protect\n例句\nOne mistake could ==jeopardize== his career. 一个失误就可能危及他的事业。","fields":{"Front":"jeopardize","Back":"释义\nv. 危及，危害，使处于危险，损害\n词根词缀\njeopardy 危险（jeo 游戏 + pard 平分）+ -ize → 使陷入险境\n助记\njeopardy n.危险；in jeopardy 处于危险；同 endanger, risk, imperil；反 protect\n例句\nOne mistake could ==jeopardize== his career. 一个失误就可能危及他的事业。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_50","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"lease","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 租约，租期；v. 出租，租得\n词根词缀\n古法语 laissier'允许、出租'（lax 放松）；a new lease of life 重获生机\n助记\nleash n.拴狗带；release v.释放；同 rent, hire, let\n例句\nThey signed a three-year ==lease== on the flat. 他们签了这套公寓三年的租约。","fields":{"Front":"lease","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 租约，租期；v. 出租，租得\n词根词缀\n古法语 laissier'允许、出租'（lax 放松）；a new lease of life 重获生机\n助记\nleash n.拴狗带；release v.释放；同 rent, hire, let\n例句\nThey signed a three-year ==lease== on the flat. 他们签了这套公寓三年的租约。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_51","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"medal","back":"释义\nn. 奖章，勋章，奖牌，纪念章\n词根词缀\nmed 金属、一半（coin）+ -al → 金属奖章\n助记\nmedalist n.奖牌得主；medallion n.大奖章；metal n.金属（形近）\n例句\nShe won a gold ==medal== at the Olympics. 她在奥运会上夺得金牌。","fields":{"Front":"medal","Back":"释义\nn. 奖章，勋章，奖牌，纪念章\n词根词缀\nmed 金属、一半（coin）+ -al → 金属奖章\n助记\nmedalist n.奖牌得主；medallion n.大奖章；metal n.金属（形近）\n例句\nShe won a gold ==medal== at the Olympics. 她在奥运会上夺得金牌。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_52","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"spontaneity","back":"释义\nn. 自发性，自然，自发行为\n词根词缀\nspontaneous 自发的（spont 自愿）+ -eity 性质 → 出于自然\n助记\nspontaneous a.自发的；spontaneously ad.自发地；同 naturalness；反 deliberation\n例句\nChildren act with great ==spontaneity== . 孩子行事十分自然率真。","fields":{"Front":"spontaneity","Back":"释义\nn. 自发性，自然，自发行为\n词根词缀\nspontaneous 自发的（spont 自愿）+ -eity 性质 → 出于自然\n助记\nspontaneous a.自发的；spontaneously ad.自发地；同 naturalness；反 deliberation\n例句\nChildren act with great ==spontaneity== . 孩子行事十分自然率真。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_53","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"supreme","back":"释义\na. 最高的，至高无上的；极度的，最大的\n词根词缀\nsu- (=sub) 在下、向上 + prem 最高（prime）→ 高到极点的\n助记\nsupremacy n.至高权力；supremely ad.极度地；同 highest, ultimate, paramount\n例句\nThe ==Supreme== Court upheld the ruling. 最高法院维持了裁决。","fields":{"Front":"supreme","Back":"释义\na. 最高的，至高无上的；极度的，最大的\n词根词缀\nsu- (=sub) 在下、向上 + prem 最高（prime）→ 高到极点的\n助记\nsupremacy n.至高权力；supremely ad.极度地；同 highest, ultimate, paramount\n例句\nThe ==Supreme== Court upheld the ruling. 最高法院维持了裁决。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_54","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"tenant","back":"释义\nn. 房客，租户，佃户，占用者\n词根词缀\nten- 持有（tain 握）+ -ant 人 → 持有/租住房屋的人\n助记\ntenancy n.租赁；contain v.包含；maintain v.维持；landlord n.房东（对应）\n例句\nThe ==tenant== pays rent on the first of each month. 房客每月一号交租。","fields":{"Front":"tenant","Back":"释义\nn. 房客，租户，佃户，占用者\n词根词缀\nten- 持有（tain 握）+ -ant 人 → 持有/租住房屋的人\n助记\ntenancy n.租赁；contain v.包含；maintain v.维持；landlord n.房东（对应）\n例句\nThe ==tenant== pays rent on the first of each month. 房客每月一号交租。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_55","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"absurd","back":"释义\na. 荒谬的，荒唐的，可笑的，不合理的\n词根词缀\nab- 偏离 + surd 聋、钝、理性 → 偏离理性的\n助记\nabsurdity n.荒谬；absurdly ad.荒唐地；surd a.无理数的；同 ridiculous, ludicrous\n例句\nIt is ==absurd== to go out without an umbrella in this rain. 这么大的雨不带伞出门太荒唐。","fields":{"Front":"absurd","Back":"释义\na. 荒谬的，荒唐的，可笑的，不合理的\n词根词缀\nab- 偏离 + surd 聋、钝、理性 → 偏离理性的\n助记\nabsurdity n.荒谬；absurdly ad.荒唐地；surd a.无理数的；同 ridiculous, ludicrous\n例句\nIt is ==absurd== to go out without an umbrella in this rain. 这么大的雨不带伞出门太荒唐。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_56","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"adhesive","back":"释义\nn./a. n. 黏合剂，胶；a. 黏着的，有黏性的，难忘的\n词根词缀\nad- 朝向 + hes 黏附（hesitate 卡住）+ -ive → 能黏住的\n助记\nadhere v.黏附；cohere v.黏合；coherent a.连贯的；同 sticky, glue\n例句\nUse a strong ==adhesive== to fix the tile. 用强力黏合剂固定瓷砖。","fields":{"Front":"adhesive","Back":"释义\nn./a. n. 黏合剂，胶；a. 黏着的，有黏性的，难忘的\n词根词缀\nad- 朝向 + hes 黏附（hesitate 卡住）+ -ive → 能黏住的\n助记\nadhere v.黏附；cohere v.黏合；coherent a.连贯的；同 sticky, glue\n例句\nUse a strong ==adhesive== to fix the tile. 用强力黏合剂固定瓷砖。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_57","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"comply","back":"释义\nv. 遵从，依从，服从，照做\n词根词缀\ncom- 完全 + ply 折叠、满足（pliable）→ 顺从、照办\n助记\ncompliance n.遵从；compliant a.顺从的；supply v.供应；同 obey, conform；反 resist\n例句\nAll products must ==comply== with safety rules. 所有产品必须符合安全规定。","fields":{"Front":"comply","Back":"释义\nv. 遵从，依从，服从，照做\n词根词缀\ncom- 完全 + ply 折叠、满足（pliable）→ 顺从、照办\n助记\ncompliance n.遵从；compliant a.顺从的；supply v.供应；同 obey, conform；反 resist\n例句\nAll products must ==comply== with safety rules. 所有产品必须符合安全规定。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_58","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"conservationist","back":"释义\nn. 自然资源保护主义者，环保主义者\n词根词缀\nconservation 保护（con- + serv 保存）+ -ist 人 → 致力于保护自然者\n助记\nconserve v.保护；conservative a.保守的；conservatory n.温室；同 environmentalist\n例句\n==Conservationists== fought to save the forest. 环保主义者为拯救森林而奔走。","fields":{"Front":"conservationist","Back":"释义\nn. 自然资源保护主义者，环保主义者\n词根词缀\nconservation 保护（con- + serv 保存）+ -ist 人 → 致力于保护自然者\n助记\nconserve v.保护；conservative a.保守的；conservatory n.温室；同 environmentalist\n例句\n==Conservationists== fought to save the forest. 环保主义者为拯救森林而奔走。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_59","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"diversion","back":"释义\nn. 转移，转向，改道；消遣，娱乐；牵制\n词根词缀\ndivert 转移（di- 分开 + vert 转）+ -sion → 转向、消遣\n助记\ndivert v.使转向；convert v.转变；同 distraction, pastime, detour\n例句\nReading is a pleasant ==diversion== for her. 阅读对她是愉快的消遣。","fields":{"Front":"diversion","Back":"释义\nn. 转移，转向，改道；消遣，娱乐；牵制\n词根词缀\ndivert 转移（di- 分开 + vert 转）+ -sion → 转向、消遣\n助记\ndivert v.使转向；convert v.转变；同 distraction, pastime, detour\n例句\nReading is a pleasant ==diversion== for her. 阅读对她是愉快的消遣。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_60","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"endure","back":"释义\nv. 忍受，忍耐；持久，持续，耐久\n词根词缀\nen- 使 + dur 坚硬、持续 + -e → 硬撑、持久\n助记\ndurable a.耐用的；duration n.持续时间；endurance n.忍耐力；同 bear, tolerate, last\n例句\nShe could not ==endure== the pain any longer. 她再也无法忍受疼痛。","fields":{"Front":"endure","Back":"释义\nv. 忍受，忍耐；持久，持续，耐久\n词根词缀\nen- 使 + dur 坚硬、持续 + -e → 硬撑、持久\n助记\ndurable a.耐用的；duration n.持续时间；endurance n.忍耐力；同 bear, tolerate, last\n例句\nShe could not ==endure== the pain any longer. 她再也无法忍受疼痛。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_61","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"exemplary","back":"释义\na. 典范的，模范的，可作榜样的；惩戒性的\n词根词缀\nexemplify 的形容词：example 榜样（ex- 出 + em 拿）+ -ary\n助记\nexample n.榜样；exemplify v.例证；exemplar n.典范；同 model, ideal, commendable\n例句\nHer ==exemplary== work earned her a promotion. 她堪称模范的工作为她赢得晋升。","fields":{"Front":"exemplary","Back":"释义\na. 典范的，模范的，可作榜样的；惩戒性的\n词根词缀\nexemplify 的形容词：example 榜样（ex- 出 + em 拿）+ -ary\n助记\nexample n.榜样；exemplify v.例证；exemplar n.典范；同 model, ideal, commendable\n例句\nHer ==exemplary== work earned her a promotion. 她堪称模范的工作为她赢得晋升。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_62","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"exhale","back":"释义\nv. 呼气，呼出；散发出（气味、蒸汽）\n词根词缀\nex- 向外 + hale 呼吸、拖 → 向外呼气\n助记\ninhale v.吸气（反义）；exhalation n.呼气；halitosis n.口臭；同 breathe out\n例句\nShe ==exhaled== slowly to calm down. 她缓缓呼气让自己平静。","fields":{"Front":"exhale","Back":"释义\nv. 呼气，呼出；散发出（气味、蒸汽）\n词根词缀\nex- 向外 + hale 呼吸、拖 → 向外呼气\n助记\ninhale v.吸气（反义）；exhalation n.呼气；halitosis n.口臭；同 breathe out\n例句\nShe ==exhaled== slowly to calm down. 她缓缓呼气让自己平静。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_63","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"gravitational","back":"释义\na. 引力的，重力的，万有引力的\n词根词缀\ngravity 重力（grav 重）+ -ation + -al → 与重力有关的\n助记\ngravity n.重力、庄重；grave a.严重的；aggravate v.加重；gravitate v.被吸引\n例句\nThe moon's ==gravitational== pull causes tides. 月球的引力造成潮汐。","fields":{"Front":"gravitational","Back":"释义\na. 引力的，重力的，万有引力的\n词根词缀\ngravity 重力（grav 重）+ -ation + -al → 与重力有关的\n助记\ngravity n.重力、庄重；grave a.严重的；aggravate v.加重；gravitate v.被吸引\n例句\nThe moon's ==gravitational== pull causes tides. 月球的引力造成潮汐。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_64","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"hydrogen","back":"释义\nn. 氢，氢气（H）\n词根词缀\nhydro 水 + gen 产生 → 生成水的元素 → 氢\n助记\nhydroelectric a.水电的；oxygen n.氧；nitrogen n.氮；hydrate n.水合物\n例句\nWater consists of ==hydrogen== and oxygen. 水由氢和氧组成。","fields":{"Front":"hydrogen","Back":"释义\nn. 氢，氢气（H）\n词根词缀\nhydro 水 + gen 产生 → 生成水的元素 → 氢\n助记\nhydroelectric a.水电的；oxygen n.氧；nitrogen n.氮；hydrate n.水合物\n例句\nWater consists of ==hydrogen== and oxygen. 水由氢和氧组成。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_65","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"inanimate","back":"释义\na. 无生命的；无生气的，没精打采的\n词根词缀\nin- 无 + animate 有生命的（anim 生命、气息）→ 无生命的\n助记\nanimate a.有生命的；animal n.动物；unanimous a.一致的；同 lifeless, inert；反 living\n例句\nA rock is an ==inanimate== object. 石头是无生命的物体。","fields":{"Front":"inanimate","Back":"释义\na. 无生命的；无生气的，没精打采的\n词根词缀\nin- 无 + animate 有生命的（anim 生命、气息）→ 无生命的\n助记\nanimate a.有生命的；animal n.动物；unanimous a.一致的；同 lifeless, inert；反 living\n例句\nA rock is an ==inanimate== object. 石头是无生命的物体。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_66","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"leftover","back":"释义\na./n. a. 剩余的，残留的；n. 剩饭，剩余物，残留物\n词根词缀\nleft 留下（leave 过去分词）+ over 超过 → 剩下的\n助记\nleave v.留下；leftovers 常用复数；同 remaining, remnant, residue\n例句\nWe ate the ==leftovers== for lunch. 我们午饭吃了剩饭。","fields":{"Front":"leftover","Back":"释义\na./n. a. 剩余的，残留的；n. 剩饭，剩余物，残留物\n词根词缀\nleft 留下（leave 过去分词）+ over 超过 → 剩下的\n助记\nleave v.留下；leftovers 常用复数；同 remaining, remnant, residue\n例句\nWe ate the ==leftovers== for lunch. 我们午饭吃了剩饭。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_67","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"mast","back":"释义\nn. 船桅，桅杆；旗杆；（橡、山毛榉的）坚果\n词根词缀\n古英语'桅杆'；before the mast 当水手\n助记\nmasthead n.报头、桅顶；masted a.有桅的；half-mast 降半旗；同 pole, spar\n例句\nThe flag flew high on the ==mast== . 旗帜在桅杆上高高飘扬。","fields":{"Front":"mast","Back":"释义\nn. 船桅，桅杆；旗杆；（橡、山毛榉的）坚果\n词根词缀\n古英语'桅杆'；before the mast 当水手\n助记\nmasthead n.报头、桅顶；masted a.有桅的；half-mast 降半旗；同 pole, spar\n例句\nThe flag flew high on the ==mast== . 旗帜在桅杆上高高飘扬。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_68","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"overload","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 使超载，使过载，使负担过重；n. 超载，过重负担\n词根词缀\nover- 过度 + load 装载 → 装得过多\n助记\nload n./v.装载；download v.下载；information overload 信息过载；同 overburden\n例句\nDon't ==overload== the washing machine. 别把洗衣机塞太满。","fields":{"Front":"overload","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 使超载，使过载，使负担过重；n. 超载，过重负担\n词根词缀\nover- 过度 + load 装载 → 装得过多\n助记\nload n./v.装载；download v.下载；information overload 信息过载；同 overburden\n例句\nDon't ==overload== the washing machine. 别把洗衣机塞太满。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_69","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"penetrate","back":"释义\nv. 穿透，刺入，渗入；洞察，识破；打入（组织）\n词根词缀\npen- 向内 + etr 进入（enter）+ -ate → 穿入\n助记\npenetration n.穿透；penetrating a.锐利的；同 pierce, enter, permeate\n例句\nSunlight ==penetrated== through the thick leaves. 阳光透过浓密的树叶。","fields":{"Front":"penetrate","Back":"释义\nv. 穿透，刺入，渗入；洞察，识破；打入（组织）\n词根词缀\npen- 向内 + etr 进入（enter）+ -ate → 穿入\n助记\npenetration n.穿透；penetrating a.锐利的；同 pierce, enter, permeate\n例句\nSunlight ==penetrated== through the thick leaves. 阳光透过浓密的树叶。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_70","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"plantation","back":"释义\nn. 种植园，大农场；人工林，林场\n词根词缀\nplant 种植 + -ation 场所 → 大面积种植之地\n助记\nplant v.种植；transplant v.移植；planter n.种植园主、花盆；同 farm, estate\n例句\nThey worked on a cotton ==plantation== . 他们在棉花种植园干活。","fields":{"Front":"plantation","Back":"释义\nn. 种植园，大农场；人工林，林场\n词根词缀\nplant 种植 + -ation 场所 → 大面积种植之地\n助记\nplant v.种植；transplant v.移植；planter n.种植园主、花盆；同 farm, estate\n例句\nThey worked on a cotton ==plantation== . 他们在棉花种植园干活。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_71","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"region","back":"释义\nn. 地区，区域，地带；（身体）部位\n词根词缀\nreg 统治、方向（realm）+ -ion → 受管辖的一片地区\n助记\nregional a.地区的；realm n.领域；in the region of 大约；同 area, district, zone\n例句\nThis ==region== is famous for its wine. 这个地区以葡萄酒闻名。","fields":{"Front":"region","Back":"释义\nn. 地区，区域，地带；（身体）部位\n词根词缀\nreg 统治、方向（realm）+ -ion → 受管辖的一片地区\n助记\nregional a.地区的；realm n.领域；in the region of 大约；同 area, district, zone\n例句\nThis ==region== is famous for its wine. 这个地区以葡萄酒闻名。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_72","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"reserve","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 保留，预订，储备；n. 储备（物），自然保护区；矜持\n词根词缀\nre- 回 + serve 保存、服务 → 留存起来\n助记\npreserve v.保护；observe v.观察；reservation n.预订；reservoir n.水库；同 book, keep\n例句\nI'd like to ==reserve== a table for two. 我想预订一张两人桌。","fields":{"Front":"reserve","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 保留，预订，储备；n. 储备（物），自然保护区；矜持\n词根词缀\nre- 回 + serve 保存、服务 → 留存起来\n助记\npreserve v.保护；observe v.观察；reservation n.预订；reservoir n.水库；同 book, keep\n例句\nI'd like to ==reserve== a table for two. 我想预订一张两人桌。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l5_73","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"suspect","back":"释义\nv./n./a. v. 怀疑，猜想；n. 嫌疑犯；a. 可疑的，靠不住的\n词根词缀\nsus- (=sub) 在下 + spect 看 → 私下打量、起疑\n助记\nsuspicion n.怀疑；suspicious a.多疑的；inspect v.检查；同 doubt, distrust；反 trust\n例句\nPolice ==suspected== him of the theft. 警方怀疑他偷窃。","fields":{"Front":"suspect","Back":"释义\nv./n./a. v. 怀疑，猜想；n. 嫌疑犯；a. 可疑的，靠不住的\n词根词缀\nsus- (=sub) 在下 + spect 看 → 私下打量、起疑\n助记\nsuspicion n.怀疑；suspicious a.多疑的；inspect v.检查；同 doubt, distrust；反 trust\n例句\nPolice ==suspected== him of the theft. 警方怀疑他偷窃。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 5 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]}]},{"id":"toefl-list-6","name":"TOEFL 托福 › List 6","description":"托福核心词 · List 6（64 词 · 释义 + 词根词缀 + 助记 + 标黄例句）","createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["toefl","imported"],"options":{"newPerDay":null,"reviewsPerDay":null,"learningSteps":null,"relearningSteps":null,"graduatingInterval":null,"easyInterval":null,"leechThreshold":null,"leechAction":"","buryRelated":null,"maxInterval":null,"requestRetention":null,"newOrder":"","reviewOrder":""},"cards":[{"noteId":"toefl_l6_0","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"abortive","back":"释义\na. 失败的，夭折的，流产的，未成功的\n词根词缀\nabort 流产（ab- 离开 + ort 出生）+ -ive → 未能顺利产出的\n助记\nabort v.中止；abortion n.流产；同 failed, unsuccessful, fruitless；反 successful\n例句\nThey made an ==abortive== attempt to climb the peak. 他们登顶的尝试半途而废。","fields":{"Front":"abortive","Back":"释义\na. 失败的，夭折的，流产的，未成功的\n词根词缀\nabort 流产（ab- 离开 + ort 出生）+ -ive → 未能顺利产出的\n助记\nabort v.中止；abortion n.流产；同 failed, unsuccessful, fruitless；反 successful\n例句\nThey made an ==abortive== attempt to climb the peak. 他们登顶的尝试半途而废。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_1","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"ambiguity","back":"释义\nn. 含糊，模棱两可，歧义，不明确\n词根词缀\namb- 两边 + ag 驱赶、走 + -uity → 两边都可走 → 模棱两可\n助记\nambiguous a.含糊的；ambiguously ad.含糊地；同 vagueness, uncertainty；反 clarity\n例句\nThere is some ==ambiguity== in the wording of the law. 这条法律措辞有些含糊。","fields":{"Front":"ambiguity","Back":"释义\nn. 含糊，模棱两可，歧义，不明确\n词根词缀\namb- 两边 + ag 驱赶、走 + -uity → 两边都可走 → 模棱两可\n助记\nambiguous a.含糊的；ambiguously ad.含糊地；同 vagueness, uncertainty；反 clarity\n例句\nThere is some ==ambiguity== in the wording of the law. 这条法律措辞有些含糊。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_2","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"atomic","back":"释义\na. 原子的，原子能的；极小的，微粒的\n词根词缀\natom 原子（a- 无 + tom 分割，'不可再分'）+ -ic\n助记\natom n.原子；atom bomb 原子弹；an atomic amount 极少量；nuclear a.核的\n例句\nThe country developed its own ==atomic== energy program. 该国发展了自己的原子能计划。","fields":{"Front":"atomic","Back":"释义\na. 原子的，原子能的；极小的，微粒的\n词根词缀\natom 原子（a- 无 + tom 分割，'不可再分'）+ -ic\n助记\natom n.原子；atom bomb 原子弹；an atomic amount 极少量；nuclear a.核的\n例句\nThe country developed its own ==atomic== energy program. 该国发展了自己的原子能计划。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_3","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"bare","back":"释义\na./v. a. 赤裸的，光秃的；仅有的，勉强的；v. 露出，揭开\n词根词缀\n古英语'赤裸、光秃'；barely ad.仅仅、几乎不\n助记\nbarely ad.几乎不；barefoot a.赤脚的；同 naked, uncovered；反 covered\n例句\nHe worked with his ==bare== hands. 他赤手空拳地干活。","fields":{"Front":"bare","Back":"释义\na./v. a. 赤裸的，光秃的；仅有的，勉强的；v. 露出，揭开\n词根词缀\n古英语'赤裸、光秃'；barely ad.仅仅、几乎不\n助记\nbarely ad.几乎不；barefoot a.赤脚的；同 naked, uncovered；反 covered\n例句\nHe worked with his ==bare== hands. 他赤手空拳地干活。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_4","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"catholic","back":"释义\na. 普遍的，广泛的，包罗万象的；大写 Catholic 天主教的\n词根词缀\n希腊语 kata- 完全 + holos 整体 → 遍及整体的、广泛的\n助记\nCatholic n./a.天主教徒（的）；catholicity n.普遍性；同 universal, broad\n例句\nShe has ==catholic== tastes in music. 她的音乐口味广泛。","fields":{"Front":"catholic","Back":"释义\na. 普遍的，广泛的，包罗万象的；大写 Catholic 天主教的\n词根词缀\n希腊语 kata- 完全 + holos 整体 → 遍及整体的、广泛的\n助记\nCatholic n./a.天主教徒（的）；catholicity n.普遍性；同 universal, broad\n例句\nShe has ==catholic== tastes in music. 她的音乐口味广泛。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_5","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"contributory","back":"释义\na. 促成的，有助于…的，起作用的；分担的\n词根词缀\ncontribute 贡献、促成（con- + tribut 给予）+ -ory → 起促成作用的\n助记\ncontribute v.贡献；contribution n.贡献；tribute n.贡物；同 contributing\n例句\nSmoking is a major ==contributory== cause of heart disease. 吸烟是心脏病的主要诱因之一。","fields":{"Front":"contributory","Back":"释义\na. 促成的，有助于…的，起作用的；分担的\n词根词缀\ncontribute 贡献、促成（con- + tribut 给予）+ -ory → 起促成作用的\n助记\ncontribute v.贡献；contribution n.贡献；tribute n.贡物；同 contributing\n例句\nSmoking is a major ==contributory== cause of heart disease. 吸烟是心脏病的主要诱因之一。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_6","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"finalize","back":"释义\nv. 完成，确定，最终定下，定稿\n词根词缀\nfinal 最终的（fin 界限、结束）+ -ize 使 → 使之最终确定\n助记\nfinal a.最终的；finale n.终曲；finish v.完成；同 complete, conclude\n例句\nWe hope to ==finalize== the contract by Friday. 我们希望周五前敲定合同。","fields":{"Front":"finalize","Back":"释义\nv. 完成，确定，最终定下，定稿\n词根词缀\nfinal 最终的（fin 界限、结束）+ -ize 使 → 使之最终确定\n助记\nfinal a.最终的；finale n.终曲；finish v.完成；同 complete, conclude\n例句\nWe hope to ==finalize== the contract by Friday. 我们希望周五前敲定合同。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_7","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"notify","back":"释义\nv. 通知，告知，报告，使知晓\n词根词缀\nnot 知道、标记（note）+ -ify 使 → 使知道 → 通知\n助记\nnote n.笔记；notice n.通知；notification n.通知；同 inform, advise\n例句\nPlease ==notify== us of any change of address. 地址如有变动请通知我们。","fields":{"Front":"notify","Back":"释义\nv. 通知，告知，报告，使知晓\n词根词缀\nnot 知道、标记（note）+ -ify 使 → 使知道 → 通知\n助记\nnote n.笔记；notice n.通知；notification n.通知；同 inform, advise\n例句\nPlease ==notify== us of any change of address. 地址如有变动请通知我们。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_8","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"obsess","back":"释义\nv. 使着迷，使心神不宁，萦绕心头\n词根词缀\nob- 对着、加强 + sess 坐 → 一直坐在心头、挥之不去\n助记\nobsession n.痴迷；obsessive a.迷恋的；同 preoccupy, haunt\n例句\nShe is ==obsessed== with becoming a dancer. 她一心想成为舞者。","fields":{"Front":"obsess","Back":"释义\nv. 使着迷，使心神不宁，萦绕心头\n词根词缀\nob- 对着、加强 + sess 坐 → 一直坐在心头、挥之不去\n助记\nobsession n.痴迷；obsessive a.迷恋的；同 preoccupy, haunt\n例句\nShe is ==obsessed== with becoming a dancer. 她一心想成为舞者。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_9","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"offset","back":"释义\nv./n. 补偿，抵消，弥补\n词根词缀\noff 离开 + set 放置 → 对着放、相抵\n助记\nset off 出发、抵消；同 compensate for, counterbalance, make up for\n例句\nHigher wages ==offset== the rise in living costs. 加薪抵消了生活成本的上涨。","fields":{"Front":"offset","Back":"释义\nv./n. 补偿，抵消，弥补\n词根词缀\noff 离开 + set 放置 → 对着放、相抵\n助记\nset off 出发、抵消；同 compensate for, counterbalance, make up for\n例句\nHigher wages ==offset== the rise in living costs. 加薪抵消了生活成本的上涨。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_10","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"outrageously","back":"释义\nad. 骇人地，惊人地；极，异常地；蛮横地\n词根词缀\noutrage 暴行、震怒（out + rage 狂怒）+ -ous + -ly\n助记\noutrage n.暴行、震怒；outrageous a.骇人的；同 shockingly, scandalously\n例句\nThe hotel charged ==outrageously== high prices. 这家酒店要价高得离谱。","fields":{"Front":"outrageously","Back":"释义\nad. 骇人地，惊人地；极，异常地；蛮横地\n词根词缀\noutrage 暴行、震怒（out + rage 狂怒）+ -ous + -ly\n助记\noutrage n.暴行、震怒；outrageous a.骇人的；同 shockingly, scandalously\n例句\nThe hotel charged ==outrageously== high prices. 这家酒店要价高得离谱。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_11","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"overt","back":"释义\na. 公开的，明显的，公然的，不加隐瞒的\n词根词缀\n古法语'打开的'（open 同源）；covert 隐蔽的（反义）\n助记\novertly ad.公开地；同 open, evident, manifest；反 covert, hidden\n例句\nThere was no ==overt== sign of disagreement. 没有明显的分歧迹象。","fields":{"Front":"overt","Back":"释义\na. 公开的，明显的，公然的，不加隐瞒的\n词根词缀\n古法语'打开的'（open 同源）；covert 隐蔽的（反义）\n助记\novertly ad.公开地；同 open, evident, manifest；反 covert, hidden\n例句\nThere was no ==overt== sign of disagreement. 没有明显的分歧迹象。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_12","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"particle","back":"释义\nn. 颗粒，微粒；粒子；极少量\n词根词缀\npart 部分、分 + -icle 指小 → 极小的一部分 → 微粒\n助记\npart n.部分；particular a.特定的；同 grain, speck, atom\n例句\nDust ==particles== floated in the sunlight. 尘埃微粒在阳光中飘浮。","fields":{"Front":"particle","Back":"释义\nn. 颗粒，微粒；粒子；极少量\n词根词缀\npart 部分、分 + -icle 指小 → 极小的一部分 → 微粒\n助记\npart n.部分；particular a.特定的；同 grain, speck, atom\n例句\nDust ==particles== floated in the sunlight. 尘埃微粒在阳光中飘浮。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_13","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"personnel","back":"释义\nn. 全体人员，员工，职员；人事部门\n词根词缀\nperson 人 + -nel 集合 → 全体人员（重音在末）\n助记\npersonal a.个人的（形近，重音前）；personnel manager 人事经理；同 staff, employees\n例句\nAll military ==personnel== must report for duty. 全体军事人员必须报到。","fields":{"Front":"personnel","Back":"释义\nn. 全体人员，员工，职员；人事部门\n词根词缀\nperson 人 + -nel 集合 → 全体人员（重音在末）\n助记\npersonal a.个人的（形近，重音前）；personnel manager 人事经理；同 staff, employees\n例句\nAll military ==personnel== must report for duty. 全体军事人员必须报到。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_14","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"puff","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 吹气，喘气，喷出；n. 一阵（风、烟）；泡芙；粉扑\n词根词缀\n拟声词，模拟吹气声\n助记\npuff out 吹胀；huff and puff 气喘吁吁；puff pastry 千层酥；同 blow, pant, gust\n例句\nHe was ==puffing== after running up the stairs. 跑上楼后他直喘气。","fields":{"Front":"puff","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 吹气，喘气，喷出；n. 一阵（风、烟）；泡芙；粉扑\n词根词缀\n拟声词，模拟吹气声\n助记\npuff out 吹胀；huff and puff 气喘吁吁；puff pastry 千层酥；同 blow, pant, gust\n例句\nHe was ==puffing== after running up the stairs. 跑上楼后他直喘气。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_15","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"retrospective","back":"释义\na./n. a. 回顾的，追溯的；n.（艺术家）回顾展\n词根词缀\nretro- 向后 + spect 看 + -ive → 向后看的\n助记\nretrospect n.回顾；in retrospect 回想起来；prospective a.预期的；同 backward-looking\n例句\nThe museum held a ==retrospective== of the painter's work. 博物馆举办了这位画家的回顾展。","fields":{"Front":"retrospective","Back":"释义\na./n. a. 回顾的，追溯的；n.（艺术家）回顾展\n词根词缀\nretro- 向后 + spect 看 + -ive → 向后看的\n助记\nretrospect n.回顾；in retrospect 回想起来；prospective a.预期的；同 backward-looking\n例句\nThe museum held a ==retrospective== of the painter's work. 博物馆举办了这位画家的回顾展。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_16","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"senior","back":"释义\na./n. a. 年长的，资深的，高级的；n. 高年级/毕业班学生；长辈\n词根词缀\nsen 老（senate 元老院）+ -ior 比较级 → 较年长的\n助记\nsenate n.参议院；seniority n.资历；反 junior 年幼的；senior citizen 老年人\n例句\nShe is a ==senior== editor at the publishing house. 她是出版社的资深编辑。","fields":{"Front":"senior","Back":"释义\na./n. a. 年长的，资深的，高级的；n. 高年级/毕业班学生；长辈\n词根词缀\nsen 老（senate 元老院）+ -ior 比较级 → 较年长的\n助记\nsenate n.参议院；seniority n.资历；反 junior 年幼的；senior citizen 老年人\n例句\nShe is a ==senior== editor at the publishing house. 她是出版社的资深编辑。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_17","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"sticky","back":"释义\na. 黏的，黏性的；（天气）湿热的；棘手的\n词根词缀\nstick 粘贴、粘住 + -y → 黏糊糊的\n助记\nstick v.粘贴；sticker n.贴纸；a sticky situation 棘手局面；同 adhesive, gluey\n例句\nHis fingers were ==sticky== with honey. 他的手指沾了蜂蜜，黏糊糊的。","fields":{"Front":"sticky","Back":"释义\na. 黏的，黏性的；（天气）湿热的；棘手的\n词根词缀\nstick 粘贴、粘住 + -y → 黏糊糊的\n助记\nstick v.粘贴；sticker n.贴纸；a sticky situation 棘手局面；同 adhesive, gluey\n例句\nHis fingers were ==sticky== with honey. 他的手指沾了蜂蜜，黏糊糊的。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_18","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"strenuous","back":"释义\na. 费力的，艰辛的，繁重的；精力充沛的，奋发的\n词根词缀\nstren (=strength) 力量 + -uous → 需要大力气的\n助记\nstrength n.力量；strenuously ad.奋力地；同 arduous, vigorous, energetic；反 easy\n例句\nAvoid ==strenuous== exercise after a meal. 饭后避免剧烈运动。","fields":{"Front":"strenuous","Back":"释义\na. 费力的，艰辛的，繁重的；精力充沛的，奋发的\n词根词缀\nstren (=strength) 力量 + -uous → 需要大力气的\n助记\nstrength n.力量；strenuously ad.奋力地；同 arduous, vigorous, energetic；反 easy\n例句\nAvoid ==strenuous== exercise after a meal. 饭后避免剧烈运动。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_19","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"survey","back":"释义\nv./n. 调查，勘测，测量；俯瞰，纵览；概述\n词根词缀\nsur- 在上 + vey (=vid) 看 → 从上往下看 → 俯瞰、勘测\n助记\nsurveyor n.测量员；surveillance n.监视；同 poll, inspect, review\n例句\nThe report ==surveys== recent trends in education. 该报告纵览教育领域的最新趋势。","fields":{"Front":"survey","Back":"释义\nv./n. 调查，勘测，测量；俯瞰，纵览；概述\n词根词缀\nsur- 在上 + vey (=vid) 看 → 从上往下看 → 俯瞰、勘测\n助记\nsurveyor n.测量员；surveillance n.监视；同 poll, inspect, review\n例句\nThe report ==surveys== recent trends in education. 该报告纵览教育领域的最新趋势。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_20","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"utter","back":"释义\nv./a. v. 发出（声音），说，讲；a. 完全的，彻底的，绝对的\n词根词缀\n古英语'向外、完全'；utterly ad.完全地\n助记\nutterly ad.完全地；utterance n.话语；同 express, voice；absolute, total\n例句\nShe did not ==utter== a single word all evening. 她整晚一言未发。","fields":{"Front":"utter","Back":"释义\nv./a. v. 发出（声音），说，讲；a. 完全的，彻底的，绝对的\n词根词缀\n古英语'向外、完全'；utterly ad.完全地\n助记\nutterly ad.完全地；utterance n.话语；同 express, voice；absolute, total\n例句\nShe did not ==utter== a single word all evening. 她整晚一言未发。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_21","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"avenge","back":"释义\nv. 为…报仇，复仇，报复，雪耻\n词根词缀\na- (=ad) 对 + venge 报仇（vengeance）→ 讨回公道\n助记\nrevenge n.报复；vengeance n.复仇；avenger n.复仇者；区别 revenge 多为私怨泄愤\n例句\nHe swore to ==avenge== his father's death. 他发誓要为父亲的死报仇。","fields":{"Front":"avenge","Back":"释义\nv. 为…报仇，复仇，报复，雪耻\n词根词缀\na- (=ad) 对 + venge 报仇（vengeance）→ 讨回公道\n助记\nrevenge n.报复；vengeance n.复仇；avenger n.复仇者；区别 revenge 多为私怨泄愤\n例句\nHe swore to ==avenge== his father's death. 他发誓要为父亲的死报仇。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_22","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"backlighting","back":"释义\nn. 逆光，背光（光源在主体后方）\n词根词缀\nback 背后 + light 光 + -ing → 从背后打的光\n助记\nbacklight n.背光；backlit a.逆光的；front light 正面光\n例句\nThe portrait used soft ==backlighting== around her hair. 这张肖像在她发丝周围用了柔和逆光。","fields":{"Front":"backlighting","Back":"释义\nn. 逆光，背光（光源在主体后方）\n词根词缀\nback 背后 + light 光 + -ing → 从背后打的光\n助记\nbacklight n.背光；backlit a.逆光的；front light 正面光\n例句\nThe portrait used soft ==backlighting== around her hair. 这张肖像在她发丝周围用了柔和逆光。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_23","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"brief","back":"释义\na./n./v. a. 简短的，短暂的；n. 摘要，简报；（律师）案情陈述；v. 向…简要介绍\n词根词缀\nbrief 短（brevity 简短）；in brief 简言之\n助记\nbriefly ad.简短地；brevity n.简洁；briefcase n.公文包；同 short, concise；反 long\n例句\nHe gave a ==brief== introduction to the course. 他对课程做了简短介绍。","fields":{"Front":"brief","Back":"释义\na./n./v. a. 简短的，短暂的；n. 摘要，简报；（律师）案情陈述；v. 向…简要介绍\n词根词缀\nbrief 短（brevity 简短）；in brief 简言之\n助记\nbriefly ad.简短地；brevity n.简洁；briefcase n.公文包；同 short, concise；反 long\n例句\nHe gave a ==brief== introduction to the course. 他对课程做了简短介绍。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_24","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"compile","back":"释义\nv. 汇编，编纂，编辑；编译（程序）\n词根词缀\ncom- 一起 + pil 收集、掠夺（pile 堆）→ 搜集到一起编纂\n助记\ncompiler n.编纂者、编译器；compilation n.汇编；同 assemble, gather, edit\n例句\nIt took years to ==compile== the dictionary. 编纂这本词典花了多年时间。","fields":{"Front":"compile","Back":"释义\nv. 汇编，编纂，编辑；编译（程序）\n词根词缀\ncom- 一起 + pil 收集、掠夺（pile 堆）→ 搜集到一起编纂\n助记\ncompiler n.编纂者、编译器；compilation n.汇编；同 assemble, gather, edit\n例句\nIt took years to ==compile== the dictionary. 编纂这本词典花了多年时间。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_25","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"compound","back":"释义\nn./a./v. n. 化合物，复合物，大院；a. 复合的；v. 使加重，混合\n词根词缀\ncom- 一起 + pound (=pos) 放 → 放在一起 → 复合\n助记\ncompound eye 复眼；compound a problem 使问题加剧；compound interest 复利\n例句\nHoney is a ==compound== of several natural substances. 蜂蜜是多种天然物质的混合物。","fields":{"Front":"compound","Back":"释义\nn./a./v. n. 化合物，复合物，大院；a. 复合的；v. 使加重，混合\n词根词缀\ncom- 一起 + pound (=pos) 放 → 放在一起 → 复合\n助记\ncompound eye 复眼；compound a problem 使问题加剧；compound interest 复利\n例句\nHoney is a ==compound== of several natural substances. 蜂蜜是多种天然物质的混合物。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_26","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"consistency","back":"释义\nn. 一致性，连贯性，前后统一；浓度，黏稠度\n词根词缀\nconsist 由…组成、一致（con- + sist 站）+ -ency → 始终如一\n助记\nconsist v.组成；consistent a.一致的；consistently ad.一贯；同 uniformity；反 inconsistency\n例句\nHer work shows great skill but lacks ==consistency== . 她的作品技巧很好，但不够稳定。","fields":{"Front":"consistency","Back":"释义\nn. 一致性，连贯性，前后统一；浓度，黏稠度\n词根词缀\nconsist 由…组成、一致（con- + sist 站）+ -ency → 始终如一\n助记\nconsist v.组成；consistent a.一致的；consistently ad.一贯；同 uniformity；反 inconsistency\n例句\nHer work shows great skill but lacks ==consistency== . 她的作品技巧很好，但不够稳定。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_27","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"depress","back":"释义\nv. 使沮丧，使消沉；压低，按下；使萧条\n词根词缀\nde- 向下 + press 压 → 向下压 → 使消沉、萧条\n助记\npress v.压；depression n.沮丧、萧条；depressed a.沮丧的；同 sadden, dishearten\n例句\nThe rainy weather always ==depresses== me. 阴雨天总让我情绪低落。","fields":{"Front":"depress","Back":"释义\nv. 使沮丧，使消沉；压低，按下；使萧条\n词根词缀\nde- 向下 + press 压 → 向下压 → 使消沉、萧条\n助记\npress v.压；depression n.沮丧、萧条；depressed a.沮丧的；同 sadden, dishearten\n例句\nThe rainy weather always ==depresses== me. 阴雨天总让我情绪低落。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_28","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"downtown","back":"释义\nad./n./a. 在/往市中心（的），商业区（的）\n词根词缀\ndown 向下（城镇低处）+ town 镇 → 城镇中心区\n助记\nuptown ad.在城郊住宅区；city center 市中心；downtown area 商业区\n例句\nThey went ==downtown== to do some shopping. 他们去市中心购物。","fields":{"Front":"downtown","Back":"释义\nad./n./a. 在/往市中心（的），商业区（的）\n词根词缀\ndown 向下（城镇低处）+ town 镇 → 城镇中心区\n助记\nuptown ad.在城郊住宅区；city center 市中心；downtown area 商业区\n例句\nThey went ==downtown== to do some shopping. 他们去市中心购物。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_29","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"ensure","back":"释义\nv. 确保，保证，担保，使安全\n词根词缀\nen- 使 + sure 确定、可靠 → 使之确定\n助记\nsure a.确定的；insure v.投保；assure v.使确信；同 make certain, guarantee\n例句\nPlease ==ensure== that all doors are locked. 请确保所有门都锁好。","fields":{"Front":"ensure","Back":"释义\nv. 确保，保证，担保，使安全\n词根词缀\nen- 使 + sure 确定、可靠 → 使之确定\n助记\nsure a.确定的；insure v.投保；assure v.使确信；同 make certain, guarantee\n例句\nPlease ==ensure== that all doors are locked. 请确保所有门都锁好。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_30","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"exalt","back":"释义\nv. 提升，提拔；高度赞扬，使狂喜\n词根词缀\nex- 向上、出 + alt 高（altitude）→ 抬高、颂扬\n助记\naltitude n.高度；exalted a.高贵的、崇高的；exaltation n.狂喜；同 praise, elevate\n例句\nThe poem ==exalts== the beauty of nature. 这首诗颂扬自然之美。","fields":{"Front":"exalt","Back":"释义\nv. 提升，提拔；高度赞扬，使狂喜\n词根词缀\nex- 向上、出 + alt 高（altitude）→ 抬高、颂扬\n助记\naltitude n.高度；exalted a.高贵的、崇高的；exaltation n.狂喜；同 praise, elevate\n例句\nThe poem ==exalts== the beauty of nature. 这首诗颂扬自然之美。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_31","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"exodus","back":"释义\nn. 大批离去，成群外出，（人才）外流\n词根词缀\n希腊语 exodos'ex 出 + hodos 路'；源自《出埃及记》\n助记\nExodus《出埃及记》；同 departure, migration；反 influx, arrival\n例句\nThe war caused a mass ==exodus== of refugees. 战争导致难民大批外流。","fields":{"Front":"exodus","Back":"释义\nn. 大批离去，成群外出，（人才）外流\n词根词缀\n希腊语 exodos'ex 出 + hodos 路'；源自《出埃及记》\n助记\nExodus《出埃及记》；同 departure, migration；反 influx, arrival\n例句\nThe war caused a mass ==exodus== of refugees. 战争导致难民大批外流。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_32","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"gallery","back":"释义\nn. 美术馆，画廊；楼座，走廊；（射击）靶道\n词根词缀\ngal- 长廊 + -lery 场所 → 供陈列/通行的长廊\n助记\nart gallery 美术馆；press gallery 记者席；play to the gallery 哗众取宠\n例句\nHer paintings are on show at a London ==gallery== . 她的画作在伦敦一家画廊展出。","fields":{"Front":"gallery","Back":"释义\nn. 美术馆，画廊；楼座，走廊；（射击）靶道\n词根词缀\ngal- 长廊 + -lery 场所 → 供陈列/通行的长廊\n助记\nart gallery 美术馆；press gallery 记者席；play to the gallery 哗众取宠\n例句\nHer paintings are on show at a London ==gallery== . 她的画作在伦敦一家画廊展出。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_33","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"gush","back":"释义\nv./n. 涌出，喷出，迸出；滔滔不绝、过分热情地说\n词根词缀\n拟声'喷涌'；gush over 极力赞叹\n助记\ngusher n.喷油井；gushing a.过分热情的；同 pour, spout, stream\n例句\nOil ==gushed== from the broken pipe. 油从破裂的管道喷涌而出。","fields":{"Front":"gush","Back":"释义\nv./n. 涌出，喷出，迸出；滔滔不绝、过分热情地说\n词根词缀\n拟声'喷涌'；gush over 极力赞叹\n助记\ngusher n.喷油井；gushing a.过分热情的；同 pour, spout, stream\n例句\nOil ==gushed== from the broken pipe. 油从破裂的管道喷涌而出。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_34","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"instill","back":"释义\nv. 逐渐灌输（思想、情感），徐徐滴入\n词根词缀\nin- 进入 + still 滴（distill 蒸馏）→ 一滴滴注入 → 灌输\n助记\ndistill v.蒸馏；still n.蒸馏器；instillation n.灌输；同 implant, infuse\n例句\nParents should ==instill== confidence in their children. 父母应逐渐给孩子灌输自信。","fields":{"Front":"instill","Back":"释义\nv. 逐渐灌输（思想、情感），徐徐滴入\n词根词缀\nin- 进入 + still 滴（distill 蒸馏）→ 一滴滴注入 → 灌输\n助记\ndistill v.蒸馏；still n.蒸馏器；instillation n.灌输；同 implant, infuse\n例句\nParents should ==instill== confidence in their children. 父母应逐渐给孩子灌输自信。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_35","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"languish","back":"释义\nv. 衰弱，憔悴，萎靡；受煎熬，被忽视，凋萎\n词根词缀\nlangu 虚弱、倦怠（languid）+ -ish → 变得萎靡\n助记\nlanguid a.倦怠的；languor n.慵懒；同 weaken, pine, wither；反 flourish\n例句\nThe plants ==languished== in the hot dry soil. 植物在干热的土里蔫了。","fields":{"Front":"languish","Back":"释义\nv. 衰弱，憔悴，萎靡；受煎熬，被忽视，凋萎\n词根词缀\nlangu 虚弱、倦怠（languid）+ -ish → 变得萎靡\n助记\nlanguid a.倦怠的；languor n.慵懒；同 weaken, pine, wither；反 flourish\n例句\nThe plants ==languished== in the hot dry soil. 植物在干热的土里蔫了。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_36","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"optimistic","back":"释义\na. 乐观的，乐观主义的，有信心的\n词根词缀\noptimist 乐观者（optim 最好，optimum）+ -ic → 往最好处想的\n助记\noptimism n.乐观；optimum n.最佳；optimize v.优化；反 pessimistic 悲观的\n例句\nShe is ==optimistic== about her exam results. 她对考试成绩很乐观。","fields":{"Front":"optimistic","Back":"释义\na. 乐观的，乐观主义的，有信心的\n词根词缀\noptimist 乐观者（optim 最好，optimum）+ -ic → 往最好处想的\n助记\noptimism n.乐观；optimum n.最佳；optimize v.优化；反 pessimistic 悲观的\n例句\nShe is ==optimistic== about her exam results. 她对考试成绩很乐观。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_37","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"predispose","back":"释义\nv. 使预先有倾向，使偏向；使易感染/患病\n词根词缀\npre- 预先 + dispose 安排、倾向（dis- + pos 放）→ 事先就偏向\n助记\ndispose v.安排；predisposition n.倾向、禀赋；同 incline, make susceptible\n例句\nLack of exercise may ==predispose== people to illness. 缺乏运动可能使人容易生病。","fields":{"Front":"predispose","Back":"释义\nv. 使预先有倾向，使偏向；使易感染/患病\n词根词缀\npre- 预先 + dispose 安排、倾向（dis- + pos 放）→ 事先就偏向\n助记\ndispose v.安排；predisposition n.倾向、禀赋；同 incline, make susceptible\n例句\nLack of exercise may ==predispose== people to illness. 缺乏运动可能使人容易生病。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_38","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"prodigious","back":"释义\na. 巨大的，庞大的；惊人的，非凡的\n词根词缀\nprodigy 奇才、奇观（pro- 预兆 + ig 引导）+ -ous → 令人惊叹的\n助记\nprodigy n.天才、奇观；同 enormous, immense, marvelous；反 ordinary, tiny\n例句\nHe has a ==prodigious== memory for dates. 他对日期有惊人的记忆力。","fields":{"Front":"prodigious","Back":"释义\na. 巨大的，庞大的；惊人的，非凡的\n词根词缀\nprodigy 奇才、奇观（pro- 预兆 + ig 引导）+ -ous → 令人惊叹的\n助记\nprodigy n.天才、奇观；同 enormous, immense, marvelous；反 ordinary, tiny\n例句\nHe has a ==prodigious== memory for dates. 他对日期有惊人的记忆力。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_39","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"ravage","back":"释义\nv./n. 毁坏，蹂躏，严重破坏，劫掠\n词根词缀\nrav(=rape 掠夺、攫取) + -age → 大肆破坏\n助记\nravages n.破坏的痕迹；raven v.掠夺；同 devastate, destroy, plunder；反 preserve\n例句\nWar ==ravaged== the small country. 战争蹂躏了这个小国。","fields":{"Front":"ravage","Back":"释义\nv./n. 毁坏，蹂躏，严重破坏，劫掠\n词根词缀\nrav(=rape 掠夺、攫取) + -age → 大肆破坏\n助记\nravages n.破坏的痕迹；raven v.掠夺；同 devastate, destroy, plunder；反 preserve\n例句\nWar ==ravaged== the small country. 战争蹂躏了这个小国。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_40","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"soluble","back":"释义\na. 可溶的，能溶解的；可解决的\n词根词缀\nsolu 松开、溶解（solve）+ -ble 可…的 → 能化开的\n助记\nsolve v.解决；solution n.溶液、解决；dissolve v.溶解；insoluble a.不可溶的\n例句\nThese tablets are ==soluble== in water. 这些药片可溶于水。","fields":{"Front":"soluble","Back":"释义\na. 可溶的，能溶解的；可解决的\n词根词缀\nsolu 松开、溶解（solve）+ -ble 可…的 → 能化开的\n助记\nsolve v.解决；solution n.溶液、解决；dissolve v.溶解；insoluble a.不可溶的\n例句\nThese tablets are ==soluble== in water. 这些药片可溶于水。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_41","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"subject","back":"释义\nn./a./v. n. 主题，科目，臣民；a. 受支配的，易遭…的；v. 使遭受，使服从\n词根词缀\nsub- 在下 + ject 投掷、放置 → 置于…之下\n助记\nobject n.物体；project n.项目；be subject to 易受…；subject to 使经受\n例句\nAll flights are ==subject== to delay in fog. 大雾天所有航班都可能延误。","fields":{"Front":"subject","Back":"释义\nn./a./v. n. 主题，科目，臣民；a. 受支配的，易遭…的；v. 使遭受，使服从\n词根词缀\nsub- 在下 + ject 投掷、放置 → 置于…之下\n助记\nobject n.物体；project n.项目；be subject to 易受…；subject to 使经受\n例句\nAll flights are ==subject== to delay in fog. 大雾天所有航班都可能延误。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_42","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"typify","back":"释义\nv. 代表，象征，是…的典型，具有…特点\n词根词缀\ntype 类型、典型 + -ify 使 → 成为…的典型\n助记\ntype n.类型；typical a.典型的；typification n.典型化；同 represent, characterize\n例句\nThese old houses ==typify== the local architecture. 这些老宅是当地建筑的典型代表。","fields":{"Front":"typify","Back":"释义\nv. 代表，象征，是…的典型，具有…特点\n词根词缀\ntype 类型、典型 + -ify 使 → 成为…的典型\n助记\ntype n.类型；typical a.典型的；typification n.典型化；同 represent, characterize\n例句\nThese old houses ==typify== the local architecture. 这些老宅是当地建筑的典型代表。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_43","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"aroma","back":"释义\nn. 芳香，香气，香味；韵味，气息\n词根词缀\n希腊/拉丁语'香料、香气'；aromatic a.芳香的\n助记\naromatic a.芳香的；同 fragrance, scent, perfume；aroma 多指食物/咖啡香\n例句\nThe kitchen was filled with the ==aroma== of fresh coffee. 厨房里弥漫着新鲜咖啡的香气。","fields":{"Front":"aroma","Back":"释义\nn. 芳香，香气，香味；韵味，气息\n词根词缀\n希腊/拉丁语'香料、香气'；aromatic a.芳香的\n助记\naromatic a.芳香的；同 fragrance, scent, perfume；aroma 多指食物/咖啡香\n例句\nThe kitchen was filled with the ==aroma== of fresh coffee. 厨房里弥漫着新鲜咖啡的香气。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_44","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"benefit","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 益处，好处；福利，救济金；v. 有益于，受益，得益\n词根词缀\nbene- 善、好（benediction 祝福）+ fit 做 → 做好事、益处\n助记\nbeneficial a.有益的；benefactor n.捐助人；benevolent a.仁慈的；同 advantage, profit；反 harm\n例句\nRegular exercise ==benefits== both body and mind. 经常锻炼对身心都有益。","fields":{"Front":"benefit","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 益处，好处；福利，救济金；v. 有益于，受益，得益\n词根词缀\nbene- 善、好（benediction 祝福）+ fit 做 → 做好事、益处\n助记\nbeneficial a.有益的；benefactor n.捐助人；benevolent a.仁慈的；同 advantage, profit；反 harm\n例句\nRegular exercise ==benefits== both body and mind. 经常锻炼对身心都有益。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_45","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"cube","back":"释义\nn./v. 立方体，方块；立方（三次方）；v. 切成方块，求立方\n词根词缀\n希腊语 kubos'立方体、骰子'；cubic a.立方的\n助记\ncubic a.立方体的；cubism n.立体主义；square n.正方形（二维）\n例句\nAdd a few ice ==cubes== to the drink. 往饮料里加几块冰块。","fields":{"Front":"cube","Back":"释义\nn./v. 立方体，方块；立方（三次方）；v. 切成方块，求立方\n词根词缀\n希腊语 kubos'立方体、骰子'；cubic a.立方的\n助记\ncubic a.立方体的；cubism n.立体主义；square n.正方形（二维）\n例句\nAdd a few ice ==cubes== to the drink. 往饮料里加几块冰块。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_46","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"deception","back":"释义\nn. 欺骗，蒙蔽，骗术，诡计\n词根词缀\ndeceive 欺骗（de- 离开 + ceive 拿、抓）+ -ption → 引人上当\n助记\ndeceive v.欺骗；deceit n.欺骗；deceptive a.迷惑人的；同 fraud, trickery；反 honesty\n例句\nHe obtained the money by ==deception== . 他靠欺骗弄到那笔钱。","fields":{"Front":"deception","Back":"释义\nn. 欺骗，蒙蔽，骗术，诡计\n词根词缀\ndeceive 欺骗（de- 离开 + ceive 拿、抓）+ -ption → 引人上当\n助记\ndeceive v.欺骗；deceit n.欺骗；deceptive a.迷惑人的；同 fraud, trickery；反 honesty\n例句\nHe obtained the money by ==deception== . 他靠欺骗弄到那笔钱。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_47","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"dictate","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 口述（让人记录），听写；命令，支配；n. 命令，指令\n词根词缀\ndict 说、断言（dictionary）+ -ate → 口授、发号施令\n助记\ndictation n.听写、口述；dictator n.独裁者；predict v.预言；同 order, prescribe\n例句\nShe ==dictated== a letter to her secretary. 她向秘书口述一封信。","fields":{"Front":"dictate","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 口述（让人记录），听写；命令，支配；n. 命令，指令\n词根词缀\ndict 说、断言（dictionary）+ -ate → 口授、发号施令\n助记\ndictation n.听写、口述；dictator n.独裁者；predict v.预言；同 order, prescribe\n例句\nShe ==dictated== a letter to her secretary. 她向秘书口述一封信。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_48","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"dissenter","back":"释义\nn. 持异议者，反对者，不同意的人\n词根词缀\ndissent 异议（dis- 分开 + sent 感觉、赞同）+ -er 人 → 意见不同者\n助记\ndissent v.异议；consent v.同意；assent v.赞成；同 dissident, objector；反 conformist\n例句\nThe law was passed despite objections from ==dissenters== . 尽管有反对者，法律仍获通过。","fields":{"Front":"dissenter","Back":"释义\nn. 持异议者，反对者，不同意的人\n词根词缀\ndissent 异议（dis- 分开 + sent 感觉、赞同）+ -er 人 → 意见不同者\n助记\ndissent v.异议；consent v.同意；assent v.赞成；同 dissident, objector；反 conformist\n例句\nThe law was passed despite objections from ==dissenters== . 尽管有反对者，法律仍获通过。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_49","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"eclecticism","back":"释义\nn. 折中主义，兼收并蓄，博采众长\n词根词缀\neclectic 折中（ec- 出 + lect 选）+ -ism → 从各家中挑选的做法\n助记\neclectic a.兼收并蓄的；select v.挑选；collect v.收集；反 exclusivism\n例句\nHer design is a form of stylish ==eclecticism== . 她的设计是一种时髦的折中主义。","fields":{"Front":"eclecticism","Back":"释义\nn. 折中主义，兼收并蓄，博采众长\n词根词缀\neclectic 折中（ec- 出 + lect 选）+ -ism → 从各家中挑选的做法\n助记\neclectic a.兼收并蓄的；select v.挑选；collect v.收集；反 exclusivism\n例句\nHer design is a form of stylish ==eclecticism== . 她的设计是一种时髦的折中主义。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_50","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"elective","back":"释义\na./n. a. 选修的，可选择的；选举的；n. 选修课\n词根词缀\nelect 选举、选择（e- 出 + lect 选）+ -ive → 可选择的\n助记\nelect v.选举；election n.选举；select v.挑选；compulsory/required 必修的（反义）\n例句\nShe chose photography as her ==elective== . 她选摄影作为选修课。","fields":{"Front":"elective","Back":"释义\na./n. a. 选修的，可选择的；选举的；n. 选修课\n词根词缀\nelect 选举、选择（e- 出 + lect 选）+ -ive → 可选择的\n助记\nelect v.选举；election n.选举；select v.挑选；compulsory/required 必修的（反义）\n例句\nShe chose photography as her ==elective== . 她选摄影作为选修课。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_51","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"embody","back":"释义\nv. 体现，使具体化，具体表达；包含，收录\n词根词缀\nem- 使进入 + body 身体、实体 → 赋予实体、体现\n助记\nbody n.身体；embodiment n.化身、体现；同 represent, express, incorporate\n例句\nThe statue ==embodies== the spirit of freedom. 这座雕像体现了自由精神。","fields":{"Front":"embody","Back":"释义\nv. 体现，使具体化，具体表达；包含，收录\n词根词缀\nem- 使进入 + body 身体、实体 → 赋予实体、体现\n助记\nbody n.身体；embodiment n.化身、体现；同 represent, express, incorporate\n例句\nThe statue ==embodies== the spirit of freedom. 这座雕像体现了自由精神。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_52","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"fade","back":"释义\nv. 褪色，凋谢；逐渐消失，变暗，衰退\n词根词缀\n古法语 fader'变淡、失去生气'（fad 平淡）\n助记\nfaded a.褪色的；fade away 逐渐消失；fade out 淡出；同 dim, wither；反 brighten\n例句\nThe bright colors had ==faded== in the sun. 鲜艳的颜色在阳光下褪了。","fields":{"Front":"fade","Back":"释义\nv. 褪色，凋谢；逐渐消失，变暗，衰退\n词根词缀\n古法语 fader'变淡、失去生气'（fad 平淡）\n助记\nfaded a.褪色的；fade away 逐渐消失；fade out 淡出；同 dim, wither；反 brighten\n例句\nThe bright colors had ==faded== in the sun. 鲜艳的颜色在阳光下褪了。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_53","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"friction","back":"释义\nn. 摩擦（力）；冲突，不和，摩擦\n词根词缀\nfric 摩擦（fricare）+ -tion → 摩擦、摩擦生隙\n助记\nfricative n.摩擦音；同 rubbing, abrasion, conflict, discord；反 harmony\n例句\n==Friction== between the two families lasted for years. 两家人之间的不和持续多年。","fields":{"Front":"friction","Back":"释义\nn. 摩擦（力）；冲突，不和，摩擦\n词根词缀\nfric 摩擦（fricare）+ -tion → 摩擦、摩擦生隙\n助记\nfricative n.摩擦音；同 rubbing, abrasion, conflict, discord；反 harmony\n例句\n==Friction== between the two families lasted for years. 两家人之间的不和持续多年。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_54","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"highlight","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 强调，突出，照亮；n. 最精彩/最重要部分；高光\n词根词缀\nhigh 高 + light 光 → 用高光照亮、突出\n助记\nhighlighter n.荧光笔；spotlight n.聚光灯；同 emphasize, stress, feature\n例句\nThe report ==highlights== the need for reform. 报告强调了改革的必要性。","fields":{"Front":"highlight","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 强调，突出，照亮；n. 最精彩/最重要部分；高光\n词根词缀\nhigh 高 + light 光 → 用高光照亮、突出\n助记\nhighlighter n.荧光笔；spotlight n.聚光灯；同 emphasize, stress, feature\n例句\nThe report ==highlights== the need for reform. 报告强调了改革的必要性。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_55","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"hoe","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 锄头；v. 锄地，松土，铲除\n词根词缀\n古法语 houe'锄'；动词为锄草松土\n助记\nhoe 形近 hug 拥抱；同 dig, weed；shovel n.铁锹\n例句\nShe was ==hoeing== the vegetable garden. 她在菜园里锄地。","fields":{"Front":"hoe","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 锄头；v. 锄地，松土，铲除\n词根词缀\n古法语 houe'锄'；动词为锄草松土\n助记\nhoe 形近 hug 拥抱；同 dig, weed；shovel n.铁锹\n例句\nShe was ==hoeing== the vegetable garden. 她在菜园里锄地。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_56","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"inviting","back":"释义\na. 诱人的，吸引人的，引人注目的，宜人的\n词根词缀\ninvite 邀请、招致 + -ing → 像在发出邀请的、诱人的\n助记\ninvite v.邀请；invitation n.邀请；同 appealing, tempting, attractive；反 uninviting\n例句\nThe cafe looked warm and ==inviting== . 这家咖啡馆看起来温暖又诱人。","fields":{"Front":"inviting","Back":"释义\na. 诱人的，吸引人的，引人注目的，宜人的\n词根词缀\ninvite 邀请、招致 + -ing → 像在发出邀请的、诱人的\n助记\ninvite v.邀请；invitation n.邀请；同 appealing, tempting, attractive；反 uninviting\n例句\nThe cafe looked warm and ==inviting== . 这家咖啡馆看起来温暖又诱人。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_57","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"niche","back":"释义\nn. 壁龛；合适的位置/职业；利基（细分）市场\n词根词缀\n法语'壁龛、小窝'（nest 相关）；find one's niche 找到合适位置\n助记\nniche market 小众市场；a niche in the wall 壁龛；同 recess, position, slot\n例句\nHe finally found his ==niche== in academic research. 他终于在学术研究中找到合适的位置。","fields":{"Front":"niche","Back":"释义\nn. 壁龛；合适的位置/职业；利基（细分）市场\n词根词缀\n法语'壁龛、小窝'（nest 相关）；find one's niche 找到合适位置\n助记\nniche market 小众市场；a niche in the wall 壁龛；同 recess, position, slot\n例句\nHe finally found his ==niche== in academic research. 他终于在学术研究中找到合适的位置。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_58","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"piracy","back":"释义\nn. 海盗行为；盗版，侵犯版权/专利权\n词根词缀\npirate 海盗、盗版者（pir 攻击、尝试）+ -cy 行为\n助记\npirate n.海盗 v.盗版；pirated a.盗版的；air piracy 劫机；同 robbery, plagiarism\n例句\nSoftware ==piracy== costs the industry billions. 软件盗版让该行业损失数十亿。","fields":{"Front":"piracy","Back":"释义\nn. 海盗行为；盗版，侵犯版权/专利权\n词根词缀\npirate 海盗、盗版者（pir 攻击、尝试）+ -cy 行为\n助记\npirate n.海盗 v.盗版；pirated a.盗版的；air piracy 劫机；同 robbery, plagiarism\n例句\nSoftware ==piracy== costs the industry billions. 软件盗版让该行业损失数十亿。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_59","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"plank","back":"释义\nn. 木板，厚板；（政党）政纲条目，政策要点\n词根词缀\n古法语 planche'平板'（plan 平）；plank 较 board 厚\n助记\nplanking n.铺板；walk the plank 走跳板（海盗）；同 board, timber\n例句\nThe floor was made of old oak ==planks== . 地板由旧橡木厚板铺成。","fields":{"Front":"plank","Back":"释义\nn. 木板，厚板；（政党）政纲条目，政策要点\n词根词缀\n古法语 planche'平板'（plan 平）；plank 较 board 厚\n助记\nplanking n.铺板；walk the plank 走跳板（海盗）；同 board, timber\n例句\nThe floor was made of old oak ==planks== . 地板由旧橡木厚板铺成。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_60","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"propel","back":"释义\nv. 推进，推动，驱动；激励，促使\n词根词缀\npro- 向前 + pel 推、驱动 → 向前推\n助记\npropeller n.螺旋桨；compel v.强迫；expel v.驱逐；同 drive, push forward；反 hinder\n例句\nA small engine ==propels== the boat. 一台小型发动机驱动这艘船。","fields":{"Front":"propel","Back":"释义\nv. 推进，推动，驱动；激励，促使\n词根词缀\npro- 向前 + pel 推、驱动 → 向前推\n助记\npropeller n.螺旋桨；compel v.强迫；expel v.驱逐；同 drive, push forward；反 hinder\n例句\nA small engine ==propels== the boat. 一台小型发动机驱动这艘船。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_61","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"stride","back":"释义\nv./n. 大步走，阔步行进；n. 大步，步幅；进展，进步\n词根词缀\n古英语 stridan'跨、大步走'；strode/stridden\n助记\ntake in one's stride 从容应对；make strides 取得进展；同 march, step\n例句\nHe ==strode== confidently onto the stage. 他自信地大步走上台。","fields":{"Front":"stride","Back":"释义\nv./n. 大步走，阔步行进；n. 大步，步幅；进展，进步\n词根词缀\n古英语 stridan'跨、大步走'；strode/stridden\n助记\ntake in one's stride 从容应对；make strides 取得进展；同 march, step\n例句\nHe ==strode== confidently onto the stage. 他自信地大步走上台。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_62","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"subtle","back":"释义\na. 微妙的，细微的，难以察觉的；精巧的，敏锐的\n词根词缀\nsub- 在下、精细 + tle (=tex) 编织 → 精细编织、不易察觉\n助记\nsubtly ad.微妙地；subtlety n.微妙；同 delicate, faint, cunning；反 obvious, blunt\n例句\nThere is a ==subtle== difference between the two words. 这两个词有细微差别。","fields":{"Front":"subtle","Back":"释义\na. 微妙的，细微的，难以察觉的；精巧的，敏锐的\n词根词缀\nsub- 在下、精细 + tle (=tex) 编织 → 精细编织、不易察觉\n助记\nsubtly ad.微妙地；subtlety n.微妙；同 delicate, faint, cunning；反 obvious, blunt\n例句\nThere is a ==subtle== difference between the two words. 这两个词有细微差别。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l6_63","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"wrinkle","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 皱纹，褶皱；v.（使）起皱，皱起\n词根词缀\n古英语/古诺斯语'皱褶'；wrinkled a.有皱纹的\n助记\nwrinkly a.皱的；wrinkle-free a.免烫的；同 crease, fold, line；smooth 抚平\n例句\nHer dress was ==wrinkled== after the long trip. 长途旅行后她的裙子皱巴巴的。","fields":{"Front":"wrinkle","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 皱纹，褶皱；v.（使）起皱，皱起\n词根词缀\n古英语/古诺斯语'皱褶'；wrinkled a.有皱纹的\n助记\nwrinkly a.皱的；wrinkle-free a.免烫的；同 crease, fold, line；smooth 抚平\n例句\nHer dress was ==wrinkled== after the long trip. 长途旅行后她的裙子皱巴巴的。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 6 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]}]},{"id":"toefl-list-7","name":"TOEFL 托福 › List 7","description":"托福核心词 · List 7（72 词 · 释义 + 词根词缀 + 助记 + 标黄例句）","createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["toefl","imported"],"options":{"newPerDay":null,"reviewsPerDay":null,"learningSteps":null,"relearningSteps":null,"graduatingInterval":null,"easyInterval":null,"leechThreshold":null,"leechAction":"","buryRelated":null,"maxInterval":null,"requestRetention":null,"newOrder":"","reviewOrder":""},"cards":[{"noteId":"toefl_l7_0","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"aerial","back":"释义\na./n. a. 空中的，航空的；空气的，高耸的；n. 天线\n词根词缀\naer 空气、空中（air）+ -ial → 空中的\n助记\nair n.空气；aerate v.充气；antenna n.天线；aerobic a.有氧的\n例句\nThey took an ==aerial== photograph of the island. 他们拍了岛屿的航空照片。","fields":{"Front":"aerial","Back":"释义\na./n. a. 空中的，航空的；空气的，高耸的；n. 天线\n词根词缀\naer 空气、空中（air）+ -ial → 空中的\n助记\nair n.空气；aerate v.充气；antenna n.天线；aerobic a.有氧的\n例句\nThey took an ==aerial== photograph of the island. 他们拍了岛屿的航空照片。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_1","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"affable","back":"释义\na. 和蔼可亲的，友善的，易接近的，亲切的\n词根词缀\naf- + fa (=fari 说) + -ble → 易于交谈的、亲切的\n助记\nfable n.寓言；affability n.和蔼；同 amiable, friendly, genial；反 unfriendly\n例句\nThe host was ==affable== to every guest. 主人对每位客人都和蔼可亲。","fields":{"Front":"affable","Back":"释义\na. 和蔼可亲的，友善的，易接近的，亲切的\n词根词缀\naf- + fa (=fari 说) + -ble → 易于交谈的、亲切的\n助记\nfable n.寓言；affability n.和蔼；同 amiable, friendly, genial；反 unfriendly\n例句\nThe host was ==affable== to every guest. 主人对每位客人都和蔼可亲。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_2","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"affirm","back":"释义\nv. 断言，肯定，证实，确认，申明\n词根词缀\naf- (=ad) 加强 + firm 坚固 → 坚定地说 → 断言\n助记\nfirm a.坚固的；affirmative a.肯定的；confirm v.确认；同 assert, declare；反 deny\n例句\nShe ==affirmed== that the report was accurate. 她肯定报告内容准确。","fields":{"Front":"affirm","Back":"释义\nv. 断言，肯定，证实，确认，申明\n词根词缀\naf- (=ad) 加强 + firm 坚固 → 坚定地说 → 断言\n助记\nfirm a.坚固的；affirmative a.肯定的；confirm v.确认；同 assert, declare；反 deny\n例句\nShe ==affirmed== that the report was accurate. 她肯定报告内容准确。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_3","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"animate","back":"释义\nv./a. v. 赋予生命，使有生气，激励；a. 有生命的，生气勃勃的\n词根词缀\nanim 生命、气息 + -ate → 给予生命\n助记\nanimal n.动物；inanimate a.无生命的；animation n.动画、活力；同 enliven, vitalize\n例句\nA smile suddenly ==animated== her face. 一个微笑让她的脸顿时生动起来。","fields":{"Front":"animate","Back":"释义\nv./a. v. 赋予生命，使有生气，激励；a. 有生命的，生气勃勃的\n词根词缀\nanim 生命、气息 + -ate → 给予生命\n助记\nanimal n.动物；inanimate a.无生命的；animation n.动画、活力；同 enliven, vitalize\n例句\nA smile suddenly ==animated== her face. 一个微笑让她的脸顿时生动起来。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_4","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"cardinal","back":"释义\na./n. a. 主要的，基本的；深红的；n. 红衣主教；基数；北美红雀\n词根词缀\ncardin 铰链、枢纽（card）+ -al → 像枢纽一样关键的\n助记\ncardinal number 基数；ordinal number 序数；cardinal vowel 基本元音；同 chief, principal\n例句\nExercise is one of the ==cardinal== rules of good health. 锻炼是健康的基本原则之一。","fields":{"Front":"cardinal","Back":"释义\na./n. a. 主要的，基本的；深红的；n. 红衣主教；基数；北美红雀\n词根词缀\ncardin 铰链、枢纽（card）+ -al → 像枢纽一样关键的\n助记\ncardinal number 基数；ordinal number 序数；cardinal vowel 基本元音；同 chief, principal\n例句\nExercise is one of the ==cardinal== rules of good health. 锻炼是健康的基本原则之一。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_5","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"charisma","back":"释义\nn. 魅力，感召力，超凡的个人气质\n词根词缀\n希腊语 kharisma'神授的恩典'（charis 恩惠）\n助记\ncharismatic a.有魅力的；同 charm, magnetism, appeal；charismatic leadership 魅力型领导\n例句\nThe leader spoke with great ==charisma== . 这位领导讲话极具感召力。","fields":{"Front":"charisma","Back":"释义\nn. 魅力，感召力，超凡的个人气质\n词根词缀\n希腊语 kharisma'神授的恩典'（charis 恩惠）\n助记\ncharismatic a.有魅力的；同 charm, magnetism, appeal；charismatic leadership 魅力型领导\n例句\nThe leader spoke with great ==charisma== . 这位领导讲话极具感召力。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_6","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"cohesive","back":"释义\na. 有黏合力的，凝聚的，团结的，有凝聚力的\n词根词缀\ncohere 黏合、连贯（co- 一起 + her 黏）+ -sive → 黏在一起的\n助记\ncohere v.黏合；cohesion n.凝聚力；adhere v.黏附；同 united, connected；反 divided\n例句\nThey formed a tight, ==cohesive== team. 他们组成一支紧密团结的队伍。","fields":{"Front":"cohesive","Back":"释义\na. 有黏合力的，凝聚的，团结的，有凝聚力的\n词根词缀\ncohere 黏合、连贯（co- 一起 + her 黏）+ -sive → 黏在一起的\n助记\ncohere v.黏合；cohesion n.凝聚力；adhere v.黏附；同 united, connected；反 divided\n例句\nThey formed a tight, ==cohesive== team. 他们组成一支紧密团结的队伍。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_7","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"compensate","back":"释义\nv. 补偿，赔偿，弥补，抵消，给报酬\n词根词缀\ncom- 一起 + pens 称量、支付（pension）+ -ate → 一起称量补足\n助记\ncompensation n.补偿、赔偿金；pension n.养老金；同 make up for, recompense\n例句\nNothing can ==compensate== for the loss of health. 什么也弥补不了失去健康。","fields":{"Front":"compensate","Back":"释义\nv. 补偿，赔偿，弥补，抵消，给报酬\n词根词缀\ncom- 一起 + pens 称量、支付（pension）+ -ate → 一起称量补足\n助记\ncompensation n.补偿、赔偿金；pension n.养老金；同 make up for, recompense\n例句\nNothing can ==compensate== for the loss of health. 什么也弥补不了失去健康。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_8","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"conceal","back":"释义\nv. 隐藏，隐瞒，遮住，掩盖\n词根词缀\ncon- 完全 + ceal (=cel) 隐藏 → 彻底藏起来\n助记\nconcealment n.隐藏；同 hide, cover, mask；反 reveal, expose\n例句\nHe could not ==conceal== his disappointment. 他无法掩饰失望。","fields":{"Front":"conceal","Back":"释义\nv. 隐藏，隐瞒，遮住，掩盖\n词根词缀\ncon- 完全 + ceal (=cel) 隐藏 → 彻底藏起来\n助记\nconcealment n.隐藏；同 hide, cover, mask；反 reveal, expose\n例句\nHe could not ==conceal== his disappointment. 他无法掩饰失望。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_9","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"differentiate","back":"释义\nv. 区分，区别，辨别；使不同；分化\n词根词缀\ndifferent 不同的（dif- 分开 + fer 携带）+ -iate 使 → 使有差别\n助记\ndifferent a.不同的；difference n.差别；indifferent a.冷漠的；同 distinguish, discriminate\n例句\nCan you ==differentiate== these two species? 你能区分这两个物种吗？","fields":{"Front":"differentiate","Back":"释义\nv. 区分，区别，辨别；使不同；分化\n词根词缀\ndifferent 不同的（dif- 分开 + fer 携带）+ -iate 使 → 使有差别\n助记\ndifferent a.不同的；difference n.差别；indifferent a.冷漠的；同 distinguish, discriminate\n例句\nCan you ==differentiate== these two species? 你能区分这两个物种吗？","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_10","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"disconcert","back":"释义\nv. 使不安，使困惑，使张皇失措，扰乱\n词根词缀\ndis- 否定 + concert 协同、安排 → 打乱安排而慌乱\n助记\nconcert n.协同；disconcerting a.令人不安的；同 unsettle, confuse, rattle；反 reassure\n例句\nHis strange question ==disconcerted== her. 他奇怪的问题让她不知所措。","fields":{"Front":"disconcert","Back":"释义\nv. 使不安，使困惑，使张皇失措，扰乱\n词根词缀\ndis- 否定 + concert 协同、安排 → 打乱安排而慌乱\n助记\nconcert n.协同；disconcerting a.令人不安的；同 unsettle, confuse, rattle；反 reassure\n例句\nHis strange question ==disconcerted== her. 他奇怪的问题让她不知所措。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_11","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"federal","back":"释义\na. 联邦的，联邦制的，联邦政府的\n词根词缀\n拉丁语 foedus'盟约、条约'；联邦由各邦盟约组成\n助记\nfederation n.联邦；confederate a.结盟的；federalist n.联邦主义者\n例句\nThe plan is funded by the ==federal== government. 该计划由联邦政府资助。","fields":{"Front":"federal","Back":"释义\na. 联邦的，联邦制的，联邦政府的\n词根词缀\n拉丁语 foedus'盟约、条约'；联邦由各邦盟约组成\n助记\nfederation n.联邦；confederate a.结盟的；federalist n.联邦主义者\n例句\nThe plan is funded by the ==federal== government. 该计划由联邦政府资助。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_12","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"herald","back":"释义\nv./n. v. 预示…的来临，宣布，欢呼；n. 先驱，使者，预兆\n词根词缀\n古法语 heralt'传令官'；动词为通报、预示\n助记\nheraldic a.纹章的；同 announce, foreshadow；harbinger n.预兆（同义）\n例句\nDark clouds ==herald== the coming storm. 乌云预示暴风雨将至。","fields":{"Front":"herald","Back":"释义\nv./n. v. 预示…的来临，宣布，欢呼；n. 先驱，使者，预兆\n词根词缀\n古法语 heralt'传令官'；动词为通报、预示\n助记\nheraldic a.纹章的；同 announce, foreshadow；harbinger n.预兆（同义）\n例句\nDark clouds ==herald== the coming storm. 乌云预示暴风雨将至。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_13","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"herb","back":"释义\nn. 草本植物，药草，香草，调味草\n词根词缀\n拉丁语 herba'草、草本'；herbivore 食草动物\n助记\nherbal a.草本的；herbivore n.食草动物；herbicide n.除草剂；carnivore n.食肉动物\n例句\nShe added fresh ==herbs== to the soup. 她往汤里加了新鲜香草。","fields":{"Front":"herb","Back":"释义\nn. 草本植物，药草，香草，调味草\n词根词缀\n拉丁语 herba'草、草本'；herbivore 食草动物\n助记\nherbal a.草本的；herbivore n.食草动物；herbicide n.除草剂；carnivore n.食肉动物\n例句\nShe added fresh ==herbs== to the soup. 她往汤里加了新鲜香草。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_14","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"induct","back":"释义\nv. 使正式入会，征召…入伍，吸收为成员；引导，传授\n词根词缀\nin- 进入 + duct 引导 → 引导进入（组织）\n助记\nconduct v.引导；induction n.入会、归纳；introduce v.引入；同 initiate, install\n例句\nHe was ==inducted== into the army last spring. 他去年春天应征入伍。","fields":{"Front":"induct","Back":"释义\nv. 使正式入会，征召…入伍，吸收为成员；引导，传授\n词根词缀\nin- 进入 + duct 引导 → 引导进入（组织）\n助记\nconduct v.引导；induction n.入会、归纳；introduce v.引入；同 initiate, install\n例句\nHe was ==inducted== into the army last spring. 他去年春天应征入伍。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_15","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"interactive","back":"释义\na. 交互式的，相互作用的，人机对话的\n词根词缀\ninteract 互动（inter- 相互 + act 做）+ -ive → 可相互作用的\n助记\nact v.行动；interaction n.互动；active a.积极的；interactivity n.交互性\n例句\nThe museum has many hands-on, ==interactive== displays. 博物馆有许多可动手的互动展品。","fields":{"Front":"interactive","Back":"释义\na. 交互式的，相互作用的，人机对话的\n词根词缀\ninteract 互动（inter- 相互 + act 做）+ -ive → 可相互作用的\n助记\nact v.行动；interaction n.互动；active a.积极的；interactivity n.交互性\n例句\nThe museum has many hands-on, ==interactive== displays. 博物馆有许多可动手的互动展品。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_16","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"lipid","back":"释义\nn. 脂质，油脂，脂肪类物质\n词根词缀\n希腊语 lipos'脂肪'（lip 脂肪）+ -id 物质\n助记\nliposuction n.吸脂术；fat n.脂肪（日常词）；lipid 为生化术语\n例句\nThe cell membrane is made largely of ==lipids== . 细胞膜主要由脂质构成。","fields":{"Front":"lipid","Back":"释义\nn. 脂质，油脂，脂肪类物质\n词根词缀\n希腊语 lipos'脂肪'（lip 脂肪）+ -id 物质\n助记\nliposuction n.吸脂术；fat n.脂肪（日常词）；lipid 为生化术语\n例句\nThe cell membrane is made largely of ==lipids== . 细胞膜主要由脂质构成。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_17","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"originate","back":"释义\nv. 起源，发源，来自；创立，发明，发起\n词根词缀\norigin 起源（ori 升起、开始）+ -ate 使 → 使产生、起源于\n助记\norigin n.起源；original a.最初的；orient n.东方；同 arise, derive, initiate\n例句\nThe custom ==originated== in ancient China. 这一习俗起源于古代中国。","fields":{"Front":"originate","Back":"释义\nv. 起源，发源，来自；创立，发明，发起\n词根词缀\norigin 起源（ori 升起、开始）+ -ate 使 → 使产生、起源于\n助记\norigin n.起源；original a.最初的；orient n.东方；同 arise, derive, initiate\n例句\nThe custom ==originated== in ancient China. 这一习俗起源于古代中国。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_18","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"psychoanalysis","back":"释义\nn. 精神分析，心理分析（疗法）\n词根词缀\npsycho 精神 + analysis 分析（ana- 完全 + lys 分解）\n助记\npsychoanalyze v.做精神分析；analyze v.分析；Freud 弗洛伊德（创立者）\n例句\nHe trained in ==psychoanalysis== in Vienna. 他在维也纳接受精神分析训练。","fields":{"Front":"psychoanalysis","Back":"释义\nn. 精神分析，心理分析（疗法）\n词根词缀\npsycho 精神 + analysis 分析（ana- 完全 + lys 分解）\n助记\npsychoanalyze v.做精神分析；analyze v.分析；Freud 弗洛伊德（创立者）\n例句\nHe trained in ==psychoanalysis== in Vienna. 他在维也纳接受精神分析训练。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"susp