ate":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_21","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"rhinoceros","back":"释义\nn. 犀牛\n词根词缀\n希腊语 rhino 鼻 + ceros 角 → 鼻上长角的动物\n助记\nrhino n.犀牛（口语）；rhinoceros 复数加 -es 或不变；hippopotamus n.河马\n例句\nThe ==rhinoceros== wallowed in the muddy river. 犀牛在泥河里打滚。","fields":{"Front":"rhinoceros","Back":"释义\nn. 犀牛\n词根词缀\n希腊语 rhino 鼻 + ceros 角 → 鼻上长角的动物\n助记\nrhino n.犀牛（口语）；rhinoceros 复数加 -es 或不变；hippopotamus n.河马\n例句\nThe ==rhinoceros== wallowed in the muddy river. 犀牛在泥河里打滚。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_22","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"wax","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 蜡，蜂蜡；v. 打蜡；（月亮）渐满；增大，渐渐变成\n词根词缀\n古英语'蜂蜡'；wane 月亏（反义）\n助记\nwaxen a.蜡黄的；wax museum 蜡像馆；wax and wane 盛衰；wane v.亏缺\n例句\nThe moon ==waxes== and wanes every month. 月亮每月盈亏交替。","fields":{"Front":"wax","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 蜡，蜂蜡；v. 打蜡；（月亮）渐满；增大，渐渐变成\n词根词缀\n古英语'蜂蜡'；wane 月亏（反义）\n助记\nwaxen a.蜡黄的；wax museum 蜡像馆；wax and wane 盛衰；wane v.亏缺\n例句\nThe moon ==waxes== and wanes every month. 月亮每月盈亏交替。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_23","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"wedge","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 楔子，楔形物；v. 楔入，挤入，卡住\n词根词缀\n古英语 wecg'楔子'；与 wiggle 相关（挤动）\n助记\nwedged a.卡住的；wedge-shaped a.楔形的；同 block, jam, squeeze\n例句\nShe ==wedged== the door open with a stone. 她用石头把开着的门楔住。","fields":{"Front":"wedge","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 楔子，楔形物；v. 楔入，挤入，卡住\n词根词缀\n古英语 wecg'楔子'；与 wiggle 相关（挤动）\n助记\nwedged a.卡住的；wedge-shaped a.楔形的；同 block, jam, squeeze\n例句\nShe ==wedged== the door open with a stone. 她用石头把开着的门楔住。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_24","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"acknowledge","back":"释义\nv. 承认，确认；致谢；告知收到；对…打招呼\n词根词缀\nac- + knowledge 知识、知晓 → 表示知晓、承认\n助记\nknowledge n.知识；acknowledgment n.承认、致谢；同 admit, recognize；反 deny, ignore\n例句\nShe ==acknowledged== that she had made an error. 她承认自己犯了错。","fields":{"Front":"acknowledge","Back":"释义\nv. 承认，确认；致谢；告知收到；对…打招呼\n词根词缀\nac- + knowledge 知识、知晓 → 表示知晓、承认\n助记\nknowledge n.知识；acknowledgment n.承认、致谢；同 admit, recognize；反 deny, ignore\n例句\nShe ==acknowledged== that she had made an error. 她承认自己犯了错。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_25","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"adjoin","back":"释义\nv. 贴近，毗连，相邻，与…接界\n词根词缀\nad- 朝向 + join 连接 → 连接、毗邻\n助记\njoin v.连接；adjacent a.邻近的；同 border, neighbor；adjoining a.毗邻的\n例句\nThe kitchen ==adjoins== the dining room. 厨房与餐厅相连。","fields":{"Front":"adjoin","Back":"释义\nv. 贴近，毗连，相邻，与…接界\n词根词缀\nad- 朝向 + join 连接 → 连接、毗邻\n助记\njoin v.连接；adjacent a.邻近的；同 border, neighbor；adjoining a.毗邻的\n例句\nThe kitchen ==adjoins== the dining room. 厨房与餐厅相连。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_26","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"anonymous","back":"释义\na. 匿名的，无名的，无特色的，无个性的\n词根词缀\nan- 无 + onym 名字（name）+ -ous → 没有名字的\n助记\nanonymity n.匿名；synonym n.同义词；antonym n.反义词；pseudonym n.笔名\n例句\nThe author chose to remain ==anonymous== . 作者选择不具名。","fields":{"Front":"anonymous","Back":"释义\na. 匿名的，无名的，无特色的，无个性的\n词根词缀\nan- 无 + onym 名字（name）+ -ous → 没有名字的\n助记\nanonymity n.匿名；synonym n.同义词；antonym n.反义词；pseudonym n.笔名\n例句\nThe author chose to remain ==anonymous== . 作者选择不具名。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_27","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"bargain","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 便宜货，交易，协议；v. 讨价还价，谈判，预料\n词根词缀\nbarter（物物交换）的变体；bargain for 预料\n助记\nbargain with 与…讲价；into the bargain 此外；同 deal, negotiate；bargain hunter 淘便宜货者\n例句\nThis coat was a real ==bargain== . 这件外套买得真划算。","fields":{"Front":"bargain","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 便宜货，交易，协议；v. 讨价还价，谈判，预料\n词根词缀\nbarter（物物交换）的变体；bargain for 预料\n助记\nbargain with 与…讲价；into the bargain 此外；同 deal, negotiate；bargain hunter 淘便宜货者\n例句\nThis coat was a real ==bargain== . 这件外套买得真划算。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_28","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"barn","back":"释义\nn. 谷仓，牲口棚，车库，库房\n词根词缀\n古英语 bere'大麦' + ern'房屋' → 存粮房\n助记\nbarley n.大麦；barn dance 谷仓舞会；stable n.马厩；granary n.粮仓\n例句\nThey stored hay in the old ==barn== . 他们把干草存放在旧谷仓里。","fields":{"Front":"barn","Back":"释义\nn. 谷仓，牲口棚，车库，库房\n词根词缀\n古英语 bere'大麦' + ern'房屋' → 存粮房\n助记\nbarley n.大麦；barn dance 谷仓舞会；stable n.马厩；granary n.粮仓\n例句\nThey stored hay in the old ==barn== . 他们把干草存放在旧谷仓里。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_29","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"boast","back":"释义\nv./n. 自夸，夸耀，吹嘘；（某地）以拥有…而自豪\n词根词缀\n古诺斯语'吹嘘、夸口'；boastful a.好自夸的\n助记\nboastful a.自夸的；同 brag, crow；boast about 夸耀；modest a.谦虚的（反义）\n例句\nThe town ==boasts== a fine old library. 这座小镇以拥有一座漂亮的老图书馆而自豪。","fields":{"Front":"boast","Back":"释义\nv./n. 自夸，夸耀，吹嘘；（某地）以拥有…而自豪\n词根词缀\n古诺斯语'吹嘘、夸口'；boastful a.好自夸的\n助记\nboastful a.自夸的；同 brag, crow；boast about 夸耀；modest a.谦虚的（反义）\n例句\nThe town ==boasts== a fine old library. 这座小镇以拥有一座漂亮的老图书馆而自豪。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_30","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"cider","back":"释义\nn. 苹果酒，苹果汁\n词根词缀\n希伯来/希腊语 sikera'烈酒'；古法语 sidre 指苹果酒\n助记\nhard cider 含酒精苹果酒；apple cider 苹果汁；vinegar n.醋（与酒同源）\n例句\nThey pressed apples to make fresh ==cider== . 他们压榨苹果做新鲜苹果酒。","fields":{"Front":"cider","Back":"释义\nn. 苹果酒，苹果汁\n词根词缀\n希伯来/希腊语 sikera'烈酒'；古法语 sidre 指苹果酒\n助记\nhard cider 含酒精苹果酒；apple cider 苹果汁；vinegar n.醋（与酒同源）\n例句\nThey pressed apples to make fresh ==cider== . 他们压榨苹果做新鲜苹果酒。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_31","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"concave","back":"释义\na. 凹的，凹面的，凹入的\n词根词缀\ncon- 加强 + cave 洞穴、中空 → 像洞一样凹入的\n助记\ncave n.洞穴；excavate v.挖掘；convex a.凸的（反义）；hollow a.中空的\n例句\nThe inside of a spoon is ==concave== . 勺子内侧是凹面。","fields":{"Front":"concave","Back":"释义\na. 凹的，凹面的，凹入的\n词根词缀\ncon- 加强 + cave 洞穴、中空 → 像洞一样凹入的\n助记\ncave n.洞穴；excavate v.挖掘；convex a.凸的（反义）；hollow a.中空的\n例句\nThe inside of a spoon is ==concave== . 勺子内侧是凹面。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_32","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"culminate","back":"释义\nv. 达到顶点/高潮，以…告终，达到终点\n词根词缀\nculmen 顶峰（culmin 顶）+ -ate → 到达顶峰\n助记\nculmination n.顶点、高潮；同 peak, climax, conclude；culminate in 以…告终\n例句\nThe festival ==culminated== in a fireworks show. 节日以烟花表演达到高潮。","fields":{"Front":"culminate","Back":"释义\nv. 达到顶点/高潮，以…告终，达到终点\n词根词缀\nculmen 顶峰（culmin 顶）+ -ate → 到达顶峰\n助记\nculmination n.顶点、高潮；同 peak, climax, conclude；culminate in 以…告终\n例句\nThe festival ==culminated== in a fireworks show. 节日以烟花表演达到高潮。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_33","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"distribute","back":"释义\nv. 分配，分发，分送；分布，散布\n词根词缀\ndis- 分开 + tribut 给予 + -e → 分开给予 → 分发\n助记\ndistribution n.分配；contribute v.贡献；tribute n.贡物；同 hand out, spread\n例句\nVolunteers ==distributed== food to the poor. 志愿者向穷人分发食物。","fields":{"Front":"distribute","Back":"释义\nv. 分配，分发，分送；分布，散布\n词根词缀\ndis- 分开 + tribut 给予 + -e → 分开给予 → 分发\n助记\ndistribution n.分配；contribute v.贡献；tribute n.贡物；同 hand out, spread\n例句\nVolunteers ==distributed== food to the poor. 志愿者向穷人分发食物。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_34","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"exceed","back":"释义\nv. 超过，超出，胜过，越出\n词根词缀\nex- 向外 + ceed 走 → 走到…之外 → 超过\n助记\nexcess n.过度；excessive a.过多的；proceed v.进行；同 surpass, go beyond\n例句\nThe cost must not ==exceed== our budget. 费用绝不能超出预算。","fields":{"Front":"exceed","Back":"释义\nv. 超过，超出，胜过，越出\n词根词缀\nex- 向外 + ceed 走 → 走到…之外 → 超过\n助记\nexcess n.过度；excessive a.过多的；proceed v.进行；同 surpass, go beyond\n例句\nThe cost must not ==exceed== our budget. 费用绝不能超出预算。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_35","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"forestall","back":"释义\nv. 预先阻止，先发制人，抢先行动\n词根词缀\nfore- 事先、在前 + stall 阻挡、设置 → 事先阻拦\n助记\nstall v.拖住、熄火；beforehand ad.事先；同 prevent, anticipate, avert\n例句\nWe acted quickly to ==forestall== further trouble. 我们迅速行动以防止更多麻烦。","fields":{"Front":"forestall","Back":"释义\nv. 预先阻止，先发制人，抢先行动\n词根词缀\nfore- 事先、在前 + stall 阻挡、设置 → 事先阻拦\n助记\nstall v.拖住、熄火；beforehand ad.事先；同 prevent, anticipate, avert\n例句\nWe acted quickly to ==forestall== further trouble. 我们迅速行动以防止更多麻烦。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_36","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"gloss","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 光泽，光亮；注解，掩饰；v. 注释，粉饰，掩盖\n词根词缀\n古诺斯语'火焰、闪光'；gloss over 掩饰\n助记\nglossy a.有光泽的；glossary n.词汇表；同 shine, sheen；gloss over 掩饰\n例句\nHe tried to ==gloss== over his mistakes. 他试图粉饰自己的错误。","fields":{"Front":"gloss","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 光泽，光亮；注解，掩饰；v. 注释，粉饰，掩盖\n词根词缀\n古诺斯语'火焰、闪光'；gloss over 掩饰\n助记\nglossy a.有光泽的；glossary n.词汇表；同 shine, sheen；gloss over 掩饰\n例句\nHe tried to ==gloss== over his mistakes. 他试图粉饰自己的错误。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_37","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"hitherto","back":"释义\nad. 迄今，到目前为止，至今\n词根词缀\nhither 到此处（here）+ to 到 → 到此为止、迄今\n助记\nhither ad.到这里；henceforth ad.从今以后；同 so far, until now, thus far\n例句\nThe theory was ==hitherto== untested. 该理论迄今尚未经检验。","fields":{"Front":"hitherto","Back":"释义\nad. 迄今，到目前为止，至今\n词根词缀\nhither 到此处（here）+ to 到 → 到此为止、迄今\n助记\nhither ad.到这里；henceforth ad.从今以后；同 so far, until now, thus far\n例句\nThe theory was ==hitherto== untested. 该理论迄今尚未经检验。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_38","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"incredulous","back":"释义\na. 怀疑的，不轻信的，表示不相信的\n词根词缀\nin- 不 + credulous 轻信的（cred 相信）→ 不肯轻信的\n助记\ncredit n.相信；credible a.可信的；incredible a.难以置信的；同 skeptical, doubting\n例句\nHe gave me an ==incredulous== look. 他用怀疑的神情看我。","fields":{"Front":"incredulous","Back":"释义\na. 怀疑的，不轻信的，表示不相信的\n词根词缀\nin- 不 + credulous 轻信的（cred 相信）→ 不肯轻信的\n助记\ncredit n.相信；credible a.可信的；incredible a.难以置信的；同 skeptical, doubting\n例句\nHe gave me an ==incredulous== look. 他用怀疑的神情看我。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_39","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"jolt","back":"释义\nv./n. 震动，猛击，颠簸；使震惊，使受到打击\n词根词缀\n拟'猛撞'之声；与 jowl 相关\n助记\njolt n.震动；a jolt of caffeine 一阵咖啡因提神；同 shake, jerk, shock\n例句\nThe bus ==jolted== over the rough road. 公交车在崎岖路上颠簸。","fields":{"Front":"jolt","Back":"释义\nv./n. 震动，猛击，颠簸；使震惊，使受到打击\n词根词缀\n拟'猛撞'之声；与 jowl 相关\n助记\njolt n.震动；a jolt of caffeine 一阵咖啡因提神；同 shake, jerk, shock\n例句\nThe bus ==jolted== over the rough road. 公交车在崎岖路上颠簸。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,