ontinued to ==spiral== upward. 物价继续螺旋式上涨。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_47","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"stingy","back":"释义\na. 吝啬的，小气的，舍不得的，不足的\n词根词缀\nsting 刺、蛰 + -y → 像被蛰一样一毛不拔\n助记\nsting v.蛰；stinginess n.吝啬；同 miserly, mean, tightfisted；反 generous\n例句\nHe is too ==stingy== to leave a tip. 他小气到不给小费。","fields":{"Front":"stingy","Back":"释义\na. 吝啬的，小气的，舍不得的，不足的\n词根词缀\nsting 刺、蛰 + -y → 像被蛰一样一毛不拔\n助记\nsting v.蛰；stinginess n.吝啬；同 miserly, mean, tightfisted；反 generous\n例句\nHe is too ==stingy== to leave a tip. 他小气到不给小费。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_48","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"triumph","back":"释义\nn./v. 胜利，巨大成功，狂喜；战胜，获胜\n词根词缀\n拉丁语 triumphus'凯旋、凯旋式'\n助记\ntriumphant a.得意洋洋的；triumphal a.凯旋的；同 victory, conquer；反 defeat\n例句\nGood shall ==triumph== over evil. 善良终将战胜邪恶。","fields":{"Front":"triumph","Back":"释义\nn./v. 胜利，巨大成功，狂喜；战胜，获胜\n词根词缀\n拉丁语 triumphus'凯旋、凯旋式'\n助记\ntriumphant a.得意洋洋的；triumphal a.凯旋的；同 victory, conquer；反 defeat\n例句\nGood shall ==triumph== over evil. 善良终将战胜邪恶。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDay