 n.注意；extend v.延伸；intend v.打算；attend to 处理、照料\n例句\nAbout a hundred people ==attended== the lecture. 约一百人听了讲座。","fields":{"Front":"attend","Back":"释义\nv. 出席，参加；照料，看护；注意，专心\n词根词缀\nat- 朝向 + tend 伸展、留意 → 把注意力转向、出席\n助记\nattention n.注意；extend v.延伸；intend v.打算；attend to 处理、照料\n例句\nAbout a hundred people ==attended== the lecture. 约一百人听了讲座。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_52","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"comet","back":"释义\nn. 彗星\n词根词缀\n希腊语 kometes'长发'（彗尾如长发）；与 comb 相关\n助记\ncomet 彗尾 tail；asteroid n.小行星；meteor n.流星；cometary a.彗星的\n例句\nA bright ==comet== crossed the night sky. 一颗明亮彗星划过夜空。","fields":{"Front":"comet","Back":"释义\nn. 彗星\n词根词缀\n希腊语 kometes'长发'（彗尾如长发）；与 comb 相关\n助记\ncomet 彗尾 tail；asteroid n.小行星；meteor n.流星；cometary a.彗星的\n例句\nA bright ==comet== crossed the night sky. 一颗明亮彗星划过夜空。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_53","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"commentary","back":"释义\nn. 评论，评注，解说词，实况报道\n词根词缀\ncomment 评论（com- 完全 + ment 思考）+ -ary → 一系列评论、解说\n助记\ncomment v./n.评论；commentate v.解说；mental a.思考的；同 narration, review\n例句\nHe gave a running ==commentary== on the game. 他对比赛做了连续实况解说。","fields":{"Front":"commentary","Back":"释义\nn. 评论，评注，解说词，实况报道\n词根词缀\ncomment 评论（com- 完全 + ment 思考）+ -ary → 一系列评论、解说\n助记\ncomment v./n.评论；commentate v.解说；mental a.思考的；同 narration, review\n例句\nHe gave a running ==commentary== on the game. 他对比赛做了连续实况解说。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_54","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"estimate","back":"释义\nv./n. 估计，估价，估算，判断\n词根词缀\naes- 价值、估价（esteem 尊重、评价）+ -timate → 估算价值\n助记\nesteem v.尊重；estimation n.评价；overestimate v.高估；同 assess, evaluate, reckon\n例句\nWe ==estimate== the cost at about two thousand dollars. 我们估计费用约两千美元。","fields":{"Front":"estimate","Back":"释义\nv./n. 估计，估价，估算，判断\n词根词缀\naes- 价值、估价（esteem 尊重、评价）+ -timate → 估算价值\n助记\nesteem v.尊重；estimation n.评价；overestimate v.高估；同 assess, evaluate, reckon\n例句\nWe ==estimate== the cost at about two thousand dollars. 我们估计费用约两千美元。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_55","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"gorilla","back":"释义\nn. 大猩猩\n词根词缀\n希腊语（西非语源）'多毛野人'；guerrilla 游击战（形近，注意区别）\n助记\n区别 guerrilla n.游击队；gorilla 复数加 -s；chimpanzee n.黑猩猩\n例句\nA huge silverback ==gorilla== led the group. 一只巨大的银背大猩猩率领着群体。","fields":{"Front":"gorilla","Back":"释义\nn. 大猩猩\n词根词缀\n希腊语（西非语源）'多毛野人'；guerrilla 游击战（形近，注意区别）\n助记\n区别 guerrilla n.游击队；gorilla 复数加 -s；chimpanzee n.黑猩猩\n例句\nA huge silverback ==gorilla== led the group. 一只巨大的银背大猩猩率领着群体。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_56","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"heading","back":"释义\nn. 标题，题目，类目；航向，方向\n词根词缀\nhead 头、顶部 + -ing → 位于顶部的文字 → 标题\n助记\nhead n.头；headline n.大字标题；header n.页眉；同 title, caption\n例句\nThe figures are listed under several ==headings== . 数据列在几个标题之下。","fields":{"Front":"heading","Back":"释义\nn. 标题，题目，类目；航向，方向\n词根词缀\nhead 头、顶部 + -ing → 位于顶部的文字 → 标题\n助记\nhead n.头；headline n.大字标题；header n.页眉；同 title, caption\n例句\nThe figures are listed under several ==headings== . 数据列在几个标题之下。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_57","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"impetus","back":"释义\nn. 推动，动力，刺激，冲力，促进\n词根词缀\nim- 进入 + pet 寻求、冲（compete）+ -us → 冲力、推动力\n助记\ncompete v.竞争；appetite n.欲望；同 momentum, stimulus, drive\n例句\nThe discovery gave new ==impetus== to the research. 这一发现给研究注入新动力。","fields":{"Front":"impetus","Back":"释义\nn. 推动，动力，刺激，冲力，促进\n词根词缀\nim- 进入 + pet 寻求、冲（compete）+ -us → 冲力、推动力\n助记\ncompete v.竞争；appetite n.欲望；同 momentum, stimulus, drive\n例句\nThe discovery gave new ==impetus== to the research. 这一发现给研究注入新动力。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_58","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"incubate","back":"释义\nv. 孵化，孵卵；培育，培养；潜伏\n词根词缀\nin- 在…上 + cub 躺、卧（cubicle 小隔间）+ -ate → 卧在卵上 → 孵化\n助记\nincubator n.孵化器、恒温箱；incubation n.孵化、潜伏期；cub n.幼兽\n例句\nThe eggs ==incubate== for about two weeks. 卵孵化约需两周。","fields":{"Front":"incubate","Back":"释义\nv. 孵化，孵卵；培育，培养；潜伏\n词根词缀\nin- 在…上 + cub 躺、卧（cubicle 小隔间）+ -ate → 卧在卵上 → 孵化\n助记\nincubator n.孵化器、恒温箱；incubation n.孵化、潜伏期；cub n.幼兽\n例句\nThe eggs ==incubate== for about two weeks. 卵孵化约需两周。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_59","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"instruct","back":"释义\nv. 教，教授，指导；命令，指示；通知\n词根词缀\nin- 进入 + struct 建造、整理 → 把知识构建进脑中 → 教授\n助记\nstructure n.结构；instruction n.指导；construct v.建造；同 teach, direct, order\n例句\nStaff are ==instructed== to wear safety helmets. 员工被要求戴安全帽。","fields":{"Front":"instruct","Back":"释义\nv. 教，教授，指导；命令，指示；通知\n词根词缀\nin- 进入 + struct 建造、整理 → 把知识构建进脑中 → 教授\n助记\nstructure n.结构；instruction n.指导；construct v.建造；同 teach, direct, order\n例句\nStaff are ==instructed== to wear safety helmets. 员工被要求戴安全帽。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_60","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"lodge","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 小屋，门房，乡间旅舍，分会；v. 寄宿，安顿；卡住；正式提出\n词根词缀\n古法语 loge'小屋、棚'（leaf 遮蔽）；与 lobby 相关\n助记\nlodging n.寄宿处；dislodge v.移走；lodge a complaint 提出投诉；同 cabin\n例句\nThey stayed at a hunting ==lodge== in the woods. 他们住在林中的狩猎小屋。","fields":{"Front":"lodge","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 小屋，门房，乡间旅舍，分会；v. 寄宿，安顿；卡住；正式提出\n词根词缀\n古法语 loge'小屋、棚'（leaf 遮蔽）；与 lobby 相关\n助记\nlodging n.寄宿处；dislodge v.移走；lodge a complaint 提出投诉；同 cabin\n例句\nThey stayed at a hunting ==lodge== in the woods. 他们住在林中的狩猎小屋。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_61","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"logical","back":"释义\na. 合乎逻辑的，合理的，逻辑（上）的，条理分明的\n词根词缀\nlogic 逻辑（log 理性、言说）+ -al → 符合逻辑的\n助记\nlogic n.逻辑；illogical a.不合逻辑的；logician n.逻辑学家；同 rational, coherent\n例句\nThere is only one ==logical== conclusion. 只有一个合乎逻辑的结论。","fields":{"Front":"logical","Back":"释义\na. 合乎逻辑的，合理的，逻辑（上）的，条理分明的\n词根词缀\nlogic 逻辑（log 理性、言说）+ -al → 符合逻辑的\n助记\nlogic n.逻辑；illogical a.不合逻辑的；logician n.逻辑学家；同 rational, coherent\n例句\nThere is only one ==logical== conclusion. 只有一个合乎逻辑的结论。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_62","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"mason","back":"释义\nn. 石匠，泥瓦工；共济会成员\n词根词缀\n古法语 masson'石匠'（与 make 建造相关）\n助记\nmasonry n.石工、砖石建筑；stone n.石头；bricklayer n.砖匠；Freemason n.共济会会员\n例句\nThe ==mason== carefully laid the stone wall. 石匠仔细砌石墙。","fields":{"Front":"mason","Back":"释义\nn. 石匠，泥瓦工；共济会成员\n词根词缀\n古法语 masson'石匠'（与 make 建造相关）\n助记\nmasonry n.石工、砖石建筑；stone n.石头；bricklayer n.砖匠；Freemason n.共济会会员\n例句\nThe ==mason== carefully laid the stone wall. 石匠仔细砌石墙。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_63","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"mime","back":"释义\nn./v. 哑剧（演员），丑角；模拟表演，比手势，假唱\n词根词缀\n希腊语 mimos'模仿者、小丑'；mimic 模仿（同源）\n助记\nmimic v.模仿；pantomime n.童话剧、手势；mimicry n.拟态、模仿\n例句\nThe street ==mime== pretended to be trapped in a box. 街头哑剧演员假装被困在箱子里。","fields":{"Front":"mime","Back":"释义\nn./v. 哑剧（演员），丑角；模拟表演，比手势，假唱\n词根词缀\n希腊语 mimos'模仿者、小丑'；mimic 模仿（同源）\n助记\nmimic v.模仿；pantomime n.童话剧、手势；mimicry n.拟态、模仿\n例句\nThe street ==mime== pretended to be trapped in a box. 街头哑剧演员假装被困在箱子里。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_64","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"preoccupation","back":"释义\nn. 全神贯注，出神；心事，当务之急，成见\n词根词缀\npreoccupy 使全神贯注（pre- 先 + occupy 占据）+ -ation → 心神先被占据\n助记\noccupy v.占据；preoccupy v.使凝神；preoccupied a.心事重重的；同 obsession, concern\n例句\nSafety became his main ==preoccupation== . 安全成了他最挂心的事。","fields":{"Front":"preoccupation","Back":"释义\nn. 全神贯注，出神；心事，当务之急，成见\n词根词缀\npreoccupy 使全神贯注（pre- 先 + occupy 占据）+ -ation → 心神先被占据\n助记\noccupy v.占据；preoccupy v.使凝神；preoccupied a.心事重重的；同 obsession, concern\n例句\nSafety became his main ==preoccupation== . 安全成了他最挂心的事。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_65","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"resemble","back":"释义\nv. 像，与…相似，类似\n词根词缀\nre- 再、加强 + sembl 相似、相同（same）→ 看起来相同\n助记\nresemblance n.相似；assemble v.集合；similar a.相似的；同 look like, mirror\n例句\nShe strongly ==resembles== her mother. 她长得很像母亲。","fields":{"Front":"resemble","Back":"释义\nv. 像，与…相似，类似\n词根词缀\nre- 再、加强 + sembl 相似、相同（same）→ 看起来相同\n助记\nresemblance n.相似；assemble v.集合；similar a.相似的；同 look like, mirror\n例句\nShe strongly ==resembles== her mother. 她长得很像母亲。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_66","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"sedimentary","back":"释义\na. 沉积的，沉积形成的，水成的\n词根词缀\nsediment 沉积物（sed 坐、沉降，sit）+ -ment + -ary → 沉积而成的\n助记\nsit v.坐；sediment n.沉积物；residue n.残余；sedimentation n.沉积作用\n例句\nCoal is found in ==sedimentary== rock layers. 煤存在于沉积岩层中。","fields":{"Front":"sedimentary","Back":"释义\na. 沉积的，沉积形成的，水成的\n词根词缀\nsediment 沉积物（sed 坐、沉降，sit）+ -ment + -ary → 沉积而成的\n助记\nsit v.坐；sediment n.沉积物；residue n.残余；sedimentation n.沉积作用\n例句\nCoal is found in ==sedimentary== rock layers. 煤存在于沉积岩层中。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_67","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"sociology","back":"释义\nn. 社会学\n词根词缀\nsocio 社会、同伴（society）+ -logy 学科 → 研究社会的学问\n助记\nsociety n.社会；social a.社会的；associate v.交往；sociologist n.社会学家\n例句\nShe majored in ==sociology== at university. 她大学主修社会学。","fields":{"Front":"sociology","Back":"释义\nn. 社会学\n词根词缀\nsocio 社会、同伴（society）+ -logy 学科 → 研究社会的学问\n助记\nsociety n.社会；social a.社会的；associate v.交往；sociologist n.社会学家\n例句\nShe majored in ==sociology== at university. 她大学主修社会学。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_68","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"solar","back":"释义\na. 太阳的，日光的，利用太阳光的\n词根词缀\nsol 太阳（sun）+ -ar → 与太阳有关的\n助记\nsun n.太阳；solar system 太阳系；solstice n.至日；lunar a.月球的（对应）\n例句\nThey installed ==solar== panels on the roof. 他们在屋顶装了太阳能板。","fields":{"Front":"solar","Back":"释义\na. 太阳的，日光的，利用太阳光的\n词根词缀\nsol 太阳（sun）+ -ar → 与太阳有关的\n助记\nsun n.太阳；solar system 太阳系；solstice n.至日；lunar a.月球的（对应）\n例句\nThey installed ==solar== panels on the roof. 他们在屋顶装了太阳能板。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_69","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"stratigraphy","back":"释义\nn. 地层学，地层情况，地层排列\n词根词缀\nstrati 层（stratum 地层）+ -graphy 描述 → 研究地层的学问\n助记\nstratum n.地层（复数 strata）；stratify v.分层；stratosphere n.平流层\n例句\n==Stratigraphy== helps determine the age of fossils. 地层学有助于确定化石年代。","fields":{"Front":"stratigraphy","Back":"释义\nn. 地层学，地层情况，地层排列\n词根词缀\nstrati 层（stratum 地层）+ -graphy 描述 → 研究地层的学问\n助记\nstratum n.地层（复数 strata）；stratify v.分层；stratosphere n.平流层\n例句\n==Stratigraphy== helps determine the age of fossils. 地层学有助于确定化石年代。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_70","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"unpredictable","back":"释义\na. 不可预测的，难以预料的，反复无常的\n词根词缀\nun- 不 + predict 预言（pre- 前 + dict 说）+ -able → 无法预言的\n助记\npredict v.预言；prediction n.预测；同 changeable, uncertain；反 predictable, reliable\n例句\nThe weather here is highly ==unpredictable== . 这里的天气极难预料。","fields":{"Front":"unpredictable","Back":"释义\na. 不可预测的，难以预料的，反复无常的\n词根词缀\nun- 不 + predict 预言（pre- 前 + dict 说）+ -able → 无法预言的\n助记\npredict v.预言；prediction n.预测；同 changeable, uncertain；反 predictable, reliable\n例句\nThe weather here is highly ==unpredictable== . 这里的天气极难预料。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l7_71","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"vault","back":"释义\nn./v. n. 拱顶，地窖，保险库；墓穴；撑竿跳；v. 跳跃，撑竿跳过\n词根词缀\n古法语 volte'翻滚、拱'（volv 卷）；拱顶如翻滚\n助记\npole vault 撑竿跳；vaulted a.拱顶的；同 jump, leap, cellar, crypt\n例句\nThe jewels were kept in a bank ==vault== . 珠宝存放在银行保险库里。","fields":{"Front":"vault","Back":"释义\nn./v. n. 拱顶，地窖，保险库；墓穴；撑竿跳；v. 跳跃，撑竿跳过\n词根词缀\n古法语 volte'翻滚、拱'（volv 卷）；拱顶如翻滚\n助记\npole vault 撑竿跳；vaulted a.拱顶的；同 jump, leap, cellar, crypt\n例句\nThe jewels were kept in a bank ==vault== . 珠宝存放在银行保险库里。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 7 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]}]},{"id":"toefl-list-8","name":"TOEFL 托福 › List 8","description":"托福核心词 · List 8（83 词 · 释义 + 词根词缀 + 助记 + 标黄例句）","createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["toefl","imported"],"options":{"newPerDay":null,"reviewsPerDay":null,"learningSteps":null,"relearningSteps":null,"graduatingInterval":null,"easyInterval":null,"leechThreshold":null,"leechAction":"","buryRelated":null,"maxInterval":null,"requestRetention":null,"newOrder":"","reviewOrder":""},"cards":[{"noteId":"toefl_l8_0","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"agile","back":"释义\nadj. 敏捷的；灵活的\n词根词缀\nag 行动（agent）+ ile → 行动轻快的\n助记\nagility n.敏捷；nimble adj.灵巧的；反 clumsy adj.笨拙的\n例句\nThe ==agile== cat leapt from the floor to the shelf. 敏捷的猫从地板跳到架子上。","fields":{"Front":"agile","Back":"释义\nadj. 敏捷的；灵活的\n词根词缀\nag 行动（agent）+ ile → 行动轻快的\n助记\nagility n.敏捷；nimble adj.灵巧的；反 clumsy adj.笨拙的\n例句\nThe ==agile== cat leapt from the floor to the shelf. 敏捷的猫从地板跳到架子上。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_1","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"apportion","back":"释义\nv. 分配；分摊\n词根词缀\nap (=ad) 向 + portion 份额 → 按份分给\n助记\nportion n.一份；allocate v.分配；distribution n.分发\n例句\nThe money was ==apportioned== equally among the three children. 钱在三个孩子间平分了。","fields":{"Front":"apportion","Back":"释义\nv. 分配；分摊\n词根词缀\nap (=ad) 向 + portion 份额 → 按份分给\n助记\nportion n.一份；allocate v.分配；distribution n.分发\n例句\nThe money was ==apportioned== equally among the three children. 钱在三个孩子间平分了。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_2","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"communal","back":"释义\nadj. 公共的；社区的；公社的\n词根词缀\ncommun 共同（community）+ al 形容词 → 共同享有的\n助记\ncommunity n.社区；common adj.共同的；反 private adj.私人的\n例句\nThe kitchen was ==communal== , shared by everyone in the dorm. 厨房是公共的，由宿舍里每个人共用。","fields":{"Front":"communal","Back":"释义\nadj. 公共的；社区的；公社的\n词根词缀\ncommun 共同（community）+ al 形容词 → 共同享有的\n助记\ncommunity n.社区；common adj.共同的；反 private adj.私人的\n例句\nThe kitchen was ==communal== , shared by everyone in the dorm. 厨房是公共的，由宿舍里每个人共用。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_3","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"competence","back":"释义\nn. 能力；胜任\n词根词缀\ncompet 力争（compete）+ ence 名词 → 足以应对的能力\n助记\ncompetent adj.胜任的；incompetent adj.无能力的；capability n.能力\n例句\nHer ==competence== as a surgeon was never in doubt. 她作为外科医生的能力从未被怀疑。","fields":{"Front":"competence","Back":"释义\nn. 能力；胜任\n词根词缀\ncompet 力争（compete）+ ence 名词 → 足以应对的能力\n助记\ncompetent adj.胜任的；incompetent adj.无能力的；capability n.能力\n例句\nHer ==competence== as a surgeon was never in doubt. 她作为外科医生的能力从未被怀疑。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_4","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"complex","back":"释义\nadj./n. 复杂的；综合体；情结\n词根词缀\ncom 一起 + plex 折叠（ply）→ 折叠在一起的\n助记\ncomplexity n.复杂性；complicate v.使复杂；反 simple\n例句\nThe human brain is a remarkably ==complex== organ. 人脑是极其复杂的器官。","fields":{"Front":"complex","Back":"释义\nadj./n. 复杂的；综合体；情结\n词根词缀\ncom 一起 + plex 折叠（ply）→ 折叠在一起的\n助记\ncomplexity n.复杂性；complicate v.使复杂；反 simple\n例句\nThe human brain is a remarkably ==complex== organ. 人脑是极其复杂的器官。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_5","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"concept","back":"释义\nn. 概念；观念\n词根词缀\ncon 一起 + cept 拿、抓（capture）→ 把握到的想法\n助记\nconception n.构想；conceptual adj.概念上的；notion n.观念\n例句\nYoung children find the ==concept== of time difficult. 幼儿觉得时间的概念很难理解。","fields":{"Front":"concept","Back":"释义\nn. 概念；观念\n词根词缀\ncon 一起 + cept 拿、抓（capture）→ 把握到的想法\n助记\nconception n.构想；conceptual adj.概念上的；notion n.观念\n例句\nYoung children find the ==concept== of time difficult. 幼儿觉得时间的概念很难理解。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_6","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"discard","back":"释义\nv. 丢弃；抛弃\n词根词缀\ndis 离开 + card 纸牌 → 扔掉（废牌）\n助记\ndispose of 处理；abandon v.抛弃；反 keep\n例句\nHe ==discarded== the old newspapers after moving. 搬家后他把旧报纸扔掉了。","fields":{"Front":"discard","Back":"释义\nv. 丢弃；抛弃\n词根词缀\ndis 离开 + card 纸牌 → 扔掉（废牌）\n助记\ndispose of 处理；abandon v.抛弃；反 keep\n例句\nHe ==discarded== the old newspapers after moving. 搬家后他把旧报纸扔掉了。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_7","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"fortuitous","back":"释义\nadj. 偶然的；意外的；幸运的\n词根词缀\nfort 机会（fortune）+ uitous → 凭运气的\n助记\nfortune n.运气；accidental adj.偶然的；fortunate adj.幸运的\n例句\nMeeting her at the airport was a ==fortuitous== coincidence. 在机场遇见她是个幸运的巧合。","fields":{"Front":"fortuitous","Back":"释义\nadj. 偶然的；意外的；幸运的\n词根词缀\nfort 机会（fortune）+ uitous → 凭运气的\n助记\nfortune n.运气；accidental adj.偶然的；fortunate adj.幸运的\n例句\nMeeting her at the airport was a ==fortuitous== coincidence. 在机场遇见她是个幸运的巧合。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_8","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"fragile","back":"释义\nadj. 易碎的；脆弱的\n词根词缀\nfrag 破碎（同 fracture）+ ile 易…的 → 易破碎的\n助记\nfragility n.脆弱；frail adj.虚弱的；fragment n.碎片\n例句\nBe careful; that glass vase is very ==fragile== . 小心，那只玻璃花瓶很易碎。","fields":{"Front":"fragile","Back":"释义\nadj. 易碎的；脆弱的\n词根词缀\nfrag 破碎（同 fracture）+ ile 易…的 → 易破碎的\n助记\nfragility n.脆弱；frail adj.虚弱的；fragment n.碎片\n例句\nBe careful; that glass vase is very ==fragile== . 小心，那只玻璃花瓶很易碎。","Ex