len in the city this year. 该市今年的青少年犯罪有所下降。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_14","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"lettuce","back":"释义\nn. 莴苣；生菜\n词根词缀\n源自拉丁语 lactis 乳（茎叶含白色乳汁）→ 生菜\n助记\ncabbage n.卷心菜；spinach n.菠菜；vegetable n.蔬菜\n例句\nShe added fresh ==lettuce== and tomato to the sandwich. 她往三明治里加了新鲜生菜和番茄。","fields":{"Front":"lettuce","Back":"释义\nn. 莴苣；生菜\n词根词缀\n源自拉丁语 lactis 乳（茎叶含白色乳汁）→ 生菜\n助记\ncabbage n.卷心菜；spinach n.菠菜；vegetable n.蔬菜\n例句\nShe added fresh ==lettuce== and tomato to the sandwich. 她往三明治里加了新鲜生菜和番茄。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_15","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"promote","back":"释义\nv. 促进；提升；促销\n词根词缀\npro 向前 + mot 移动（motion）→ 向前推\n助记\npromotion n.提升；promote sales 促销；反 demote v.降级\n例句\nRegular exercise ==promotes== good health. 经常锻炼促进健康。","fields":{"Front":"promote","Back":"释义\nv. 促进；提升；促销\n词根词缀\npro 向前 + mot 移动（motion）→ 向前推\n助记\npromotion n.提升；promote sales 促销；反 demote v.降级\n例句\nRegular exercise ==promotes== good health. 经常锻炼促进健康。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"sta