义\nn. 硅石；二氧化硅\n词根词缀\nsilic 硅（silicon）+ a 名词 → 含硅矿物\n助记\nsilicon n.硅；quartz n.石英；mineral n.矿物\n例句\n==Silica== is the main mineral found in sand and quartz. 硅石是沙子和石英中的主要矿物。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_19","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"status","back":"释义\nn. 地位；身份；状况\n词根词缀\n拉丁语 status 站立、状态（同 state）→ 所处位置\n助记\nstate n.状态；standing n.地位；status quo 现状\n例句\nDoctors enjoy high social ==status== in many countries. 医生在许多国家享有很高的社会地位。","fields":{"Front":"status","Back":"释义\nn. 地位；身份；状况\n词根词缀\n拉丁语 status 站立、状态（同 state）→ 所处位置\n助记\nstate n.状态；standing n.地位；status quo 现状\n例句\nDoctors enjoy high social ==status== in many countries. 医生在许多国家享有很高的社会地位。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_20","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"vacant","back":"释义\nadj. 空的；未被占用的；（职位）空缺的\n词根词缀\nvac 空（vacuum）+ ant 形容词 → 空着的\n助记\nvacancy n.空缺；vacate v.腾空；empty adj.空的；反 occupied\n例句\nThe house has been ==vacant== since last winter. 这房子从去年冬天起就一直空着。","fields":{"Front":"vacant","Back":"释义\nadj. 空的；未被占用的；（职位）空缺的\n词根词缀\nvac 空（vacuum）+ ant 形容词 → 空着的\n助记\nvacancy n.空缺；vacate v.腾空；empty adj.空的；反 occupied\n例句\nThe house has been ==vacant== since last winter. 这房子从去年冬天起就一直空着。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.00