j.炽热的；flame n.火焰；ablaze adj.着火的\n例句\nFirefighters worked all night to control the ==blaze== . 消防员奋战一夜控制火势。","fields":{"Front":"blaze","Back":"释义\nn./v. 火焰；烈火；燃烧\n词根词缀\n古英语 blæse 火焰、火炬 → 熊熊燃烧\n助记\nblazing adj.炽热的；flame n.火焰；ablaze adj.着火的\n例句\nFirefighters worked all night to control the ==blaze== . 消防员奋战一夜控制火势。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_24","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"bureaucracy","back":"释义\nn. 官僚机构；官僚作风\n词根词缀\nbureau 局、办公处 + crat 统治 + y → 官员统治\n助记\nbureaucrat n.官僚；bureaucratic adj.官僚的；red tape 繁文缛节\n例句\nGetting a visa often involves a lot of ==bureaucracy== . 办签证常涉及繁琐的官僚手续。","fields":{"Front":"bureaucracy","Back":"释义\nn. 官僚机构；官僚作风\n词根词缀\nbureau 局、办公处 + crat 统治 + y → 官员统治\n助记\nbureaucrat n.官僚；bureaucratic adj.官僚的；red tape 繁文缛节\n例句\nGetting a visa often involves a lot of ==bureaucracy== . 办签证常涉及繁琐的官僚手续。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_25","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"complaint","back":"释义\nn. 抱怨；投诉；疾病\n词根词缀\ncom 加强 + plaint 哀叹 → 表达不满\n助记\ncomplain v.抱怨；complainant n.原告；grumble v.嘟囔\n例句\nWe received several ==complaints== about the noise. 我们收到几起关于噪音的投诉。","fields":{"Front":"complaint","Back":"释义\nn. 抱怨；投诉；疾病\n词根词缀\ncom 加强 + plaint 哀叹 → 表达不满\n助记\ncomplain v.抱怨；complainant n.原告；grumble v.嘟囔\n例句\nWe received several ==complaints== about the noise. 我们收到几起关于