stic adj.讽刺的；sneer v.冷笑；derogatory adj.贬低的\n例句\nHe made a ==snide== remark about her appearance. 他对她的外表说了句挖苦话。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_43","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"stampede","back":"释义\nn./v. 惊逃；蜂拥；奔逃\n词根词缀\n西班牙语 estampida 轰响、踩踏 → 兽群狂奔\n助记\nrush v.冲；panic n.恐慌；trample v.踩踏\n例句\nA loud noise caused a ==stampede== among the cattle. 一声巨响引发牛群惊逃。","fields":{"Front":"stampede","Back":"释义\nn./v. 惊逃；蜂拥；奔逃\n词根词缀\n西班牙语 estampida 轰响、踩踏 → 兽群狂奔\n助记\nrush v.冲；panic n.恐慌；trample v.踩踏\n例句\nA loud noise caused a ==stampede== among the cattle. 一声巨响引发牛群惊逃。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_44","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"swift","back":"释义\nadj. 迅速的；敏捷的\n词根词缀\n古英语 swift 快（与 sweep 相关）→ 快速移动\n助记\nswiftly adv.迅速地；rapid adj.迅速的；反 slow\n例句\nThe government took ==swift== action to stop the spread. 政府迅速采取行动阻止蔓延。","fields":{"Front":"swift","Back":"释义\nadj. 迅速的；敏捷的\n词根词缀\n古英语 swift 快（与 sweep 相关）→ 快速移动\n助记\nswiftly adv.迅速地；rapid adj.迅速的；反 slow\n例句\nThe government took ==swift== action to stop the spread. 政府迅速采取行动阻止蔓延。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","r