itari）+ ant → 随之而来\n助记\naccompany v.伴随；attendant adj.伴随的；concurrent adj.同时发生的\n例句\nFever is a ==concomitant== symptom of many infections. 发烧是许多感染的伴随症状。","fields":{"Front":"concomitant","Back":"释义\nadj./n. 伴随的；伴随物\n词根词缀\ncon 一起 + comit 跟随（comitari）+ ant → 随之而来\n助记\naccompany v.伴随；attendant adj.伴随的；concurrent adj.同时发生的\n例句\nFever is a ==concomitant== symptom of many infections. 发烧是许多感染的伴随症状。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_70","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"cubism","back":"释义\nn. 立体主义；立体派\n词根词缀\ncub 立方体（cube）+ ism 主义 → 以几何形体作画\n助记\ncube n.立方体；cubist n.立体派艺术家；abstract adj.抽象的\n例句\nPicasso was one of the founders of ==cubism== . 毕加索是立体主义的奠基人之一。","fields":{"Front":"cubism","Back":"释义\nn. 立体主义；立体派\n词根词缀\ncub 立方体（cube）+ ism 主义 → 以几何形体作画\n助记\ncube n.立方体；cubist n.立体派艺术家；abstract adj.抽象的\n例句\nPicasso was one of the founders of ==cubism== . 毕加索是立体主义的奠基人之一。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_71","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"drastic","back":"释义\nadj. 激烈的；剧烈的；严厉的\n词根词缀\ndrast 行动、施行（drama 同源）+ ic → 动作很大的\n助记\ndrastically adv.剧烈地；extreme adj.极端的；radical adj.根本的\n例句\nThe company made ==drastic== cuts to its budget. 公司对预算进行了大幅削减。","fields":{"Front":"drastic","Back":"释义\nadj. 激烈的；剧烈的；严厉的\n词根词缀\ndrast 行动、施行（drama 同源）+ ic → 动作很大的\n助记\ndrastically adv.剧烈地；extreme adj.极端的；radical adj.根本的\n例句\nThe company made ==drastic== cuts to its budget. 公司对预算进行了大幅削减。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_72","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"dubious","back":"释义\nadj. 可疑的；怀疑的；靠不住的\n词根词缀\ndub 怀疑（doubt 同源）+ ious → 拿不准的\n助记\ndubiety n.怀疑；doubtful adj.可疑的；skeptical adj.怀疑的\n例句\nI remain ==dubious== about his chances of success. 我对他成功的把握仍表示怀疑。","fields":{"Front":"dubious","Back":"释义\nadj. 可疑的；怀疑的；靠不住的\n词根词缀\ndub 怀疑（doubt 同源）+ ious → 拿不准的\n助记\ndubiety n.怀疑；doubtful adj.可疑的；skeptical adj.怀疑的\n例句\nI remain ==dubious== about his chances of success. 我对他成功的把握仍表示怀疑。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_73","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"former","back":"释义\nadj./n. 以前的；前者的；前者\n词根词缀\n古英语 forma 最先（fore 的比较级）→ 在前的\n助记\nformerly adv.以前；the former..., the latter... 前者……后者……；反 latter\n例句\nThe ==former== president still gives speeches. 前总统仍在发表演讲。","fields":{"Front":"former","Back":"释义\nadj./n. 以前的；前者的；前者\n词根词缀\n古英语 forma 最先（fore 的比较级）→ 在前的\n助记\nformerly adv.以前；the former..., the latter... 前者……后者……；反 latter\n例句\nThe ==former== president still gives speeches. 前总统仍在发表演讲。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_74","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"informant","back":"释义\nn. 提供消息者；线人\n词根词缀\ninform 告知 + ant 人 → 提供信息者\n助记\ninform v.通知；information n.信息；whistleblower n.举报人\n例句\nThe journalist refused to name her ==informant== . 记者拒绝透露线人姓名。","fields":{"Front":"informant","Back":"释义\nn. 提供消息者；线人\n词根词缀\ninform 告知 + ant 人 → 提供信息者\n助记\ninform v.通知；information n.信息；whistleblower n.举报人\n例句\nThe journalist refused to name her ==informant== . 记者拒绝透露线人姓名。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_75","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"melodic","back":"释义\nadj. 旋律的；音调优美的\n词根词缀\nmelod 旋律 + ic 形容词 → 有关旋律的\n助记\nmelody n.旋律；melodious adj.悦耳的；rhythmic adj.有节奏的\n例句\nThe song has a simple but memorable ==melodic== line. 这首歌有简单却难忘的旋律线。","fields":{"Front":"melodic","Back":"释义\nadj. 旋律的；音调优美的\n词根词缀\nmelod 旋律 + ic 形容词 → 有关旋律的\n助记\nmelody n.旋律；melodious adj.悦耳的；rhythmic adj.有节奏的\n例句\nThe song has a simple but memorable ==melodic== line. 这首歌有简单却难忘的旋律线。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_76","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"mythology","back":"释义\nn. 神话；神话集\n词根词缀\nmyth 神话 + ology …学 → 神话体系\n助记\nmyth n.神话；mythical adj.神话的；folklore n.民间传说\n例句\nGreek ==mythology== is full of gods and heroes. 希腊神话中充满了神与英雄。","fields":{"Front":"mythology","Back":"释义\nn. 神话；神话集\n词根词缀\nmyth 神话 + ology …学 → 神话体系\n助记\nmyth n.神话；mythical adj.神话的；folklore n.民间传说\n例句\nGreek ==mythology== is full of gods and heroes. 希腊神话中充满了神与英雄。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_77","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"narrate","back":"释义\nv. 叙述；讲述；解说\n词根词缀\nnarr 知晓、讲述（narrative）+ ate 动词 → 讲出来\n助记\nnarration n.叙述；narrator n.叙述者；relate v.讲述\n例句\nThe documentary is ==narrated== by a famous actor. 这部纪录片由一位著名演员解说。","fields":{"Front":"narrate","Back":"释义\nv. 叙述；讲述；解说\n词根词缀\nnarr 知晓、讲述（narrative）+ ate 动词 → 讲出来\n助记\nnarration n.叙述；narrator n.叙述者；relate v.讲述\n例句\nThe documentary is ==narrated== by a famous actor. 这部纪录片由一位著名演员解说。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_78","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"pensive","back":"释义\nadj. 沉思的；忧郁的\n词根词缀\npens 称量、权衡（ponder）+ ive → 在心中掂量\n助记\npensiveness n.沉思；thoughtful adj.沉思的；meditative adj.冥想的\n例句\nShe looked ==pensive== , staring quietly out the window. 她静静望着窗外，神情若有所思。","fields":{"Front":"pensive","Back":"释义\nadj. 沉思的；忧郁的\n词根词缀\npens 称量、权衡（ponder）+ ive → 在心中掂量\n助记\npensiveness n.沉思；thoughtful adj.沉思的；meditative adj.冥想的\n例句\nShe looked ==pensive== , staring quietly out the window. 她静静望着窗外，神情若有所思。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_79","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"proponent","back":"释义\nn. 支持者；提倡者\n词根词缀\npro 支持 + pon 放置（component 同根）+ ent 人 → 提出支持的人\n助记\npropose v.提议；advocate n.倡导者；反 opponent n.反对者\n例句\nShe is a leading ==proponent== of renewable energy. 她是可再生能源的主要倡导者。","fields":{"Front":"proponent","Back":"释义\nn. 支持者；提倡者\n词根词缀\npro 支持 + pon 放置（component 同根）+ ent 人 → 提出支持的人\n助记\npropose v.提议；advocate n.倡导者；反 opponent n.反对者\n例句\nShe is a leading ==proponent== of renewable energy. 她是可再生能源的主要倡导者。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_80","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"puddle","back":"释义\nn. 水坑；水洼\n词根词缀\n古英语 pudd 小水洼 + le 指小 → 一小洼水\n助记\npond n.池塘；pool n.水塘；paddle v.蹚水\n例句\nChildren jumped in the ==puddles== after the rain. 雨后孩子们在水坑里跳来跳去。","fields":{"Front":"puddle","Back":"释义\nn. 水坑；水洼\n词根词缀\n古英语 pudd 小水洼 + le 指小 → 一小洼水\n助记\npond n.池塘；pool n.水塘；paddle v.蹚水\n例句\nChildren jumped in the ==puddles== after the rain. 雨后孩子们在水坑里跳来跳去。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_81","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"signify","back":"释义\nv. 表示；意味着；要紧\n词根词缀\nsign 记号、信号 + ify 使 → 用记号表达\n助记\nsignificance n.意义；significant adj.重要的；denote v.表示\n例句\nA red light ==signifies== that you must stop. 红灯表示你必须停下。","fields":{"Front":"signify","Back":"释义\nv. 表示；意味着；要紧\n词根词缀\nsign 记号、信号 + ify 使 → 用记号表达\n助记\nsignificance n.意义；significant adj.重要的；denote v.表示\n例句\nA red light ==signifies== that you must stop. 红灯表示你必须停下。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l8_82","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"tragic","back":"释义\nadj. 悲剧的；悲惨的\n词根词缀\ntrag 山羊（tragedy 原义山羊歌）+ ic → 悲剧的\n助记\ntragedy n.悲剧；tragically adv.悲惨地；comic adj.喜剧的\n例句\nThe accident was a ==tragic== loss for the whole community. 这场事故是整个社区的惨痛损失。","fields":{"Front":"tragic","Back":"释义\nadj. 悲剧的；悲惨的\n词根词缀\ntrag 山羊（tragedy 原义山羊歌）+ ic → 悲剧的\n助记\ntragedy n.悲剧；tragically adv.悲惨地；comic adj.喜剧的\n例句\nThe accident was a ==tragic== loss for the whole community. 这场事故是整个社区的惨痛损失。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 8 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]}]},{"id":"toefl-list-9","name":"TOEFL 托福 › List 9","description":"托福核心词 · List 9（76 词 · 释义 + 词根词缀 + 助记 + 标黄例句）","createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["toefl","imported"],"options":{"newPerDay":null,"reviewsPerDay":null,"learningSteps":null,"relearningSteps":null,"graduatingInterval":null,"easyInterval":null,