"fields":{"Front":"feudal","Back":"释义\nadj. 封建的；封建制度的\n词根词缀\nfeudum 封地 + al → 封地制的\n助记\nfeudalism n.封建主义；fief n.封地；feud n.世仇\n例句\nSerfs worked the land under the ==feudal== system. 封建制度下农奴耕种土地。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 9 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l9_8","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"motif","back":"释义\nn. 主题；（艺术）母题\n词根词缀\nmot 动 + if → 推动作品的核心意念\n助记\nmotive n.动机；theme n.主题；leitmotif n.主旋律\n例句\nThe rose is a recurring ==motif== in her paintings. 玫瑰是她画作中反复出现的母题。","fields":{"Front":"motif","Back":"释义\nn. 主题；（艺术）母题\n词根词缀\nmot 动 + if → 推动作品的核心意念\n助记\nmotive n.动机；theme n.主题；leitmotif n.主旋律\n例句\nThe rose is a recurring ==motif== in her paintings. 玫瑰是她画作中反复出现的母题。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 9 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l9_9","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"offer","back":"释义\nv./n. 提供；提出；报价\n词根词缀\nof (=ob) 向 + fer 拿 → 拿到面前\n助记\noffering n.祭品；offer letter 录用通知；provide v.提供\n例句\nThey ==offered== me a job after the interview. 面试后他们给了我一份工作。","fields":{"Front":"offer","Back":"释义\nv./n. 提供；提出；报价\n词根词缀\nof (=ob) 向 + fer 拿 → 拿到面前\n助记\noffering n.祭品；offer letter 录用通知；provide v.提供\n例句\nThey ==offered== me a job after the interview. 面试后他们给了我一份工作。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 9 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","sc