of the plants we eat. 蜜蜂为许多食用植物授粉。","fields":{"Front":"pollinate","Back":"释义\nv. 给…授粉\n词根词缀\npollen 花粉 + ate 动词 → 传递花粉\n助记\npollen n.花粉；pollination n.授粉；pollinator n.传粉者\n例句\nBees ==pollinate== many of the plants we eat. 蜜蜂为许多食用植物授粉。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 9 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l9_13","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"shore","back":"释义\nn./v. 岸，海滨；支撑\n词根词缀\n古英语 scora 岸 → 海与陆地相接处\n助记\nashore adv.向岸；coast n.海岸；seashore n.海滨\n例句\nThey walked along the ==shore== collecting shells. 他们沿海岸散步捡贝壳。","fields":{"Front":"shore","Back":"释义\nn./v. 岸，海滨；支撑\n词根词缀\n古英语 scora 岸 → 海与陆地相接处\n助记\nashore adv.向岸；coast n.海岸；seashore n.海滨\n例句\nThey walked along the ==shore== collecting shells. 他们沿海岸散步捡贝壳。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 9 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l9_14","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"sustenance","back":"释义\nn. 食物；营养；生计\n词根词缀\nsus (=sub) 在下 + ten 支撑（contain）+ ance → 维持生命之物\n助记\nsustain v.维持；sustainable adj.可持续的；nourishment n.营养\n例句\nThey lived on simple ==sustenance== from the land. 他们靠土地产出的简单食物为生。","fields":{"Front":"sustenance","Back":"释义\nn. 食物；营养；生计\n词根词缀\nsus (=sub) 在下 + ten 支撑（contain）+ ance → 维持生命之物\n助记\nsustain v.维持；sustainable adj.可持续的；nourishment n.营养\n例句\nThey lived on simple ==sustenance== from the land. 他们靠土地产出的简单食物为生。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 9 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":fa