d== his studies while playing games. 他打游戏而荒废学业。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 9 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l9_52","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"outrageous","back":"释义\nadj. 骇人的；离谱的；无法容忍的\n词根词缀\nout 超出 + rage 狂暴 + ous → 超出常理\n助记\noutrage n.暴行；outrageously adv.过分地；shocking adj.骇人\n例句\nThey charged an ==outrageous== price for the meal. 这顿饭他们开出离谱的价格。","fields":{"Front":"outrageous","Back":"释义\nadj. 骇人的；离谱的；无法容忍的\n词根词缀\nout 超出 + rage 狂暴 + ous → 超出常理\n助记\noutrage n.暴行；outrageously adv.过分地；shocking adj.骇人\n例句\nThey charged an ==outrageous== price for the meal. 这顿饭他们开出离谱的价格。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 9 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l9_53","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"penicillin","back":"释义\nn. 青霉素；盘尼西林\n词根词缀\npenicill 小刷子（霉菌形似）+ in 素 → 青霉素\n助记\nantibiotic n.抗生素；mold n.霉菌；vaccine n.疫苗\n例句\n==Penicillin== was the first widely used antibiotic. 青霉素是第一种被广泛使用的抗生素。","fields":{"Front":"penicillin","Back":"释义\nn. 青霉素；盘尼西林\n词根词缀\npenicill 小刷子（霉菌形似）+ in 素 → 青霉素\n助记\nantibiotic n.抗生素；mold n.霉菌；vaccine n.疫苗\n例句\n==Penicillin== was the first widely used antibiotic. 青霉素是第一种被广泛使用的抗生素。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 9 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":""