 n.策略\n例句\nThe driver ==maneuvered== the truck into the narrow lane. 司机把卡车巧妙开进窄巷。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 9 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l9_69","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"neutron","back":"释义\nn. 中子\n词根词缀\nneutr 中性（neutral）+ on 粒子后缀 → 中性粒子\n助记\nneutral adj.中性的；proton n.质子；electron n.电子\n例句\nA ==neutron== has no electric charge. 中子不带电荷。","fields":{"Front":"neutron","Back":"释义\nn. 中子\n词根词缀\nneutr 中性（neutral）+ on 粒子后缀 → 中性粒子\n助记\nneutral adj.中性的；proton n.质子；electron n.电子\n例句\nA ==neutron== has no electric charge. 中子不带电荷。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 9 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l9_70","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"rate","back":"释义\nn./v. 比率；速度；费用；评估\n词根词缀\nrat 计算（ratio）→ 比率\n助记\nratio n.比例；rating n.评级；birth rate 出生率\n例句\nThe unemployment ==rate== fell again this month. 本月失业率再次下降。","fields":{"Front":"rate","Back":"释义\nn./v. 比率；速度；费用；评估\n词根词缀\nrat 计算（ratio）→ 比率\n助记\nratio n.比例；rating n.评级；birth rate 出生率\n例句\nThe unemployment ==rate== fell again this month. 本月失业率再次下降。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 9 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"revie