,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l10_2","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"deceptive","back":"释义\nadj. 欺骗的；误导的\n词根词缀\nde 离开 + cept 抓（deceive）+ ive → 引人上当\n助记\ndeceive v.欺骗；deception n.欺骗；deceit n.欺诈\n例句\nAppearances can often be ==deceptive== . 外表往往具有迷惑性。","fields":{"Front":"deceptive","Back":"释义\nadj. 欺骗的；误导的\n词根词缀\nde 离开 + cept 抓（deceive）+ ive → 引人上当\n助记\ndeceive v.欺骗；deception n.欺骗；deceit n.欺诈\n例句\nAppearances can often be ==deceptive== . 外表往往具有迷惑性。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 10 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l10_3","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"delicate","back":"释义\nadj. 精致的；脆弱的；微妙的\n词根词缀\ndelic 精细（delicious）+ ate → 精细的\n助记\ndelicacy n.精致、佳肴；fragile adj.易碎的；subtle adj.微妙的\n例句\nThe cup has a very ==delicate== painted pattern. 杯子有非常精致的手绘图案。","fields":{"Front":"delicate","Back":"释义\nadj. 精致的；脆弱的；微妙的\n词根词缀\ndelic 精细（delicious）+ ate → 精细的\n助记\ndelicacy n.精致、佳肴；fragile adj.易碎的；subtle adj.微妙的\n例句\nThe cup has a very ==delicate== painted pattern. 杯子有非常精致的手绘图案。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 10 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l10_4","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"foliage","back":"释义\nn. 叶子（总称）\n词根词缀\nfoli 叶子（folio）+ age 总称\n助记\nleaf n.叶子；defoliate v.使落叶；foliage plant 观叶植物\n例句\nThe autumn ==foliage== turned red and gold. 秋叶变成红色和金色。","fields":{"Front":"foliage","Back":"释义\nn. 叶子（总称）\n词根词缀\nfoli 叶子（folio）+ age 总称\n助记\nleaf n.叶子；defoliate v.使落叶；foliage plant 观叶植物\n例句\nThe autumn ==foliage== turned red and gold. 秋叶变成红色和金色。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 10 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l10_5","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"glue","back":"释义\nn./v. 胶；胶合；紧盯\n词根词缀\n古法语 glu 胶（拉丁 glus）→ 粘住\n助记\nbe glued to 紧盯；gluey adj.胶黏的；paste n.浆糊；stick v.粘\n例句\nHe ==glued== the broken handle back onto the cup. 他把断掉的把手粘回杯子。","fields":{"Front":"glue","Back":"释义\nn./v. 胶；胶合；紧盯\n词根词缀\n古法语 glu 胶（拉丁 glus）→ 粘住\n助记\nbe glued to 紧盯；gluey adj.胶黏的；paste n.浆糊；stick v.粘\n例句\nHe ==glued== the broken handle back onto the cup. 他把断掉的把手粘回杯子。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 10 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l10_6","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"improvise","back":"释义\nv. 即兴创作；临时凑做\n词根词缀\nim (=in) 未 + pro 预先 + vis 看（provide）→ 未预备\n助记\nimprovisation n.即兴；impromptu adj.即兴的；extemporize v.即兴\n例句\nThe band ==improvised== a long jazz solo. 乐队即兴演奏了长长的爵士独奏。","fields":{"Front":"improvise","Back":"释义\nv. 即兴创作；临时凑做\n词根词缀\nim (=in) 未 + pro 预先 + vis 看（provide）→ 未预备\n助记\nimprovisation n.即兴；impromptu adj.即兴的；extemporize v.即兴\n例句\nThe band ==improvised== a long jazz solo. 乐队即兴演奏了长长的爵士独奏。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 10 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l10_7","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"inflation","back":"释义\nn. 通货膨胀；膨胀\n词根词缀\nin 向内 + flat 吹（inflate）+ ion → 吹胀\n助记\ninflate v.使膨胀；deflation n.通货紧缩；inflatable adj.可充气的\n例句\n==Inflation== pushed the price of food much higher. 通货膨胀推高了食品价格。","fields":{"Front":"inflation","Back":"释义\nn. 通货膨胀；膨胀\n词根词缀\nin 向内 + flat 吹（inflate）+ ion → 吹胀\n助记\ninflate v.使膨胀；deflation n.通货紧缩；inflatable adj.可充气的\n例句\n==Inflation== pushed the price of food much higher. 通货膨胀推高了食品价格。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 10 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l10_8","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"lash","back":"释义\nv./n. 鞭打；猛击；睫毛\n词根词缀\n中古英语 lashen 鞭打 → 抽打\n助记\neyelash n.睫毛；whip v.鞭打；lashing n.鞭打\n例句\nRain ==lashed== against the windows all night. 雨整夜猛打窗户。","fields":{"Front":"lash","Back":"释义\nv./n. 鞭打；猛击；睫毛\n词根词缀\n中古英语 lashen 鞭打 → 抽打\n助记\neyelash n.睫毛；whip v.鞭打；lashing n.鞭打\n例句\nRain ==lashed== against the windows all night. 雨整夜猛打窗户。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 10 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step"