onize v.同步\n例句\nTwo ==simultaneous== explosions shook the city. 两起同时发生的爆炸震动了城市。","fields":{"Front":"simultaneous","Back":"释义\nadj. 同时的；同步的\n词根词缀\nsimul 一起（similar）+ taneous → 同时\n助记\nsimultaneously adv.同时；simulate v.模拟；synchronize v.同步\n例句\nTwo ==simultaneous== explosions shook the city. 两起同时发生的爆炸震动了城市。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 10 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l10_17","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"spontaneous","back":"释义\nadj. 自发的；自然的\n词根词缀\nspont 自愿（sponte）+ aneous → 自发\n助记\nspontaneity n.自发性；voluntary adj.自愿的；impulsive adj.冲动的\n例句\nThe crowd broke into ==spontaneous== applause. 人群自发挥起掌声。","fields":{"Front":"spontaneous","Back":"释义\nadj. 自发的；自然的\n词根词缀\nspont 自愿（sponte）+ aneous → 自发\n助记\nspontaneity n.自发性；voluntary adj.自愿的；impulsive adj.冲动的\n例句\nThe crowd broke into ==spontaneous== applause. 人群自发挥起掌声。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 10 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l10_18","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"summit","back":"释义\nn. 顶峰；峰会\n词根词缀\nsumm 最高（sum）+ it → 最高点\n助记\npeak n.山峰；summit meeting 峰会；反 base\n例句\nThey reached the ==summit== just before sunrise. 他们在日出前抵达顶峰。","fields":{"Front":"summit","Back":"释义\nn. 顶峰；峰会\n词根词缀\nsumm 最高（sum）+ it → 最高点\n助记\npeak n.山峰；summit meeting 峰会；反 base\n例句\nThey reached the ==summit== just before sunrise. 他们在日出前抵达顶峰。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 10 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":fal