nShe felt deep ==sympathy== for the homeless man. 她对无家可归者深怀同情。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 10 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l10_61","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"thrifty","back":"释义\nadj. 节俭的；节约的\n词根词缀\nthrift 节俭（thrive）+ y → 节俭\n助记\nthrift n.节俭；economical adj.经济的；frugal adj.俭朴的；反 wasteful\n例句\nHe was ==thrifty== and saved every extra dollar. 他很节俭，省下每一分余钱。","fields":{"Front":"thrifty","Back":"释义\nadj. 节俭的；节约的\n词根词缀\nthrift 节俭（thrive）+ y → 节俭\n助记\nthrift n.节俭；economical adj.经济的；frugal adj.俭朴的；反 wasteful\n例句\nHe was ==thrifty== and saved every extra dollar. 他很节俭，省下每一分余钱。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 10 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l10_62","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"tropic","back":"释义\nn./adj. 回归线；热带；热带的\n词根词缀\ntrop 转向 → 太阳“回转”之线\n助记\ntropical adj.热带的；the tropics 热带；subtropical adj.亚热带的\n例句\nThe fruit grows near the ==tropic== . 这种水果长在热带附近。","fields":{"Front":"tropic","Back":"释义\nn./adj. 回归线；热带；热带的\n词根词缀\ntrop 转向 → 太阳“回转”之线\n助记\ntropical adj.热带的；the tropics 热带；subtropical adj.亚热带的\n例句\nThe fruit grows near the ==tropic== . 这种水果长在热带附近。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 10 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedD