6-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l10_73","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"microprocessor","back":"释义\nn. 微处理器\n词根词缀\nmicro 微小 + process 处理 + or 物 → 微处理器\n助记\nprocessor n.处理器；microchip n.微芯片；CPU 中央处理器\n例句\nThe ==microprocessor== controls the whole device. 微处理器控制整个设备。","fields":{"Front":"microprocessor","Back":"释义\nn. 微处理器\n词根词缀\nmicro 微小 + process 处理 + or 物 → 微处理器\n助记\nprocessor n.处理器；microchip n.微芯片；CPU 中央处理器\n例句\nThe ==microprocessor== controls the whole device. 微处理器控制整个设备。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 10 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l10_74","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"oceanographer","back":"释义\nn. 海洋学家\n词根词缀\nocean 海洋 + graph 记录 + er 人 → 海洋研究者\n助记\noceanography n.海洋学；geographer n.地理学家；marine adj.海洋的\n例句\nThe ==oceanographer== studied deep-sea currents. 海洋学家研究深海洋流。","fields":{"Front":"oceanographer","Back":"释义\nn. 海洋学家\n词根词缀\nocean 海洋 + graph 记录 + er 人 → 海洋研究者\n助记\noceanography n.海洋学；geographer n.地理学家；marine adj.海洋的\n例句\nThe ==oceanographer== studied deep-sea currents. 海洋学家研究深海洋流。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 10 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l10_75","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"range","back":"释义\nn./v. 范围；山脉；射程；变化；排列\n词根词缀\n古法语 range 排列、行列（rank）→ 范围\n助记\narrange v.安排；ranger n.护林员；a range of 一系列\n例句\nThe prices ==range== from ten to fifty dollars. 价格从十到五十美元不等。","fields":{"Front":"range","Back":"释义\nn./v. 范围；山脉；射程；变化；排列\n词根词缀\n古法语 range 排列、行列（rank）→ 范围\n助记\narrange v.安排；ranger n.护林员；a range of 一系列\n例句\nThe prices ==range== from ten to fifty dollars. 价格从十到五十美元不等。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 10 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l10_76","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"staggering","back":"释义\nadj. 令人震惊的；巨大的\n词根词缀\nstagger 蹒跚、使摇晃 → 惊人到踉跄\n助记\nstagger v.蹒跚；astonishing adj.惊人的；astounding adj.令人惊骇的\n例句\nThe project cost a ==staggering== sum of money. 项目耗资惊人。","fields":{"Front":"staggering","Back":"释义\nadj. 令人震惊的；巨大的\n词根词缀\nstagger 蹒跚、使摇晃 → 惊人到踉跄\n助记\nstagger v.蹒跚；astonishing adj.惊人的；astounding adj.令人惊骇的\n例句\nThe project cost a ==staggering== sum of money. 项目耗资惊人。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 10 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l10_77","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"stanza","back":"释义\nn. （诗的）节，段\n词根词缀\n意大利语 stanza 停留、房间（stand 同根）→ 诗中停顿之节\n助记\nverse n.诗句；line n.诗行；chapter n.章节\n例句\nThe poem has four ==stanzas== of six lines. 这首诗有四节，每节六行。","fields":{"Front":"stanza","Back":"释义\nn. （诗的）节，段\n词根词缀\n意大利语 stanza 停留、房间（stand 同根）→ 诗中停顿之节\n助记\nverse n.诗句；line n.诗行；chapter n.章节\n例句\nThe poem has four ==stanzas== of six lines. 这首诗有四节，每节六行。","E