teId":"toefl_l10_80","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"trivial","back":"释义\nadj. 琐碎的；微不足道的\n词根词缀\ntri 三 + via 路（三岔路口闲谈琐事）→ 琐碎\n助记\ntriviality n.琐事；trifle n.小事；petty adj.琐碎的；反 important\n例句\nDon't waste time on ==trivial== details. 别把时间浪费在琐碎细节上。","fields":{"Front":"trivial","Back":"释义\nadj. 琐碎的；微不足道的\n词根词缀\ntri 三 + via 路（三岔路口闲谈琐事）→ 琐碎\n助记\ntriviality n.琐事；trifle n.小事；petty adj.琐碎的；反 important\n例句\nDon't waste time on ==trivial== details. 别把时间浪费在琐碎细节上。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 10 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l10_81","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"vertebrate","back":"释义\nn./adj. 脊椎动物；有脊椎的\n词根词缀\nvertebr 脊椎（vertex 转折处）+ ate → 有脊椎\n助记\ninvertebrate n.无脊椎动物；spine n.脊柱；backbone n.脊椎\n例句\nFish, birds and mammals are ==vertebrates== . 鱼、鸟和哺乳动物都是脊椎动物。","fields":{"Front":"vertebrate","Back":"释义\nn./adj. 脊椎动物；有脊椎的\n词根词缀\nvertebr 脊椎（vertex 转折处）+ ate → 有脊椎\n助记\ninvertebrate n.无脊椎动物；spine n.脊柱；backbone n.脊椎\n例句\nFish, birds and mammals are ==vertebrates== . 鱼、鸟和哺乳动物都是脊椎动物。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 10 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]}]},{"id":"toefl-list-11","name":"TOEFL 托福 › List 11","description":"托福核心词 · List 11（85 词 · 释义 + 词根词缀 + 助记 + 标黄例句）","createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["toefl","imported"],"options":{"newPerDay":null,"reviewsPerDay":null,"learningSteps":null,"relearningSteps":null,"graduatingI