==anteceded== the Iron Age. 青铜时代先于铁器时代。","fields":{"Front":"antecede","Back":"释义\nv. 先于；在…之前\n词根词缀\nante 在前 + cede 走（proceed）→ 走在前面\n助记\nantecedent n.前事；precede v.先于；ancestor n.祖先\n例句\nThe Bronze Age ==anteceded== the Iron Age. 青铜时代先于铁器时代。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 11 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l11_3","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"bruise","back":"释义\nn./v. 瘀伤；使受瘀伤\n词根词缀\n古英语 brysan 压碎 → 磕碰出瘀青\n助记\nbruising n.瘀伤；injure v.受伤；swelling n.肿块\n例句\nShe had a ==bruise== on her arm after the fall. 她摔倒后手臂有瘀青。","fields":{"Front":"bruise","Back":"释义\nn./v. 瘀伤；使受瘀伤\n词根词缀\n古英语 brysan 压碎 → 磕碰出瘀青\n助记\nbruising n.瘀伤；injure v.受伤；swelling n.肿块\n例句\nShe had a ==bruise== on her arm after the fall. 她摔倒后手臂有瘀青。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 11 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l11_4","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"condiment","back":"释义\nn. 调味品；佐料\n词根词缀\ncon 加强 + diment 调味（condire 腌渍）→ 调料\n助记\nseasoning n.调料；spice n.香料；sauce n.酱汁\n例句\nSalt and pepper are common ==condiments== . 盐和胡椒是常见调味品。","fields":{"Front":"condiment","Back":"释义\nn. 调味品；佐料\n词根词缀\ncon 加强 + diment 调味（condire 腌渍）→ 调料\n助记\nseasoning n.调料；spice n.香料；sauce n.酱汁\n例句\nSalt and pepper are common ==condiments== . 盐和胡椒是常见调味品。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 11 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l11_5","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"conducive","back":"释义\nadj. 有益的；有助于…的\n词根词缀\ncon 共同 + duc 引导（conduct）+ ive → 引向有利\n助记\nconduce v.有助于；favorable adj.有利的；beneficial adj.有益的\n例句\nQuiet rooms are ==conducive== to study. 安静房间有助于学习。","fields":{"Front":"conducive","Back":"释义\nadj. 有益的；有助于…的\n词根词缀\ncon 共同 + duc 引导（conduct）+ ive → 引向有利\n助记\nconduce v.有助于；favorable adj.有利的；beneficial adj.有益的\n例句\nQuiet rooms are ==conducive== to study. 安静房间有助于学习。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 11 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l11_6","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"cowhand","back":"释义\nn. 牧场工人；牛仔\n词根词缀\ncow 牛 + hand 人手 → 牧牛工\n助记\ncowboy n.牛仔；ranch hand 牧场工；herder n.牧人\n例句\nThe ==cowhand== rode out to round up the cattle. 牧牛工骑马去赶牛。","fields":{"Front":"cowhand","Back":"释义\nn. 牧场工人；牛仔\n词根词缀\ncow 牛 + hand 人手 → 牧牛工\n助记\ncowboy n.牛仔；ranch hand 牧场工；herder n.牧人\n例句\nThe ==cowhand== rode out to round up the cattle. 牧牛工骑马去赶牛。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 11 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l11_7","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"dateline","back":"释义\nn. 日期栏；国际日期变更线\n词根词缀\ndate 日期 + line 栏、线 → 日期栏\n助记\ndeadline n.截止日期；International Date Line 国际日期变更线\n例句\nThe reporter's name appeared above the ==dateline== . 记者姓名出现在电头日期栏上方。","fields":{"Front":"dateline","Back":"释义\nn. 日期栏；国际日期变更线\n词根词缀\ndate 日期 + line 栏、线 → 日期栏\n助记\ndeadline n.截止日期；International Date Line 国际日期变更线\n例句\nThe reporter's name appeared above the ==dateline== . 记者姓名出现在电头日期栏上方。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 11 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l11_8","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"dawn","back":"释义\nn./v. 黎明；开端；破晓\n词根词缀\n古英语 dagung 变亮（day 同根）→ 破晓\n助记\ndaybreak n.拂晓；dusk n.黄昏；the dawn of …的开端\n例句\nThey set off at ==dawn== to catch the train. 他们黎明出发赶火车。","fields":{"Front":"dawn","Back":"释义\nn./v. 黎明；开端；破晓\n词根词缀\n古英语 dagung 变亮（day 同根）→ 破晓\n助记\ndaybreak n.拂晓；dusk n.黄昏；the dawn of …的开端\n例句\nThey set off at ==dawn== to catch the train. 他们黎明出发赶火车。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 11 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l11_9","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"deem","back":"释义\nv. 认为；视为\n词根词缀\n古英语 deman 判断（doom 同根）→ 判定、认为\n助记\nconsider v.认为；regard v.看待；judge v.判断\n例句\nThe plan was ==deemed== too risky to try. 该计划被认为风险太大。","fields":{"Front":"deem","Back":"释义\nv. 认为；视为\n词根词缀\n古英语 deman 判断（doom 同根）→ 判定、认为\n助记\nconsider v.认为；regard v.看待；judge v.判断\n例句\nThe plan was ==deemed== too risky to try. 该计划被认为风险太大。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 11 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00