y n.尊严；outraged adj.震怒的\n例句\nShe was ==indignant== at the unfair accusation. 她对不公指控感到愤慨。","fields":{"Front":"indignant","Back":"释义\nadj. 愤慨的；义愤的\n词根词缀\nin 不 + dign 值得（dignity）+ ant → 认为不公而怒\n助记\nindignation n.愤慨；dignity n.尊严；outraged adj.震怒的\n例句\nShe was ==indignant== at the unfair accusation. 她对不公指控感到愤慨。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 11 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l11_13","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"lore","back":"释义\nn. 知识；传说；民间学问\n词根词缀\n古英语 lar 学问（learn 同根）→ 世代相传的知识\n助记\nfolklore n.民间传说；wisdom n.智慧；legend n.传说\n例句\nOld herbal ==lore== described which plants heal. 古老草药学记载哪些植物可治病。","fields":{"Front":"lore","Back":"释义\nn. 知识；传说；民间学问\n词根词缀\n古英语 lar 学问（learn 同根）→ 世代相传的知识\n助记\nfolklore n.民间传说；wisdom n.智慧；legend n.传说\n例句\nOld herbal ==lore== described which plants heal. 古老草药学记载哪些植物可治病。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 11 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l11_14","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"meticulous","back":"释义\nadj. 一丝不苟的；极仔细的\n词根词缀\nmetic 畏惧（metus 恐惧）+ ulous → 怕出错而仔细\n助记\nmeticulously adv.细致地；scrupulous adj.严谨的；反 careless\n例句\nHe kept ==meticulous== notes of every experiment. 他对每个实验都做了一丝不苟的记录。","fields":{"Front":"meticulous","Back":"释义\nadj. 一丝不苟的；极仔细的\n词根词缀\nmetic 畏惧（metus 恐惧）+ ulous → 怕出错而仔细\n助记\nmeticulously adv.细致地；scrupulous adj.严谨的；反 careless\n例句\nHe kept ==meticulous== notes of every experiment. 他对每个实验都做了一丝不苟的记录。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 11 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l11_15","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"noteworthy","back":"释义\nadj. 值得注意的；显著的\n词根词缀\nnote 注意 + worthy 值得的 → 值得留意\n助记\nnotable adj.显著的；remarkable adj.非凡的；反 ordinary\n例句\nThe study produced several ==noteworthy== results. 研究得出几项值得注意的结果。","fields":{"Front":"noteworthy","Back":"释义\nadj. 值得注意的；显著的\n词根词缀\nnote 注意 + worthy 值得的 → 值得留意\n助记\nnotable adj.显著的；remarkable adj.非凡的；反 ordinary\n例句\nThe study produced several ==noteworthy== results. 研究得出几项值得注意的结果。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 11 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l11_16","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"refute","back":"释义\nv. 反驳；驳斥；驳倒\n词根词缀\nre 回 + fute 打 → 回击、驳倒\n助记\nrefutation n.驳斥；disprove v.证伪；contradict v.反驳；反 support\n例句\nThe lawyer ==refuted== the witness's claim. 律师驳斥了证人的说法。","fields":{"Front":"refute","Back":"释义\nv. 反驳；驳斥；驳倒\n词根词缀\nre 回 + fute 打 → 回击、驳倒\n助记\nrefutation n.驳斥；disprove v.证伪；contradict v.反驳；反 support\n例句\nThe lawyer ==refuted== the witness's claim. 律师驳斥了证人的说法。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 11 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"r