":"释义\nn. 热情；热忱\n词根词缀\nen 在内 + thus (=the) 神（entheos 神灵附体）+ iasm → 狂热\n助记\nenthusiastic adj.热情的；passion n.激情；eagerness n.热切\n例句\nShe showed great ==enthusiasm== for the project. 她对项目表现出极大热情。","fields":{"Front":"enthusiasm","Back":"释义\nn. 热情；热忱\n词根词缀\nen 在内 + thus (=the) 神（entheos 神灵附体）+ iasm → 狂热\n助记\nenthusiastic adj.热情的；passion n.激情；eagerness n.热切\n例句\nShe showed great ==enthusiasm== for the project. 她对项目表现出极大热情。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 11 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l11_72","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"ethic","back":"释义\nn. 伦理；道德标准\n词根词缀\neth 习俗、品格（ethos）+ ic → 道德准则\n助记\nethics n.伦理学；ethical adj.道德的；moral n.道德\n例句\nA strong work ==ethic== made her successful. 强烈职业道德让她成功。","fields":{"Front":"ethic","Back":"释义\nn. 伦理；道德标准\n词根词缀\neth 习俗、品格（ethos）+ ic → 道德准则\n助记\nethics n.伦理学；ethical adj.道德的；moral n.道德\n例句\nA strong work ==ethic== made her successful. 强烈职业道德让她成功。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 11 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l11_73","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"fragrant","back":"释义\nadj. 芳香的；芬芳的\n词根词缀\nfragr 散发香气（fragrare）+ ant → 芬芳\n助记\nfragrance n.香味；scented adj.有香味的；aromatic adj.芳香的；反 unscented\n例句\nThe garden was full of ==fragrant== roses. 花园满是芬芳玫瑰。","fields":{"Front":"fragrant","Back":"释义\nadj. 芳香的；芬芳的\n词根词缀\nfragr 散发香气（fragrare）+ ant → 芬芳\n助记\nfragrance n.香味；scented adj.有香味的；aromatic adj.芳香的；反 unscented\n例句\n