y 水星\n例句\nOld thermometers contained liquid ==mercury== . 旧温度计装液态水银。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 11 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l11_79","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"perception","back":"释义\nn. 感知；知觉；看法\n词根词缀\nper 完全 + cept 抓住（perceive）+ ion → 感知\n助记\nperceive v.察觉；perceptive adj.敏锐的；sensation n.感觉\n例句\nStress can change ==perception== of risk. 压力会改变对风险的感知。","fields":{"Front":"perception","Back":"释义\nn. 感知；知觉；看法\n词根词缀\nper 完全 + cept 抓住（perceive）+ ion → 感知\n助记\nperceive v.察觉；perceptive adj.敏锐的；sensation n.感觉\n例句\nStress can change ==perception== of risk. 压力会改变对风险的感知。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 11 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l11_80","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"refer","back":"释义\nv. 参考；提及；提交\n词根词缀\nre 回 + fer 带（offer）→ 带回、指涉\n助记\nreference n.参考；refer to 提及；consult v.查阅\n例句\nPlease ==refer== to page ten for the answer. 答案请参见第十页。","fields":{"Front":"refer","Back":"释义\nv. 参考；提及；提交\n词根词缀\nre 回 + fer 带（offer）→ 带回、指涉\n助记\nreference n.参考；refer to 提及；consult v.查阅\n例句\nPlease ==refer== to page ten for the answer. 答案请参见第十页。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 11 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledD