e v.刺激；stimulation n.激励；incentive n.刺激物\n例句\nBright light is a strong ==stimulus== to the eyes. 强光是对眼的强刺激。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 11 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l11_84","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"stir","back":"释义\nv./n. 搅动；激起；移动；搅动\n词根词缀\n古英语 styrian 搅动 → 搅拌、唤起\n助记\nstirring adj.激动人心的；mix v.混合；stir up 激起\n例句\nShe ==stirred== sugar into her tea. 她把糖搅进茶里。","fields":{"Front":"stir","Back":"释义\nv./n. 搅动；激起；移动；搅动\n词根词缀\n古英语 styrian 搅动 → 搅拌、唤起\n助记\nstirring adj.激动人心的；mix v.混合；stir up 激起\n例句\nShe ==stirred== sugar into her tea. 她把糖搅进茶里。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 11 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]}]},{"id":"toefl-list-12","name":"TOEFL 托福 › List 12","description":"托福核心词 · List 12（85 词 · 释义 + 词根词缀 + 助记 + 标黄例句）","createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["toefl","imported"],"options":{"newPerDay":null,"reviewsPerDay":null,"learningSteps":null,"relearningSteps":null,"graduatingInterval":null,"easyInterval":null,"leechThreshold":null,"leechAction":"","buryRelated":null,"maxInterval":null,"requestRetention":null,"newOrder":"","reviewOrder":""},"cards":[{"noteId":"toefl_l12_0","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"acquaint","back":"释义\nv. 使熟悉；使认识\n词根词缀\nac (=ad) 向 + quaint 知道 → 使知晓\n助记\nacquaintance n.熟人；be acquainted with 了解；inform v.告知\n例句\nPlease ==acquaint== yourself with the rules. 请熟悉规则。","fields":{"F