句\nPick up a free ==pamphlet== at the desk. 在前台拿免费小册子。","fields":{"Front":"pamphlet","Back":"释义\nn. 小册子\n词根词缀\n以 Pamphilus（情诗小册）命名 + let 小 → 小册\n助记\nbooklet n.小册子；brochure n.手册；leaflet n.传单\n例句\nPick up a free ==pamphlet== at the desk. 在前台拿免费小册子。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 12 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l12_79","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"predominant","back":"释义\nadj. 占主导的；显著的；主要的\n词根词缀\npre 先 + domin 统治（dominate）+ ant → 居首\n助记\ndominate v.支配；dominant adj.占优的；prevailing adj.流行的\n例句\nEnglish is the ==predominant== language here. 英语是这里主要语言。","fields":{"Front":"predominant","Back":"释义\nadj. 占主导的；显著的；主要的\n词根词缀\npre 先 + domin 统治（dominate）+ ant → 居首\n助记\ndominate v.支配；dominant adj.占优的；prevailing adj.流行的\n例句\nEnglish is the ==predominant== language here. 英语是这里主要语言。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 12 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l12_80","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"prominent","back":"释义\nadj. 突出的；著名的；显眼的\n词根词缀\npro 向前 + min 突出（eminere）+ ent → 前突\n助记\nprominence n.突出；eminent adj.卓越的；反 obscure\n例句\nA ==prominent== scientist led the study. 杰出科学家主持研究。","fields":{"Front":"prominent","Back":"释义\nadj. 突出的；著名的；显眼的\n词根词缀\npro 向前 + min 突出（eminere）+ ent → 前突\n助记\nprominence n.突出；eminent adj.卓越的；反 obscure\n例句\nA ==prominent== scientist led the study. 杰出科学家主持研究。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 12 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":fal