Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l13_71","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"larva","back":"释义\nn. 幼虫，幼体\n词根词缀\n源自拉丁语 larva（面具、鬼魂），指幼虫形态\n助记\n复数 larvae；pupa 蛹\n例句\nThe egg hatches into a tiny ==larva== . 卵孵化成一只小幼虫。","fields":{"Front":"larva","Back":"释义\nn. 幼虫，幼体\n词根词缀\n源自拉丁语 larva（面具、鬼魂），指幼虫形态\n助记\n复数 larvae；pupa 蛹\n例句\nThe egg hatches into a tiny ==larva== . 卵孵化成一只小幼虫。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 13 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l13_72","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"longevity","back":"释义\nn. 长寿，持久，寿命\n词根词缀\nlong （长）+ ev （年龄、时代）+ -ity → 长寿命\n助记\nmedieval 中世纪的；long-lived 长寿的\n例句\nGood diet contributes to ==longevity== . 良好的饮食有助于长寿。","fields":{"Front":"longevity","Back":"释义\nn. 长寿，持久，寿命\n词根词缀\nlong （长）+ ev （年龄、时代）+ -ity → 长寿命\n助记\nmedieval 中世纪的；long-lived 长寿的\n例句\nGood diet contributes to ==longevity== . 良好的饮食有助于长寿。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 13 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l13_73","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"monastery","back":"释义\nn. 修道院，寺院\n词根词缀\nmonas （独自，同 monk 僧侣）+ -tery （场所）→ 僧侣独居之所\n助记\nmonk 僧侣；monastic 修道院的\n例句\nThe old ==monastery== stood on the hill. 那座古老的修道院坐落在山上。","fields":{"Front":"monastery","Back":"释义\nn. 修道院，寺院\n词根词缀\nmonas （独自，同 monk 僧侣）+ -tery （场所）→ 僧侣独居之所\n助记\nmonk 僧侣；monastic 修道院的\n例句\nThe old ==monastery== stood on the hill. 那座古老的修道院坐落在山上。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 13 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l13_74","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"pioneer","back":"释义\nn./v. 先驱，开拓者；开拓，倡导\n词根词缀\n源自法语 pionnier（步兵、开路者）\n助记\npioneering 开创性的；近义 trailblazer\n例句\nShe was a ==pioneer== in modern medicine. 她是现代医学的先驱。","fields":{"Front":"pioneer","Back":"释义\nn./v. 先驱，开拓者；开拓，倡导\n词根词缀\n源自法语 pionnier（步兵、开路者）\n助记\npioneering 开创性的；近义 trailblazer\n例句\nShe was a ==pioneer== in modern medicine. 她是现代医学的先驱。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 13 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l13_75","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"primal","back":"释义\nadj. 原始的，最初的，首要的\n词根词缀\nprim （第一、最初）+ -al → 最初的\n助记\nprimary 首要的；primitive 原始的\n例句\nHunger is a ==primal== human need. 饥饿是人类的原始需求。","fields":{"Front":"primal","Back":"释义\nadj. 原始的，最初的，首要的\n词根词缀\nprim （第一、最初）+ -al → 最初的\n助记\nprimary 首要的；primitive 原始的\n例句\nHunger is a ==primal== human need. 饥饿是人类的原始需求。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 13 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l13_76","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"revolt","back":"释义\nn./v. 反抗，起义；使反感\n词根词缀\nre- （反）+ volt （转）→ 反转过来 → 反抗\n助记\nrevolution 革命；revolting 令人恶心的\n例句\nThe people rose in ==revolt== against the king. 人民起义反抗国王。","fields":{"Front":"revolt","Back":"释义\nn./v. 反抗，起义；使反感\n词根词缀\nre- （反）+ volt （转）→ 反转过来 → 反抗\n助记\nrevolution 革命；revolting 令人恶心的\n例句\nThe people rose in ==revolt== against the king. 人民起义反抗国王。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 13 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l13_77","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"subsistence","back":"释义\nn. 维持生活，生存，勉强糊口\n词根词缀\nsub- （在下）+ sist （站立）+ -ence → 勉强撑住 → 生存\n助记\nsubsist 维持生存；exist 存在\n例句\nThey lived at a bare ==subsistence== level. 他们过着仅够糊口的生活。","fields":{"Front":"subsistence","Back":"释义\nn. 维持生活，生存，勉强糊口\n词根词缀\nsub- （在下）+ sist （站立）+ -ence → 勉强撑住 → 生存\n助记\nsubsist 维持生存；exist 存在\n例句\nThey lived at a bare ==subsistence== level. 他们过着仅够糊口的生活。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 13 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l13_78","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"wear","back":"释义\nv./n. 穿戴；磨损，耐用；衣物\n词根词缀\n古英语 werian（穿着）\n助记\nwear out 穿破；weary 疲惫的\n例句\nThese shoes ==wear== well and last for years. 这双鞋很耐穿，能穿好几年。","fields":{"Front":"wear","Back":"释义\nv./n. 穿戴；磨损，耐用；衣物\n词根词缀\n古英语 werian（穿着）\n助记\nwear out 穿破；weary 疲惫的\n例句\nThese shoes ==wear== well and last for years. 这双鞋很耐穿，能穿好几年。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":