hed 痛苦的\n例句\nShe cried out in ==anguish== at the news. 听到消息她痛苦地哭喊。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 14 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l14_2","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"apportionment","back":"释义\nn. 分配，分摊，分派\n词根词缀\nap- （=ad-）+ portion （份额）+ -ment → 分成份额\n助记\napportion 分配；portion 一部分\n例句\nThe ==apportionment== of funds was fair to all teams. 资金的分摊对所有团队都公平。","fields":{"Front":"apportionment","Back":"释义\nn. 分配，分摊，分派\n词根词缀\nap- （=ad-）+ portion （份额）+ -ment → 分成份额\n助记\napportion 分配；portion 一部分\n例句\nThe ==apportionment== of funds was fair to all teams. 资金的分摊对所有团队都公平。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 14 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l14_3","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"attentive","back":"释义\nadj. 专心的，留意的；体贴的\n词根词缀\nat- （=ad- 向）+ tent （伸展、注意）+ -ive → 注意力伸向…的\n助记\nattention 注意；attend 专心/出席\n例句\nThe students were ==attentive== during the lecture. 学生们听讲座时很专心。","fields":{"Front":"attentive","Back":"释义\nadj. 专心的，留意的；体贴的\n词根词缀\nat- （=ad- 向）+ tent （伸展、注意）+ -ive → 注意力伸向…的\n助记\nattention 注意；attend 专心/出席\n例句\nThe students were ==attentive== during the lecture. 学生们听讲座时很专心。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 14 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l14_4","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"audition","back":"释义\nn./v. 试镜，试听，面试\n词根词缀\naudit （听）+ -ion → 听（演员表演）→ 试镜\n助记\naudience 观众；audible 听得见的\n例句\nShe has an ==audition== for the play tomorrow. 她明天要参加这部剧的试镜。","fields":{"Front":"audition","Back":"释义\nn./v. 试镜，试听，面试\n词根词缀\naudit （听）+ -ion → 听（演员表演）→ 试镜\n助记\naudience 观众；audible 听得见的\n例句\nShe has an ==audition== for the play tomorrow. 她明天要参加这部剧的试镜。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 14 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l14_5","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"corollary","back":"释义\nn. 必然结果，推论\n词根词缀\ncor- （=com-）+ oll （小的）+ -ary → 附带的结果\n助记\n近义 consequence, result；corollary of …的结果\n例句\nHigher spending is a natural ==corollary== of growth. 支出增加是增长的必然结果。","fields":{"Front":"corollary","Back":"释义\nn. 必然结果，推论\n词根词缀\ncor- （=com-）+ oll （小的）+ -ary → 附带的结果\n助记\n近义 consequence, result；corollary of …的结果\n例句\nHigher spending is a natural ==corollary== of growth. 支出增加是增长的必然结果。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 14 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l14_6","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"descent","back":"释义\nn. 下降；斜坡；血统，出身\n词根词缀\nde- （向下）+ scent （攀爬，同 ascend）→ 向下爬 → 下降\n助记\nascend 上升；of Chinese descent 华裔\n例句\nThe plane began its ==descent== into the airport. 飞机开始向机场下降。","fields":{"Front":"descent","Back":"释义\nn. 下降；斜坡；血统，出身\n词根词缀\nde- （向下）+ scent （攀爬，同 ascend）→ 向下爬 → 下降\n助记\nascend 上升；of Chinese descent 华裔\n例句\nThe plane began its ==descent== into the airport. 飞机开始向机场下降。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 14 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l14_7","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"emancipate","back":"释义\nv. 解放，使摆脱束缚\n词根词缀\ne- （=ex- 出）+ mancip （掌握、所有权）→ 从掌控中放出 → 解放\n助记\nemancipation 解放；近义 liberate, free\n例句\nEducation can ==emancipate== people from poverty. 教育能把人从贫困中解放出来。","fields":{"Front":"emancipate","Back":"释义\nv. 解放，使摆脱束缚\n词根词缀\ne- （=ex- 出）+ mancip （掌握、所有权）→ 从掌控中放出 → 解放\n助记\nemancipation 解放；近义 liberate, free\n例句\nEducation can ==emancipate== people from poverty. 教育能把人从贫困中解放出来。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 14 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l14_8","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"gallop","back":"释义\nv./n. （马）飞奔，疾驰；飞速发展\n词根词缀\n拟声词，模拟马蹄声\n助记\ntrot 小跑；at a gallop 飞快地\n例句\nThe horse ==galloped== across the open field. 马飞奔穿过旷野。","fields":{"Front":"gallop","Back":"释义\nv./n. （马）飞奔，疾驰；飞速发展\n词根词缀\n拟声词，模拟马蹄声\n助记\ntrot 小跑；at a gallop 飞快地\n例句\nThe horse ==galloped== across the open field. 马飞奔穿过旷野。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 14 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"