nt 减少\n例句\nSalary rises in small annual ==increments== . 工资每年小幅增加。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 14 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l14_12","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"myriad","back":"释义\nn./adj. 无数，大量；无数的\n词根词缀\nmyri （一万、无数）+ -ad → 上万的 → 无数的\n助记\n近义 countless, innumerable；反义 few\n例句\nThere are a ==myriad== of stars in the night sky. 夜空中有无数的星星。","fields":{"Front":"myriad","Back":"释义\nn./adj. 无数，大量；无数的\n词根词缀\nmyri （一万、无数）+ -ad → 上万的 → 无数的\n助记\n近义 countless, innumerable；反义 few\n例句\nThere are a ==myriad== of stars in the night sky. 夜空中有无数的星星。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 14 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l14_13","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"protrude","back":"释义\nv. 突出，伸出，鼓起\n词根词缀\npro- （向前）+ trud （推、伸）→ 向前伸出\n助记\nintrude 闯入；protrusion 突出物\n例句\nNails ==protruded== from the old wooden board. 旧木板上伸出几根钉子。","fields":{"Front":"protrude","Back":"释义\nv. 突出，伸出，鼓起\n词根词缀\npro- （向前）+ trud （推、伸）→ 向前伸出\n助记\nintrude 闯入；protrusion 突出物\n例句\nNails ==protruded== from the old wooden board. 旧木板上伸出几根钉子。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 14 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],