e== data to find patterns. 科学家分析数据以寻找规律。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 15 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l15_2","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"artesian","back":"释义\nadj. 自流（井）的\n词根词缀\n源自法语 Artois（地名，自流井发源地）\n助记\nartesian well 自流井；well 井\n例句\nThey drilled an ==artesian== well in the valley. 他们在山谷里钻了一口自流井。","fields":{"Front":"artesian","Back":"释义\nadj. 自流（井）的\n词根词缀\n源自法语 Artois（地名，自流井发源地）\n助记\nartesian well 自流井；well 井\n例句\nThey drilled an ==artesian== well in the valley. 他们在山谷里钻了一口自流井。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 15 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l15_3","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"conductivity","back":"释义\nn. 传导性，电导率\n词根词缀\nconduct （引导、传导）+ -ivity → 传导能力\n助记\nconduct 引导；conductor 导体/指挥\n例句\nCopper has high electrical ==conductivity== . 铜的导电性很强。","fields":{"Front":"conductivity","Back":"释义\nn. 传导性，电导率\n词根词缀\nconduct （引导、传导）+ -ivity → 传导能力\n助记\nconduct 引导；conductor 导体/指挥\n例句\nCopper has high electrical ==conductivity== . 铜的导电性很强。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 15 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l15_4","ord":0,"notet