"释义\nv. 管理，施行；给予（药物、考试）\n词根词缀\nad- （向）+ minister （仆人、服务）→ 服务、掌管 → 管理\n助记\nadministration 管理/行政；minister 部长\n例句\nNurses ==administer== medicine to patients. 护士给病人服药。","fields":{"Front":"administer","Back":"释义\nv. 管理，施行；给予（药物、考试）\n词根词缀\nad- （向）+ minister （仆人、服务）→ 服务、掌管 → 管理\n助记\nadministration 管理/行政；minister 部长\n例句\nNurses ==administer== medicine to patients. 护士给病人服药。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 15 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l15_61","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"astronomy","back":"释义\nn. 天文学\n词根词缀\nastro （星星）+ nomy （规律、学问）→ 研究星体的学问\n助记\nastronaut 宇航员；astronomical 天文的/庞大的\n例句\nShe studied ==astronomy== to understand the universe. 她学习天文学以了解宇宙。","fields":{"Front":"astronomy","Back":"释义\nn. 天文学\n词根词缀\nastro （星星）+ nomy （规律、学问）→ 研究星体的学问\n助记\nastronaut 宇航员；astronomical 天文的/庞大的\n例句\nShe studied ==astronomy== to understand the universe. 她学习天文学以了解宇宙。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 15 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l15_62","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"cargo","back":"释义\nn. （船、飞机装载的）货物\n词根词缀\ncar- （=charge 装载）+ go → 被运载之物\n助记\ncarriage 运输/车厢；discharge 卸下\n例句\nThe ship unloaded its ==cargo== at the port. 船在港口卸下货物。","fields":{"Front":"cargo","Back":"释义\nn. （船、飞机装载的）货物\n词根词缀\ncar- （=charge 装载）+ go → 被运载之物\n助记\ncarriage 运输/车厢；discharge 卸下\n例句\nThe ship unloaded its ==cargo== at the port. 船在港口卸下货物。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 15 组"