"back":"释义\nv. 波动，起伏，涨落\n词根词缀\nfluctu （流动、波浪，同 fluent）+ -ate → 像波浪般起伏\n助记\nfluctuation 波动；fluid 流体\n例句\nPrices ==fluctuate== with demand. 价格随需求波动。","fields":{"Front":"fluctuate","Back":"释义\nv. 波动，起伏，涨落\n词根词缀\nfluctu （流动、波浪，同 fluent）+ -ate → 像波浪般起伏\n助记\nfluctuation 波动；fluid 流体\n例句\nPrices ==fluctuate== with demand. 价格随需求波动。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 15 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l15_66","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"impermeable","back":"释义\nadj. 不可渗透的，不透水的\n词根词缀\nim- （不）+ perme （穿过、渗透）+ -able → 穿不过的\n助记\npermeate 渗透；permeable 可渗透的\n例句\nThe jacket is made of ==impermeable== fabric. 这件夹克用不透水的面料制成。","fields":{"Front":"impermeable","Back":"释义\nadj. 不可渗透的，不透水的\n词根词缀\nim- （不）+ perme （穿过、渗透）+ -able → 穿不过的\n助记\npermeate 渗透；permeable 可渗透的\n例句\nThe jacket is made of ==impermeable== fabric. 这件夹克用不透水的面料制成。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 15 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l15_67","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"inferior","back":"释义\nadj./n. 较差的，下级的；下级\n词根词缀\ninfer （低）+ -ior （比较级）→ 更低的\n助记\nsuperior 优越的；inferiority 自卑/低劣\n例句\nCheap goods are often of ==inferior== quality. 廉价商品往往质量较差。","fields":{"Front":"inferior","Back":"释义\nadj./n. 较差的，下级的；下级\n词根词缀\ninfer （低）+ -ior （比较级）→ 更低的\n助记\nsuperior 优越的；inferiority 自卑/低劣\n例句\nCheap goods are often of ==inferior== quality. 廉价商品往往质量较差。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 15 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"