夺\n词根词缀\nprey （源自拉丁语 praeda 战利品、猎物）\n助记\npredator 捕食者；prey on 捕食/折磨\n例句\nThe lion stalked its ==prey== silently. 狮子悄悄潜近猎物。","fields":{"Front":"prey","Back":"释义\nn./v. 猎物，受害者；捕食，掠夺\n词根词缀\nprey （源自拉丁语 praeda 战利品、猎物）\n助记\npredator 捕食者；prey on 捕食/折磨\n例句\nThe lion stalked its ==prey== silently. 狮子悄悄潜近猎物。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 15 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l15_71","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"quiescent","back":"释义\nadj. 静止的，休眠的，不活动的\n词根词缀\nquies （安静，同 quiet）+ -cent → 安静的\n助记\nquiet 安静的；acquiesce 默许\n例句\nThe volcano has remained ==quiescent== for decades. 这座火山已休眠数十年。","fields":{"Front":"quiescent","Back":"释义\nadj. 静止的，休眠的，不活动的\n词根词缀\nquies （安静，同 quiet）+ -cent → 安静的\n助记\nquiet 安静的；acquiesce 默许\n例句\nThe volcano has remained ==quiescent== for decades. 这座火山已休眠数十年。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 15 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l15_72","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"removal","back":"释义\nn. 移动，除去，免职\n词根词缀\nre- （离开）+ mov （移动）+ -al → 移走\n助记\nremove 移走；movable 可移动的\n例句\nStain ==removal== requires special soap. 去除污渍需要专用肥皂。","fields":{"Front":"removal","Back":"释义\nn. 移动，除去，免职\n词根词缀\nre- （离开）+ mov （移动）+ -al → 移走\n助记\nremove 移走；movable 可移动的\n例句\nStain ==removal== requires special soap. 去除污渍需要专用肥皂。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 15 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:0