":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l16_38","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"exorbitant","back":"释义\nadj. （价格、要求）过高的，过分的\n词根词缀\nex- （出）+ orbit （轨道）+ -ant → 越出常轨的 → 过高的\n助记\norbit 轨道；近义 excessive, prohibitive\n例句\nThe hotel charged ==exorbitant== prices. 那家酒店要价高得离谱。","fields":{"Front":"exorbitant","Back":"释义\nadj. （价格、要求）过高的，过分的\n词根词缀\nex- （出）+ orbit （轨道）+ -ant → 越出常轨的 → 过高的\n助记\norbit 轨道；近义 excessive, prohibitive\n例句\nThe hotel charged ==exorbitant== prices. 那家酒店要价高得离谱。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 16 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l16_39","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"extort","back":"释义\nv. 敲诈，勒索，强取\n词根词缀\nex- （出）+ tort （扭曲）→ 强扭出来 → 勒索\n助记\ntorture 拷打；tort 侵权行为\n例句\nThey ==extorted== money from the shop owner. 他们向店主勒索钱财。","fields":{"Front":"extort","Back":"释义\nv. 敲诈，勒索，强取\n词根词缀\nex- （出）+ tort （扭曲）→ 强扭出来 → 勒索\n助记\ntorture 拷打；tort 侵权行为\n例句\nThey ==extorted== money from the shop owner. 他们向店主勒索钱财。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 16 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l16_40","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"inanity","back":"释义\nn. 空虚，愚蠢，无聊言行\n词根词缀\ninan （空的，同 inane）+ -ity → 空洞\n助记\ninane 愚蠢空洞的；v