固体\n词根词缀\nsolid （坚固，同 consolidate）\n助记\nsolidarity 团结；consolidate 巩固\n例句\nThe chair is made of ==solid== oak. 这把椅子由实心橡木制成。","fields":{"Front":"solid","Back":"释义\nadj./n. 固体的，结实的，可靠的；固体\n词根词缀\nsolid （坚固，同 consolidate）\n助记\nsolidarity 团结；consolidate 巩固\n例句\nThe chair is made of ==solid== oak. 这把椅子由实心橡木制成。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 19 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l19_72","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"symmetry","back":"释义\nn. 对称，匀称，对称美\n词根词缀\nsym- （共同）+ metr （测量）→ 两边度量一致\n助记\nsymmetric 对称的；meter 测量\n例句\nThe leaf has perfect ==symmetry== . 这片叶子完全对称。","fields":{"Front":"symmetry","Back":"释义\nn. 对称，匀称，对称美\n词根词缀\nsym- （共同）+ metr （测量）→ 两边度量一致\n助记\nsymmetric 对称的；meter 测量\n例句\nThe leaf has perfect ==symmetry== . 这片叶子完全对称。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 19 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l19_73","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"treadmill","back":"释义\nn. 跑步机；单调的工作\n词根词缀\ntread （踩踏）+ mill （磨坊）→ 原地踩踏装置\n助记\ntread 踩；mill 磨坊\n例句\nShe runs on the ==treadmill== each morning. 她每天早上在跑步机上跑步。","fields":{"Front":"treadmill","Back":"释义\nn. 跑步机；单调的工作\n词根词缀\ntread （踩踏）+ mill （磨坊）→ 原地踩踏装置\n助记\ntread 踩；mill 磨坊\n例句\nShe runs on the ==treadmill== each morning. 她每天早上在跑步机上跑步。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 19 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.0