ary== of strangers online. 她对网上的陌生人保持警惕。","fields":{"Front":"wary","Back":"释义\nadj. 谨慎的，警惕的，提防的\n词根词缀\nwar （留意，同 aware）+ -y\n助记\nbeware 当心；cautious 谨慎的\n例句\nShe was ==wary== of strangers online. 她对网上的陌生人保持警惕。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 20 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]}]},{"id":"toefl-list-21","name":"TOEFL 托福 › List 21","description":"托福核心词 · List 21（73 词 · 释义 + 词根词缀 + 助记 + 标黄例句）","createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["toefl","imported"],"options":{"newPerDay":null,"reviewsPerDay":null,"learningSteps":null,"relearningSteps":null,"graduatingInterval":null,"easyInterval":null,"leechThreshold":null,"leechAction":"","buryRelated":null,"maxInterval":null,"requestRetention":null,"newOrder":"","reviewOrder":""},"cards":[{"noteId":"toefl_l21_0","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"aerobics","back":"释义\nn. 有氧运动，健美操\n词根词缀\naer （空气、氧气，同 air）+ -obics\n助记\naerobic 有氧的；aerial 空中的\n例句\nShe does simple ==aerobics== every morning. 她每天早上做简单的有氧运动。","fields":{"Front":"aerobics","Back":"释义\nn. 有氧运动，健美操\n词根词缀\naer （空气、氧气，同 air）+ -obics\n助记\naerobic 有氧的；aerial 空中的\n例句\nShe does simple ==aerobics== every morning. 她每天早上做简单的有氧运动。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 21 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l21_1","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"affection","back":"释义\nn. 喜爱，感情，爱慕\n词根词缀\naf- （=ad-）+ fect （作用于、情感）+ -ion\n助记\naffectionate 深情的；affect 影响\n例句\nShe has deep ==affection== for her hometown. 她对家乡怀有深厚感情。","fields":{"Front":"affection","Back":"释义\nn. 喜爱，感情，爱慕\n词根词缀\naf- （=ad-）+ fect （作用于、情感）+ -ion\n助记\naffectionate 深情的；affect 影响\n例句\nShe has deep ==affection== for her hometown. 她对家乡怀有深厚感情。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 21 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l21_2","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"bacteria","back":"释义\nn. 细菌（bacterium 的复数）\n词根词缀\nbacter （小棍、杆菌）+ -ia\n助记\nbacterial 细菌的；germ 微生物\n例句\nWarm water helps wash away ==bacteria== . 温水有助于冲走细菌。","fields":{"Front":"bacteria","Back":"释义\nn. 细菌（bacterium 的复数）\n词根词缀\nbacter （小棍、杆菌）+ -ia\n助记\nbacterial 细菌的；germ 微生物\n例句\nWarm water helps wash away ==bacteria== . 温水有助于冲走细菌。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 21 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l21_3","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"diet","back":"释义\nn./v. 日常饮食；节食；限定饮食\n词根词缀\ndiet （希腊语 diaita 生活方式、饮食）\n助记\ndietary 饮食的；dietitian 营养师\n例句\nA balanced ==diet== keeps you healthy. 均衡饮食让你保持健康。","fields":{"Front":"diet","Back":"释义\nn./v. 日常饮食；节食；限定饮食\n词根词缀\ndiet （希腊语 diaita 生活方式、饮食）\n助记\ndietary 饮食的；dietitian 营养师\n例句\nA balanced ==diet== keeps you healthy. 均衡饮食让你保持健康。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 21 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"s