 → 徒劳\n助记\nfutility 徒劳；useless 无用的\n例句\nIt is ==futile== to argue with him. 和他争论是徒劳的。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 21 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l21_7","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"hoard","back":"释义\nv./n. 贮藏，囤积；秘藏的财物\n词根词缀\n古英语 hord（宝藏、囤积）\n助记\nstockpile 储备；amass 积聚\n例句\nThe old squirrel ==hoarded== nuts for winter. 老松鼠为冬天囤积坚果。","fields":{"Front":"hoard","Back":"释义\nv./n. 贮藏，囤积；秘藏的财物\n词根词缀\n古英语 hord（宝藏、囤积）\n助记\nstockpile 储备；amass 积聚\n例句\nThe old squirrel ==hoarded== nuts for winter. 老松鼠为冬天囤积坚果。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 21 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l21_8","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"litter","back":"释义\nn./v. 垃圾，杂物；一窝幼崽；乱扔\n词根词缀\n古法语 litiere（床铺、稻草垫）\n助记\nlitterbin 垃圾桶；rubbish 垃圾\n例句\nPlease do not ==litter== in the park. 请勿在公园里乱扔垃圾。","fields":{"Front":"litter","Back":"释义\nn./v. 垃圾，杂物；一窝幼崽；乱扔\n词根词缀\n古法语 litiere（床铺、稻草垫）\n助记\nlitterbin 垃圾桶；rubbish 垃圾\n例句\nPlease do not ==litter== in the park. 请勿在公园里乱扔垃圾。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 21 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l21_9","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"lumber","back":"释义\nn./v. 木材，木料；笨重地移动\n词根词缀\n可能与 Lombard（伦巴第，放贷/旧货商）相关\n助记\ntimber 木材；lumberjack 伐木工人\n例句\nThey stacked dry ==lumber== beside the shed. 他们在棚屋旁堆起干木料。","fields":{"Front":"lumber","Back":"释义\nn./v. 木材，木料；笨重地移动\n词根词缀\n可能与 Lombard（伦巴第，放贷/旧货商）相关\n助记\ntimber 木材；lumberjack 伐木工人\n例句\nThey stacked dry ==lumber== beside the shed. 他们在棚屋旁堆起干木料。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 21 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l21_10","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"parallel","back":"释义\nadj./n./v. 平行的；类似的；与…平行；平行线\n词根词缀\npara- （在旁）+ allel （彼此）→ 并排而行\n助记\nparallelism 平行；similar 相似的\n例句\nThe two roads run almost ==parallel== . 两条路几乎平行。","fields":{"Front":"parallel","Back":"释义\nadj./n./v. 平行的；类似的；与…平行；平行线\n词根词缀\npara- （在旁）+ allel （彼此）→ 并排而行\n助记\nparallelism 平行；similar 相似的\n例句\nThe two roads run almost ==parallel== . 两条路几乎平行。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 21 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l21_11","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"positive","back":"释义\nadj. 积极的，肯定的；阳性的；明确的\n词根词缀\npos- （放置、确定，同 position）+ -itive\n助记\nnegative 消极的；positively 肯定地\n例句\nShe kept a calm, ==positive== attitude. 她保持冷静、积极的态度。","fields":{"Front":"positive","Back":"释义\nadj. 积极的，肯定的；阳性的；明确的\n词根词缀\npos- （放置、确定，同 position）+ -itive\n助记\nnegative 消极的；positively 肯定地\n例句\nShe kept a calm, ==positive== attitude. 她保持冷静、积极的态度。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 21 组","tags":[],"