\n助记\nskill 技能；trick 窍门\n例句\nShe has a ==knack== for remembering names. 她有记名字的诀窍。","fields":{"Front":"knack","Back":"释义\nn. 诀窍，本领，巧妙手法\n词根词缀\n可能与 knock（敲击）相关，引申为巧劲\n助记\nskill 技能；trick 窍门\n例句\nShe has a ==knack== for remembering names. 她有记名字的诀窍。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 21 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l21_28","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"lighthearted","back":"释义\nadj. 轻松愉快的，无忧无虑的\n词根词缀\nlight （轻松的）+ hearted （心情的）\n助记\ncarefree 无忧无虑的；cheerful 快乐的\n例句\nThey shared a warm, ==lighthearted== laugh. 他们轻松愉快地笑了。","fields":{"Front":"lighthearted","Back":"释义\nadj. 轻松愉快的，无忧无虑的\n词根词缀\nlight （轻松的）+ hearted （心情的）\n助记\ncarefree 无忧无虑的；cheerful 快乐的\n例句\nThey shared a warm, ==lighthearted== laugh. 他们轻松愉快地笑了。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 21 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l21_29","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"locality","back":"释义\nn. 地点，位置，所在地\n词根词缀\nlocal （地方的，同 place）+ -ity\n助记\nlocal 当地的；location 位置\n例句\nThey know every path in the ==locality== . 他们熟悉这一带的每条小路。","fields":{"Front":"locality","Back":"释义\nn. 地点，位置，所在地\n词根词缀\nlocal （地方的，同 place）+ -ity\n助记\nlocal 当地的；location 位置\n例句\nThey know every path in the ==locality== . 他们熟悉这一带的每条小路。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 21 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"