ious. 别想当然地认为答案显而易见。","fields":{"Front":"assume","Back":"释义\nv. 假定，假设；承担，呈现\n词根词缀\nas- （=ad-）+ sum （拿取，同 consume）→ 拿来用\n助记\nassumption 假设；consume 消耗\n例句\nDo not ==assume== that the answer is obvious. 别想当然地认为答案显而易见。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 21 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l21_41","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"colony","back":"释义\nn. 殖民地；聚居区；（生物）群体\n词根词缀\ncolon （耕种、定居者，同 cultivate）+ -y\n助记\ncolonial 殖民的；colonize 殖民\n例句\nA small ==colony== of ants lived under the stone. 石头下住着一小群蚂蚁。","fields":{"Front":"colony","Back":"释义\nn. 殖民地；聚居区；（生物）群体\n词根词缀\ncolon （耕种、定居者，同 cultivate）+ -y\n助记\ncolonial 殖民的；colonize 殖民\n例句\nA small ==colony== of ants lived under the stone. 石头下住着一小群蚂蚁。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 21 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l21_42","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"complain","back":"释义\nv. 抱怨，投诉，发牢骚\n词根词缀\ncom- （加强）+ plain （捶胸、 lament）\n助记\ncomplaint 抱怨；complainer 抱怨者\n例句\nShe ==complained== about the cold room. 她抱怨房间太冷。","fields":{"Front":"complain","Back":"释义\nv. 抱怨，投诉，发牢骚\n词根词缀\ncom- （加强）+ plain （捶胸、 lament）\n助记\ncomplaint 抱怨；complainer 抱怨者\n例句\nShe ==complained== about the cold room. 她抱怨房间太冷。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 21 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stabi