8T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l21_69","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"ration","back":"释义\nn./v. 配给量，定量；配给，限量供应\n词根词缀\nrat （推算、比率，同 ratio）+ -ion\n助记\nratio 比率；rational 理性的\n例句\nEach camper got a small daily ==ration== of water. 每位露营者每天得到少量定量水。","fields":{"Front":"ration","Back":"释义\nn./v. 配给量，定量；配给，限量供应\n词根词缀\nrat （推算、比率，同 ratio）+ -ion\n助记\nratio 比率；rational 理性的\n例句\nEach camper got a small daily ==ration== of water. 每位露营者每天得到少量定量水。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 21 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l21_70","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"stash","back":"释义\nv./n. 藏匿，隐藏；藏匿处，私藏物\n词根词缀\n可能与 cache（隐藏）相关\n助记\nconceal 隐藏；stash away 藏起\n例句\nHe ==stashed== the small box under the bed. 他把小盒子藏在床下。","fields":{"Front":"stash","Back":"释义\nv./n. 藏匿，隐藏；藏匿处，私藏物\n词根词缀\n可能与 cache（隐藏）相关\n助记\nconceal 隐藏；stash away 藏起\n例句\nHe ==stashed== the small box under the bed. 他把小盒子藏在床下。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 21 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l21_71","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"unequal","back":"释义\nadj. 不平等的，不均等的；不胜任的\n词根词缀\nun- （不）+ equal （相等的）\n助记\ninequality 不平等；uneven 不均的\n例句\nThey received ==unequal== shares of the work. 他们分到的工作量不均等。","fields":{"Front":"unequal","Back"