ery 意象/画像\n例句\nThe small poem follows a simple ==imagist== style. 这首小诗采用简单的意象派风格。","fields":{"Front":"imagist","Back":"释义\nn./adj. 意象派诗人；意象主义的\n词根词缀\nimag （形象、意象，同 image）+ -ist （人）\n助记\nimage 意象；imagery 意象/画像\n例句\nThe small poem follows a simple ==imagist== style. 这首小诗采用简单的意象派风格。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 22 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l22_50","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"oblivious","back":"释义\nadj. 未察觉的，没注意到的，健忘的\n词根词缀\nob- （覆盖）+ liv （抹去，同 erase? 实为 levis）→ 记忆被抹去\n助记\noblivion 遗忘；forgetful 健忘的\n例句\nHe was ==oblivious== to the cold wind. 他没有察觉到寒风。","fields":{"Front":"oblivious","Back":"释义\nadj. 未察觉的，没注意到的，健忘的\n词根词缀\nob- （覆盖）+ liv （抹去，同 erase? 实为 levis）→ 记忆被抹去\n助记\noblivion 遗忘；forgetful 健忘的\n例句\nHe was ==oblivious== to the cold wind. 他没有察觉到寒风。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 22 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l22_51","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"petroleum","back":"释义\nn. 石油\n词根词缀\npetr （岩石，同 petrify）+ oleum （油）→ 岩石中的油\n助记\npetrol 汽油；petrify 使石化\n例句\nThey refined crude ==petroleum== into fuel. 他们把原油提炼成燃料。","fields":{"Front":"petroleum","Back":"释义\nn. 石油\n词根词缀\npetr （岩石，同 petrify）+ oleum （油）→ 岩石中的油\n助记\npetrol 汽油；petrify 使石化\n例句\nThey refined crude ==petroleum== into fuel. 他们把原油提炼成燃料。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 22 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00: