ible → 能领会\n助记\ncomprehend 理解；comprehensive 全面的\n例句\nHer simple explanation was clear and ==comprehensible== . 她简单的解释清晰易懂。","fields":{"Front":"comprehensible","Back":"释义\nadj. 可理解的，易懂的\n词根词缀\ncom- （完全）+ prehens （抓住）+ -ible → 能领会\n助记\ncomprehend 理解；comprehensive 全面的\n例句\nHer simple explanation was clear and ==comprehensible== . 她简单的解释清晰易懂。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 22 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l22_68","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"controversial","back":"释义\nadj. 有争议的，引起争论的\n词根词缀\ncontro- （相反）+ vers （转）+ -ial → 转向对立\n助记\ncontroversy 争论；contradict 反驳\n例句\nIt was a small but ==controversial== decision. 那是个虽小却有争议的决定。","fields":{"Front":"controversial","Back":"释义\nadj. 有争议的，引起争论的\n词根词缀\ncontro- （相反）+ vers （转）+ -ial → 转向对立\n助记\ncontroversy 争论；contradict 反驳\n例句\nIt was a small but ==controversial== decision. 那是个虽小却有争议的决定。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 22 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l22_69","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"defer","back":"释义\nv. 推迟，延期；听从，服从（to）\n词根词缀\nde- （离开）+ fer （携带）→ 带走 → 延后\n助记\ndeference 顺从；delay 推迟\n例句\nThey decided to ==defer== the small meeting. 他们决定推迟这次小会。","fields":{"Front":"defer","Back":"释义\nv. 推迟，延期；听从，服从（to）\n词根词缀\nde- （离开）+ fer （携带）→ 带走 → 延后\n助记\ndeference 顺从；delay 推迟\n例句\nThey decided to ==defer== the small meeting. 他们决定推迟这次小会。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 22 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"susp