atch （=empacher 催促）→ 迅速派出\n助记\nsend 发送；despatch 派遣（异体）\n例句\nThey will ==dispatch== the small package today. 他们今天会寄出小包裹。","fields":{"Front":"dispatch","Back":"释义\nv./n. 派遣，发送；迅速处理；急件\n词根词缀\ndis- （离开）+ patch （=empacher 催促）→ 迅速派出\n助记\nsend 发送；despatch 派遣（异体）\n例句\nThey will ==dispatch== the small package today. 他们今天会寄出小包裹。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 22 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l22_73","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"enlighten","back":"释义\nv. 启发，启蒙，教导，开导\n词根词缀\nen- （使）+ light （光）+ -en → 给予光明\n助记\nenlightenment 启蒙；light 光\n例句\nThe simple lesson ==enlightened== the young students. 这堂简单的课启发了年轻学生。","fields":{"Front":"enlighten","Back":"释义\nv. 启发，启蒙，教导，开导\n词根词缀\nen- （使）+ light （光）+ -en → 给予光明\n助记\nenlightenment 启蒙；light 光\n例句\nThe simple lesson ==enlightened== the young students. 这堂简单的课启发了年轻学生。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 22 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l22_74","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"frenzy","back":"释义\nn./v. 狂乱，狂热，暴怒\n词根词缀\nfren （希腊语 phren 心灵、狂乱）+ -zy\n助记\nfrenzied 狂乱的；frenetic 发狂的\n例句\nThe crowd worked itself into a wild ==frenzy== . 人群陷入狂热。","fields":{"Front":"frenzy","Back":"释义\nn./v. 狂乱，狂热，暴怒\n词根词缀\nfren （希腊语 phren 心灵、狂乱）+ -zy\n助记\nfrenzied 狂乱的；frenetic 发狂的\n例句\nThe crowd worked itself into a wild ==frenzy== . 人群陷入狂热。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 22 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"l