标记）+ -able → 值得再标记\n助记\nremark 评论；markedly 显著地\n例句\nShe made ==remarkable== progress in reading. 她在阅读上取得非凡进步。","fields":{"Front":"remarkable","Back":"释义\nadj. 非凡的，显著的，引人注目的\n词根词缀\nre- （再）+ mark （标记）+ -able → 值得再标记\n助记\nremark 评论；markedly 显著地\n例句\nShe made ==remarkable== progress in reading. 她在阅读上取得非凡进步。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 22 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l22_78","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"session","back":"释义\nn. 会议，会期；学期；一段时间\n词根词缀\nsess （坐，同 sit）+ -ion → 坐在一起开会\n助记\nsemester 学期；sit 坐\n例句\nThey held a short study ==session== after lunch. 午饭后他们进行了一段短学习。","fields":{"Front":"session","Back":"释义\nn. 会议，会期；学期；一段时间\n词根词缀\nsess （坐，同 sit）+ -ion → 坐在一起开会\n助记\nsemester 学期；sit 坐\n例句\nThey held a short study ==session== after lunch. 午饭后他们进行了一段短学习。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 22 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l22_79","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"trifle","back":"释义\nn./v. 琐事，小事，少量；轻视，玩弄\n词根词缀\ntrif （古法语 trufe 玩笑、琐事）\n助记\ntrifling 微不足道的；trivial 琐碎的\n例句\nDo not waste time on simple ==trifles== . 别把时间浪费在简单琐事上。","fields":{"Front":"trifle","Back":"释义\nn./v. 琐事，小事，少量；轻视，玩弄\n词根词缀\ntrif （古法语 trufe 玩笑、琐事）\n助记\ntrifling 微不足道的；trivial 琐碎的\n例句\nDo not waste time on simple ==trifles== . 别把时间浪费在简单琐事上。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 22 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00