== her from working as a driver.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 23 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l23_2","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"Potassium","back":"释义\nn. n. 钾\n词根词缀\n化学元素钾\n助记\n无\n例句\nBananas are rich in ==potassium==.","fields":{"Front":"Potassium","Back":"释义\nn. n. 钾\n词根词缀\n化学元素钾\n助记\n无\n例句\nBananas are rich in ==potassium==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 23 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l23_3","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"Incorporate","back":"释义\nv. v. 合并，包含；注册成立\n词根词缀\nin-（进入）+ corp（身体），纳入整体合并\n助记\nincorporation n. 合并，成立；incorporate into 融入…\n例句\nTheories are ==incorporated== into our practice.","fields":{"Front":"Incorporate","Back":"释义\nv. v. 合并，包含；注册成立\n词根词缀\nin-（进入）+ corp（身体），纳入整体合并\n助记\nincorporation n. 合并，成立；incorporate into 融入…\n例句\nTheories are ==incorporated== into our practice.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 23 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l23_4","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"Crippling","back":"释义\nadj. adj. 严重损坏的；令人震惊的\n词根词缀\n谐音“磕了破”，一碰就破伤害严重\n助记\ncripple v. 使跛，削弱\n例句\nThe damage was