结晶\n例句\nA small clear ==crystal== caught the light. 一颗清澈小水晶接住光线。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 24 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l24_4","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"cushion","back":"释义\nn./v. 垫子，软垫；缓冲，缓和\n词根词缀\ncush （臀部、垫，同 hip）+ -ion\n助记\npillow 枕头；buffer 缓冲\n例句\nThe soft grass ==cushioned== his fall. 柔软的草地缓冲了他的摔倒。","fields":{"Front":"cushion","Back":"释义\nn./v. 垫子，软垫；缓冲，缓和\n词根词缀\ncush （臀部、垫，同 hip）+ -ion\n助记\npillow 枕头；buffer 缓冲\n例句\nThe soft grass ==cushioned== his fall. 柔软的草地缓冲了他的摔倒。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 24 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l24_5","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"decipher","back":"释义\nv. 破译，辨认，解读\n词根词缀\nde- （去除）+ cipher （密码）→ 解除密码\n助记\ncipher 密码；decode 解码\n例句\nShe slowly ==deciphered== the old handwriting. 她慢慢辨认出旧笔迹。","fields":{"Front":"decipher","Back":"释义\nv. 破译，辨认，解读\n词根词缀\nde- （去除）+ cipher （密码）→ 解除密码\n助记\ncipher 密码；decode 解码\n例句\nShe slowly ==deciphered== the old handwriting. 她慢慢辨认出旧笔迹。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 24 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l24_6","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","fr