 开创；usherette 女引座员\n例句\nThe simple change ==ushered== in a new era. 这简单变革开创了一个新时代。","fields":{"Front":"usher","Back":"释义\nn./v. 引座员，迎宾；引导，开创\n词根词缀\nush （门，拉丁语 ostiarius 守门人）+ -er\n助记\nusher in 开创；usherette 女引座员\n例句\nThe simple change ==ushered== in a new era. 这简单变革开创了一个新时代。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 24 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l24_71","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"varnish","back":"释义\nn./v. 清漆，光泽面；涂漆，掩饰\n词根词缀\nvarn （希腊语 Berenice 古城，产亮漆）+ -ish\n助记\nvanish 消失；tarnish 使失去光泽\n例句\nA thin coat of simple ==varnish== protected the wood. 一层薄薄的简单清漆保护木头。","fields":{"Front":"varnish","Back":"释义\nn./v. 清漆，光泽面；涂漆，掩饰\n词根词缀\nvarn （希腊语 Berenice 古城，产亮漆）+ -ish\n助记\nvanish 消失；tarnish 使失去光泽\n例句\nA thin coat of simple ==varnish== protected the wood. 一层薄薄的简单清漆保护木头。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 24 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l24_72","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"apparatus","back":"释义\nn. 器械，设备，装置；机构\n词根词缀\nap- （=ad-）+ par （准备，同 prepare）+ -atus\n助记\nprepare 准备；apparel 服装\n例句\nThey used a simple exercise ==apparatus== . 他们使用一种简单的健身器械。","fields":{"Front":"apparatus","Back":"释义\nn. 器械，设备，装置；机构\n词根词缀\nap- （=ad-）+ par （准备，同 prepare）+ -atus\n助记\nprepare 准备；apparel 服装\n例句\nThey used a simple exercise ==apparatus== . 他们使用一种简单的健身器械。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 24 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"cre