ic","front":"recipient","back":"释义\nn. 接受者，收件人，受方\n词根词缀\nre- （回）+ cip （拿取，同 receive）+ -ient\n助记\nreceive 收到；recipe 食谱\n例句\nShe was the simple ==recipient== of the small prize. 她是这个小奖的简单获奖者。","fields":{"Front":"recipient","Back":"释义\nn. 接受者，收件人，受方\n词根词缀\nre- （回）+ cip （拿取，同 receive）+ -ient\n助记\nreceive 收到；recipe 食谱\n例句\nShe was the simple ==recipient== of the small prize. 她是这个小奖的简单获奖者。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 24 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l24_84","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"respire","back":"释义\nv. 呼吸；松口气，（植物）呼吸作用\n词根词缀\nre- （再）+ spire （呼吸，同 spirit）\n助记\nrespiration 呼吸；inspire 吸气/激励\n例句\nThe small plants slowly ==respire== in the dark. 小植物在黑暗中慢慢呼吸。","fields":{"Front":"respire","Back":"释义\nv. 呼吸；松口气，（植物）呼吸作用\n词根词缀\nre- （再）+ spire （呼吸，同 spirit）\n助记\nrespiration 呼吸；inspire 吸气/激励\n例句\nThe small plants slowly ==respire== in the dark. 小植物在黑暗中慢慢呼吸。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 24 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l24_85","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"solitude","back":"释义\nn. 独处，独居；幽静，荒僻之地\n词根词缀\nsol （单独，同 sole）+ -itude\n助记\nsolitary 独处的；solo 独奏\n例句\nHe enjoyed the simple ==solitude== of the woods. 他享受林间简单的幽静。","fields":{"Front":"solitude","Back":"释义\nn. 独处，独居；幽静，荒僻之地\n词根词缀\nsol （单独，同 sole）+ -itude\n助记\nsolitary 独处的；solo 独奏\n例句\nHe enjoyed the simple ==solitude== of the woods. 他享受林间简单的幽静。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 24 