tially 本质上\n例句\nSimple repetition is ==essential== for recall. 简单重复对记忆必不可少。","fields":{"Front":"essential","Back":"释义\nadj./n. 必要的，必不可少的；本质的；要素\n词根词缀\nessence （本质）+ -tial\n助记\nessence 本质；essentially 本质上\n例句\nSimple repetition is ==essential== for recall. 简单重复对记忆必不可少。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 25 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l25_7","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"membrane","back":"释义\nn. 膜，薄膜，细胞膜\n词根词缀\nmembran （薄皮，拉丁语 membrana）\n助记\nmember 成员/肢体；membranous 膜状的\n例句\nA thin simple ==membrane== covered the cell. 一层薄而简单的膜覆盖细胞。","fields":{"Front":"membrane","Back":"释义\nn. 膜，薄膜，细胞膜\n词根词缀\nmembran （薄皮，拉丁语 membrana）\n助记\nmember 成员/肢体；membranous 膜状的\n例句\nA thin simple ==membrane== covered the cell. 一层薄而简单的膜覆盖细胞。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 25 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l25_8","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"nocturnal","back":"释义\nadj. 夜间的，夜行的，夜间活动的\n词根词缀\nnoct （夜晚，拉丁语 nox）+ -urnal\n助记\nnocturne 夜曲；equinox 昼夜平分时\n例句\nThe simple owl is a ==nocturnal== bird. 简单说，猫头鹰是夜行性鸟类。","fields":{"Front":"nocturnal","Back":"释义\nadj. 夜间的，夜行的，夜间活动的\n词根词缀\nnoct （夜晚，拉丁语 nox）+ -urnal\n助记\nnocturne 夜曲；equinox 昼夜平分时\n例句\nThe simple owl is a ==nocturnal== bird. 简单说，猫头鹰是夜行性鸟类。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 25 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00: