，灿烂的\n词根词缀\ngorge （喉头、美丽，古法语 gorgias 优雅）\n助记\ngorge 峡谷/狼吞虎咽；gorgon 丑陋女人\n例句\nThe simple warm card looked ==gorgeous== . 简单温暖卡片看起来极美。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 26 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l26_72","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"hydraulic","back":"释义\nadj. 水力的，液压的，水压的\n词根词缀\nhydr （水，同 hydrogen）+ -aulic （管、乐器）\n助记\nhydrogen 氢；dehydrate 脱水\n例句\nThey used a simple ==hydraulic== lift. 他们使用简单液压升降机。","fields":{"Front":"hydraulic","Back":"释义\nadj. 水力的，液压的，水压的\n词根词缀\nhydr （水，同 hydrogen）+ -aulic （管、乐器）\n助记\nhydrogen 氢；dehydrate 脱水\n例句\nThey used a simple ==hydraulic== lift. 他们使用简单液压升降机。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 26 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l26_73","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"impose","back":"释义\nv. 强加，征收；欺骗，打扰\n词根词缀\nim- （=in- 在上）+ pos （放置，同 position）→ 放上去\n助记\nposition 位置；expose 暴露\n例句\nThey did not ==impose== a simple strict limit. 他们没有强加简单严格的限制。","fields":{"Front":"impose","Back":"释义\nv. 强加，征收；欺骗，打扰\n词根词缀\nim- （=in- 在上）+ pos （放置，同 position）→ 放上去\n助记\nposition 位置；expose 暴露\n例句\nThey did not ==impose== a simple strict limit. 他们没有强加简单严格的限制。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 26 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"