ission.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 32 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l32_3","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"Motive","back":"释义\nn. n. 动机，目的\n词根词缀\n行动的动因与目的\n助记\nulterior motive 别有用心；motivation n. 动力，动机\n例句\nHe had an ulterior ==motive== for helping.","fields":{"Front":"Motive","Back":"释义\nn. n. 动机，目的\n词根词缀\n行动的动因与目的\n助记\nulterior motive 别有用心；motivation n. 动力，动机\n例句\nHe had an ulterior ==motive== for helping.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 32 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l32_4","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"Evade","back":"释义\nv. v. 逃避，回避；避开\n词根词缀\ne-（出）+ vade（走），走出去以避开\n助记\navoid v. 避免（近义词）；evasion n. 逃避，借口\n例句\nHe tried to ==evade== military service.","fields":{"Front":"Evade","Back":"释义\nv. v. 逃避，回避；避开\n词根词缀\ne-（出）+ vade（走），走出去以避开\n助记\navoid v. 避免（近义词）；evasion n. 逃避，借口\n例句\nHe tried to ==evade== military service.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 32 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l32_5","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"Credentialism","back":"释义\nn. n. 文凭主义，资历主义\n词根词缀\ncredential（文凭、证书）+ -ism（主义），唯文凭论\n助记\ncrede