空，同 vacant）+ -uum\n助记\nvacant 空的；vacuum cleaner 吸尘器\n例句\nThe simple flask held a near ==vacuum== . 简单烧瓶里接近真空。","fields":{"Front":"vacuum","Back":"释义\nn./v. 真空，空虚；用吸尘器打扫\n词根词缀\nvac （空，同 vacant）+ -uum\n助记\nvacant 空的；vacuum cleaner 吸尘器\n例句\nThe simple flask held a near ==vacuum== . 简单烧瓶里接近真空。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 43 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l43_46","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"antique","back":"释义\nn./adj. 古董，古物；古董的，古老的\n词根词缀\nantiqu （古老，拉丁语 ante 在前）+ -e\n助记\nancient 古老的；anticipate 预期\n例句\nA small plain ==antique== bowl sat on the shelf. 架子上有个朴素古董小碗。","fields":{"Front":"antique","Back":"释义\nn./adj. 古董，古物；古董的，古老的\n词根词缀\nantiqu （古老，拉丁语 ante 在前）+ -e\n助记\nancient 古老的；anticipate 预期\n例句\nA small plain ==antique== bowl sat on the shelf. 架子上有个朴素古董小碗。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 43 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l43_47","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"resistant","back":"释义\nadj. 抵抗的，有抵抗力的；耐…的\n词根词缀\nresist （抵抗，re- 反 + sist 站）+ -ant\n助记\nresist 抵抗；assist 帮助\n例句\nThe simple material was water ==resistant== . 简单材料耐水。","fields":{"Front":"resistant","Back":"释义\nadj. 抵抗的，有抵抗力的；耐…的\n词根词缀\nresist （抵抗，re- 反 + sist 站）+ -ant\n助记\nresist 抵抗；assist 帮助\n例句\nThe simple material was water ==resistant== . 简单材料耐水。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 43 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-