告，同 announce）\n助记\nannounce 宣布；pronounce 发音\n例句\nThey ==denounced== the simple careless error. 他们斥责这个简单粗心错误。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 43 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]}]},{"id":"toefl-list-44","name":"TOEFL 托福 › List 44","description":"托福核心词 · List 44（80 词 · 释义 + 词根词缀 + 助记 + 标黄例句）","createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["toefl","imported"],"options":{"newPerDay":null,"reviewsPerDay":null,"learningSteps":null,"relearningSteps":null,"graduatingInterval":null,"easyInterval":null,"leechThreshold":null,"leechAction":"","buryRelated":null,"maxInterval":null,"requestRetention":null,"newOrder":"","reviewOrder":""},"cards":[{"noteId":"toefl_l44_0","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"squirt","back":"释义\nv./n. 喷射；喷出；一股液体\n词根词缀\nsquirt 拟声词根（液体被挤出的声音）\n助记\n近义 spray, spurt, jet；squirt gun 水枪\n例句\nWater ==squirted== from the hole in the hose. 水从软管的破洞里喷了出来。","fields":{"Front":"squirt","Back":"释义\nv./n. 喷射；喷出；一股液体\n词根词缀\nsquirt 拟声词根（液体被挤出的声音）\n助记\n近义 spray, spurt, jet；squirt gun 水枪\n例句\nWater ==squirted== from the hole in the hose. 水从软管的破洞里喷了出来。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 44 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l44_1","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"resin","back":"释义\nn. 树脂；松香\n词根词缀\nresin 词根（树木的黏稠分泌物）\n助记\n派生 resinous adj. 含树脂的；近义 gum, sap\n例句\nPine trees produce a sticky ==resin== . 松树会分泌一种黏稠的树脂。","fields":{"Front":"resin","Back":"释义\nn. 树脂；松香\n词根词缀\nresin 词根（树木的黏稠分泌物）\n助记\n派生 resinous adj. 含树脂的；近义 gum, sap\n例句\nPine trees produce a sticky ==resin== . 松树会分泌一种黏稠的树脂。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 44 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l44_2","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"context","back":"释义\nn. 上下文；语境；背景\n词根词缀\ncon- 共同 + text 编织 → 文字编织在一起 → 上下文\n助记\ncontextual adj. 上下文的；in this context 在这种背景下\n例句\nYou can guess the meaning from the ==context== . 你可以根据上下文猜出意思。","fields":{"Front":"context","Back":"释义\nn. 上下文；语境；背景\n词根词缀\ncon- 共同 + text 编织 → 文字编织在一起 → 上下文\n助记\ncontextual adj. 上下文的；in this context 在这种背景下\n例句\nYou can guess the meaning from the ==context== . 你可以根据上下文猜出意思。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 44 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l44_3","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"symptom","back":"释义\nn. 症状；征兆\n词根词缀\nsympt 降临 + -om 名词 → 降临在身上的情况 → 症状\n助记\nsymptomatic adj. 作为征兆的；近义 sign, indication\n例句\nA fever is a common ==symptom== of flu. 发烧是流感的常见症状。","fields":{"Front":"symptom","Back":"释义\nn. 症状；征兆\n词根词缀\nsympt 降临 + -om 名词 → 降临在身上的情况 → 症状\n助记\nsymptomatic adj. 作为征兆的；近义 sign, indication\n例句\nA fever is a common ==symptom== of flu. 发烧是流感的常见症状。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 44 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l44_4","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"interrupt","back":"释义\nv. 打断；中断；打扰\n词根词缀\ninter- 在…之间 + rupt 断裂 → 从中间断开 → 打断\n助记\ninterruption n. 打断；近义 break in, cut off\n例句\nPlease don't ==interrupt== me while I'm speaking. 我说话时请不要打断我。","fields":{"Front":"interrupt","Back":"释义\nv. 打断；中断；打扰\n词根词缀\ninter- 在…之间 + rupt 断裂 → 从中间断开 → 打断\n助记\ninterruption n. 打断；近义 break in, cut off\n例句\nPlease don't ==interrupt== me while I'm speaking. 我说话时请不要打断我。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 44 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l44_5","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"defect","back":"释义\nn. 缺点；缺陷 v. 叛变\n词根词缀\nde- 离开 + fect 做 → 没做好 → 缺陷\n助记\ndefective adj. 有缺陷的；近义 flaw, fault\n例句\nThe car was returned because of a manufacturing ==defect== . 这辆车因制造缺陷被退回。","fields":{"Front":"defect","Back":"释义\nn. 缺点；缺陷 v. 叛变\n词根词缀\nde- 离开 + fect 做 → 没做好 → 缺陷\n助记\ndefective adj. 有缺陷的；近义 flaw, fault\n例句\nThe car was returned because of a manufacturing ==defect== . 这辆车因制造缺陷被退回。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 44 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l44_6","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"velocity","back":"释义\nn. 速度；速率\n词根词缀\nveloc 快 + -ity 名词 → 快的程度 → 速度\n助记\n近义 speed, rate；物理中指有方向的矢量速度\n例句\nThe rocket reached a very high ==velocity== . 火箭达到了极高的速度。","fields":{"Front":"velocity","Back":"释义\nn. 速度；速率\n词根词缀\nveloc 快 + -ity 名词 → 快的程度 → 速度\n助记\n近义 speed, rate；物理中指有方向的矢量速度\n例句\nThe rocket reached a very high ==velocity== . 火箭达到了极高的速度。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 44 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l44_7","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"dormitory","back":"释义\nn. （学校）宿舍\n词根词缀\ndorm 睡眠 + -itory 场所 → 睡觉的地方 → 宿舍\n助记\n缩写 dorm；dormant adj. 休眠的\n例句\nMost first-year students live in the ==dormitory== . 大多数一年级学生住在宿舍。","fields":{"Front":"dormitory","Back":"释义\nn. （学校）宿舍\n词根词缀\ndorm 睡眠 + -itory 场所 → 睡觉的地方 → 宿舍\n助记\n缩写 dorm；dormant adj. 休眠的\n例句\nMost first-year students live in the ==dormitory== . 大多数一年级学生住在宿舍。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 44 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l44_8","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"freight","back":"释义\nn. 货物；货运 v. 运送\n词根词缀\nfreight 词根（运载的货物）\n助记\nfreighter n. 货船；freight train 货运列车；近义 cargo, goods\n例句\nThe train was carrying a heavy load of ==freight== . 这列火车运载着沉重的货物。","fields":{"Front":"freight","Back":"释义\nn. 货物；货运 v. 运送\n词根词缀\nfreight 词根（运载的货物）\n助记\nfreighter n. 货船；freight train 货运列车；近义 cargo, goods\n例句\nThe train was carrying a heavy load of ==freight== . 这列火车运载着沉重的货物。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 44 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l44_9","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"tread","back":"释义\nv. 踩；踏；行走 n. 胎面；脚步声\n词根词缀\ntread 词根（踩踏）\n助记\n过去式 trod；近义 step, trample；tire tread 轮胎花纹\n例句\nBe careful not to ==tread== on the wet floor. 小心别踩到湿地板。","fields":{"Front":"tread","Back":"释义\nv. 踩；踏；行走 n. 胎面；脚步声\n词根词缀\ntread 词根（踩踏）\n助记\n过去式 trod；近义 step, trample；tire tread 轮胎花纹\n例句\nBe careful not to ==tread== on the wet floor. 小心别踩到湿地板。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 44 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l44_10","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"ascribe","back":"释义\nv. 把…归因于；归咎于\n词根词缀\na- 向 + scribe 写 → 写到某人名下 → 归因于\n助记\nascribe A to B；近义 attribute, owe\n例句\nShe ==ascribed== her success to hard work. 她把成功归因于努力。","fields":{"Front":"ascribe","Back":"释义\nv. 把…归因于；归咎于\n词根词缀\na- 向 + scribe 写 → 写到某人名下 → 归因于\n助记\nascribe A to B；近义 attribute, owe\n例句\nShe ==ascribed== her success to hard work. 她把成功归因于努力。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 44 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l44_11","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"supplement","back":"释义\nn./v. 补充（物）；增刊；补充剂\n词根词缀\nsup- 在下面 + ple 填满 + -ment 名词 → 补充填满 → 补充\n助记\nsupplementary adj. 补充的；近义 addition, add-on\n例句\nShe takes vitamin ==supplements== every morning. 她每天早上服用维生素补充剂。\n[sound:supplement.mp3]","fields":{"Front":"supplement","Back":"释义\nn./v. 补充（物）；增刊；补充剂\n词根词缀\nsup- 在下面 + ple 填满 + -ment 名词 → 补充填满 → 补充\n助记\nsupplementary adj. 补充的；近义 addition, add-on\n例句\nShe takes vitamin ==supplements== every morning. 她每天早上服用维生素补充剂。\n[sound:supplement.mp3]","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 44 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l44_12","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"equation","back":"释义\nn. 方程式；等式\n词根词缀\nequ 相等 + -ation 名词 → 两边相等的式子 → 方程式\n助记\nequate v. 等同；equal adj. 相等的\n例句\nSolve the ==equation== for x. 解这个关于 x 的方程。","fields":{"Front":"equation","Back":"释义\nn. 方程式；等式\n词根词缀\nequ 相等 + -ation 名词 → 两边相等的式子 → 方程式\n助记\nequate v. 等同；equal adj. 相等的\n例句\nSolve the ==equation== for x. 解这个关于 x 的方程。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 44 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l44_13","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"copper","back":"释义\nn. 铜；铜币 adj. 铜色的\n词根词缀\ncopper 词根（源自产铜地 Cyprus）\n助记\ncopper wire 铜线；元素符号 Cu\n例句\nThe old pipes were made of ==copper== . 这些旧管子是铜做的。","fields":{"Front":"copper","Back":"释义\nn. 铜；铜币 adj. 铜色的\n词根词缀\ncopper 词根（源自产铜地 Cyprus）\n助记\ncopper wire 铜线；元素符号 Cu\n例句\nThe old pipes were made of ==copper== . 这些旧管子是铜做的。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 44 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.0