记\nallay fears / concerns；近义 ease, relieve, calm\n例句\nThe doctor tried to ==allay== her fears. 医生努力减轻她的恐惧。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 44 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l44_66","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"expropriate","back":"释义\nv. 征用；没收（财产）\n词根词缀\nex- 出 + propri 自己的 + -ate → 从自己手中拿走 → 征用\n助记\nproperty 同根（自己的财产）；近义 seize, confiscate\n例句\nThe state ==expropriated== the land for a new highway. 国家为修建新公路征用了土地。","fields":{"Front":"expropriate","Back":"释义\nv. 征用；没收（财产）\n词根词缀\nex- 出 + propri 自己的 + -ate → 从自己手中拿走 → 征用\n助记\nproperty 同根（自己的财产）；近义 seize, confiscate\n例句\nThe state ==expropriated== the land for a new highway. 国家为修建新公路征用了土地。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 44 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l44_67","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"mandate","back":"释义\nn. 授权；命令；委任 v. 强制要求\n词根词缀\nmand 命令 / 托付 + -ate → 命令\n助记\nmandatory adj. 强制的；command 同根；近义 order, directive\n例句\nThe new law ==mandates== lower emissions. 新法律强制要求降低排放。","fields":{"Front":"mandate","Back":"释义\nn. 授权；命令；委任 v. 强制要求\n词根词缀\nmand 命令 / 托付 + -ate → 命令\n助记\nmandatory adj. 强制的；command 同根；近义 order, directive\n例句\nThe new law ==mandates== lower emissions. 新法律强制要求降低排放。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 44 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"diff