","front":"forfeit","back":"释义\nv. 丧失；被没收 n. 罚金；丧失\n词根词缀\nfor- 离开 + feit 做 → 因做错而失去 → 丧失\n助记\n近义 lose, surrender, penalty\n例句\nIf you cancel late, you ==forfeit== your deposit. 如果你取消太晚，就会损失押金。","fields":{"Front":"forfeit","Back":"释义\nv. 丧失；被没收 n. 罚金；丧失\n词根词缀\nfor- 离开 + feit 做 → 因做错而失去 → 丧失\n助记\n近义 lose, surrender, penalty\n例句\nIf you cancel late, you ==forfeit== your deposit. 如果你取消太晚，就会损失押金。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 44 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l44_76","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"juridical","back":"释义\nadj. 司法的；法律上的\n词根词缀\njur 法律 + -idical 形容词 → 司法的\n助记\njury n. 陪审团；justice n. 司法；近义 judicial, legal\n例句\nThe case raised several ==juridical== questions. 这个案子提出了几个法律问题。","fields":{"Front":"juridical","Back":"释义\nadj. 司法的；法律上的\n词根词缀\njur 法律 + -idical 形容词 → 司法的\n助记\njury n. 陪审团；justice n. 司法；近义 judicial, legal\n例句\nThe case raised several ==juridical== questions. 这个案子提出了几个法律问题。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 44 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l44_77","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"lawsuit","back":"释义\nn. 诉讼；起诉\n词根词缀\nlaw 法律 + suit 诉讼 → 法律诉讼\n助记\nfile a lawsuit 提起诉讼；近义 case, action\n例句\nShe filed a ==lawsuit== against the company. 她对这家公司提起了诉讼。","fields":{"Front":"lawsuit","Back":"释义\nn. 诉讼；起诉\n词根词缀\nlaw 法律 + suit 诉讼 → 法律诉讼\n助记\nfile a lawsuit 提起诉讼；近义 case, action\n例句\nShe filed a ==lawsuit== against the company. 她对这家公司提起了诉讼。