o== . 该党公布了竞选宣言。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 45 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l45_61","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"outlaw","back":"释义\nn. 歹徒；亡命之徒 v. 宣布…非法\n词根词缀\nout 在外 + law 法律 → 法律之外的人\n助记\n近义 bandit, criminal；outlaw sth 取缔\n例句\nThe sheriff hunted the ==outlaw== across the desert. 警长穿越沙漠追捕那个歹徒。","fields":{"Front":"outlaw","Back":"释义\nn. 歹徒；亡命之徒 v. 宣布…非法\n词根词缀\nout 在外 + law 法律 → 法律之外的人\n助记\n近义 bandit, criminal；outlaw sth 取缔\n例句\nThe sheriff hunted the ==outlaw== across the desert. 警长穿越沙漠追捕那个歹徒。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 45 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l45_62","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"pact","back":"释义\nn. 协定；条约；契约\n词根词缀\npact 词根（同意 / 约定，同 peace）\n助记\n近义 treaty, agreement, accord\n例句\nThe two nations signed a peace ==pact== . 两国签署了和平协定。","fields":{"Front":"pact","Back":"释义\nn. 协定；条约；契约\n词根词缀\npact 词根（同意 / 约定，同 peace）\n助记\n近义 treaty, agreement, accord\n例句\nThe two nations signed a peace ==pact== . 两国签署了和平协定。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 45 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l45_63","ord":0,"notetype":"b