i- 双 + lemma 前提 → 两个前提难选\n助记\non the horns of a dilemma 进退维谷\n例句\nShe faced the ==dilemma== of work or family. 她面临工作还是家庭的两难。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 46 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l46_64","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"peculiar","back":"释义\nadj. 奇怪的；特有的；特殊的\n词根词缀\npecul 私有 + -iar → 私人特有的\n助记\npeculiarity n. 特性；近义 odd, strange, distinctive\n例句\nThe food has a ==peculiar== taste. 这食物有种奇怪的味道。","fields":{"Front":"peculiar","Back":"释义\nadj. 奇怪的；特有的；特殊的\n词根词缀\npecul 私有 + -iar → 私人特有的\n助记\npeculiarity n. 特性；近义 odd, strange, distinctive\n例句\nThe food has a ==peculiar== taste. 这食物有种奇怪的味道。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 46 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l46_65","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"morale","back":"释义\nn. 士气；斗志\n词根词缀\nmor 精神（同 moral）+ -ale → 精神状态\n助记\n注意对比 moral 道德的；近义 confidence, spirit\n例句\nThe team's ==morale== was high after the win. 获胜后全队士气高涨。","fields":{"Front":"morale","Back":"释义\nn. 士气；斗志\n词根词缀\nmor 精神（同 moral）+ -ale → 精神状态\n助记\n注意对比 moral 道德的；近义 confidence, spirit\n例句\nThe team's ==morale== was high after the win. 获胜后全队士气高涨。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 46 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDay