aution n. 预防；caution n. 小心\n例句\nThey took ==precautionary== measures before the storm. 风暴前他们采取了预防措施。","fields":{"Front":"precautionary","Back":"释义\nadj. 预防的；防备的\n词根词缀\npre- 预先 + caution 谨慎 + -ary\n助记\nprecaution n. 预防；caution n. 小心\n例句\nThey took ==precautionary== measures before the storm. 风暴前他们采取了预防措施。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 47 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l47_1","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"sap","back":"释义\nn. 树液；活力 v. 削弱\n词根词缀\nsap 词根（树液，引申抽干活力）\n助记\n近义 drain, weaken, exhaust；tree sap 树液\n例句\nThe long battle ==sapped== the army's strength. 漫长的战斗消耗了军队的力量。","fields":{"Front":"sap","Back":"释义\nn. 树液；活力 v. 削弱\n词根词缀\nsap 词根（树液，引申抽干活力）\n助记\n近义 drain, weaken, exhaust；tree sap 树液\n例句\nThe long battle ==sapped== the army's strength. 漫长的战斗消耗了军队的力量。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 47 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"toefl_l47_2","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"compact","back":"释义\nadj. 紧凑的；紧密的 n. 合约 v. 压实\n词根词缀\ncom- 一起 + pact 系紧 → 紧压在一起\n助记\ncompaction n. 压实；近义 dense；反义 loose\n例句\nThe apartment is small but ==compact== . 这套公寓虽小却紧凑。","fields":{"Front":"compact","Back":"释义\nadj. 紧凑的；紧密的 n. 合约 v. 压实\n词根词缀\ncom- 一起 + pact 系紧 → 紧压在一起\n助记\ncompaction n. 压实；近义 dense；反义 loose\n例句\nThe apartment is small but ==compact== . 这套公寓虽小却紧凑。","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"第 47 组","tags":[],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"